 got a sweet deal for you, Orange League Champ."X\bFor 50 per piece, these candies will give your Pokémon 10 levels each, trust me!"1\bTalk to me again if you'd like some, hehe."..."HThey seem to be offering you a Pokémon. Would you like to take it?"There is no room for it."\rYou did wonderful."\PN's house"/\bFeeling slow? Press the 'F' or 'F7' key."5\bWant to save faster? Press the left 'Alt' key."0\bI locked myself out of the house again...""\bYour dreams will burn to..."�\bYes, that has to be it. If I follow those instructions I'll find the ultimate challenge without a doubt. But what could the last word possibly be?"Gary's house"%\bI wish I was as strong as you."8\bYou can jump over this ledge by walking up to it."p\bGary: So \PN, you woke up late. What a loser. It's a shame, because I ended up getting the best Pokémon."X\bIt's good to have a grandfather in the business, isn't it.\nCatch you later, \PN."f\bGary: I heard you beat the Orange League and did something for my grandfather while I was gone."<\bI guess you're tough enough to have a battle with me."B\bGary: Not bad, \PN, though you still have a long way to go."5\bI'm off to challenge the Johto League. See ya."M\bGary: \PN, good to see you again. How has it been traveling the world?"H\bI bet you've become a Pokémon Master by this point, haven't you?"P\bHm, I guess that's up for you to decide. I'll see you around. Later, \PN."/Pallet Town\nShades of your journey await!"\bYou tried your best."2There's a barrier in the way. You can't pass."Z\bGary: What are you doing here \PN? Shouldn't you be off becoming a Pokémon Master?"`\bI guess you wanted to come see your old pal. I can take a quick break to battle with you."W\bGary: I should get back to work. Researching Pokémon is a never-ending pursuit."\rJigglypuff""\bGary: Long time no see \PN."S\bI just got back from the Sinnoh region. I've been doing some research there."<\bYou want to see one of the Pokémon I got from there?"[\bGary: You've really gotten strong, though I still think I could beat you if I tried."?\bI'm heading back to Sinnoh soon. I suggest you visit it."t\bGary: I decided I'm done with Gym battles. I'm gonna head to Hoenn and help my grandfather with his research."=\r\PN, you did great in the league. I'm so proud of you!"Professor Oak's Lab"K\rMom: How did it go, \PN? Ah, it looks like you got a lovely Pikachu."�\rIt's going to be a wonderful journey, I can just tell. You were in such a rush I didn't have time to give you these earlier. Be sure to use them." \PN obtained Running Shoes."B\rMom: It's going to be a wonderful journey, I can just tell."0\rDon't leave. Wild Pokémon are out there."\rHi \PN, how is it going?"�\bOak: \PN, great job in the league. Gary stopped by already and told us he lost. He left before I could ask him to do me a favor, so I'm wondering if you would."J\bWould you head to Valencia Island in the Orange Archipelago for me?"�\bProfessor Ivy is there and has a mysterious Poké Ball she wants me to check out. There is a league there as well that might interest you."E\bHead up to Viridian City. There is a blimp that will take you."]\bOak: Head up to Viridian City. There is a blimp that will take you to Valencia Island."Yes"No[E"*Rotom Phone: Llamada entrante de Goh:"N\bGoh: Eh, \PN. ¿Podrías reunirte conmigo en el Parque Cerezo? Gracias."\bMr. Mime"LHay un Mr. Mime bloqueando el paso. ¿Te gustaría llevártelo contigo?"+\b¡Lo hiciste genial en la liga, \PN!"'\rMamá: ¡Bienvenido a casa, \PN!"\rPidgey"\rPidgeotto"\rPidgeot"La puerta está cerrada."[\bEl Profesor Oak centra su investigación en las relaciones entre humanos y Pokémon."P\bPsst. Tengo una oferta irresistible para ti, campeón de la Liga Naranja."V\bPor 50 cada uno, estos caramelos subirán 10 niveles a tus Pokémon, ¡créeme!"7\bHabla conmigo otra vez si quieres algunos, jeje."..."FParece que te están ofreciendo un Pokémon. ¿Quieres aceptarlo?"No hay sitio para él."\rLo hiciste de maravilla."Casa de \PN"9\b¿Sientes que va lento? Pulsa la tecla 'F' o 'F7'."F\b¿Quieres guardar más rápido? Pulsa la tecla 'Alt' izquierda.",\bMe he vuelto a dejar fuera de casa..."$\bTus sueños arderán hasta..."�\bSí, tiene que ser eso. Si sigo esas instrucciones, encontraré el desafío definitivo sin duda. Pero, ¿cuál podría ser la última palabra?"Casa de Gary"(\bOjalá fuera tan fuerte como tú."C\bPuedes saltar esta cornisa simplemente caminando hacia ella."y\bGary: Así que \PN, te despertaste tarde. Qué pringado. Es una pena, porque al final me llevé el mejor Pokémon."N\bEstá bien tener a tu abuelo metido en esto, ¿verdad?\nNos vemos, \PN."j \bGary: He oído que venciste en la Liga Naranja e hiciste algo por mi abuelo mientras yo no estaba."F\bSupongo que eres lo bastante fuerte como para combatir conmigo."P\bGary: No ha estado mal, \PN, aunque todavía te queda mucho por recorrer."2\bMe voy a desafiar la Liga Johto. Nos vemos."V\bGary: \PN, me alegro de verte otra vez. ¿Qué tal te va viajando por el mundo?"T\bApuesto a que a estas alturas ya te has convertido en Maestro Pokémon, ¿no?"T\bHm, supongo que eso te toca decidirlo a ti. Ya nos veremos. Hasta luego, \PN."<Pueblo Paleta\n¡Los matices de tu aventura te esperan!"\bLo has dado todo.";Hay una barrera bloqueando el camino. No puedes pasar."h\bGary: ¿Qué haces aquí, \PN? ¿No deberías estar por ahí convirtiéndote en Maestro Pokémon?"n\bSupongo que querías venir a ver a tu viejo amigo. Puedo hacer una pausa rápida para combatir contigo."b\bGary: Debería volver al trabajo. Investigar a los Pokémon es una tarea que nunca termina."\rJigglypuff", \bGary: Cuánto tiempo sin verte, \PN."M\bAcabo de volver de la región de Sinnoh. He estado investigando allí."=\b¿Quieres ver uno de los Pokémon que conseguí allí?"j\bGary: De verdad te has hecho fuerte, aunque sigo pensando que podría vencerte si me lo propusiera.">\bPronto volveré a Sinnoh. Te recomiendo que la visites."�\bGary: He decidido que ya he terminado con los combates de Gimnasio. Voy a i