émon"	Exit"Roadblock"Deactivate;[,"2\bI'm a basic trainer with a Shadow Pokémon."You're too good for me!"g\bDid you manage to snag my Shadow Pokémon? Because you can't battle me again for another chance."\\rYou can battle me repeatedly, and have unlimited attempts to snag my Shadow Pokémon."U\rYou've managed to snag my Shadow Electabuzz. I'm not going to do anything now."}\bI can tell you some things about Shadow Pokémon in Essentials. However, the wiki has far more information about them." \bWhat do you want to know?"k\bShadow Pokémon are a special kind of Pokémon which appeared in Pokémon Colosseum and Pokémon XD."b\bThey can be included in Essentials as well. See the wiki for information on how to do this."]\bTrainers with Shadow Pokémon are set up in exactly the same way as any other trainer."�\bAny Poké Ball can be defined as a Snag Ball in items.txt. If $PokemonGlobal.snagMachine is TRUE, all Poké Balls will be Snag Balls automatically."�\b$Trainer.shadowcaught is an array (like the Pokédex seen/owned arrays) which keeps track of which Shadow Pokémon species have been caught."2\bYou can purify Shadow Pokémon in two ways."=\bThe first is by bringing them to the Relic Stone here."n\bThe second is by placing them in the Purify Chamber, which you can access from the PC in Poké Centers."7\bI've now given you access to the Purify Chamber."~\bThe effects of Heart Gauge-lowering items are already in Essentials. You just need to add the items themselves to items.txt."�\bI can control the weather. Which weather would you like to see?\ch[1,-1,None,Rain,Storm, Snow,Sandstorm,Sunny,HeavyRain,Blizzard]"f\bThis weather can occur even at night, and doesn't fade in/out. It's better if you don't use it."�\bNote that the weather metadata for this map is set, even though its probability is 0. This prevents the weather from lingering when you leave this map."(\bI stopped you as you walked past."�\bHaving "Trainer(2)" as my event's name, and the "Event Touch" trigger, tells me to activate whenever you enter either of the two tiles in front of me."u\bKernel.pbExclaim makes me exclaim. Kernel.pbNoticePlayer does the same thing, as well as make me approach you."�\bTrainers use these features by default, but other NPCs like me can use them too. Roadblock events in particular love to use them."R\bShall I turn you back like a real roadblock, or should I deactivate myself?"k\bOkay. I'll fulfil my roadblock condition myself, by turning the Global Switch I depend on (5) to ON."p\bRoadblock events don't normally set the conditions they wait for (Global Switch 5 in my case), but I did."\bHaiiiii-yaaaaaah!"\bYou won, good job."You lost, too bad."B\bHello. This is what I say if you talk to me during the day."\bHalt! Who goes there?"5\bThis is what I say if you talk to me at night."Information"Shadow Pokémon battles"Purifying Pokémon"	Exit"Roadblock"DeactivateIu;␀`D[[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"m\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have finished your Journey to be a Pokemon Master."5\bBut do you really think you are the very best?"~\bWe have two Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."\bMuk! Muk!"Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."6\bWow! Well done on completing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"No[�"0\bOak: Ven aquí y recoge tu Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Espera, ¡no olvides tu Pokémon inicial!"+\bOak: Espera, ¡no olvides a Pikachu!""[SISTEMA ACTIVÁNDOSE.......]"$[¡ADVERTENCIA! ¡ADVERTENCIA!]"¿Teletransportarse?"�\b¡Vaya, vaya, qué sorpresa! ¡\PN! Soy Hitsukid, supongo que ya habrás terminado tu viaje para convertirte en Maestro Pokémon."1\bPero, ¿de verdad crees que eres el mejor?"}\bAquí tenemos dos Transportadores Cuánticos que te llevarán a otras dimensiones para saciar tu ansia de nuevos desafíos."X\bPero ten cuidado, percibo una energía muy tenaz procedente de esos dispositivos."X\bParece que te esperan grandes desafíos... pero quedas advertido. ¡MUCHA SUERTE!">\bOak: Ah, \PN, ¿cómo va todo? ¿Tu Pikachu está bien?"&\bOak: Si lo quieres, llévatelo."6\bOak: Ah, \PN, conseguiste la GS Ball, ¿verdad?".\bBien, bien. Déjame echarle un vistazo."5\bHmm. No consigo averiguar qué hacer con ella."R\b\PN, ¿puedo pedirte que la conserves un poco más y se la lleves a César?"�\bVive en Pueblo Azalea, en la región de Johto. La forma más rápida de llegar debería ser por la Ruta 22. Está cerca de la Liga Kanto."r\bOak: La forma más rápida de llegar a la región de Johto es por la Ruta 22. Está cerca de la Liga Kanto."W\bOak: Ah, hola, \PN. He oído que lo hiciste muy bien en la Conferencia Plateada."{\bGary decidió irse a Hoenn para investigar un poco. Parece un lugar estupendo al que ir si buscas un nuevo desafío."g\bDirígete a Ciudad Carmín. Avisaré al capitán de que vas. Hay un barco que te llevará allí."H\bAdemás, habla con mi ayudante de abajo. Tiene un regalo para ti."c\bY por último, pero no menos importante, tu madre tiene ropa nueva para ti. Aquí la tienes."y\bTe queda estupendamente. Aunque, si prefieres la ropa de antes, puedes cambiarte con la cómoda de tu habitación."n\bOak: Dirígete a Ciudad Carmín. Avisaré al capitán de que vas. Hay un barco que te llevará a Hoenn."Z\bOak: Ah, hola, \PN. He oído que lo hiciste muy bien en la Conferencia Ever Grande."�\bAdemás llegas en buen momento, porque el Frente Batalla acaba de abrir aquí mismo, en Kanto. El primero que te recomendaría es la Fábrica Batalla, cerca de Ciudad Celeste."@\bOak: Ve a Ciudad Celeste para desafiar el Frente Batalla."E\bOak: Ah, hola, \PN. Así que venciste al Frente Batalla, ¿eh?"x\b¿Estás pensando en ir a la región de Sinnoh? Te prepararé un viaje. Como siempre, dirígete a Ciudad Carmín."/\bY una vez más, aquí tienes ropa nueva."F\bOak: Ve a Ciudad Carmín para coger el transporte hacia Sinnoh.">\bOak: Ah, hola, \PN. Así que terminaste la Liga Sinnoh."�\bHe visto que lo hiciste bastante bien. Estoy seguro de que estás listo para tu próximo desafío. ¿Qué te parece ir a Teselia conmigo?"J\bDirígete a Ciudad Verde. Allí habrá un dirigible para llevarnos."T\bY, como seguro que ya has imaginado, tu madre tiene un nuevo atuendo para ti."O\bOak: Dirígete a Ciudad Verde. Allí habrá un dirigible para llevarnos."c\bOak: La Liga Teselia parece un buen desafío para ti. Espero con ganas saber tus resultados."DEsta Poké Ball contiene un Pokémon capturado por el Profesor.">\bOak: Entonces, ¿quieres a Pikachu, el Pokémon Ratón?"V\bOak: Por desgracia, es el único que queda, así que te sugiero que lo aceptes."\bPikachu"7Pikachu empezó a seguirte.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"JGary: Pueblo Paleta\n Paul: Ciudad Rocavelo\n Barry: Pueblo Hojaverde"^Trip: Pueblo Arcilla\n Alain: Laboratorio del Profesor Ciprés\n Sawyer: Ciudad Luminalia".Gladion: Ciudad Hauoli\n Hau: Pueblo Tapu"KMisty: Ciudad Celeste\n Brock: Ciudad Plateada\n Tracey: Corral de Oak".May: Ciudad Trigal\n Dawn: Ciudad Vetusta".Iris: Ciudad Caolín\n Cilan: Ciudad Gres"7Clemont: Ciudad Luminalia\n Serena: Ciudad Calagua"3Lana: Ciudad Hauoli\n Kiawe: Ruinas de la Vida"PMallow: Ciudad Hauoli\n Sophocles: Escuela Pokémon\n Lillie: Ciudad Hauoli"Goh: Parque Cerezo"!¡\PN recibió una Pokédex!"Ya tienes una Pokédex."\b¡Muk! ¡Muk!"¡¡Rotom!!"t\bHola, \PN. He logrado crear una máquina que captura la esencia de Entrenadores poderosos de otra dimensión."Q\bSe llaman 'portadores de Pokédex'. Siéntete libre de probar la máquina."~\bOak: \PN, llegas tarde. Ya se han llevado todos los Pokémon iniciales. ...Bueno, queda uno, pero es un poco temerario."N\bOak: Parece que a Pikachu no le gusta quedarse dentro de su Poké Ball."2\bOak: Charmander, ¡una elección excelente!"0\bOak: Squirtle, ¡una elección excelente!"2\bNo olvides coger tu Pokédex antes de irte."#[SISTEMA ACTIVÁNDOSE........]"[¡PELIGRO! ¡PELIGRO!]"�¿Teletransportarse?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",Este lugar... parece ser Pueblo Paleta.":Este lugar... parece ser el Gimnasio de Ciudad Verde.".Este lugar... parece ser la Meseta Añil.".Este lugar... parece ser el Bosque Verde."/Este lugar... parece ser Pueblo Primavera."+Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Verde."*Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Iris."-Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Portual."0Este lugar... parece ser Pueblo Littleroot."/Este lugar... parece ser la Torre Batalla."*Este lugar... parece ser Isla Hierro."-Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Pradera.".Este lugar... parece ser el Monte Corona.":Este lugar... parece ser la Liga Pokémon de Teselia."/Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Mayólica."/Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Hormigón.",Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Engobe."0Este lugar... parece ser Pueblo Petroglifo.",Este lugar... parece ser Ciudad Yantra.")Este lugar... parece ser Pueblo Iki."1Este lugar... parece ser el Paraíso Æther."2Este lugar... parece ser la Cima de la Torre."/Este lugar... parece ser el Bosque Oniria."�\bOak: No estoy seguro de qué más te queda por hacer, \PN. Yo diría que has dado pasos de gigante para convertirte en Maestro Pokémon."�\bPodrías buscar a los amigos que has conocido por el camino. Puede que quieran volver a verte. Tengo por aquí una lista con los lugares en los que están."T\bTambién hay un recinto de combate en Ciudad Fayenza que podría interesarte."2\b¿Qué pasa? ¿Quieres que vea tu Pokédex?"\bHmm... ya veo...";\b¡Vaya! ¡Bien hecho por completar la Pokédex, \PN!"#\bAquí tienes una recompensa."p\bRecuerda, \PN, tu aventura no termina aquí. ¡Aún te queda muchísimo por explorar en este vasto mundo!"c\bOak: He oído que también has vencido en la región de Teselia. Un trabajo magnífico, \PN."D\b¿Ya has conocido a Rotom? Lo capturé en las Islas Decolora."\b¿Dónde está eso? Oh, es un lugar horrible. No querría hacerte pasar por ese viaje. Solo fui para encontrar un Rotom."�\b¿Piensas ir después a la región de Kalos? Excelente idea. He oído hablar de un poder misterioso que procede de esa región."I\bDirígete a Ciudad Verde. Allí habrá un dirigible para llevarte."/\bAh, y no nos olvidemos de tu ropa nueva."N\bOak: Dirígete a Ciudad Verde. Allí habrá un dirigible para llevarte."\\bOak: He oído que también has vencido en la región de Kalos. Un trabajo magnífico."f\bAdemás, llegas en un momento perfecto. Tu madre acaba de ganar un viaje a la región de Alola."a\bTambién tengo este Huevo que necesito entregar a mi primo Samson. Dáselo cuando llegues.""\bEspera. No olvides tu ropa."%\bOak: Ve a hablar con tu madre.";\bOak: ¿No deberías estar en la escuela ahora mismo?"p\bOak: Excelente trabajo al convertirte en el Campeón de Alola, \PN. Fue un combate realmente emocionante."\bSiento tener que acortar esta reunión, pero un nuevo Profesor va a abrir un laboratorio en Ciudad Carmín y acepté asistir."\b¡Ya sé! ¿Por qué no vienes conmigo? Entonces está decidido. Tu madre y yo nos reuniremos contigo en Ciudad Carmín."�\bNaturalmente, tu madre te ha dejado aquí algo de ropa. Le preocupaba que tuvieras tanta prisa por ver a tus Pokémon que olvidaras pasar por casa."C\bOak: Tu madre y yo nos reuniremos contigo en Ciudad Carmín."G\bOak: Hola, \PN. ¿Qué tal va el trabajo con el Profesor Cerezo?"o\bOak: Hola, \PN. ¿Qué tal va el trabajo con el Profesor Cerezo? ¿Le va bien a Goh con el Proyecto Mew?"Q\bOak: Hola, \PN. La sorpresa que tengo para ti está en la parte de atrás."�\bOak: Hola, \PN. ¿Qué tal fue tu encuentro con Paul? ¿Te comentó que recibió una oferta para convertirse en Líder de Gimnasio?"@\bOak: Excelente trabajo al convertirte en el Monarca, \PN."U\bOak: Así que has vuelto tras otro viaje, ¿eh? Siempre es una grata sorpresa."�\bHas logrado muchísimo desde que conociste a Pikachu por primera vez. Los vínculos que has creado, las regiones que has explorado, y también los amigos y Pokémon que has conocido."�\bNunca has dejado de crecer como Entrenador, y dudo mucho que ahora tengas intención de parar. El camino para convertirse en Maestro Pokémon es largo."\bEstoy realmente orgulloso de ti, \PN. Te deseo suerte en tu próximo viaje. Y recuerda que siempre serás bienvenido en casa."Sí"No;[�"1\bOak: Come here and get your Pokédex, \PN."5\bOak: Wait, don't forget your starter Pokémon!"'\bOak: Wait, don't forget Pikachu!"[SYSTEM ACTIVATING.......]"[WARNING! WARNING!]"Teleport?"m\bHey, surprise surprise! \PN! I'm Hitsukid, you must have finished your Journey to be a Pokemon Master."5\bBut do you really think you are the very best?"~\bWe have two Quantum Transporters here, bringing you to other dimensions in order to satisfy your hunger for more challenges."L\bWatch out though, I am sensing tenacious vibes through those devices."a\bSeems like great challenges for you to overcome... but you have been warned. ALL THE BEST!"@\bOak: Ah \PN, how is it going? Is your Pikachu doing well?"$\bOak: If you want it, take it."3\bOak: Ah \PN, you got the GS ball didn't you?"+\bGood good. Let me have a look at it.":\bHmm. I can't seem to figure out what to do with it."O\b\PN, can I ask you to hold on to it a little longer and take it to Kurt?"|\bHe lives in Azalea Town in the Johto region. The fastest way there should be on Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."`\bOak: The fastest way to the Johto region is through Route 22. It's near the Kanto League."I\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Silver Conference."�\bGary decided to head off to Hoenn to do some research. It seems like a lovely place for you to go if you want a new challenge."n\bHead to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you there."@\bAlso, speak to my aide downstairs. He has a gift for you."U\bAnd last but not least, your mother has some new clothes for you. Here you go."l\bThey look spendid. If you'd prefer your old ones though you can change with the dresser in your room."v\bOak: Head to Vermilion City. I'll tell the captain you are coming. There is a ship that will take you to Hoenn."N\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. I heard you did well in the Ever Grande Conference."�\bIt's good timing too since the Battle Frontier just opened up right here in Kanto! The first one I would recommend is the Battle Factory near Cerulean City."@\bOak: Head to Cerulean City to battle the Battle Frontier."@\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you beat the Battle Frontier then?"u\bYou're thinking about the Sinnoh region? I'll set up a ride for you. Like always, head over to Vermilion City."1\bAnd once again, here are some new clothes.";\bOak: Head to Vermilion City to get a ride to Sinnoh."=\bOak: Ah, hello \PN. So you finished the Sinnoh League."n\bI saw you did quite well. I'm sure you're ready for your next challenge. Why not head to Unova with me?"I\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."O\bAnd as I'm sure you guessed by now your mother has a new outfit for you."N\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take us over."j\bOak: The Unova League sounds like a good challenge for you. I look forward to hearing your results.";This ball contains a Pokémon caught by the Professor.">\bOak: So, you want Pikachu, the Electric mouse Pokémon?"M\bOak: Unfortunately, it is the only one left, so I suggest you take it."\bPikachu":Pikachu started to follow you.\se[itemlevel]\wtnp[20]"DGary: Pallet Town\n Paul: Veilstone City\n Barry: Twinleaf Town"OTrip: Nuvema Town\n Alain: Professor Sycamore's Lab\n Sawyer: Lumiose City".Gladion: Hau'oli City\n Hau: Tapu Village"EMisty: Cerulean City\n Brock: Pewter City\n Tracey: Oak's Corral",May: Goldenrod City\n Dawn: Eterna City"/Iris: Opelucid City\n Cilan: Striaton City"2Clemont: Lumiose City\n Serena: Lilycove City".Lana: Hau'oli City\n Kiawe: Ruins of Life"MMallow: Hau'oli City\n Sophocles: Pokémon School\n Lillie: Hau'oli City"Goh: Cerise Park"\PN received a Pokédex!"!You already have a Pokédex."\bMuk! Muk!"Rotom!!"{\bHello \PN. I've managed to make a machine that captures the essence of powerful Trainers from a different dimension."L\bThey are called 'Pokédex holders'. Feel free to try the machine out."\bOak: \PN, you're late. All of the starter Pokémon have been taken. ...Well there is one left, but it is a bit reckless."D\bOak: It seems Pikachu doesn't like to stay in its Poké Ball.",\bOak: Charmander, an excellent choice!"*\bOak: Squirtle, an excellent choice!";\bDon't forget to take your Pokédex before you leave." [SYSTEM ACTIVATING........]"[DANGER! DANGER!]"�Teleport?\ch[1,1,Red,Blue,Green,Yellow,Gold,Silver, Crystal,Ruby,Sapphire,Emerald,Diamond,Pearl,Platinum, Black,White,Blake,Whitley,X,Y,Sun,Moon,Henry,Casey,No]",This place...appears to be Pallet Town."1This place...appears to be the Viridian Gym."3This place...appears to be the Indigo Plateau."0This place...appears to be Viridian Forest.".This place...appears to be New Bark Town.".This place...appears to be Viridian City.".This place...appears to be Ecruteak City."/This place...appears to be Slateport City."0This place...appears to be Littleroot Town."1This place...appears to be the Battle Tower.",This place...appears to be Iron Island.".This place...appears to be Pastoria City.",This place...appears to be Mt. Coronet.":This place...appears to be the Unova Pokémon League."-This place...appears to be Nimbasa City."-This place...appears to be Virbank City.".This place...appears to be Aspertia City.".This place...appears to be Geosenge Town."-This place...appears to be Shalour City.")This place...appears to be Iki Town."0This place...appears to be Aether Paradise."-This place...appears to be Tower Summit."1This place...appears to be Slumbering Weald."~\bOak: I'm not sure what else there is for you to do, \PN. I would say you've made huge strides to becoming a Pokémon Master."�\bYou could seek out the friends you've met along the way. They may want to see you again. I have a list of the places where they are somewhere around here."M\bThere is also a battle hall in Driftveil City that might interest you."5\bWhat's that? You want me to see your Pokédex?"\bHmm... I see..."6\bWow! Well done on completing the Pokédex, \PN!"\bHere's a reward."q\bRemeber \PN, your adventure doesn't end here. There's still so much for you to explore in this vast world!"O\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Unova region as well. Wonderful work, \PN."C\bHave you met Rotom yet? I caught it in the Decolore Islands."|\bWhere's that at? Oh, it's a horrible place. I wouldn't want to make you suffer the trip. I only went to find a Rotom."x\bYou plan on going to the Kalos region next? Excellent idea. I heard of a mysterious power coming from the region."J\bHead over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."1\bOh, and let's not forget your new clothes."O\bOak: Head over to Viridian City. A blimp will be there to take you over."J\bOak: I hear you've beaten the Kalos region as well. Wonderful work."S\bIt's also wonderful timing. Your mother just won a trip to the Alola region."g\bI also have this egg that I need to deliver to my cousin Samson. Give it to him when you arrive."'\bWait. Don't forget your clothes."&\bOak: Go speak with your mother."1\bOak: Shouldn't you be in school right now?"c\bOak: Excellent work on becoming the Champion of Alola, \PN. It was quite the exciting match."z\bI'm sorry to cut this meeting short, but a new Professor is opening a lab in Vermilion City and I agreed to attend."l\bI know! Why don't you join me? Well then, it's settled. Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."�\bNaturally, your mother left you some clothes here. She was worried you'd be in such a rush to see your Pokémon that you'd forget to stop home."9\bOak: Your mother and I will meet you in Vermilion."?\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise?"b\bOak: Hello \PN. How is it working with Professor Cerise? Is Project Mew going well for Goh?"?\bOak: Hello \PN. The surprise I have for you is out back."u\bOak: Hello \PN. How did your meeting go with Paul? Did he mention he recieved an offer to become a Gym Leader?"7\bOak: Excellent job on becoming the Monarch, \PN."W\bOak: Come back after another journey, have you? It's always a pleasant surprise."�\bYou've accomplished so much since you first met Pikachu. The bonds you've made, the regions you've explored, and the friends and Pokémon too."�\bYou've never stopped growing as a Trainer, and I doubt you have any intention on quitting now. The road to becoming a Pokémon Master is a long one."y\bI'm truly proud of you, \PN. I wish you luck in your next journey. And know that you're always welcomed back home."Yes"NoIu;␀}[["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"6\bOh! The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!",\bOh. The boulder is not on the switch."+This ladder leads to a random dungeon."�The levels of Pokémon within are based on the levels of Pokémon in the player's party. The relevant code is in the script section PokemonEncounterModifiers."KThe positions of the boulders are checked by a Parallel Process event."eThe hole event must have its "Through" option set, to allow boulder events to be pushed onto it."�Which tile puzzle do you want to play?\ch[1,8, Alph,Alph Rotator,Mystic Square,Tile Swap, Tile Swap Rotator,Rubik's Square,Star Rotator,Cancel]"Puzzle solved!"Gave up...["1\bCan you push that boulder onto the switch?"7\bOh!  The boulder has been moved onto the switch!"\bWell done!"-\bOh.  The boulder is not on the switch."+This ladder leads to a random dungeon."�The levels of Pokémon within are based on the levels of Pokémon in the player's party.  The relevant code is in the script section PokemonEncounterModifiers."KThe positions of the boulders are checked by a Parallel Process event."eThe hole event must have its "Through" option set, to allow boulder events to be pushed onto it."�Which tile puzzle do you want to play?\ch[1,8, Alph,Alph Rotator,Mystic Square,Tile Swap, Tile Swap Rotator,Rubik's Square,Star Rotator,Cancel]