ce.\ch[1,-1, Valencia Island,Nuvema,Lumiose,Alola,Exit]"FParalysis reduces speed and may prevent the Pokémon from moving."DParalysis remains after battles. Use Parlyz Heal for treatment."0It stays frozen even after the battle ends."3A frozen Pokémon becomes helplessly immobile."5Use Ice Heal to thaw out the suffering Pokémon."3When confused, a Pokémon's may attack itself."0Confusion does not last if recalled though."
