[["v\bDrayden: I'd like to thank you for your help in developing Iris's abilities. She's become an excellent Trainer."l\rIris: \PN! It's great to see you again. Can you believe we're both competing in the same competition?"�\rDon't think I'm going to be easy though. Since we last saw each other I've met and battled many Dragon-type Trainers and Pokémon."�\rPlus, I'm now the Champion of Unova. That's not enough to be a Dragon Master yet. Winning this battle against you will get me one step closer to that."^Rotom Phone: Based on performance, your rank is now 99. You have entered the Ultra Class."~\rIris: Ugh, I can't believe I lost. Don't worry, I'll keep getting stronger. Let's battle again once I reach the Ultra Class!"G\rIris: You're so good, but don't be surprised if I win next time."�\rIris: Wha! ...Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion? Good, because I need all the experience I can get if I'm going to become a Dragon Master."#\bWelcome to the Opelucid Gym."0\rDon't expect an easy victory around here."9\rDrayden is far stronger than your average Trainer."a\bDrayden uses Dragon type Pokémon. They are weak against the Dragon, Ice, and Fairy types."^\bThey are strong against Dragon. They are resistant to Electric, Fire, Grass, and Water.["�\bDrayden: Me gustaría darte las gracias por ayudar a desarrollar las habilidades de Iris. Se ha convertido en una Entrenadora excelente."l\rIris: ¡\PN! Qué alegría volver a verte. ¿Puedes creer que estemos compitiendo en el mismo torneo?"�\rPero no creas que va a ser fácil vencerme. Desde la última vez que nos vimos, me he encontrado y he combatido con muchos Entrenadores y Pokémon de tipo Dragón."�\rAdemás, ahora soy la Campeona de Teselia. Pero eso todavía no basta para convertirme en una Maestra Dragón. Ganarte en este combate me acercará un paso más a conseguirlo."[Rotom Phone: Según tu rendimiento, tu rango es ahora 99. Has entrado en la Ultraplus."�\rIris: Ugh, no puedo creer que haya perdido. No te preocupes, seguiré haciéndome más fuerte. ¡Volvamos a combatir cuando alcance la Ultraplus!"N\rIris: Eres muy bueno, pero no te sorprendas si la próxima vez gano yo."�\rIris: ¡¿Eh?! ...¡Hola, \PN! ¿Has vuelto para combatir contra una Campeona? Bien, porque necesito toda la experiencia posible si voy a convertirme en Maestra Dragón."0\bBienvenido al Gimnasio de Ciudad Caolín."0\rNo esperes una victoria fácil por aquí."@\rDrayden es mucho más fuerte que un Entrenador corriente."c\bDrayden usa Pokémon de tipo Dragón. Son débiles frente a los tipos Dragón, Hielo y Hada."_\bSon fuertes contra el tipo Dragón. Resisten los tipos Eléctrico, Fuego, Planta y Agua.;["v\bDrayden: I'd like to thank you for your help in developing Iris's abilities. She's become an excellent Trainer."l\rIris: \PN! It's great to see you again. Can you believe we're both competing in the same competition?"�\rDon't think I'm going to be easy though. Since we last saw each other I've met and battled many Dragon-type Trainers and Pokémon."�\rPlus, I'm now the Champion of Unova. That's not enough to be a Dragon Master yet. Winning this battle against you will get me one step closer to that."^Rotom Phone: Based on performance, your rank is now 99. You have entered the Ultra Class."~\rIris: Ugh, I can't believe I lost. Don't worry, I'll keep getting stronger. Let's battle again once I reach the Ultra Class!"G\rIris: You're so good, but don't be surprised if I win next time."�\rIris: Wha! ...Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion? Good, because I need all the experience I can get if I'm going to become a Dragon Master."#\bWelcome to the Opelucid Gym."0\rDon't expect an easy victory around here."9\rDrayden is far stronger than your average Trainer."a\bDrayden uses Dragon type Pokémon. They are weak against the Dragon, Ice, and Fairy types."^\bThey are strong against Dragon. They are resistant to Electric, Fire, Grass, and Water.Iu;␀�[[&"\bOnix"\bSteelix"\bSudowoodo"\bGeodude"l\bBrock uses Rock type Pokémon. They are weak against Water, Grass, Fighting, Ground, and Steel types."�\bDespite all the weaknesses, they are strong against Fire, Bug, Flying, and Ice. Normal and Poison moves also don't do much damage."\bCroagunk"\bCrobat"\bBattle me now!"2\bYou're pretty hot. But not as hot as Brock!"\rChansey"\rBlissey"\bLudicolo"\rComfey"\bMarshtomp"G\bBrock: So, you're here. I'm Brock. I'm Pewter City's Gym Leader."|\bMy rock-hard willpower is shown even in my Pokémon. My Pokémon are all rock hard, and have true-grit determination."\bShow me your best!".\bBrock: You've earned the Boulder Badge."\bHere, have this TM too."B\bA TM, Technical Machine, contains a technique for Pokémon."a\bTM80 contains Rock Slide. It inflicts damage and has a chance to make the opponent flinch."f\bBrock: I actually wanted to be a Pokémon Breeder, not a Gym Leader, but I do it for my family."+\bBrock: \PN? What are you doing here?"\\bCame to see me did you? I'm still training to be a doctor. How are your goals coming?"5\bNevermind. It might be easier to just show me."j\bBrock: Good to see you \PN! If you want I can groom one of your Pokémon. It may help it in battle."5\bBrock: Which Pokémon do you want me to groom?"\bBrock: Oh, okay then."2\bBrock: There! \v[2] looks a lot better now!"\rForretress"Yes"No[&"\bOnix"\bSteelix"\bSudowoodo"\bGeodude"l\bBrock usa Pokémon de tipo Roca. Son débiles frente a los tipos Agua, Planta, Lucha, Tierra y Acero."�\bA pesar de todas esas debilidades, son fuertes contra los tipos Fuego, Bicho, Volador y Hielo. Además, los movimientos de tipo Normal y Veneno tampoco les hacen mucho daño."\bCroagunk"\bCrobat"\b¡Combate conmigo ahora!"8\bEstás bastante bien. ¡Pero no tanto como Brock!"\rChansey"\rBlissey"\bLudicolo"\rComfey"\bMarshtomp"\\bBrock: Así que has venido. Soy Brock. Soy el Líder del Gimnasio de Ciudad Plateada."�\bMi férrea fuerza de voluntad se refleja incluso en mis Pokémon. Todos mis Pokémon son duros como la roca y tienen una det