l mundo lo llama pokemaníaco!"#\bCreo que vive en la Ruta 25."\rChansey"-\rHola, y bienvenido al Centro Pokémon."3\rDevolvemos la salud a tus Pokémon cansados."3\r¿Te gustaría que descansaran tus Pokémon?">\rDe acuerdo, me quedaré con tus Pokémon unos segundos."@\rPuede que tus Pokémon estén infectados por el Pokérus."v\rSe sabe muy poco sobre el Pokérus, salvo que son formas de vida microscópicas que se adhieren a los Pokémon."Z\rSe dice que, mientras están infectados, los Pokémon crecen de manera excepcional."\rGracias por esperar.";\rHemos devuelto la salud por completo a tus Pokémon.""\r¡Esperamos volver a verte!"=\rAntes deberías devolver toda la salud a tus Pokémon."9\rTus Pokémon han recuperado por completo su salud."+\r¡Esperamos que tengas mucho éxito!"N\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada, Cancelar]"V\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada,Carmín, Cancelar]"f\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada,Carmín,Azafrán,Lavanda,Cancelar]"o\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada,Carmín,Azafrán,Lavanda,Azulona, Cancelar]"v\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada,Carmín,Azafrán,Lavanda,Azulona, Fucsia,Cancelar]"}\rMi Clefairy puede teletransportarte.\ch[1,-1,Verde, Plateada,Carmín,Azafrán,Lavanda,Azulona, Fucsia,Isla Canela,Cancelar]"\r¡Clefairy!"Sí"No;["=\bBill has lots of Pokémon! He collects rare ones, too!"C\bHave you heard about Bill? Everyone calls him a Pokémantic!"&\bI believe he lives on Route 25."\rChansey"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"F\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter, Cancel]"P\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion, Cancel]"`\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Cancel]"i\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Cancel]"q\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Fuchsia,Cancel]"z\rMy Clefairy can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Viridian, Pewter,Vermilion,Saffron,Lavender,Celadon, Fuchsia,Cinnabar,Cancel]"\rClefairy!"Yes"NoIu;␀�f[[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"h\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city?"�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar"%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun.">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."M\bIf you get lost, you can use it and it will tell you where to go next."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."%\rIt was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"No[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: ¿Sí? ¿Qué quieres?"0\rChloe: ¿Qué debería hacer con mi vida?".\bOak: Estoy deseando ver tus resultados."/\r¿Crees que está aceptando solicitudes?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: ¿Qué tal fue la misión del Proyecto Mew? Mientras no estabas, llamó Opal. Le gustaría que visitaras su gimnasio en Pueblo Plié."G\bGoh: Espero que no sea para más cuestionarios. ¿Listo para ir?"�\bCerise: \PN, es terrible. Pokémon de todo el mundo están volviendo a convertirse en Huevos. Nadie sabe qué está pasando ni por qué."�\bCerise: El problema comenzó en Sinnoh, así que tendremos que empezar nuestra búsqueda allí. Puede que el Profesor Serbal tenga alguna idea sobre adónde ir."/\bGoh: No perdamos tiempo. ¿Estás listo?"r\bCerise: Gracias a los dos por responder tan rápido. Gracias a vosotros, todos los Pokémon están a salvo."�\bVolviendo a asuntos menos urgentes, Alistair, Líder del Gimnasio de Pueblo Crampón, quiere verte. Dice que tiene algo que podría ayudarte en tus combates."A\bGoh: Me vendría bien algo más relajado. ¿Listo para ir?"A\bCerise: ¿No te estaba esperando tu amigo en Ciudad Canal?"G\bCerise: He oído que vas a visitar a tu amigo en Ciudad Algaria."-\bCerise: Suerte en tu próximo combate."D\bCerise: He oído que Goh está ahora mismo en Ciudad Calagua."z\bCerise: Han avistado un Pokémon desconocido en las Nieves de la Corona. Me gustaría que los dos lo investigarais."C\bLa estación de tren de Ciudad Puntera puede llevaros allí."N\bCerise: Tienes que visitar al Profesor Oak. Dale recuerdos de mi parte."2\bCerise: Goh te está buscando en el parque."A\bCerise: El Torneo de Maestros ha comenzado. Confío en ti.":\bCerise: Vi todos tus combates. Lo hiciste muy bien."[\bGoh está en algún lugar de la ciudad esperándote. Quería hablar contigo de algo."_\bCerise: Así que os vais los dos, ¿eh? Aunque os echaré de menos, sé que es lo mejor."q\bGoh: Gracias, Profesor. Me aseguraré de venir de visita. Mis Pokémon estarán en buenas manos con usted."K\bCerise: Antes de que te vayas, tengo un regalo para ti. Úsalo bien."�\bTengo un último consejo para ti. Asegúrate de revisar tu teléfono a menudo y repasar tus notas. Ayuda a mantenerlo todo organizado."�\bCerise: Tengo un último consejo para ti. Asegúrate de revisar tu teléfono a menudo y repasar tus notas. Ayuda a mantenerlo todo organizado."\bCuídate."\rDragonite"\b¡Yamper!"2\bCerise: Gracias por visitar mi laboratorio."e\bCerise: Arriba hay una cama que podéis usar los dos. Empezaremos con nuestro trabajo mañana."\\bCerise: Ha aparecido una invasión masiva de Ivysaur en la ciudad. Id a investigarlo."�\bCerise: Así que la invasión masiva la causó el Team Rocket, ¿eh? Me alegra que estuvierais allí para encargaros del asunto."�\bAhora que eso está resuelto, deja que te dé el proyecto que tenía pensado. Goh encontró un artículo sobre el fenómeno que hace que los Pokémon se vuelvan gigantes."|\bEsto solo ocurre en la región de Galar, así que necesitaré que vayáis allí para descubrir qué está ocurriendo."9\bPodéis coger un tren allí desde Ciudad Azafrán."B\bCerise: Puedes coger un tren a Galar desde Ciudad Azafrán."�\bCerise: Así que encontrasteis un Snorlax gigante, ¿eh? Buen trabajo. Tendré que investigar esto más a fondo por mi cuenta."}\bNo quiero saturaros con un proyecto tras otro. ¿Por qué no os tomáis un descanso y visitáis el Frente Batalla en Hoenn?"3\bPodéis llegar allí en el barco del puerto."H\bCerise: Goh me contó que ganaste la Copa Flauta. ¡Buen trabajo!"h\bPero acabas de perderte a Goh. Oyó hablar de avistamientos de Dragonite y se fue a capturar uno."�\bAhora debería estar en la Isla Dragonite. Puedes reunirte con él tomando el barco que está al oeste del que acabas de usar."�\bCerise: Ahí estáis. Tengo noticias emocionantes para los dos. He conseguido dos entradas para las Series Mundiales de Coronación."=\bGoh: ¿Series Mundiales de Coronación? ¿Qué es eso?"�\bCerise: Es parecido a una liga, pero en vez de celebrarse en una sola región y tener un Campeón, se disputa por todo el mundo y corona al Monarca."o\bLa final se celebrará pronto. Deberíais daros prisa e ir a Ciudad Puntera antes de que os la perdáis."D\bCerise: ¿Qué tal fue el combate? Espero que lo disfrutaras."�\bEsta vez necesito que vayáis a las Ruinas Colosales del Resort Desierto. Puede que los Pokémon de allí dentro tengan relación con los de Galar."<\bPodéis llegar allí viajando a la Ruta 4 de Teselia."{\bGoh: Esto suena como una oportunidad para capturar algunos Pokémon. Yo estoy listo si tú lo estás. ¿Quieres ir ahora?"{\bCerise: ¿Estás listo, \PN? La próxima temporada de las Series Mundiales de Coronación ha comenzado oficialmente."7\bVamos a inscribirte a través de tu Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Inscrito: Entrenador \PN. Clase Normal. El rival cercano Visquez, ubicado en el Gimnasio de Ciudad Carmín, está listo para combatir."5\bGoh: Vaya, ¿ya te han emparejado con alguien?"�\bCerise: Ya hay más de 10.000 participantes. Tiene sentido que todo el mundo esté deseando combatir. \PN, ve a reunirte con él."K\bCerise: \PN, ve a reunirte con él en el Gimnasio de Ciudad Carmín."a\bCerise: Bien, ya estáis los dos aquí. Necesito que vayáis a la Zona Descanso de Sinnoh."�\bHan surgido rumores sobre un Pokémon misterioso que, según dicen, se esconde en un lago cercano. A ver si podéis encontrarlo."g\bCerise: Me alegra que los dos hayáis podido encontrar al Magikarp antes que el Team Rocket. Es-"�Rotom Phone: Anuncio. Las Series Mundiales de Coronación están organizando un Desafío del Festival de Combate en Ciudad Yantra, en la región de Kalos."h\bGoh: Es en Kalos. Es una gran oportunidad para capturar algunos Pokémon de Kalos. ¿Vamos ahora?"M\bCerise: ¿Así que has entrado en la Superclase? ¡Eso es fantástico!"}\bCerise: Hablando de eso, creo que la Campeona de Galar va a tener pronto un combate. Deberías ir a Ciudad Puntera a verlo."B\bGoh: Yo estoy listo para ir. ¿Tú también lo estás, \PN?"�\bCerise: ¿Qué tal van tus combates? Si te apetece tomarte un descanso, Goh está ahora mismo en el Centro Pokémon participando en un evento de intercambio."F\bCerise: Creo que Goh te estaba buscando en el parque de atrás."R\bCerise: ¿Tienes un combate en Ciudad Azafrán? No dejes que te entretenga."�\bCerise: Gracias por reunirte con nosotros, \PN. Ha aparecido una tormenta de arena en Ciudad Malvalona. Como consecuencia, la gente de allí ha sido obligada a marcharse."�\bNo solo eso, sino que una canción de inquietante belleza procedente del interior de la tormenta de arena parece estar hipnotizando a los ciudadanos."�\bGoh: Esto parece algo de lo que podemos encargarnos. \PN, sé que lo has estado pasando mal en tus últimos combates. ¿Listo para intentarlo?"r\bCerise: Gracias a los dos por ocuparos de ese Flygon. Me pregunto qué lo llevó a hacerle eso a la ciudad."�\bSea como sea, mientras no estabais recibí una llamada del Profesor Kukui. Le gustaría que \PN fuera a Alola de visita. Goh, tú también eres bienvenido."W\bGoh: Gracias por invitarme. \PN, supongo que yo ya estoy listo para ir. ¿Y tú?"+\bCerise: ¿Qué tal van tus combates?"L\bCerise: Goh te está esperando en la Ruta 10. Está al este de aquí."|\bCerise: Goh me contó que Zapdos fue un desafío difícil. Como mínimo, sí lograsteis evitar que provocara otro apagón."N\bCerise: Deberías... \PN, ¿qué es ese resplandor rojo que sale de ti?"N\bGoh: Es la Muñequera Dinamax. Pero eso no puede usarse fuera de Galar."�\bCerise: Eso es preocupante. Deberías ir a Pueblo Par en Galar para reunirte con la Profesora Magnolia. Es la máxima experta en Dinamax."?\bPuedes llegar allí cogiendo el tren en Ciudad Azafrán."N\bCerise: Puedes llegar a Pueblo Par cogiendo el tren en Ciudad Azafrán."|\bCerise: Me alegra que los dos hayáis podido detener una crisis. Descansad un poco y luego retomad vuestros combates."�\bCerise: Ya has vuelto. Goh se impacientó y no pudo esperar. Se fue a la Isla Cero. Puedes llegar a ella en el barco del extremo del puerto."f\bCerise: Supongo que Mew no estaba allí. Es una pena, pero he encontrado otra cosa emocionante."b\bAl parecer, hay fósiles raros en el Área Silvestre. Los dos deberíais ir a investigarlo."Z\bGoh: Voy a capturarlos y completar todavía más la Pokédex. \PN, ¿listo para ir?"u\bCerise: Ahí estáis los dos. Mi hija me recordó el Bosque Lumirinto y los Ponyta y Rapidash que viven allí."J\bMe preguntaba si podríais ir hasta allí y ver si encontráis uno."\\bTendréis que ir al oeste desde Ciudad Artejo y luego al noreste desde Pueblo Ladera."@\bGoh: Por supuesto, Profesor. \PN, ¿estás listo para ir?"|\bCerise: El Castillo de la Caballería se encuentra tomando el dirigible en Ciudad Luminalia. Disfruta de tu entrenamiento."I\bCerise: Goh te está esperando en el laboratorio del Profesor Oak."�\bGoh: Profesor. He recibido mi misión clasificatoria del Proyecto Mew. Necesito encontrar un Ninetales de Alola en el Monte Corona."\\bCerise: Estupendo. \PN, ¿por qué no vas con él? El apoyo moral siempre viene bien."4\bGoh: Lo agradecería. ¿Estás listo para ir?"|\bCerise: Me alegra que hayáis vuelto. La gente de Sinnoh está sufriendo pesadillas. Sospecho que Darkrai está implicado."n\bLas pesadillas están ocurriendo por los alrededores de Pueblo Aromaflor. Por favor, id a investigarlo."4\bGoh: ¿Pesadillas...? Eso suena serio. Vamos."<\bCerise: Goh te está esperando en el Resort Desierto."Dracovish"R\rMamá: \PN, ¿qué te parece este lugar? Creo que al final quedará genial."4\bGoh: Me pregunto por qué Lugia estaba aquí."R\rHe oído que el Profesor Cerezo tiene una hija. Me pregunto dónde estará."\bGengar"*\bGoh: Me pregunto qué querrá Opal."~\bGoh: Pokémon de todo el mundo se están convirtiendo en Huevos. Tenemos que arreglar esto antes de que sea demasiado tarde."6\bGoh: Por suerte pudimos detener al Team Rocket."7\bGoh: ¿Te diriges a Ciudad Algaria? Diviértete."G\bGoh: Necesito tu ayuda con mi próxima misión del Proyecto Mew."�\bEl objetivo es encontrar a Articuno. Mi mejor apuesta son las Islas Espuma. He oído que podemos llegar allí desde Isla Canela."\b¿Estás listo para ir?"C\bGoh: Tienes un nuevo combate, ¿verdad? Estaré animándote."J\bGoh: Las Nieves de la Corona. Me pregunto qué encontraremos allí."X\bGoh: Empezar por mi cuenta da miedo. Pero sé que necesito vivir esa experiencia."\bSirfetch'd")\bHola. Soy Ren, y este es Francois."<\bHe oído que este laboratorio solía estar encantado."9\bCerise: Buenos días. Tengo vuestra primera tarea."W\bHa aparecido una invasión masiva de Ivysaur en la ciudad. Salid a investigarlo."P\bPero antes de que os vayáis, tengo algo que debería ayudaros a los dos."E\bSi os perdéis, podéis usarlo y os dirá adónde ir después.":\bGoh: Gracias, Profesor. \PN, pongámonos en marcha."-\bYa era hora de que este sitio abriera."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Anuncio. Nuevo combate programado para las Series Mundiales de Coronación. El combate tendrá lugar en la Liga de Kalos contra Drácena."IParece que Gengar confía en ti. ¿Te gustaría llevártelo contigo?"C\rHola. Soy Chrysa, una de las asistentes del Profesor Cerezo.">\rMe hace mucha ilusión que trabajes aquí con nosotros."*\rHa sido estupendo trabajar contigo."1\rJessie: Ahora nos llevaremos tus Pokémon.".\bMeowth: No tenéis ninguna oportunidad."2\bJames: Ni se os ocurra intentar resistiros."\bWobbuffet: ¡Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"Y\bCerise: Así que tú y Goh encontrasteis al raro Pokémon Lugia. Es todo un logro."]\bTengo una idea. ¿Por qué no os quedáis aquí como mis asistentes de investigación?"-\bGoh: ¿De verdad? ¡Eso sería genial!"P\rMamá: \PN, qué emocionante. Dejaré a Mimey aquí para que cuide de ti."?\rNunca pensé que este lugar llegaría a abrir de verdad."4\bGoh: Nunca había visto una invasión masiva."%\bGoh: Nunca he estado en Galar."H\bGoh: Las Series Mundiales de Coronación. Eso te pega mucho, \PN."9\bGoh: Voy a capturar un montón de Pokémon nuevos."2\bGoh: Lo harás genial en tu primer combate."8\bGoh: Vamos a encontrar a ese Pokémon misterioso.";\bGoh: Me alegra que pudiéramos encontrar a Magikarp.".\bGoh: Lo hiciste genial en tus combates."A\bGoh: Me pregunto qué estará pasando en Ciudad Malvalona."$\bGoh: Ese Flygon fue tremendo."F\bGoh: Alola fue divertida. Quizá podríamos volver algún día."O\bGoh: Me pregunto qué estará haciendo que tu Muñequera Dinamax brille."K\bGoh: Vaya viaje ha sido ese. Me alegra volver a la búsqueda de Mew."/\bGoh: Mewtwo me dio mucho en qué pensar."1\bGoh: He estado capturando muchos Pokémon."�\bGoh: El Castillo de la Caballería suena como una buena forma de entrenar a algunos de mis Pokémon. Puede que yo también vaya."C\bGoh: Me preocupa el Proyecto Mew. ¿Seré lo bastante bueno?">\bGoh: Darkrai suena peligroso. Deberíamos darnos prisa."Magnemite"U\bCerise: Gracias a todos por asistir a la inauguración del Laboratorio Cerezo."�\bCerise: Con vuestro apoyo, estoy seguro de que aprenderé todo lo que hay que saber sobre el mundo y los Pokémon que lo habitan. Es..."A\bOh. Parece que han avistado un Pokémon raro en el puerto."K\b\PN, eso parece ideal para ti. ¿Por qué no vas a echar un vistazo?"E\bSolía pasar por aquí de noche. Siempre me daba escalofríos."�Rotom Phone: Anuncio. Se ha encontrado un nuevo rival para las Series Mundiales de Coronación. Maike, ubicada en Ciudad Azafrán, está lista para combatir."Sí"No;[�"\bMr. Mime"$\rChloe: Yes? What do you want?",\rChloe: What should I do with my life?"7\bOak: I'm looking forward to seeing your results."-\rDo you think he's taking applications?"\rEevee"�\bCerise: How did the Project Mew mission go? While you were gone, a call from Opal came in. She'd like you to visit her gym in Ballonlea."=\bGoh: Hopefully it's not for more quizzes. Ready to go?"�\bCerise: \PN, it's terrible. Pokémon all over the world are turning back into Eggs. Nobody knows what is happening or what is going on."�\bCerise: The issue began in Sinnoh, so we'll have to start our search there. Professor Rowan may have some idea as to where to go."4\bGoh: Let's not waste any time. Are you ready?"_\bCerise: Thank you both for your quick response. Thanks to you all the Pokémon are safe."�\bBack to less pressing matters, Allister, a Stow-on- Side Gym Leader, would like to meet you. He says he has something to help you with your battles."=\bGoh: I could use something more relaxing. Ready to go?"C\bCerise: Wasn't your friend waiting for you in Canalave City?"P\bCerise: I heard you're going to be visiting your friend at Mossdeep City.",\bCerise: Good luck in your next match.":\bCerise: I heard Goh was in Lilycove City right now."t\bCerise: An unknown Pokémon has been spotted in the Crown Tundra. I'd like the both of you to investigate it."6\bThe train station in Wyndon can take you there."D\bCerise: You need to visit Professor Oak. Give him my regards."2\bCerise: Goh is looking for you in the park."B\bCerise: The Masters Tournament has begun. I believe in you."B\bCerise: I watched all of your battles. You did a great job."e\bGoh is somewhere in the city waiting for you. He had something he wanted to talk to you about."c\bCerise: So the two of you are leaving? As much as I'll miss you, I know this is what's best."d\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. I'll be sure to visit. My Pokémon will be in good hands with you."A\bCerise: Before you go, I have a gift for you. Use it well."�\bI have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."�\bCerise: I have one last piece of advice for you. Be sure to check your phone often and refresh yourself on your notes. It helps to stay organized."\bTake care."\rDragonite"\bYamper!"-\bCerise: Thank you for visiting my lab."e\bCerise: There's a bed upstairs the two of you can use. We'll get started on our work tomorrow."V\bCerise: A mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Go investigate it."d\bCerise: So the mass outbreak was caused by Team Rocket? I'm glad you were there to handle it."�\bNow that that's been handled, let me give you the project I intended on. Goh found an article about the phenomenon that causes Pokémon to grow giant."h\bThis only happens in the Galar region, so I'll need you to go there to discover what's happening."4\bYou can take a train there from Saffron City."?\bCerise: You can take a train to Galar from Saffron City."b\bCerise: So you found a giant Snorlax? Good work. I'll have to research this more on my own."�\bI don't want to overload you with one project after the next. Why don't you take a break and visit the Battle Frontier in Hoenn?"5\bYou can get there from the ship at the harbor."@\bCerise: I heard from Goh you won the Flute Cup. Good job!"a\bYou just missed Goh, however. He heard about Dragonite sightings and left to go catch one."|\bHe should be at Dragonite Island now. You can meet up with him by taking the boat to the west of the one you were just on."}\bCerise: There you are. I have some exciting news for you both. I acquired two tickets for the World Coronation Series."1\bGoh: World Coronation Series? What's that?"�\bCerise: It's similar to a league, but instead of taking place in one region and having a Champion, it takes place across the world and crowns the Monarch."V\bThe finals is taking place soon. You should hurry to Wyndon before you miss it."9\bCerise: How was the battle? I hope you enjoyed it."�\bThis time I need the two of you to head to the Colossus Ruins in the Desert Resort. The Pokémon inside might have a connection to the ones in Galar."D\bYou can find your way there by traveling to Route 4 in Unova."p\bGoh: This sounds like an opportunity to catch some Pokémon. I'm ready if you are. Do you want to go now?"d\bCerise: Are you ready, \PN? The World Coronation Series's next season has officially started."7\bLet's get you registed through your Rotom Phone."�Rotom Phone: ...Registed: Trainer \PN. Normal Class. Nearby opponent Visquez, located in the Vermilion City Gym, is ready for battle."9\bGoh: Woah, you've already matched up with someone?"�\bCerise: There are already over 10,000 participants. It makes sense that everyone is eager for battle. \PN, go ahead and meet up with them."H\bCerise: \PN, go ahead and meet up with them at the Vermilion Gym."W\bCerise: Good, you've both here. I need you to head to the Resort Area in Sinnoh."n\bThere's been rumors of a mysterious Pokémon said to be hiding in a local lake. See if you can find it."^\bCerise: I'm happy the two of you were able to find the Magikarp before Team Rocket. It-"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. The World Coronation Series is hosting a Battle Festival Challenge in Shalour City in the Kalos region."`\bGoh: It's in Kalos. That's a great chance to catch some Kalos Pokémon. Should we go now?"C\bCerise: So you've entered the Great Class? That's fantastic!"s\bCerise: Speaking of, I think the Galar Champion is having a match soon. You should head to Wyndon and watch."5\bGoh: I'm ready to go. Are you good to go, \PN?"�\bCerise: How are your battles going? If you're looking to take a break, Goh is at the Pokémon Center right now taking place in a trade event."D\bCerise: I think Goh was looking for you in the park out back."J\bCerise: You have a match in Saffron City? Don't let me hold you up."�\bCerise: Thank you for joining us, \PN. A sandstorm has appeared in Mauville City. The people there have been pushed out as a result."v\bNot only that, but a hauntingly beautiful song from inside the sandstorm is seemingly hypnotizing the citizens."�\bGoh: This sounds like something we can handle. \PN, I know you've been struggling with your last few matches. Ready to give this a shot?"h\bCerise: Thank you both for dealing with that Flygon. I wonder what caused it do that to the city?"�\bRegardless, I recieved a call while you were both gone from Professor Kukui. He'd like for \PN to come to Alola to visit. Goh, you're welcomed as well."M\bGoh: Thank you for inviting me. \PN, I guess I'm ready to go. Are you?"*\bCerise: How are your battles going?"L\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Route 10. It's to the east of here."�\bCerise: I heard from Goh that Zapdos was a difficult challenge. At the very least, you did manage to stop it from causing another power outage."G\bCerise: You should... \PN, what's that red glow coming from you?"K\bGoh: It's the Dynamax Band. But that can't be used outside of Galar."�\bCerise: That is concerning. You should head to Wedgehurst in Galar to meet with Professor Magnolia. She's the leading expert on Dynamax."8\bYou can get there by taking the train in Saffron."H\bCerise: You can get to Wedgehurst by taking the train in Saffron."n\bCerise: I'm glad the both of you were able to stop a crisis. Take a break and get back to your battles."�\bCerise: You're back. Goh got impatient and couldn't wait. He went to Cero Island. You can find it through the boat at the far end of the port."[\bCerise: I guess Mew wasn't there. It's a shame, but I found something else exciting."Z\bApparently, there are rare fossils in the Wild Area. You two should go investigate."Y\bGoh: I'm going to catch them and fill up the Pokédex even more. \PN, ready to go?"|\bCerise: There you two are. My daughter reminded me about Glimwood Tangle and the Ponyta and Rapidash that live there."X\bI was wondering if the two of you could head there and see if you could find one."R\bYou'll have to go west from Hammerlocke, then north east from Stow-on-Side.";\bGoh: Of course, Professor. \PN, are you ready to go?"l\bCerise: The Castle of Chivalry can be found by taking the blimp in Lumiose City. Enjoy your training."=\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at Professor Oak's lab."{\bGoh: Professor. I've recieved my qualifier mission from Project Mew. I need to find an Alolan Ninetales at Mount Coronet."[\bCerise: Wonderful. \PN, why don't you go with him? Moral support is always welcomed."0\bGoh: I'd welcome it. Are you ready to go?"|\bCerise: I'm glad you two are back. People in Sinnoh have been struggling with nightmares. I suspect a Darkrai is involved."Q\bThe nightmares are happening around Floaroma Town. Please go check it out."8\bGoh: Nightmares... That sounds serious. Let's go.";\bCerise: Goh is waiting for you at the Desert Resort."Dracovish"\\rMom: \PN, what do you think of this place? I think it's going to turn out just great."(\bGoh: I wonder why Lugia was here?"F\rI heard Professor Cerise has a daughter. I wonder where she is."\bGengar"%\bGoh: I wonder what Opal wants."f\bGoh: Pokémon around the world are turning into Eggs. We need to fix this before it's too late."8\bGoh: Thankfully we were able to stop Team Rocket."1\bGoh: You're heading to Mossdeep? Have fun.">\bGoh: I need your help with my next Project Mew mission."\bThe objective is to find an Articuno. My best guess is at the Seafoam Islands. I heard we can get there from Cinnabar Island."\bAre you ready to go?"F\bGoh: You have a new battle, don't you? I'll be rooting for you."=\bGoh: The Crown Tundra. I wonder what we'll find there."U\bGoh: Starting out on my own is terrifying. But I know I need to experience it."\bSirfetch'd")\bHi. I'm Ren, and this is Francois."+\bI heard this lab used to be haunted."B\bCerise: Good morning. I have your first assignment for you."X\bA mass outbreak of Ivysaur has appeared in the city. Head out and investigate it."L\bBut before you go, I have something that should help the both of you."M\bIf you get lost, you can use it and it will tell you where to go next."7\bGoh: Thank you, Professor. \PN, let's get going.")\bIt's about time this place opened."\bRiolu"\bLucario"�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at the Kalos League against Drasna."IGengar seems like it trusts you. Would you like to take it with you?"?\rHello. I'm Chrysa, one of Professor Cerise's assistants."4\rI'm excited to have you working here with us."%\rIt was great working with you."1\rJessie: We'll be taking your Pokémon now."(\bMeowth: You don't stand a chance."+\bJames: Don't even try and resist us."\bWobbuffet: Wobbuffet!"\bFarfetch'd"^\bCerise: So you and Goh found the rare Pokémon, Lugia. That's quite the achomplishment."T\bI have an idea. Why don't the two of you stay here as my research assistants?"(\bGoh: Really? That would be great!"G\rMom: \PN, how exciting. I'll leave Mimey here to watch over you."6\rI never thought this place would actually open."3\bGoh: I've never seen a mass outbreak before.",\bGoh: I've never been to Galar before."N\bGoh: The World Coronation Series. That sounds right up your alley, \PN."5\bGoh: I'm going to catch a ton of new Pokémon."1\bGoh: You'll do great in your first battle."0\bGoh: Let's find that mysterious Pokémon."4\bGoh: I'm happy we were able to find Magikarp."*\bGoh: You did great in your matches."1\bGoh: I wonder what's going on in Mauville."$\bGoh: That Flygon was intense."<\bGoh: Alola was fun. Maybe we could go again sometime.">\bGoh: I wonder what's causing your Dynamax Band to glow?"V\bGoh: What a journey that was. I'm glad to be getting back to searching for Mew."0\bGoh: Mewtwo gave me a lot to think about."1\bGoh: I've been catching a lot of Pokémon."k\bGoh: The Castle of Chivalry sounds like a good way to train some of my Pokémon. I might go as well."A\bGoh: I'm worried about Project Mew. Will I be good enough?"6\bGoh: Darkrai sounds dangerous. We should hurry."Magnemite"V\bCerise: Thank you, everyone, for visiting the opening of the Cerise Laboratory."z\bCerise: With your support, I'm certain I'll learn all there is about the world and Pokémon that inhabit it. It...."C\bOh. It seems a rare Pokémon has been spotted in the harbor."U\b\PN, that sounds right up your alley. Why don't you go ahead and check it out?"G\bI used to walk by this place at night. It always creeped me out."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Maike, located in Saffron City, is ready for battle."Yes"NoIu;␀�[[%")\rAre you good enough to face Misty?"F\rYou have to face other Trainers to see how good you really are."\bClauncher!"\rPolitoed"Lily: We run the Gym here."\bPsyduck"\rGoldeen"!Violet: We run the Gym here."\bAzurill"\bCorsola"V\bMisty uses Water type Pokémon. They are weak against Grass and Electric types."s\bThey are strong against Fire, Ground, and Rock. Fire, Ice, Steel, and Water moves also don't do much damage."\bHorsea"\bGyarados!"\bLet's battle!"\\bMisty is a Trainer who's going to keep improving. She won't lose to someone like you!"Starmie"g\rMis