 5 years. It finally ends here. This is probably the final legacy."�\bMy legacy could've been just been between a few chosen ones. But Reinhart trusted and passed the baton to us to continue this journey in the ways we can, and I am appreciative of that."C\bSo yeah. That's it. Thanks for listening to my yapping. Heh."N\bWere you expecting more? Have you met Luc and Foul through this system?"\b......................"Q\bI guess I could spare some time for you. I did promise the BIG BAD to you."4\bThis shouldn't be difficult for you. Alright?"K\bYou did it. You defeated the BIG BAD. I'm truly proud of you. *sigh*"d\bThis is really finally all over for me. Let me bring you back. And I will go back to my spot."\bAnd goodbye."/The cool breeze refreshes your Pokémon...Iu;␀�[[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are no apricorns."(\bPainting. What a wonderful thing."C\bDo you know of the move Sketch? It can copy almost any move."\bLook at my Pokémon."\bI think I fit in." \rHave you seen my brother?"%\rI need to return his Arcanine.["&\rHoy conocí al chico más mono."\rEspero volver a verlo."&\b¿Te gustan las aguas termales?"\bDebería irme pronto."f\rHay un árbol de Bonguri por aquí. ¿Crees que algún día podríamos usarlo como combustible?"-\rLos tipos Eléctricos son los mejores."No hay Bonguris.")\bPintar. Qué cosa tan maravillosa."O\b¿Conoces el movimiento Esquema? Puede copiar casi cualquier movimiento."\bMira a mi Pokémon."\bCreo que encajo aquí." \r¿Has visto a mi hermano?"(\rTengo que devolverle su Arcanine.;[""\rI met the cutest boy today." \rI hope to meet him again."\bDo you like hot springs?"\bI should be going soon."Z\rThere's an Apricorn tree around here. Do you think we could use it as fuel one day?"#\rElectric types are the best."There are