ith me, \PN. I can sense you have a lot of potential. It reminds me of when I discovered Leon."�\bWe've both worked hard to get where we are today. I plan to use that success to preserve the very best that Galar has to offer."�\bMy point is that you have promise as a Trainer and I'd like to offer my resources to support your battling ambitions. What do you think?"\b... You don't want it?"M\rOleana: How dare you. Do you have any idea what kind of honor this is?"H\bRose: Now, now, \PN is following his own path. I can admire that."\bThank you for your time."G\rA Champion, are you? I guess you might need something like this."a\rThose candies work based on experience over levels. Try using that one on a weak Pokémon."^\rMost people don't take the train these days. The Flying Taxi is how most people travel."\\bI've worked here for over a year. The stuff we're doing is going to change the world."8\bI like to come here after a long day of battling."Yes"No"Saffron"Goldenrod"	Exit"FreezingtonIu;␀[["\rIndeedee"<\bI just gave away my last X Attack. Why did I do that?"Z\rChairman Rose never fails to amaze me. The amount of work he puts into this region."S\bHave you been to the Wild Area? It's one of the biggest places in the world."H\rMy Kadabra can Teleport you. However, she is too tired right now."@\rMy Kadabra can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Hammerlocke, Cancel]"W\rMy Kadabra can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Hammerlocke, Stow-on-Side,Ballonlea,Cancel]"a\rMy Kadabra can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Hammerlocke, Stow-on-Side,Ballonlea,Spikemuth,Cancel]"l\rMy Kadabra can Teleport you.\ch[1,-1,Hammerlocke, Stow-on-Side,Ballonlea,Spikemuth,Wedgehurst,Cancel]"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon.