e."Sí"No;[\"\bIndeedee"(\bDo you think I can enter one day?"X\rIris: Do you think I could ask Cynthia and Diantha for a picture? I'm so nervous."'\rLeon's Charizard is unstoppable."?\bAlain will be my pick. Someone has to pick the underdog."/\bThis room is only for the Masters Eight."N\rDawn: You're in the finals! No need to worry though. I know you'll win."\bRookidee"]\rCynthia is my pick. Her elegance and calculations are going to put her above the pack."T\rDiantha: How lovely to see you again. I hope you perform well against Steven."9\rDiantha: I have to battle Leon next. Wish me luck."[\rDiantha: Don't underestimate Leon. His raw strength is enough to overwhelm strategy.":\bI made it to the top eight last year. It was tough.":\bI've been following Leon for years. He never loses."\rDratini"t\bLeon: Thank you everyone for supporting me during this season, but there's an emergency outside. I need to..."9\bWait, you already dealt with it? What's your name?"W\b\PN, thank you. You saved the stadium from ruin. Let me give you this as thanks."i\bThat's a Dynamax Band. With it you'll be able to Dynamax your Pokémon in certain places in Galar."b\bHow would you like to test it out in a battle against me? I'll meet you inside the stadium."t\bAnd to everyone else, I promise I'll keep doing my best to deliver the greatest battles for you all to watch!"h\bLeon: How would you like to test it out in a battle against me? I'll meet you inside the stadium."=\bIris is my pick. Her Dragon past strikes a cord in me."M\bLance: It's nice to see each other under less dangerous circumstances."3\bThere are no matches taking place right now."B\bYou're the Trainer Leon agreed to challenge. Are you ready?"R\bYou're \PN? You're late. We were about to call the match in Marnie's favor."/\bWhatever. You're here now. Get in there.")\bParticipant \PN. Please follow me."~\bNow, Wyndon Stadium is crammed full with spectators. You can already hear cheers in anticipation of the heated battles."G