bOh! That's it! That's an honest to goodness Heart Scale!"F\bLet me guess, you want me to teach one of your Pokémon a move?"%\bWhich Pokémon needs tutoring?"K\bIf your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back with a Heart Scale."?\bHunh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an Egg.":\bNo way, I don't want to go near a Shadow Pokémon.."\bSorry..."I\bIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach to your \v[3]."/\bWhich move should I teach to your \v[3]?"1\PN handed over one Heart Scale in exchange."\bThe Park here is so fun!"+\bToo bad you can't catch any of them."Yes"No["l\bLa gente no dejaba de capturar a los Pokémon del parque, así que se creó una norma para impedirlo."1\rOh, ¿vas a probar los Gimnasios de aquí?"*\rEntonces toma esto. Puede ayudarte."G\rEl Gimnasio más cercano es el de Cissy. Está en la Isla Mikan."O\bMi casa se siente un poco distinta. Solo que no sé qué es exactamente."3\bSoy el Maníaco de los Movimientos Pokémon."W\bConozco todos y cada uno de los movimientos que aprenden los Pokémon al crecer.",\bTambién colecciono Escamas Corazón."J\bSi me traes una, le enseñaré un movimiento a uno de tus Pokémon."8\b¡Oh! ¡Eso es! ¡Una Escama Corazón auténtica!"V\bDéjame adivinar: ¿quieres que le enseñe un movimiento a uno de tus Pokémon?")\b¿Qué Pokémon necesita tutoría?"X\bSi tus Pokémon necesitan aprender un movimiento, vuelve con una Escama Corazón."J\b¿Eh? No hay ni un solo movimiento que pueda enseñarle a un Huevo."=\bNi hablar, no quiero acercarme a un Pokémon Oscuro..."\bLo siento..."N\bNo parece que tenga ningún movimiento que pueda enseñarle a tu \v[3]."8\b¿Qué movimiento debería enseñarle a tu \v[3]?"/\PN entregó una Escama Corazón a cambio.".\b¡El parque de aquí es divertidísimo!"1\bLástima que no puedas capturar a ninguno."Sí"No;["W\bPeople kept catching the Pokémon in the park, so a rule was made to prevent it."1\rOh, you're going to try out the Gyms here?"'\rTake this then. It may help you."V\rThe closest Gym to here is the one that belongs to Cissy. It's on Mikan Island."G\bMy house feels a little different. I just don't know what it is."$\bI'm the Pokémon Move Maniac."?\bI know every single move that Pokémon learn growing up.",\bI'm also a collector of Heart Scales."F\bIf you bring me one, I'll teach a move to one of your Pokémon."?\bOh! That's it! That's an honest to goodness Heart Scale!"F\bLet me guess, you want me to teach one of your Pokémon a move?"%\bWhich Pokémon needs tutoring?"K\bIf your Pokémon need to learn a move, come back with a Heart Scale."?\bHunh? There isn't a single move that I can teach an Egg.":\bNo way, I don't want to go near a Shadow Pokémon.."\bSorry..."I\bIt doesn't appear as if I have any move I can teach to your \v[3]."/\bWhich move should I teach to your \v[3]?"1\PN handed over one Heart Scale in exchange."\bThe Park here is so fun!"+\bToo bad you can't catch any of them."Yes"NoIu;␀7[["8\bDespite the park, we don't get too many visitors."#The map seems to be incorrect."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rChansey"Yes"No[">\bA pesar del parque, no recibimos demasiados visitantes."#El mapa parece ser incorrecto."-\rHola, y bienvenido al Centro Pokémon."@\rDevolvemos la salud por completo a tus Pokémon cansados."3\r¿Te gustaría que tus Pokémon descansaran?">\rDe acuerdo, me quedaré con tus Pokémon unos segundos."@\rPuede que tus Pokémon estén infectados por el Pokérus."v\rSe sabe muy poco sobre el Pokérus, salvo que son formas de vida microscópicas que se adhieren a los Pokémon."Z\rSe dice que, mientras están infectados, los Pokémon crecen excepcionalmente bien."\rGracias por esperar.";\rHemos devuelto la salud por completo a tus Pokémon.""\r¡Esperamos volver a verte!"G\rAntes deberías restaurar por completo la salud de tus Pokémon."1\rTus Pokémon han recuperado toda su salud." \r¡Esperamos que triunfes!"\rChansey"Sí"No;["8\bDespite the park, we don't get too many visitors."#The map seems to be incorrect."1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rChansey"Yes"NoIu;␀
0[[�"Choose your path."U\bMilo: Well then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"h\rNessa: No matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."i\bKabu: In the end, the match will be decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."G\rBea: I think I'll test that unshakable spirit of yours, shall I?"#\bAllister: H...here...I go..."Y\rOpal: I'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."4\bGordie: Size means strength! Savor this pain!"p\rMelony: All righty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."Q\bAvery: Prepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"-\rKlara: You'll never know what hit you!"O\bPiers: Get ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"M\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"P\bRaihan: Bring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"^\bMustard: Don't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"n\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolutely champion time!"<\bHop: So let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"a\bBede: I suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how pathetic you are and how strong I am."U\rMarnie: It'd be no fun if things ended quick... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"M\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna give it a taste test?"B\rGloria: Ok, wait no further! All pumped up and ready to go!"\\rMagnolia: So, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."(\rSonia: Let's give it our all now!"a\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, then Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"�\bRose: I saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."k\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle. But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"K\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules. You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"]\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh? Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"W\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello! I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"f\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"[\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think. I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"}\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia. Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."{\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do. Dream big."{\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant. I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"e\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden? I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."N\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view. Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."|\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you. You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."z\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're... titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."^\rI believe you have the potential to do great things. But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"u\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover. There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."z\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk. Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored? Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"c\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions! I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"S\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning. I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"S\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing! I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine."�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."y\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I’m an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they’re fans of mine!"�\rOften, they’ll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"^\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That’s true of people and Pokémon alike!"t\rI’ve definitely noticed what your good points are! I’ll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"Y\rMina: Hrmmm! Bueno, esto es frustrante. No logré sacar de verdad todo mi poder..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"h\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can’t let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."^\bDon't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."w\bIt’s been a while since I’ve walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It’s a nice feeling."P\bNow I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."i\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can’t be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."^\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"[\rLet’s be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"i\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."6\bI’d be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an autoridad expert of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don’t expect to be forgiven. I’m simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."p\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!">\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us? *laughs*"W\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND! And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."Z\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress. And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."}\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters. So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"^\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"O\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."d\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"Y\bMolayne: Now I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"=\bElio: I’d be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"|\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"	Left"	Down"
Right"Yes"No"Stay and Confront"Return to Lobby"Escape[�"Elige tu camino."W\bMilo: Bueno, entonces, ¿ponemos este pajar en marcha? ¡Esto va a ser de aúpa!"l\rNessa: Da igual el tipo de plan que estés tramando, mi compañera y yo nos encargaremos de hundirlo."i\bKabu: Al final, el combate se decidirá por qué lado sea capaz de liberar su verdadero potencial."[\rBea: Creo que pondré a prueba ese espíritu inquebrantable que tienes, ¿te parece?"#\bAllister: A...aquí...voy..."f\rOpal: No te perderé de vista, criatura. Enséñame de lo que eres capaz cuando das todo de ti."<\bGordie: ¡El tamaño es fuerza! ¡Saborea este dolor!"l\rMelony: Muy bien, supongo que deberíamos empezar. No podrás escapar cuando te congele por completo."e\bAvery: ¡Prepárate para experimentar poderes psíquicos que desafían la comprensión humana!"2\rKlara: ¡No sabrás ni qué te ha golpeado!"V\bPiers: ¡Prepárate para un pogo conmigo y con los míos! ¡Es hora de rockear!"O\bPeony: ¡Prepárate, soy bastante feroz en combate! ¡No te me achantes!"g\bRaihan: ¡Que llegue la tormenta! ¡Yo, el poderoso Raihan, haré salir volando a todo el mundo!"[\bMustard: ¡No hagas esperar demasiado a este anciano! Solo dilo cuando estés listo."q\bLeon: Puedo sentir a mis compañeros impacientes de emoción... ¡Lo vamos a pasar de auténtico campeón!"U\bHop: ¡Así que enseñémosle a todo el mundo el mejor combate de la historia!"m\bBede: Supongo que debería demostrar, sin lugar a dudas, lo patético que eres y lo fuerte que soy yo."d\rMarnie: No tendría gracia si esto acabara rápido... ¿Tienes algo de pelea en ti? ¡Genial!"N\bVictor: ¡Mis Pokémon están preparados y listos! ¿Quieres probarlos?"N\rGloria: ¡Vale, no esperemos más! ¡Estoy a tope y lista para empezar!"|\rMagnolia: Bien, \PN. Ha llegado el momento de mostrarme tu verdadera fuerza en los lazos de confianza que has creado."#\rSonia: ¡Vamos a darlo todo!"f\rOleana: ¡Cuando te haga pedazos, el presidente Rose estará un paso más cerca de su objetivo!"�\bRose: Vi talento en ti. Me recordabas un poco a mí mismo cuando era joven. ¡Enséñame esa energía necesaria para mantener vivo este mundo brillante y resplandeciente!"l\rMai: ¡Así que tengamos un combate divertido e intenso que ambos equipos puedan disfrutar de verdad!"}\bLian: Estoy decidido a seguir avanzando, así que retírate mientras aún puedas. O enfréntate a la furia de mis Pokémon."4\rArezu: ¡Es un placer conocerte! ¡Empecemos!".\rCalaba: Ahora no nos distraigamos más."/\bIscan: S-si insistes... Podemos empezar."8\rPalina: Sin más dilación, enséñame tu equipo."8\bMelli: ¡Acepta tu derrota y aparta de mi camino!"s\bIngo: Tal vez un combate Pokémon contigo logre desbloquear este recuerdo... ¿Me honrarías con un combate?"P\rSabi: Bueno, tendrás tus recompensas... ¡si antes consigues derrotarme!"f\bGaeric: ¡Si aspiras a la victoria, entonces debemos juzgar si estás a la altura del desafío!"V\rCharm: ¡Soy la mayor de las Hermanas Fortuna, y seré tu Charm de mala suerte!"b\rClover: ¡Soy la mediana de las Hermanas Fortuna, y soy un trébol que no podrás arrancar!"n\rCoin: ¡Soy la pequeña de las Hermanas Fortuna, Coin, pero desde luego no soy tu amuleto de la suerte!"\bBeni: ¡Tú, el rival digno de mis grandes técnicas ninja, que han estado acumulando polvo durante todos estos largos años!"m\rZisu: Enséñame de lo que eres capaz. ¡Observaré con atención todos y cada uno de tus movimientos!"n\bKamado: ¡Dejaremos que el destino decida lo que viene ahora! ¡El más fuerte de los dos prevalecerá!"_\bAdaman: Oh. ¡Me saltaré los saludos! ¡No tenemos más tiempo que perder! ¡Empecemos!"P\rIrida: Comparemos lo que sabemos, a ver de quién es el mundo más vasto."X\rCyllene: Sabes lo que se espera de ti. Ahora depende de ti llegar hasta el final."L\bRei: Ahora ha llegado el momento de que brillen nuestros compañeros."I\rAkari: ¡Allá voy! ¡Prepárate para enfrentarte a todo mi poder!"x\bLaventon: ¡Vamos! ¿Qué te parece? ¿Nos ayudamos mutuamente para que yo pueda comprender mejor a tus Pokémon?"s\rCogita: Tendré que concederme esta única vez, para fortalecer todavía más tu determinación. Combatamos."s\bVolo: ¡PARA CREAR UN MUNDO COMPLETAMENTE NUEVO! ¡Todos desaparecerán, para forjar un MUNDO NUEVO Y MEJOR!"W\bMilo: ¿Mmmm? Ah, tú debes de ser uno de esos desafiantes, ¿no? Me llamo Milo."v\b¡Vamos a ser tan duros como la mala hierba! Pero... ¡eso no te va a frenar! ¡Menudo trabajo más bien hecho!"Q\bBueno, entonces, ¿ponemos este pajar en marcha? ¡Esto va a ser de aúpa!"�\bMilo: ¡Combatir contigo parece haber espabilado a mis Pokémon de tipo Planta! ¡Espero que para ti también haya sido un combate Pokémon satisfactorio!"0\b¡Te estaremos animando desde las gradas!"�\rNessa: Tú eres uno de los respaldados por Hitsu, ¿verdad? Te has convertido en todo un tema de conversación entre nosotros."�\rCreo que ya te habrás dado cuenta, pero soy Nessa. No dudo de que tu mente como Entrenador Pokémon debe de estar bastante pulida."j\rPero da igual el tipo de plan que estés tramando, mi compañera y yo nos encargaremos de hundirlo."`\rNessa: ¡Tu trabajo en equipo ha sido impecable! Hasta consigue darme un poco de envidia."N\r¡Surca esa corriente hasta el final! ¡Dale al público lo que quiere!"�\bKabu: Todos los Entrenadores y sus Pokémon entrenan duro en busca de la victoria. Pero eso también significa que tu oponente se esfuerza al máximo para ganar."}\bHe estado entrenando hasta el último momento para poder garantizarte el mejor combate posible cuando nos enfrentemos."d\bPero al final, el combate se decide por qué lado es capaz de liberar su verdadero potencial."�\bKabu: Está claro que tu talento ha superado mis muchos años de experiencia. Me alegra haber podido sentir también mi propio crecimiento."v\b¡Y pienso seguir creciendo y combatiendo hasta convertirme en un viejo cascarrabias al que nadie pueda vencer!"e\rBea: Hay que tener cuidado de no dejar que una sola victoria nos adormezca en la complacencia."V\r¿Tú también tienes un espíritu inquebrantable que no se tambalea ante nada?"6\rCreo que voy a poner eso a prueba, ¿te parece?"E\rBea: Enfrentarme a ti me dio toda la respuesta que necesitaba."m\rBea: Está bien ser inquebrantable ante el combate. Pero también está bien dejarse conmover por él."\bAllister: ......Oh. Tú."/\b...Soy Allister. ...Tienes buen aspecto."\bA-aquí... voy...">\bAllister: ...Eso estuvo genial. Te rec... recordaré..."&\bD-da lo mejor de ti ahí fuera."\rOpal: Ahí estás, criatura. Aunque desde luego andas muy falto de color rosa, pareces un buen candidato para ser mi sucesor."~\rPor fin me está haciendo efecto el té de la mañana, y supongo que ya es un poco tarde para presentarme, pero... soy Opal."`\rNo te perderé de vista, criatura. Enséñame de lo que eres capaz cuando das todo de ti."r\rOpal: Sigue sin ser lo que busco... Oh, no te preocupes por eso, criatura. Es solo cuestión de mis gustos."v\rPronto llegará el momento de que yo abandone el foco. Para que los jóvenes talentos puedan brillar de verdad."Z\bGordie: Me llamo Gordie. Admito que me siento un poco mal por hacerte esto, pero..."^\b¡Voy a usar este combate para demostrarle al público que mis Pokémon son imbatibles!"4\b¡El tamaño es fuerza! ¡Saborea este dolor!"_\bGordie: Eso ha sido... impresionante. Las reglas son las reglas. Puedes seguir adelante."`\bMe enorgullezco de mis sólidos Pokémon. Solo tengo que entrenar más duro, eso es todo."[\rMelony: Soy Melony. Bueno, descubrirás que mi estilo de combate es bastante severo."P\rSi no tienes cuidado, podría hacerte perder el equilibrio de un plumazo."d\rMuy bien, supongo que deberíamos empezar. No podrás escapar cuando te congele por completo."�\rMelony: Por supuesto, ver perder a mis Pokémon es triste, pero conocer a alguien tan joven con semejante habilidad es todo un honor."5\rDale una buena paliza al siguiente, ¿quieres?"A\bAvery: Una puntualidad bastante admirable. Me llamo Avery."{\bNo creo que aún estés a la altura... Y me corresponde a mí, como elegante adulto, asegurarme de que lo entiendas."^\b¡Prepárate para experimentar poderes psíquicos que desafían la comprensión humana!",\bAvery: Improbable... No, ¡imposible!"]\bQuizá no sea más que un hombre corriente que dio absolutamente todo lo que tenía..."o\rKlara: ¡Ajá, ahí estás, y además justo a tiempo! ¡Soy la colorida, cariñosa y carismática Klara!"a\r......¿Y ese silencio? ¿Me está vacilando... un crío? Uf, qué dolor de cabeza eres..."+\r¡No sabrás ni qué te ha golpeado!"R\rKlara: ¡¿Eh?! ¡No, no, no! ¡NO, no, no! ¡Tiene que haber algún error!"[\r¡Aaagh! ¡¿Por qué no puedo ganar?! ¡Tanto esfuerzo para no sacar nada en claro!"o\bPiers: *suspiro*... Así que al final has venido, ¿eh? Creía que nadie iba a aparecer para desafiarme."�\bLo único que puede hacer un humilde cantante es cantar una humilde canción. Aun así, espero que disfrutes del combate, aunque ya sabes que vas a perder."N\b¡Prepárate para un pogo conmigo y con mi gente! ¡Es hora de rockear!"V\bPiers: Piers no hace bises, pero admito que ahora mismo me lo estoy planteando."5\b¡Volvamos a vernos para combatir algún día!"J\bPeony: ¡Gahahaha! ¡Sí que eres valiente, buscando pelea conmigo!"Q\bNo puedo decir que me disguste que te metas por aquí... ¡Me llamo Peony!"H\b¡Prepárate, soy bastante feroz en combate! ¡No te me achantes!"U\bPeony: ¡Gahahaaa! ¡Mírame, recibiendo una paliza de un jovenzuelo como tú!"w\b¡Eso sí que ha sido un combate final ultramegaardiente! Me quito el sombrero ante ti. Y en más de un sentido."e\bRaihan: ¡Oh! ¡Pero si es el Entrenador respaldado por Hitsu! A ver... ¿cómo era tu nombre?"\b¡Ah, cierto! ¡\PN! Y si el mismísimo Hitsu reconoció tu potencial... entonces supongo que serás todo un Entrenador."_\b¡Que llegue la tormenta! ¡Yo, el poderoso Raihan, haré salir volando a todo el mundo!"}\bRaihan: Tras aquel furioso combate... me siento tan puro y renovado como el cielo cuando se despeja tras una tormenta."d\bPuede que haya perdido, pero sigo viéndome bien. Quizá debería hacerme un selfi rápido..."o\bMustard: ¡Vaya, hola! Estoy más contento que unas castañuelas de que hayas venido a combatir conmigo."K\b¡Tú también pareces de los que trabajan duro! ¡Me llamo Mustard!"R\b¡No hagas esperar demasiado a este anciano! Solo dilo cuando estés listo."�\bMustard: La fuerza sube y baja en un ciclo sin fin. En un momento la tienes en tus manos, y al siguiente se te escapa entre los dedos."v\b¡Los jóvenes crecéis a una velocidad increíble! Nunca deja de asombrarme. Mis felicitaciones más sinceras."c\bLeon: Probablemente no haga falta decirlo, pero... ¡hola! ¡Soy Leon, el Campeón de Galar!"l\bMe encanta darlo todo como Entrenador y ver a mi equipo entregarlo todo para conseguir otra victoria."k\bPuedo sentir a mis compañeros impacientes de emoción... ¡Lo vamos a pasar de auténtico campeón!"i\bLeon: ¡Has vencido incluso al invencible Campeón! ¡Te ofrezco mis más sinceras felicitaciones!"�\b¡Espero que esta no sea la última vez que nos veamos en combate! ¡Sigue desafiándome para que yo también pueda seguir alcanzando cotas cada vez mayores!"k\bHop: ¡Soy yo, Hop! ¡Ha llegado la hora de que mi nueva leyenda empiece aquí junto a mis Pokémon!"�\bMi objetivo es enfrentarme a mi hermano. Pero no solo eso, ¡quiero vencerlo! ¡Quiero ser yo quien derrote al invencible Campeón!"l\b¡Así que mostremos a todo el mundo el mejor combate de la historia y demos un paso más hacia Leon!"L\bHop: ¡Ese sí que ha sido un combate de infarto! ¡Me alegro por ti!"p\bEstoy un poco decepcionado conmigo mismo, ¡pero la próxima vez no me vencerás tan fácilmente, colega!"�\bBede: Qué broma. Es prácticamente un crimen que me hagas perder el tiempo aquí. ¿Por qué no te das media vuelta y te vas?"�\bSabes que fui elegido por el propio Hitsu y por el Presidente de Galar, ¡así que eso me hace mucho más impresionante que tú!"k\bSupongo que debería demostrar, sin lugar a dudas, lo fuerte que soy yo y lo patético que eres tú."m\bBede: Esto no es lo que había planeado. Si hubiera sido capaz de derrotarte, todo habría ido bien..."l\bLa próxima vez... demostraré a todos los presentes que estoy un nivel por encima de la competencia."u\rMarnie: Vaya, qué casualidad volver a verte. Soy Marnie. Parece que voy a tener que vigilarte de cerca, ¿eh?"U\r¿Qué estás mirando tanto? Es justo lo que piensas. Voy a ser yo quien gane."W\rNo tendría gracia si esto acabara ya... ¿Tienes algo de pelea en ti? ¡Genial!"}\rMarnie: Vale, he podido ver muchos de los puntos fuertes de ti y de tus Pokémon. ¡Supongo que eso no está nada mal!"P\rQue lo sepas... todavía no he decidido si voy a animarte... ¡Nos vemos!"r\bVictor: Soy Victor. Acabo de terminar de cocinar algo rico ahí detrás... ¿Te apetecería probarlo luego?"a\b¿No? Ya sabes, tengo bastante confianza tanto en la cocina como en los combates Pokémon."E\b¿Quieres una cata? ¡Mis Pokémon están listos y preparados!"g\bVictor: Una preparación a fondo es importante tanto en la cocina como en los combates Pokémon."l\b¡Tu trabajo en equipo es como un buen plato de curry! ¡Tengo que descubrir el secreto de tu receta!"~\rGloria: ¡Encantada de conocerte! ¡Soy Gloria! ¡Y cualquier lugar es un gran escenario para la aventura y el combate!"�\rY todo esto me ha abierto el apetito más de lo normal. ¡Creo que después me prepararé unos bocadillos! ¡Me sentarán de maravilla!"F\r¡Vale, no esperemos más! ¡Estoy a tope y lista para empezar!"f\rGloria: ¡La fuerza es difícil de conseguir, y aún más difícil de conservar! O eso dicen..."_\rCon la actuación que has dado, ¡no cabe duda de que aplastarás todos los obstáculos!"�\rMagnolia: Oh, cielos, cuánto lo siento. ¡Ni siquiera me había dado cuenta de que tenía visita! Me llamo Magnolia. ¡Bienvenido, joven Entrenador!"�\rComo bien sabes, hoy en día Dinamaxizamos a nuestros Pokémon usando la energía de los Fragmentos Estrella que han caído hasta nosotros."m\rEl Dinamax saca a la luz la verdadera fuerza nacida de la confianza entre un Pokémon y su Entrenador."s\rAsí que, \PN. Ha llegado la hora de mostrarme tu verdadera fuerza en los lazos de confianza que has creado."�\rMagnolia: Sin duda te has hecho fuerte frente a la adversidad, cariño. Ahora depende de ti decidir qué hacer con esa fuerza."y\rHay cosas que solo los jóvenes como tú podéis hacer, y hay otras que solo tú puedes hacer. Sueña a lo grande."�\rSonia: Me llamo Sonia. Soy la ayudante de la profesora. ¡He estado viajando para resolver los mayores misterios de la región de Galar!"�\r¡Ah, toma! ¡Es un libro que escribí yo! Incluso lo he firmado, así que es un objeto de coleccionista. ¿No lo quieres? Vale."\r¡Vamos a darlo todo!"S\rSonia: ¡Guau! ¿Y todo esto de repente? ¡Nunca había visto nada parecido!"5\r¡Tu hazaña de hoy va a aparecer en mi libro!"�\rOleana: Así que has superado todo lo que tenían para detenerte. No esperaba menos de los Entrenadores elegidos personalmente por el propio Hitsu."y\rPero me temo que ahora ha llegado la hora de que vuelvas a casa. Voy a ofrecerte algo verdaderamente espectacular."^\r¡Cuando te haga pedazos, el Presidente Rose estará un paso más cerca de su objetivo!"�\rOleana: ¡Arghhh! Esto es imperdonable... ¿En qué estaba pensando...? Cualquiera que hubiera llegado tan lejos no iba a ser un rival débil..."V\rTodo lo que hice, lo hice para impulsar los propios objetivos del presidente..."�\bRose: ¡Señoras y señores! A todos los que nos observan desde el vestíbulo y desde sus casas, ¡todos habéis estado esperando este gran momento!"s\bAntes de dejarme llevar, permitidme presentarme una vez más. Mi nombre es Rose, y es un placer estar aquí."�\bVi talento en ti. Me recordabas un poco a mí mismo cuando era joven. ¡Enséñame esa energía necesaria para mantener vivo este mundo brillante y resplandeciente!"�\bRose: Hmm, esto no pinta demasiado bien para mí... Impresionante de verdad, \PN. No esperaba menos de un desafiante respaldado por Hitsu."�\bEs una lástima, pero no se puede evitar... Sé que tiendo a irme por las ramas. Me encanta dar discursos. Pero creo que ya puedo dejar de hablar."b\rMai: Intentar sacar lo mejor de nuestros compañeros es algo que quizá tengamos en común."x\r¿Te sientes seguro de poder guiar a tus Pokémon en combate? Bueno, supongo que esa conversación puede esperar."g\r¡Así que tengamos un combate divertido e intenso que ambos equipos puedan disfrutar de verdad!"~\rMai: A través del combate, siento que estoy llegando a comprender mejor tanto a los tuyos como a mis propios Pokémon."`\rEspero poder llegar a comprender también así los sentimientos de los Pokémon salvajes."i\bLian: Soy Lian. Ya he deducido que has venido aquí bien preparado. Esa clase de determinación...";\bPero debo hacerte retroceder, por mucho que me pese."|\bEstoy decidido a seguir avanzando, así que retírate mientras aún puedas. O... ¡enfréntate a la furia de mis Pokémon!"�\bLian: Me disculpo por haber perdido la compostura por un momento. Puede que haya sido derrotado, ¡pero mi pasión sigue intacta!"Q\bY parece que aquí hemos terminado. ¡No te eches atrás después de esto!"V\rArezu: Tienes bastante fama, ¿sabes? Quiero decir, tu viaje es algo muy serio."b\rDe hecho, hay gente a la que le das un poco de miedo por haber logrado algo tan increíble."I\rPor cierto, soy Arezu. ¡Encantadísima de conocerte! ¡Empecemos!"X\rArezu: Parece que se me acabó la suerte... como probablemente ya habrás notado."h\rPero eres increíble, ¿lo sabías? ¡La forma en que has demostrado tu control ha sido preciosa!"a\rCalaba: Para ti, Guardiana Calaba. ¿Oh? Vaya, así que eres tú... He oído hablar de ti."[\r¿El elegido? Para mí no eres más que un cachorro. No me hagas perder más tiempo."&\rAhora no nos distraigamos más."h\rCalaba: Te debo una disculpa. Te traté con desprecio, creyendo que no eras más que un cachorro."�\rNi siquiera tuve la cortesía de escucharte. Cualquiera diría que alguien que ha vivido tanto como yo debería tener más paciencia."=\bIscan: Dame un momento... Así que, eh... soy Iscan..."v\bBueno, las visitas inesperadas me sobresaltan bastante... Espero que la próxima vez me avises con antelación."/\bA-ahora, si insistes... Podemos empezar."r\bIscan: Tus nervios no son de acero... Son... de titanio. Da auténtico miedo lo, eh... intrépido que eres."5\bYo, eh... será mejor que me retire por aquí."�\rPalina: Así que tú eres ese joven del que hablan. Tu fuerza debe de ser increíble y, sin embargo... tienes un rostro tan amable..."[\rCreo que tienes el potencial para lograr grandes cosas. Pero no voy a imponerte eso."0\rSin más dilación, enséñame tu equipo."c\rPalina: ¡Ha sido un combate espléndido! Estoy muy orgullosa tanto de ti como de tu equipo."F\rGracias, de verdad, por combatir conmigo. Significa muchísimo."o\bMelli: Jeh, parece que hasta una simple brisa podría tumbarte. ¿De verdad crees que puedes derrotarme?"K\bDeja de ponerte en ridículo. ¡No pueden detenerme los de tu clase!"1\b¡Acepta tu derrota y aparta de mi camino!"s\bMelli: ¡Escúchame bien! Ni mis Pokémon ni yo aceptamos la derrota todavía. ¡Eso fue un golpe de suerte!"�\b¡Sin embargo! Me retiraré para dejar que se recuperen. No hay ninguna vergüenza en una retirada táctica. ¡Mantente alerta!"x\bIngo: Buen día, noble Entrenador. Un placer conocerte como es debido. Tu presencia... me ha recordado a... eh..."�\bRecuerdo vagamente que una vez tuve un compañero, que se parecía... a mí. No logro recordar su nombre; lo único que puedo recordar es el mío."j\bTal vez un combate Pokémon contigo logre despertar ese recuerdo... ¿Me honrarías con un combate?"~\bIngo: A veces me descubro diciendo cosas sin saber de dónde salen esas palabras... y, aun así, parecen llenarme de fuerza."~\bAh, pero me he desviado con esta charla. Por favor, transmite mis mejores deseos a tu próximo rival. ¡Sigue adelante!"�\rSabi: Mi clarividencia me lo dijo... Tú tienes muchísimo talento, ¿verdad? ¡Seguro que va a ser divertidísimo jugar contigo!"t\r¡Soy Sabi! ¡Y también sé por qué estás aquí! ¡Para llegar hasta el final y conseguir tus recompensas!"?\rBueno, las conseguirás... ¡si antes logras derrotarme!"V\rSabi: Guau, nos encontraste Y además nos venciste. ¡Te has ganado mi respeto!"�\rOooh, y una cosa más: ¿soy realmente clarividente? ¿De verdad me lo estoy pasando bien, o me aburro? Mmm. Nadie excepto yo puede saberlo de verdad, ¿no?"o\bGaeric: ¡Empecemos con las presentaciones como es debido! Soy Gaeric. Y tú debes de ser \PN, ¿verdad?"n\b¿Con qué propósito vienes aquí buscando el título del mejor? ¿Qué te dice tu corazón que hagas?"h\b¡Si eso es lo que esperas conseguir, entonces debemos juzgar si estás a la altura del desafío!"O\bGaeric: ¡Soy duro como un iceberg, pero me has destrozado por completo!"J\bSupongo que ya puedes seguir adelante. ¡Este sí que vale la pena!"[\rCharm: Veamos, ¿quién podrías ser? Desde luego, no pareces un viajero cualquiera."}\rYo llevo la buena suerte a mis hermanas allá donde voy, y la mala suerte a cualquiera que se cruce en nuestro camino."7\r¡Soy la mayor, y seré tu Charm de mala suerte!"D\rCharm: ¿De verdad vas a insistir en interponerte, renacuajo?"M\rAhora sé más sobre cómo luchas, y la próxima vez no me contendré."X\rClover: Tu suerte acaba de acabarse. Una trampa despiadada tendida por servidora."Z\r¿Creíste ver un trébol de cuatro hojas? ¡Pues pronto vas a empezar a ver doble!"M\r¡Soy la hermana mediana, y yo soy un trébol que no podrás arrancar!"U\rClover: Este lugar... ¡Tienes que estar bromeando! ¡No fue un combate justo!"v\r¡Prácticamente estábamos siendo blandas contigo! ¡La próxima vez te haré arrepentirte de esa confianza!!!"�\rCoin: Debería presentarme como es debido... antes de mostrarte, pobre necio, lo equivocado que estabas al pensar que podrías derrotarme."a\rCara, gano yo; cruz, pierdes tú. No tienes ninguna oportunidad en este juego del destino."T\rSoy la pequeña, Coin, pero desde luego no soy tu amuleto de la buena suerte."g\rCoin: Qué tonta rematada soy. Supongo que a veces también puedo perder una tirada de moneda..."O\rPagarás por esta humillación. ¡Juro que te haré pagar con intereses!"M\bBeni: Así que estás lleno de vida y energía, ¿eh? Me alegra verlo."�\bHe oído que has logrado someter a tus rivales uno tras otro. Oh, cómo me ha hervido la sangre y me ha latido el corazón con fuerza... Al fin... al fin..."{\b¡Tú, el rival digno de mis grandes técnicas ninja, que han permanecido latentes durante todos estos largos años!"�\bBeni: Me da igual quién gane y quién pierda. Estoy aquí para mostrarte cómo lucha un ninja, ¡el estilo de una especie en extinción!"g\bEn cualquier caso, dicen que el hambre es el mejor condimento. Yo me voy a comer hasta hartarme."o\rZisu: Me llamo Zisu. Capitana del Cuerpo de Seguridad. ¿Así que tú eres de quien todo el mundo habla?"V\rVeo que tienes espíritu de lucha. Pensé que te daría el consejo que pudiera."_\rEnséñame de lo que eres capaz. ¡Observaré con atención cada uno de tus movimientos!"�\rZisu: Estilo fuerte, estilo ágil... Sabes qué es lo correcto para cada situación, y diriges a tus Pokémon con un pequeño impulso."e\rEres un verdadero veterano de los combates Pokémon. ¡Y eso, viniendo de mí, es decir mucho!"U\bKamado: ¡He estado esperándote! ¡Soy Kamado, comandante del Equipo Galaxia!"h\b¡Hrrrm! Tienes vigor, te concedo eso. Has llegado lo bastante lejos como para enfrentarte a mí."]\b¡Que decida el destino lo que ocurra ahora! ¡El más fuerte de los dos prevalecerá!"=\bKamado: De verdad eres una fuerza a tener en cuenta..."�\bTe agradezco que me hayas mostrado lo reconfortante que puede ser la presencia de los Pokémon. ¡Debemos enfrentarnos otra vez algún día!"z\bAdaman: ¡Mira quién llega puntual! ¡Qué bien conocerte al fin, forastero! Soy Adaman, líder del Clan Diamante."�\bEl tiempo consiste en el cambio, y no podemos vivir con miedo a eso. Solo podemos intentar cambiar para mejor la época en la que vivimos."k\bOh, mira la hora. ¡Entonces me salto los saludos! ¡No tenemos más tiempo que perder! ¡Empecemos!"e\bAdaman: Bueno, ¡lo has logrado! ¡Ha sido increíble! Todavía sigo temblando, incluso ahora."h\b¡La próxima vez iremos a por ti con aún más fuerza y te daremos un combate que no olvidarás!"[\rIrida: Este escenario es solo para nosotros dos. ¡Soy Irida, líder del Clan Perla!"y\rEl mundo que se abre ante nuestros ojos se ensancha cuando alcanzamos una verdadera comprensión con los Pokémon."K\rComparemos lo que sabemos para ver de quién es el mundo más vasto."h\rIrida: Tu fuerza pura es tan inabarcable como el propio espacio. Me deja completamente asombrada."~\rSé que quizá nunca llegue a comprender todo lo que existe ahí fuera, pero mantendré mi corazón abierto para intentarlo."i\rCyllene: Soy la capitana del Cuerpo de Investigación del Equipo Galaxia. Puedes llamarme Cyllene."_\rEstamos aquí para demostrar nuestra capacidad para domar y manejar a nuestros Pokémon."Q\rSabes lo que se espera de ti. Ahora depende de ti llevarlo hasta el final."\rCyllene: Puse un listón muy alto para juzgar si alguien como tú era digno, pero lo has superado. Has pasado tu prueba."V\rSiéntete orgulloso. Preséntate con entereza ante quien venga a continuación."O\bRei: ¡Soy Rei, miembro del Cuerpo de Investigación del Equipo Galaxia!"�\bQuiero dedicarme a la investigación hasta llegar a un punto en el que, si me encuentro con un Pokémon, podamos comprendernos incluso sin combatir."T\b¿Y tú qué dices? ¡Ha llegado la hora de que brillen nuestros compañeros!"k\bRei: La forma en que luchas junto a tus Pokémon... no pareces tenerle miedo al combate en absoluto."Q\bDe acuerdo. Nosotros tendremos que esforzarnos al máximo para alcanzarte."u\rAkari: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Akari, miembro del Cuerpo de Investigación del Equipo Galaxia! ¡Encantada de conocerte!"y\rNuestro trabajo en el Cuerpo de Investigación es estudiar a los Pokémon y averiguar qué clase de criaturas son."B\r¡Allá voy! ¡Prepárate para enfrentarte a todo mi poder!"m\rAkari: Supongo que investigar y aprender es una cosa, y saber aplicar bien ese conocimiento es otra..."h\rDesde luego, combatir tiene sus ventajas... Creo que ahora entiendo un poco mejor a mis Pokémon."C\bLaventon: ¡Ah! Menudo susto me has dado al aparecer así..."^\bOh, sí, y... ¿cómo te llamas? ¡Oho! ¡Así que te llamas \PN! Yo me llamo Laventon."`\bSoy una especie de erudito que busca profundizar en nuestra comprensión de los Pokémon."n\b¡Vamos! ¿Qué te parece? ¿Nos ayudamos mutuamente para que yo pueda comprender mejor a tus Pokémon?"m\bLaventon: ¡Resultados esplendiferosos! ¡Yo diría que te has ganado una buena palmada en la espalda!"J\bSabes, espero grandes cosas de ti. ¡Sigue dando guerra ahí fuera!"\rCogita: Para empezar, nada de "ama", gracias. Solo Cogita. Parece que por fin podré cumplir con mi deber, gracias a ti."k\rEn efecto, debo guiarte, alma perdida. Pues sobre ti recae la tarea de impedir una gran catástrofe."m\rEsta será la única vez que me conceda esto, para fortalecer aún más tu determinación. Combatamos."d\rCogita: Hay nobleza en saber qué es lo que debe hacerse y llevarlo a cabo. Lo ves, ¿verdad?"�\rTe he transmitido todo lo que había que transmitir. Adónde vaya la historia a partir de ahora... te corresponde a ti llevarlo hasta el final."�\bVolo: Desde que era joven, cada vez que me topaba con algo doloroso o desgarrador... no podía evitar preguntarme por qué la vida era tan injusta y por qué estaba condenado a vivir cosas así."�\bCon el tiempo, decidí canalizar toda mi energía hacia mi propia curiosidad y ambición. Y lo que más despertaba mi curiosidad eran los misterios ocultos en las leyendas, en la historia, en las ruinas..."�\bDesde que me convencí de que Arceus realmente existe, también comprendí que debía ser capaz de someter su poder... ¡PARA CREAR UN MUNDO COMPLETAMENTE NUEVO! ¡Todos desaparecerán para forjar un MUNDO NUEVO Y MEJOR!"�\bVolo: ¡Me he entregado a Arceus como nadie más! ¡Lo he venerado como al creador de todo nuestro mundo! ¡He dedicado toda mi pasión y todo mi interés a estudiarlo! ¡Todo el tiempo que he pasado escudriñando las leyendas... Todo lo que he hecho!"�\b¿Me estás diciendo que este mundo no necesita ser rehecho? Entonces mi viaje ha terminado. Mi historia acabó cuando perdí contra ti."La puerta está cerrada..."z\bBrock: Hola, ¡yo creo que una defensa dura como la roca y una gran determinación superarán cualquier obstáculo!"r\b¡Más te vale tener una determinación de acero, o te costará muchísimo hacerle daño a mis compañeros!"(\b¡Muéstrame lo mejor que tienes!"T\bBrock: El mundo es enorme. Todavía hay muchos Entrenadores fuertes como tú."(\b¡Tengo fe en que los superarás!"B\rMisty: ¡Estás ante la belleza mundialmente famosa, Misty!"N\r¡Más te vale no quedarte embobado con mi belleza y mi ofensiva total!"\r¿Estás listo, cielo?"4\rMisty: ¡Aiyeee! ¡Esto me enfada muchísimo!"W\rTengo que quitarme estas derrotas de la cabeza... ¡La próxima vez no perderé!">\bTeniente Surge: ¡Eh, enclenque! Tengo que reconocerlo."]\bHace falta valor para enfrentarte a mí. Y más te vale tener los nervios bien tensos."v\b¡Porque los combates Pokémon son guerra! ¡Te enseñaré lo que es bueno y te fulminaré hasta que te rindas!"K\bTeniente Surge: ¡De acuerdo! ¡Tú sí que vales de verdad, chaval!"H\bAhora vuelve a seguir puliéndote. ¡Sigue adelante como un rayo!"U\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... ¿Hm? Oh, buenos días. Estar aquí sola me da sueño."P\r¿Quizá deseabas desafiarme? Muy bien... Yo, Erika, acepto gustosamente."9\rDeja que mis damas demuestren el arte del ikebana."'\rErika: ¡Oh! Admiro tu técnica."I\rMe haría muy feliz volver a ver tu demostración la próxima vez."P\rSabrina: Tuve una visión de tu llegada, y sé que no eres ningún necio."S\rVi que me desafiarías, pero deliberadamente no quise ver más allá de eso."L\rAsí que te estás preparando, ¿eh? Veamos quién será el vencedor.">\rSabrina: Tu poder... supera con creces lo que preví..."A\rTe harás aún más fuerte de lo que eres ahora, lo sé...":\rJanine: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Janine! ¡Recuerda el nombre!"^\rQue yo sea la hija de un célebre miembro del Alto Mando no significa que sea inferior."g\r¡De lo contrario, sufrirás las consecuencias del horror que estoy a punto de desatar sobre ti!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... Lamento decepcionarte... Tú sí que eres de verdad."}\rVoy a volver a ponerme manos a la obra y a mejorar mis habilidades, ¡para llegar a ser mucho mejor que mi padre y que tú!"^\bBlaine: ¡Buenos días! ¿Lo sabes todo sobre los Pokémon? ¿Sobre los tuyos también?"z\b¿Qué me dices del mejor tipo de Pokémon para entrenar y cultivar? Apuesto a que eso te ha dejado pensando, ¿eh?"M\b¿Quieres conocer la ardiente respuesta? ¡Déjame darte una lección!"f\bBlaine: ¡Impresionante! Has demostrado el ingenio y el conocimiento necesarios para superarme."X\b¡Esto me enciende aún más! ¡Sé apasionado! ¡Siente esa curiosidad ardiente!"�\bBill: ¡Hola! ¡Llámame Bill! ¡Soy un auténtico Pokémaníaco! ¡Yo fui quien desarrolló el sistema de transferencia Pokémon!"\b¡Eh! ¿A qué viene esa cara de escepticismo? No estoy bromeando, colega. Hablando de eso... ¿por qué estoy yo aquí?"A\b¿Has venido a ver mi colección de Pokémon? ¡Mira esto!"U\bBill: Qué lástima. Aun así, tengo que darte las gracias por este gran rato."b\bAhora tengo que averiguar qué hago yo aquí con los otros Líderes de Gimnasio de Kanto..."X\rLorelei: ¿Se te da bien manejar criaturas heladas? Nadie puede superarme en eso."l\r¡Con mi estrategia meticulosamente planificada, todos los Pokémon quedarán congelados a mi merced!"=\rEspero que te hayas traído el abrigo de invierno, je."W\rLorelei: Eres mejor de lo que pensaba. ¡Ahora sí que empiezo a notar el calor!"N\r¡Me aseguraré de idear una contraestrategia después de este combate!"I\bRyuki: Me llamo Ryuki. Se podría decir que soy toda una estrella."d\b¡Algún día seré un Líder de Gimnasio de Kanto! ¡Pronto todo el mundo sabrá quién soy!"l\bVas a ser mi fan, ¿verdad? ¡Hagamos chocar nuestros ardientes espíritus en un estallido de gloria!"I\bRyuki: Menudo espectáculo. ¡Tú también eres un talento oculto!"Z\b¡Si lo damos todo con la suficiente fuerza y estilo, nuestra fama será imparable!"?\rAgatha: ¿Qué haces aquí husmeando, niño entrometido?"f\r¡Llevas una Pokédex encima! Tú eres el crío al que Oak ha tomado bajo su ala, ¿no es así?"|\r¡Los Pokémon están hechos para combatir! ¡No para coleccionarlos! ¡Te enseñaré cómo lucha un Entrenador de verdad!"8\rAgatha: Has ganado. No tengo nada más que decir.":\rBueno, ¿a qué esperas? ¡Vete ya, niño! ¡Fuera!"u\bTrace: Hola. Debiste de recorrer un largo camino para llegar hasta aquí. ¿Fue en busca de un desafío digno?"w\bEn cuanto a mí, ¡quiero capturar montones de Pokémon distintos y entrenarlos para que se hagan fuertes! ¡Je!"e\bQuizá debería comprobar si tus Pokémon realmente están en buena forma... ¡con un combate!"]\bTrace: Tío, ¡de verdad eres increíble! ¡Pero eso no significa que vaya a rendirme!"E\b¡Seguiré aceptando tus desafíos si volvemos a encontrarnos!"e\bBlue: ¿Y tú quién eres? Me llamo Blue. Una vez fui el Campeón de Kanto, aunque duró poco."h\b¡Pero no soy ningún mindundi cualquiera! Si veo a un rival fuerte, me entran ganas de combatir."X\b¿Quieres intentarlo? Sabré si vales o no con solo combatir contigo ahora mismo."i\bBlue: Eres duro, te lo concedo. Pero siempre hay alguien mejor. ¡Tienes que entregarte aún más!"7\bTengo que volver a entrenar. ¡Nos olemos luego!"b\rLeaf: ¡Oh, ups! ¡No eres un Pokémon! Lo siento, pensé que eras algún tipo de Pokémon."t\rBueno, eh… encantada de conocerte. ¡Soy Green! ¿Estás aquí porque tú también buscas… algo especial?"M\rMe he fijado en que tú también tienes buenos Pokémon, ¿me los das?"k\rGreen: ¡Guau, eres fuerte! ¡Oh, ya sé! ¡¿Por qué no te conviertes tú en uno de mis Pokémon?!"\rPiénsalo, ¿vale? Jeje."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."'\b¡Las palabras son innecesarias!"~\rRoxanne: Hola, soy Roxanne. Me gusta trazar estrategias antes de un combate, aplicando todo lo que he estudiado hasta ahora."l\rEstoy segura de que ambos hemos vivido muchos combates y adquirido grandes conocimientos sobre ellos."|\r¿Serías tan amable de mostrarme cómo combates para que pueda aprender? Así también veré cuánto he mejorado yo."G\rRoxanne: Has estado impecable. Aún me queda mucho por aprender."L\rQuiero seguir aprendiendo de ti. ¿Volverás a ser mi rival entonces?"B\bBrawly: ¡Se acerca una ola enorme! ¡Cuidado! ¡Allá voy!"`\bCurtido por las duras olas del mar y endurecido en la cueva de las afueras. ¡Soy Brawly!":\b¿Quieres un desafío? Veamos de qué estás hecho."M\bBrawly: ¡Vaya! ¡Guau! Has causado un impacto mayor del que esperaba."t\bTu talento ha levantado una ola de asombro que me ha desbordado. Estoy deseando repetirlo. ¡Sigue surfeando!"C\bWattson: ¡Ajá! Un alma joven y prometedora. Rebosas vigor."P\bSé lo que quieres. ¡Quieres combatir contra mis Pokémon! ¡Wahahahaha!"G\b¡Haré que salten chispas contigo! ¡No digas que no te avisé!"{\bWattson: Wahaha. ¡Al final me has dado una emoción tremenda! ¡Estoy tan impresionado que no puedo evitar reírme!"T\b¡Me lleno de optimismo al ver a un joven Entrenador tan prometedor como tú!"x\rFlannery: Bienven... ¡No, enclenque Entrenador! ¡Veo que has llegado hasta aquí en busca de rivales de verdad!"|\rEh... no te atrevas a subestimarme, yo... te mostraré, eh... ¡los ardientes movimientos que he pulido junto a mi abuelo!")\r¡Prepárate! ¡Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"�\rFlannery: Tu fuerza me recuerda muchísimo a mi abuelo. Supongo que estaba esforzándome demasiado por ser alguien que no soy."s\rCuando no actúo como yo misma, no es de extrañar que los Pokémon que combaten a mi lado se desconcierten."�\bNorman: Bien, el mundo de los Pokémon es profundo. Sinceramente creo que ninguna cantidad de entrenamiento llegará a ser suficiente."U\b¡Pero no tiene ningún mérito para mí combatir contra un Entrenador novato!"\\bAsí que más te vale darlo todo. ¡Yo haré todo lo que esté en mi mano para ganar!"P\bNorman: Lo has hecho muy bien. Lo diste todo y te ganaste esa victoria..."G\bQuiero que mi hijo aprenda de ti. Espero que lo conozcas pronto.">\rWinona: Soy una con las aves y he surcado los cielos..."F\rPor duro que haya sido, hemos triunfado con elegancia y gracia."S\rContempla nuestra elegante coreografía. ¡No pestañees o te arrepentirás!"T\rWinona: Veo que tú también eres uno con tus Pokémon. Reconozco tu talento."h\rSé que seguirás aspirando a cotas cada vez más altas. Eso es lo que te ha traído la victoria."V\bTate: Je, je, je... ¿Te sorprendimos? \rLiza: Ji, ji, ji... ¿Te sorprendimos?"F\bNo necesitamos hablar..... \r....porque ambos podemos saber...."K\b....lo que está pensando el otro... \r...¡todo en nuestras mentes!"9\b¡Esta combinación nuestra! \r¿Puedes superarla?"p\bTate: El vínculo entre tú y tus Pokémon... \rLiza: ...es mucho más fuerte que el nuestro. Lo notamos."\\bVolveremos a encontrarnos algún día.... \r...estamos completamente seguros de ello."l\bJuan: Parece que tienes una razón de peso para desafiarme. ¿Sabías que soy un Entrenador retirado?"j\bEn una ocasión renuncié a mi puesto como Líder de Gimnasio. Lo dejé todo en manos de mi alumno."�\bPero basta de charla. Supongo que hoy un Coordinador podría enseñarte un truco o dos. ¡Contempla la gran ilusión de agua esculpida por nosotros!"z\bJuan: Como la mejor música, el combate que hemos creado juntos hace vibrar acordes de inspiración en mi corazón."]\bCierro los ojos y veo visiones tuyas elevándote. ¡Una señal inequívoca de nobleza!"u\bSidney: Dijeron que yo era un macarra, ¡pero les enseñé de qué están hechas las bellezas del lado oscuro!"|\bPuedes hablar todo lo que quieras, ¡pero el ataque va antes que la defensa! ¡Lo único que importa es lo fuerte que soy!"k\bAhora sí me gusta esa mirada que me lanzas. Supongo que me darás un buen combate. ¡Vamos al lío!"n\bSidney: Escucha lo que tiene que decir este perdedor. El camino es largo, pero tú tienes lo necesario."Y\bY cuando consigas nueva fuerza, ¡vuelve aquí! Sin restricciones. ¡Sin rencores!"�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... ¡Ja, ja, ja! Tienes razón. ¿Oh? Dame un momento.... ¡Hola! Mi amiga dice que me estabas buscando."|\r¿No puedes verla? Ajajá. Claro. Es un fantasma, y yo soy una de las pocas personas capaces de comunicarme con ella."e\rNo tengas miedo. En fin, si buscas un desafío, ¡a ver si puedes siquiera tocar a mis amigas!"n\rPhoebe: Está claro que hay un vínculo más fuerte entre tú y tu equipo. Es natural que haya perdido."b\rMe gustaría ver hasta dónde puede llevarte ese vínculo. ¡No nos avergüences perdiendo!"\rGlacia: He viajado lejos para perfeccionar mis habilidades heladas. Pero todo lo que he visto han sido Entrenadores débiles."P\r¿Y tú? Me complacería enormemente que te emplearas a fondo contra mí."2\rMe pregunto qué vas a mostrarme. Adelante."�\rGlacia: Qué alivio, ¡qué ardiente ha sido eso! El fuego de tu espíritu ha hecho que mis movimientos helados parezcan apagados en comparación."p\rNo te vuelvas complaciente. Si algún día sientes la necesidad de enfriar tus emociones, vuelve a verme."z\bDrake: En su estado natural, los Pokémon son seres vivos salvajes. Pueden ayudarnos, obstaculizarnos y son libres."|\bPara que nosotros podamos combatir con los Pokémon como compañeros, ¿sabes lo que hace falta? ¿Sabes qué se necesita?"=\b¡Si no lo sabes, jamás podrás prevalecer sobre mí!"x\bDrake: Mereces todo el reconocimiento por haber llegado tan lejos. Sí que parece que sabes qué es lo necesario."�\bSí, un corazón verdaderamente virtuoso. Es a través de él como los Pokémon aprenden a distinguir el bien del mal. ¡Esa influencia les ayuda a hacerse fuertes!"�\bSteven: Tú... ¿Qué viste en tu viaje junto a tus Pokémon? ¿Qué sentiste al encontrarte con tantos Entrenadores como tú?"S\b¿Qué es lo que ha despertado en ti? ¡Quiero que me golpees con todo ello!"\b¡Dámelo todo!"s\bSteven: ¡Enhorabuena! Los sentimientos que albergas... y los Pokémon que respondieron con todo su poder..."t\bSe unieron como uno solo y crearon una fuerza aún mayor. ¡Y así fue como lograste hacerte con la victoria!"�\bWallace: A veces tus Pokémon deben danzar como una brisa primaveral; otras, golpear como un relámpago. ¡Quiero sentirme deslumbrado por tu actuación!"�\b¿Quién puede danzar con más elegancia junto a sus Pokémon? ¿Quién puede mostrar el arte más grácil en combate, tú o yo y mi gran ilusión de agua?"*\b¡Muéstramelo aquí y ahora mismo!"e\bWallace: ¡Bravo! Ahora comprendo tu autenticidad y tu magnificencia como Entrenador Pokémon."U\bEncuentro una gran alegría en haberos conocido a ti y a tus Pokémon. ¡Otra!"{\bWally: ¡E-encantado de conocerte! Soy Wally. Mis Pokémon y yo seguimos avanzando juntos, poco a poco, día a día."d\bEstoy seguro de que tú y tus Pokémon también habéis tenido que superar muchísimas cosas."u\bMis Pokémon me han dado el valor y la fuerza para luchar. ¡Tengo que ganar por ellos! ¡Así que prepárate!"y\bWally: ¡Arghhhh! Hah... tú. Gracias por no contenerte. Siento que he podido dar otro paso adelante gracias a ti."a\b¡Ya verás! Algún día... ¡juro que te alcanzaré! ¡Es una promesa que pienso cumplir!"O\rMay: ¡Eeeeeeh! ¿Qué tal va todo? ¡Soy May! ¡Encantada de conocerte!"\r¡Mi sueño es hacerme amiga de los Pokémon de todo el mundo! ¡Quiero comprenderlo todo sobre ti y sobre tus Pokémon!"]\r¿Me enseñarías a todos tus Pokémon en un combate conmigo? ¡Estoy superemocionada!"\\rMay: Ohoho, ¡guau, lo lograste! ¡Me derrotaste, pero he aprendido muchísimo de ti!"o\r¡Consigues que me entren unas ganas tremendas de hacerme más fuerte! ¡Quizá la próxima vez gane yo!"C\bBrendan: Eh, hola. Me llamo Brendan. Encantado de conocerte."�\b¡Mi sueño es convertirme en un Entrenador Pokémon mejor! ¡Quiero aprender todavía más y hacerme más fuerte de lo que soy ahora!"�\bAhora que estás aquí, puede que te hayas enfrentado a mi padre y lo hayas vencido. ¡Pero enfrentarte a mí es otra historia! ¡Allá voy!"K\bBrendan: Hmmm... Parece que esta vez no estuve a la altura. ¡Bueno!"O\b¡Tendré que esforzarme más la próxima vez! ¡Puedes contar con ello!"i\rViola: Esa expresión decidida... Ese brillo en tus ojos dice que estás a la altura del desafío."�\r¡Es fantástico! Tanto las lágrimas de frustración que siguen a la derrota como el florecer de la alegría que trae la victoria."g\r¡Ambas son grandes temas para mi cámara! ¡Ahora ven a por mí! ¡Yo, Violeta, seré tu rival!"�\rViola: El mundo que ves a través de un objetivo, y el mundo que ves con un Pokémon a tu lado, pueden parecer completamente distintos."u\r¡Tú y tus Pokémon me habéis mostrado una profundidad de campo totalmente nueva! ¡Simplemente fantástico!"p\bGrant: ¡He estado esperando con impaciencia a un desafiante digno! Participar aquí ya es todo un logro."l\bDe hecho, es muy impresionante. ¡Tengo el presentimiento de que nuestro combate merecerá la espera!"X\bEspero que me demuestres que tu habilidad como Entrenador supera incluso la mía."`\bGrant: Hay cosas que parecen quedar fuera de nuestro alcance por mucho que lo intentemos."e\bSin embargo, lo importante es no rendirse jamás, sin importar el rival ni las probabilidades."{\rKorrina: ¡Ja, ja! ¡Ha llegado el momento de la gran entrada de Lady Korrina! ¡Es broma! ¡Encantada de conocerte!"�\rEstaba haciendo un entrenamiento especial con mi Lucario cuando, de repente, tu aura lo atrajo y salió disparado hacia aquí."P\rCreo que Lucario quiere combatir contigo. ¿Aceptarías nuestro desafío?"c\rKorrina: ¡Oh! ¡He sido derrotada! ¡Ay, ay! Lady Korrina ha dado un espectáculo terrible."H\rQué despliegue de fuerza tan explosivo, muy por encima del mío."�\bRamos: ¡Jo, jo! Puede que no lo parezca, pero tengo las mejores manos verdes que podrías encontrar. Si quieres saber de plantas, yo soy tu hombre."q\bEntonces, ¿qué te parece, jovencito? ¿Disfrutaste del verdor en tu camino para convertirte en Campeón?"j\bSu supervivencia es señal de su fuerza. ¿Seguro que estás preparado para enfrentarte a todo eso?"{\bRamos: Tú crees en tus Pokémon... Y ellos también creen en ti... Una fuerza como la de los robles más poderosos."b\bHa sido un buen combate, joven brote. Desde luego, una amistad verdadera no puede forzarse."b\bClemont: ¡Hola! ¡Me gustan mis combates Pokémon igual que mis inventos: DE ALTO VOLTAJE!"�\bY desde luego los Pokémon son misteriosos... Por mucho que haya avanzado la ciencia, todavía hay muchísimo que no sabemos de ellos."i\bAun así, demos ambos lo mejor de nosotros en combate. ¡El futuro es ahora, gracias a la ciencia!"o\bClemont: No hay vergüenza en perder. Me alegra poder aprender algo nuevo gracias a desafiantes fuertes."�\bPero lo que intento hacer es disfrutar cada día al máximo junto a mis Pokémon, mientras exploro la ciencia que tanto amo con mis inventos."w\rValerie: Oh, pero si es un joven Entrenador. Has llegado revoloteando hasta mí llevado por un viento favorable."k\rEntonces supongo que te has ganado el derecho a combatir conmigo. Espero que te resulte entretenido."u\rLas escurridizas hadas pueden parecer frágiles como una brisa y delicadas como una flor, pero no te confíes."W\rValerie: Sí. Un combate magnífico. La victoria es cautivadora, ¿no es cierto?"v\r... ... ... Ah... Perdóname. Me he quedado tan cautivada que por un momento olvidé que esa victoria era tuya."X\rOlympia: Ha llegado el momento de que estemos aquí frente a frente. Soy Olympia."^\rAhora nuestros caminos se han entrelazado y cruzado. También los de nuestros Pokémon."X\rEste es un ritual para decidir tu destino y tu futuro. ¡Que comience el combate!"z\rOlympia: Un testimonio de tu habilidad. Una prueba de tu poder. Un símbolo de confianza. Tus Pokémon te obedecen."G\rIncontables estrellas iluminan tu camino. No te pongas límites."|\bWulfric: ¿Sabes una cosa? El hielo es a la vez extremadamente duro y terriblemente frágil. ¿Sabes lo que significa eso?"}\bDependiendo de los Pokémon que elijas, puedo convertirme en tu rival más duro hasta ahora... o en un completo blandengue."g\bPero está bien. ¡Así es como debe ser! En fin, basta ya de charla. ¡Pongamos esto en marcha!"q\bWulfric: ¡Impresionante! Tus Pokémon han luchado con gran valentía. Se nota que los has entrenado bien."n\bTus Pokémon lo dieron absolutamente todo en ese combate. De verdad que eres alguien especial, ¿sabes?"\rMalva: Así que tú eres la gran promesa, ¿eh? La gente me conoce como Malva, la maestra de los Pokémon de tipo Fuego."r\rDa lo mejor de ti, porque si no logras impresionarme con tu verdadera fuerza, no llegarás muy lejos aquí."d\rPero para ti esto debería ser pan comido, ¿verdad? Estoy ardiendo de odio hacia ti, mocoso."�\rMalva: Oooh, ¡qué pequeño diablillo de Entrenador! Eres demasiado, ¿lo sabías? Eres tan entretenido que me entran ganas de achicharrarte ahí mismo."F\rPero te dejaré vivir... ¡Desde luego recordaré este combate!"�\bSiebold: ¡Tú, jovencito! Tengo una pregunta que debo hacerte. ¿Crees que los combates Pokémon pueden llegar a merecer ser llamados arte?"u\bVerás, la cocina es una clase de arte que desaparece en cuanto se termina. Los combates Pokémon son iguales."u\bConsagrarte por completo a una vida hecha de experiencias fugaces... eso sí que es verdaderamente artístico."�\bSiebold: ¡Entrégate por completo, para que incluso aquello que se desvanecerá y desaparecerá quede grabado para siempre en tu corazón y en tu mente!"�\bEs deber tanto de los Entrenadores como de los chefs encontrar lo bueno en cualquier materia prima con la que trabajen. Ahí reside la respuesta para llegar cada vez más alto."s\bWikstrom: ¡Bien hallado, joven desafiante! ¡Yo soy, en verdad, la famosa hoja de acero templado, Wikstrom!"c\bCon mis magníficos Pokémon a mi lado, ¡mostraré hasta dónde puede llegar un Entrenador!"[\bPrometamos ambos que nuestro duelo será justo y honorable. ¿Preparado? ¡En garde!"�\bWikstrom: ¿Qué dulce, glorioso dolor y qué gozo sacuden ahora mi poderoso corazón? ¡Mi voluntad, capaz de hacer temblar lanzas, tiembla ante un combate tan magnífico como este!"�\b¿Y ahora qué? ¡He sido vencido! Noble caballero, eres en verdad mi igual y digno de seguir adelante por este excelso salón."�\rDrácena: ¡Oh, cielos, hola! Bienvenido, bienvenido. Debes de ser un Entrenador fuerte. ¡Eso sí que son noticias maravillosas!"f\rCuando crecí, mis abuelos me criaron con historias sobre los Pokémon del tiempo y el espacio."�\rFue realmente gracias a esas historias que decidí convertirme en Entrenadora de tipo Dragón. ¡Enfrentarme a ti hará que mis Pokémon crezcan como la mala hierba!"c\rDrácena: ¡Ay, tú! ¡Eres demasiado! ¡Tú y tus Pokémon sois sencillamente encantadores!"_\rCon tus Pokémon, estoy segura de que puedes derrotarnos a todos y cada uno de nosotros."t\rDianta: Bienvenido, Entrenador. Como soy actriz, a veces la gente se acerca a hablarme porque son fans míos."�\rA menudo dicen que verme actuar les dio valor o los animó. ¡Pero yo también recibo muchísima energía de mis fans cuando los conozco!"�\r¿Sabes? Me encantaría aprender más sobre cómo un Entrenador fuerte como tú cría a sus Pokémon, llenos de esperanza por el futuro."}\rDianta: E-estoy tan emocionada que me cuesta saber qué decir, pero yo... yo... me siento tan feliz en este momento..."q\r¡Al fin y al cabo, me ha dado la oportunidad de conocerte y combatir contigo y tus maravillosos Pokémon!"Q\rShauna: ¡Eh, eh! ¡Encantada de conocerte! ¿Te lo has pasado bien aquí?"|\rOye, ¿sabes lo que está a punto de pasar? ¡Eso es! ¡Vamos a combatir! ¡Después de todo, somos Entrenadores Pokémon!"~\rEstoy segura de que vamos a ser grandes amigos. ¡Eh! ¿Podemos ver ya a los Pokémon? ¡Quiero conocerlos yo también!"V\rShauna: Me alegro muchísimo de haber emprendido un viaje. Hice grandes amigos."�\rPude visitar muchos lugares, conocer a un montón de buena gente y crear recuerdos maravillosos. ¡Apuesto a que a ti te ha pasado lo mismo!"\bTierno: ¡Muy bien! ¡Encantado de conocerte! ¿Sabes? Parecería que estuviéramos más unidos si nos llamáramos por motes."G\b¿Puedo llamarte Jammy? ¡Ja, ja! Vale, vale, relájate un poco."�\bEn fin, ¿podemos tener un combate Pokémon? Oh, eh... perdona por soltártelo así de repente. Pero para eso estamos aquí, ¿no?"V\bTierno: ¡Eso ha sido increíble, me dan ganas de ponerme a bailar ahora mismo!"U\b¡Esa demostración de fuerza me da ganas de moverme y girar de pura emoción!"o\bTrevor: Eh, hola. Soy Trevor. ¡Mi sueño es ver toda clase de Pokémon que el mundo tiene para ofrecer!"Z\bPor eso estoy de viaje con mi Pokédex, recorriendo altas montañas y vastos mares."<\bPero eso no significa que no pueda combatir. ¡Vamos!"b\bTrevor: Aún hay tantísimo que no sé. ¿Será simplemente que no tengo lo que hace falta?"X\bOh, así que no se puede aprender todo solo a través de la Pokédex... ¡Ya veo!"_\rSerena: ¡Hola! Me llamo Serena. ¡Convierto mi amistad con mis Pokémon en pura fuerza!"Z\rEres especial. Siento que la amistad que tenemos con nuestros Pokémon nos conecta."Z\r¡Woohoo! ¡No puedo esperar a ver de qué somos capaces! Ejeje, ¡vamos a empezar!"x\rSerena: Todo el mundo tiene sus puntos fuertes. ¡Y eso es cierto tanto para las personas como para los Pokémon!"�\r¡Desde luego me he fijado en cuáles son tus puntos fuertes! Y apostaría lo que fuera a que tus Pokémon también se han dado cuenta."h\bCalem: Hola, soy Calem. ¡Voy a seguir avanzando hasta ser lo más fuerte que pueda llegar a ser!"�\bCreo que sería divertido competir para ver quién es más fuerte. ¡Pero no podremos llamarlo competición hasta que te derrote al menos una vez!",\bMuy bien, hagámoslo. ¡Vamos, todos!"�\bCalem: ¡Eres uno de mis mejores rivales! Puede que encuentres nuevas estrategias que hagan que los combates fluyan mucho mejor."c\bY antes de que lo preguntes, no, ¡no voy a decirte qué estrategias usaré la próxima vez!"�\bIlima: ¡Saludos! No he podido evitar observar tus combates. Tenías un aire tan encantador en batalla que no me quedó más remedio que hacerte venir aquí."p\bDebo admitir que sentía curiosidad por ti. Estoy deseando ver el brillo de tus movimientos en mi prueba."Z\b¡Muy bien, entonces! ¡Contempla a los magníficos Pokémon del inigualable Ilima!"b\bIlima: Tú, o mejor dicho, tú y tus Pokémon, ¡formáis un equipo de lo más interesante!"L\bSeguiré sintiendo las réplicas de ese combate durante mucho tiempo."�\rLana: Hola. Soy Lana. Solía ir mucho de pesca con mis hermanas gemelas, así que también podría decirse que es uno de mis talentos."h\rPareces un Entrenador en buena forma. ¡Entonces podríamos ir juntos a pescar Pokémon salvajes!"X\rPero más importante que eso... ¡te mostraré de lo que es capaz una Lana seria!"f\rLana: Phew... ¡ha sido fantástico! ¡Tú y tus Pokémon estabais perfectamente sincronizados!"\\rParece que me precipité al pensar que mi poder al máximo bastaría para derrotarte."�\bKiawe: Me llamo Kiawe. Mi Marowak y yo somos discípulos de las antiguas danzas que se han transmitido en Alola durante generaciones."t\b¡Mostraré por completo la afamada danza de mis Pokémon! ¡Se gane o se pierda, nunca hay suficiente baile!"}\bKiawe: ¡Asombroso! Dejarme contagiar por la emoción de un rival... ¡No hay nada que me haga desear más un combate!"e\bSí... Ese es exactamente el tipo de entrenamiento intenso que me convirtió en quien soy hoy."|\rMallow: ¡Eh! ¡Gracias por venir! ¿Ya has desayunado? ¡Tengo un Superespecial de Mallow para ti, si tienes hambre!"�\r¿Que no? Vale. Pero recuerda tomarte un descanso de vez en cuando. Un Maestro Pokémon no va siempre corriendo de un lado a otro."�\r¡Uso mi intuición de chef para escoger siempre lo mejor de lo mejor! ¡Así que pongámonos manos a la obra en pleno fragor del combate!"w\rMallow: Awwww, perdí. Supongo que ahora tendré que dejar que mis Pokémon de tipo Planta me animen otra vez..."]\rY si la próxima vez tienes hambre, ¡no seas tímido! ¡Acércate y prueba un bocado!"i\bSophocles: Hola, no se me da demasiado bien estar rodeado de gente. Cuando la gente me mira, yo..."�\bPuede que no te hayas dado cuenta, pero me acabo de desmayar como tres veces... Estoy esforzándome muchísimo por acostumbrarme a que otros me miren."v\b¡Eh! Si tienes un momento, ¿podrías enseñarme algunos trucos para tener más confianza combatiendo conmigo?"k\bSophocles: Soy tímido... y desde luego me he sentido solo antes, pero se me da genial la robótica."`\b¿Cómo? ¿Te interesa cómo se construyen las máquinas? ¿Por qué no lo dijiste antes?"\rMina: ¡Oh! Por favor, posa ahí. ¡Sí! ¡Fantástico! ¡Eso sí que es una gran composición! ¡Podría pintarte así!"�\rAunque creo que no me he presentado. Soy Mina, pintora. Bueno, más o menos... en realidad voy de un lado a otro haciendo mi arte."[\r¡Quizá tus habilidades en combate sean una auténtica obra maestra! ¡Vamos allá!"Y\rMina: Hrmmm! Bueno, esto es frustrante. No logré sacar de verdad todo mi poder..."�\r¡Me gustaría dibujar cómo te ves cuando estás combatiendo! ¡Volvamos a tener otro combate Pokémon a plena potencia algún día, sí?"�\rLillie: ¡Encantada de conocerte! Me llamo Lillie. ¡Empezar el día con una cálida sonrisa y un saludo siempre me pone de muy buen humor!"h\rAquí hay Entrenadores que vienen a desafiarte a combates, ¡así que no puedes bajar la guardia!"Q\r¡Haré todo lo posible para que ningún Pokémon tenga que acabar herido!"t\rLillie: Ugh, nos has vencido. Ojalá hubiéramos tenido un poco más de tiempo para prepararnos. Eso es todo."X\rBueno, venirse abajo no arreglará nada, ¿verdad? Vamos, ¡intentemos animarnos!"~\bNanu: Oye, tú. ¿Quieres ocupar mi puesto? Me gustaría irme a casa. Solo quiero tomarme las cosas con calma, ¿sabes?"\b¿Has venido a desafiarme? Qué fastidio, demonios. Esto son malas noticias. Bueno, no puedo ignorar algo así sin más."V\bNo te lo tomes demasiado en serio. Te agotarás si siempre vas con tanta prisa."y\bNanu: Soy un viejo. Procuro no tener sueños ya. Mientras chavales como tú disfrutéis, no puedo pedir nada más."`\bIntentar hacerse aún más fuerte también está bien... pero ese es un camino muy largo."R\rHapu: ¡Alola! Así es como saludamos a la gente en mi pueblo cada mañana."�\r¡Es bueno madrugar! ¡Deberías aprovechar al máximo el tiempo que tienes! Tener que atender los campos cada mañana me ha convertido en una madrugadora."Z\rParece que estás destinado a labrarte una gran historia. Es hora de ponerse serio."i\rHapu: Sí. Es una pena que hayamos perdido, pero supongo que ahora no nos queda otra que animarte."N\rSin duda eres un Entrenador prodigioso. Has hecho un trabajo admirable."�\rOlivia: Vaya, hola. Encantada de conoceros. Soy Olivia. Mis compañeros son adorables y duros Pokémon de tipo Roca. Os reduciremos a polvo."h\rNuestras habilidades están tan pulidas que brillan. Empiezo a sentirme como un diamante tallado."n\rPuedes contar conmigo, chaval. ¡Prepárate para el combate Pokémon más duro que hayas tenido jamás!"o\rOlivia: Los diamantes solo brillan después de que el carbón ha sido llevado hasta su límite absoluto."g\rCreo que tu viaje te deparará muchas sorpresas. Espero que también te traiga muchas alegrías."t\rKahili: Hola, soy golfista profesional y Entrenadora. Aspiro a perfeccionar mis habilidades en ambas facetas."�\rAspiro a hacer mis combates entretenidos para los espectadores. Además, disfruto jugando los mismos partidos que al público le gusta ver."r\rVeamos hasta dónde podemos volar. ¡Los vientos de la victoria soplarán a favor de mis Pokémon y de mí!"P\rKahili: ¡Uf! ¡Combatir contigo fue como una brisa refrescante! Gracias."d\rOh, ¿también te interesa el golf? Podrías tener talento. Estaría encantada de enseñarte."\bMolayne: Hola, estaba observando las estrellas hasta que apareciste tú... *bostezo*... sigo teniendo muchísimo sueño."s\bHacía tiempo que no paseaba por un lugar nuevo y conocía a tanta gente nueva. Es una sensación agradable."_\bAhora tengo que hacer lo que pueda para mantenerme al nivel de los demás. ¡Combatamos!"�\bMolayne: En cada situación eliges los mejores movimientos y objetos. Así que yo también tengo que estrujarme el cerebro en combate..."@\bPero al final me superaste en astucia. ¡No tienes igual!"m\rAcerola: ¡Hola! Soy Acerola. Sé que no lo parezco, pero mi familia fue prácticamente de la realeza."�\r¡Me encanta leer! Los libros pueden llevarnos de viaje a mundos fantásticos y contarnos las historias de personas muy lejanas."X\r¡Quizá nuestro combate llegue a contarse también en los libros durante siglos!"I\rAcerola: ¡Uf! Bueno, ahí se fue mi esperanza de hacerte añicos."�\r¡Espero que podamos seguir haciendo cosas divertidas juntos! ¡Ahí fuera hay todo un mundo de cosas emocionantes para hacer!"j\bHala: Dooot doo doo, solo un Kahuna dando un paseo. Oh, ¡un visitante poco común! Hola, soy Hala."a\bConocerás personas y Pokémon... y a veces quizá te topes con cosas que no pueden verse."p\bCuanto más reflexiones sobre estas cosas, ¡más fuertes se volverán tu mente y tu cuerpo! ¡Choquemos!"~\bHala: ...¡Humph! Este resultado no me sorprende en absoluto. Qué gran Entrenador... y qué grandes Pokémon también."}\b¡Un combate tan trepidante como ese me recorre el cuerpo entero! ¡Estoy seguro de que mis Pokémon también lo sintieron!"w\bHau: ¡Eh! Soy Hau. ¡Encantado de conocerte! No sé nada de este lugar, así que todo me parece nuevo y genial."V\bLos combates no van de ganar o perder. ¡Van de si tienes la voluntad de ganar!"?\b¡Quiero hacer todas las cosas divertidas! ¡Combatamos!"�\bHau: Conseguimos hacer algo bastante increíble cuando mis compañeros y yo estábamos totalmente sincronizados y queríamos lo mismo."j\b¡Pero parece que aún estamos a un paso de convertirnos en el Entrenador y el equipo más fuertes!"S\bGladion: ¿Qué necesita realmente un Entrenador Pokémon para tener éxito?"o\bEntrené durante mucho tiempo intentando descubrirlo. Supongo que cada cual tendrá su propia respuesta."L\bPero al menos, en mi caso... yo quiero al rival más fuerte para mí."=\bGladion: No te vencí, pero aun así valió la pena..."{\bComo mínimo, ahora puedo apreciar tu fuerza mucho más que antes. Gracias. Nos has ayudado a hacernos más fuertes."]\rSelene: ¡Alola! Soy Selene. ¡Desde que llegué aquí no ha dejado de haber emoción!"[\r¡Llenémonos hoy de tanta energía que brillemos incluso más que el sol y la luna!"2\r¡Estoy al máximo de energía! ¡Adelante!"T\rSelene: Aww, qué pena. ¡Pero tengo suerte de poder vivir una emoción así!"D\r¡Solo de pensarlo ya me entran ganas de volver a desafiarte!"q\bElio: ¡Alola! Me llamo Elio. ¿No es increíble que alguien haya sido capaz de construir algo tan enorme?"e\bEste club es bastante duro, pero al pasarlo creamos un montón de recuerdos para toda la vida.":\bEstaré encantado de mostrarte de lo que soy capaz."B\bElio: ¡Guau! Eres fuerte. ¡Tienes muy buen nivel, colega!"~\bLa fuerza de la amistad, ser amable, divertirse... Quizá debería decir que... todos nos hicimos más fuertes juntos, ¿eh?"3\rMisty: ¡Aiyeee! ¡Eso me enfada muchísimo!"L\bAhora vuelve a seguir puliéndote. ¡Tú sigue adelante como un rayo!"f\bBlaine: ¡Impresionante! Has demostrado el ingenio y el conocimiento necesarios para superarme."X\b¡Esto me enciende aún más! ¡Sé apasionado! ¡Siente esa curiosidad ardiente!"{\bFalkner: Dicen que unas alas pueden ser abatidas con una descarga... ¡No permitiré semejantes insultos a mis aves!"j\b¡Es que no se han enfrentado a mis magníficas alas, las que me han llevado a las mayores alturas!"r\b¡Te mostraré el verdadero poder de los gloriosos Pokémon de tipo Volador! ¡Vientos, permaneced conmigo!"D\bFalkner: Una derrota es una derrota. Desde luego eres fuerte."a\bMientras conserve grandes ambiciones, podré volar tan lejos como quiera. ¡Igual que tú!"Q\bBugsy: Pareces un Entrenador con grandes conocimientos sobre los Pokémon."�\bPero cuando se trata de Pokémon de tipo Bicho, yo nunca pierdo. ¡Mis investigaciones me convertirán en toda una autoridad sobre ellos!"@\bDéjame demostrarte lo que he aprendido con mis estudios."_\bBugsy: Los Pokémon de tipo Bicho son profundos. Hay muchísimos misterios por explorar."v\bPero también debería empezar a estudiar otros Pokémon. Te agradezco que me hayas hecho darme cuenta de ello."Y\rWhitney: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Whitney! ¡Los Pokémon son superadorables! ¿No te parece?"[\rY como yo también soy superadorable, ¡está clarísimo que se me da muy bien esto!"m\r¿Quieres un combate contra mí, la talentosa y superadorable yo? ¡Pues considéralo una advertencia!"4\rWhitney: ¡Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! ¡Qué malo eres!"V\rSnif... No creas que esto ha terminado. ¡La próxima vez me haré más fuerte!"I\bMorty: Bien por haber venido. Yo puedo ver lo que otros no pueden."o\bY con un poco más... me convertiré en un Entrenador verdaderamente poderoso, digno de conocer a Ho-Oh."Q\bMuéstrame el poder que posees. ¡Tú vas a ayudarme a alcanzar ese nivel!"t\bMorty: No creo que nuestros potenciales sean tan distintos. Pero tú pareces tener algo que a mí me falta..."r\bSi vuelvo a combatir contigo la próxima vez, podré contemplar algo nuevo de nuevo... Lo espero con ganas."{\bChuck: ¡WAHAHAH! ¿Así que has venido a entrenar bajo mi tutela? ¿No? ¡Entonces me has interrumpido el entrenamiento!"x\bDéjame decirte una cosa: ¡soy lo bastante duro como para aplastar piedras y romper huesos! ¡Urggh! ¡Oooarrgh!"c\b¿Cómo? ¿Que eso no tiene nada que ver con los Pokémon? ¡Es verdad! ¡Vamos, combatamos!"T\bChuck: Perder contra un chaval. La próxima generación viene pisando fuerte."c\b¡Pero una derrota es una derrota! ¡A partir de ahora voy a entrenar las 24 horas del día!"T\rJasmine: Oh... eh, hola. ¿Quieres a tus Pokémon? ¿Sin importar su aspecto?"\rLos Pokémon de tipo Acero son duros, fríos, afilados y muy fuertes... pero también anhelan cariño y cuidados delicados...";\rUm... no estoy mintiendo. ¿Puedo demostrártelo...?"M\rJasmine: T-tú estás muy pulido, tanto en habilidad como en bondad..."V\rUm... no sé muy bien cómo decir esto, pero gracias por querer a tus Pokémon."�\bPryce: Llevo entrenando desde antes de que tú nacieras. Los Pokémon, igual que los humanos, hemos vivido muchas experiencias y sufrimientos a lo largo de nuestras vidas."?\bComo soy tu mayor, déjame enseñarte a qué me refiero."Y\bPryce: Un poder impresionante. Es raro encontrar un Entrenador tan bueno como tú."h\bCuando la nieve se derrite, llega la primavera. Atesora el tiempo que pasas junto a tus Pokémon."f\rClair: Qué descaro mirarme a los ojos. Estás ante la mejor maestra de tipo Dragón del mundo."r\rPuedo mantenerme firme incluso contra miembros del Alto Mando. Pensar que tienes las agallas de desafiarme.":\rVoy a usar todo mi poder contra ti. ¡Vamos a ello!"d\rClair: ¡¿Qué?! ¿Has venido a restregarme tu victoria? Vale. ¡Enhorabuena! ¿Contento ya?"i\rCaray. Eres un Entrenador misterioso, pero me has hecho darme cuenta de aquello de lo que carezco."_\bWill: Bienvenido, el destino y tú me habéis elegido. Permíteme presentarme. Soy Will."`\bHe entrenado por todo el mundo para llegar al punto en que la gente reconociera mi poder."W\bDéjame ofrecerte este espectáculo para convencerte a ti también. ¡Contempla!"e\bWill: He observado tus técnicas: eres el mejor, sin lugar a dudas. No me queda ningún pesar."@\bEste combate pasará a la historia. Estoy seguro de ello."{\bKoga: ¡Fwahahaha! Así que me has encontrado, a mí, el que vive en las sombras. Eso me hace estremecer de júbilo."\bMi intrincado estilo te confundirá y te destruirá. Los verdaderos terrores no se basan únicamente en la fuerza bruta."O\bPrepárate para ser víctima de mis técnicas... Lo verás muy pronto..."�\bKoga: Te he sometido a todo lo que era capaz de desplegar. Pero mis esfuerzos han fracasado. Debo perfeccionar mis habilidades."H\bEstoy deseando volver a ver cómo pones a prueba tus habilidades."_\bBruno: El entrenamiento extremo da como resultado liberar un potencial aún inexplorado."|\bNo veo miedo alguno en ti. Tienes determinación. Entonces, ¿eres uno de los Entrenadores más fuertes de por aquí?"W\bOlvídalo, ¡yo te desafío! Inclínate ante nuestro poder abrumador. ¡Hoo hah!"M\bBruno: Sigues manteniéndote firme. Mi desafío ha quedado satisfecho."O\bNo tengo nada más que decir. No te preocupes por mí. ¡Sigue adelante!"C\rKaren: ¿Y ahora qué? ¿Quieres desafiarme? Qué divertido."g\rPor si no lo sabías, se me conoce por mis tácticas arrolladoras. ¿Crees que podrás con ello?"%\rPruébame. Entreténme. Vamos."{\rKaren: No existe eso de Pokémon débiles. Los Entrenadores realmente hábiles ganarían junto a aquellos a quienes aman."\\rMe gusta tu estilo. Sabes lo que de verdad importa. Vuelve a buscarme cuando quieras."�\bRoark: No soy más que un Entrenador que decidió caminar con orgullo junto a los Pokémon de tipo Roca. Cada día nos endurecemos excavando fósiles."x\b¿Puedo enseñarte lo duros que somos? ¡Yo también necesito ver la dureza de los Pokémon que combaten contigo!"\b¡Esto va a ser brutal!"]\bRoark: Ahí perdimos el control. Con una habilidad como la tuya, es natural que ganes."~\bLa próxima vez, me gustaría desafiarte a una carrera de excavación de fósiles bajo tierra, en la región de Sinnoh."�\rGardenia: No puedo negar que los tipos Planta tienen muchos puntos débiles, ¡pero ese no es el único factor que decide quién gana!"q\rMis Pokémon están creciendo sanos y fuertes. ¡Conmigo no puedes fallar! Vamos, vayamos a lo importante."9\r¡Vamos a combatir! Uno rápido de verdad, ¿vale?"T\rGardenia: ¿Qué tal te sientes? Yo quería ganar y presumir de mis Pokémon."[\rIntento ser todo lo dura que puedo, pero hoy el vencedor has sido tú. ¡Increíble!"�\rMaylene: Encantada de verte. En realidad no sé muy bien qué significa ser fuerte, pero haré todo lo que pueda como Entrenadora."J\rGracias a mi entrenamiento, poco a poco voy ganando más confianza."D\rAdemás, me tomo los combates muy en serio. ¡Cuando quieras!"W\rMaylene: Aprende de tu rival al ganar, y aprende de tu rival también al perder."S\rSí, todo es una experiencia. ¡Todavía tengo margen para seguir creciendo!"y\bCrasher Wake: El ring es mi mar embravecido~ Las olas gigantes me dieron forma~ ¡Crash! ¡Crash! ¡Crasher Wake~!"�\b¡Mis Pokémon se endurecieron en blancas aguas tempestuosas! ¡Aguantarán todo lo que les lances y luego te arrastrarán al fondo!"8\b¡La victoria será nuestra! ¡Vamos, hagámoslo!"X\bCrasher Wake: ¡Hwah! ¡Ha venido y se ha ido! ¿Cómo lo digo...? ¡Quiero más!"m\b¡Me divierto combatiendo, gane o pierda! ¡Espero que tus victorias hagan sonreír a aún más gente!"y\rFantina: Ah, oui, ¿estás aquí en busca de un desafío? Espero de verdad que lo disfrutes, pareces très fuerte."L\rPero yo ganaré, non? Porque moi es, por supuesto, très fantastique."K\rEnfin, así será. Deseo mostrarte un combate à la danse classique."]\rFantina: ¡Excusè moi! ¡Atónita! ¡Très très fuerte! ¡Tu poder es tan admirable!"n\rMerci beaucoup por esta danza conmigo. Si algún día tienes tiempo, vuelve a verme, ¿ok? ¡Au revoir!"u\bBryon: ¡Entrenador! Eres joven, igual que mi hijo Roark, y estás recorriendo el mundo en busca de desafíos."�\bCon más Entrenadores como tú tomando la iniciativa, ¡el futuro del mundo Pokémon es brillante! Pero como muro ante los jóvenes como vosotros, ¡todavía no pienso apartarme!"Z\bAcepto tu desafío. ¡Tengo la confianza necesaria para resistir todos tus ataques!"q\bByron: ¡Gwahahaha! Fuiste lo bastante fuerte como para derribar a mi preciado equipo. Reconozco tu poder."e\bHe visto algo grandioso en ti. ¡Asegúrate de mostrar tu poder también a otros Entrenadores!"Y\rCandice: ¿Vas a ser mi oponente? ¡Perfecto! ¡Estaba esperando a alguien fuerte!"@\rPero ya te aviso: soy dura porque sé cómo concentrarme."M\rTe enseñaré exactamente a qué me refiero. ¡Prepárate para perder!"�\rCandice: ¡Guau! ¡Eres increíble! ¡Te has ganado mi respeto! ¡Creo que tu concentración y tu voluntad nos han arrollado por completo!"F\r¡Pero la próxima vez me concentraré aún más y no perderé!"`\bVolkner: *Suspiro*... Vale. No me retan muy a menudo. Pero todos han sido aburridísimos."b\bNo tuve que sudar para derrotarlos. Pero en fin, supongo que será mejor terminar con esto."O\bEspero que seas tú quien me haga recordar lo divertido que es combatir."\\bVolkner: ...Jejeje. ¡Jajajá! ...¡No me lo pasaba tan bien desde... ni sé cuándo!"d\b¡Me emociona saber que tú y tu equipo seguiréis combatiendo a un nivel cada vez más alto!"_\bAaron: ¡Hola! ¡Encantado de conocerte! Debo decirte que soy un gran fan de los bichos."l\bPueden ser desagradables y crueles, ¡pero también son hermosos! ¿Te gustaría aceptar mi desafío?"h\bQuiero alcanzar la perfección, igual que mis Pokémon de tipo Bicho. ¡Déjame enfrentarme a ti!"�\bAaron: La perfección es, desde luego, algo profundo y complejo. Reconozco mi derrota, ¡pero creo que has venido a ver lo grandiosos que pueden llegar a ser los Pokémon de tipo Bicho!"_\rBertha: Vaya, vaya. Eres bastante adorable, pero tienes carácter. ¡Ajajá! Soy Bertha."_\rTengo preferencia por los Pokémon de tipo Tierra. Vastos, amplios y siempre acogedores."H\rBueno, ¿le mostrarías a esta anciana todo lo que has aprendido?"�\rBertha: Eres de lo más increíble, jovencito. Me gusta cómo tú y tus Pokémon os ganasteis la victoria trabajando como uno solo."a\rEso es lo que te hace tan fuerte. ¡Ajajá! Creo que puedes llegar tan lejos como quieras."�\bFlint: ¡Yo! ¡Me llamo Flint! Los combates son choques entre los ardientes espíritus de los Pokémon, no van de apariencias ni de qué es débil o fuerte."�\b¡Se trata de si los combatientes arden con fuerza o no! ¡He podido sentir tu espíritu encendido! ¡Déjame decirte que mi corazón siempre está en llamas!"A\b¡Muy bien, fenómeno! ¡Vamos a darle un poco de picante!"x\bFlint: ¡Pero bueno...! ¡No me lo creo! ¡He perdido! No te subestimé... ¡pero no esperaba que fueras a ganar!"K\b¡Esto me ha dejado alucinado! ¡Tú y tus Pokémon sois puro fuego!"h\bLucian: Ah, has llegado en un momento oportuno. Verás, justo acabo de terminar de leer un libro."�\bPermíteme presentarme. Soy Lucian, usuario del tipo Psíquico. Ya has demostrado ser excepcional solo con llegar hasta aquí."m\bAsí que me temo que tendré que emplearme a fondo contra ti para estar a la altura de mi reputación."R\bLucian: Altibajos. Eres tan extraordinario como el libro que acabo de leer."|\bPor favor, sal por la puerta que tienes a tu derecha, mientras yo me quedaré leyendo libros para calmar los nervios."~\bCilan: Um. Me llamo Cilan. Me gustan los Pokémon de tipo Planta; siempre me parecen tan profundos y llenos de matices."M\b¿Te gustaría combatir conmigo? Todavía me queda mucho por aprender."K\bNada personal... Sin rencores... Vamos a combatir, pase lo que pase."y\bCilan: Qué sorpresa... Eres muy fuerte, ¿verdad? Supongo que mis hermanos tampoco serían capaces de derrotarte."e\bMe alegra haber podido, al menos, mostrar el delicioso encanto de los Pokémon de tipo Planta."\bChili: ¡Escucha bien! ¡Me llamo Chili! ¡Prendo fuego a todo con Pokémon de tipo Fuego, como si fueran tacos con habanero!"_\b¡Y eso es todo! ¡Voy a enseñarte de lo que somos capaces mis Pokémon ardientes y yo!"U\bTú también estás encendido, ¿verdad? ¡Prepárate para un duelo abrasador!"J\bChili: ¡Whoa ho! ¡Estás que ardes! Has chamuscado a todos, ¿eh?"K\bPero tendrás que reconocerme que he dado un buen combate, ¿verdad?"\bCress: Encantado de conocerte. Soy Cress, especialista en Pokémon de tipo Agua. Son refrescantes, justo como me gustan."p\bSeremos mis estimados Pokémon y yo quienes te enfrentaremos en combate. ¿Serías tan amable de aceptar?"d\bIgual que es natural que el agua fluya desde lo alto hacia abajo, también lo es mi victoria."m\bCress: ¡Qué asombroso! ¡A pesar de todo, has conseguido vencer a alguien tan impresionante como yo!"i\bPienso volver a entrenar con el objetivo de derrotarte cuando te hayas hecho todavía más fuerte."y\rLenora: ¡Bienvenido! ¡Así que has venido hasta aquí! ¡No seas tímido! ¡Eres demasiado joven para cohibirte!"�\rCuando era pequeña, mi padre siempre llevaba a casa huesos que desenterraba. ¡Me fascinaba pensar en lo que habrían sido antes!"�\rY ahora también voy a investigar cómo combates junto a los Pokémon que has criado con tanto cariño. ¡La curiosidad es la salsa de la vida!"u\rLenora: Tu estilo de combate es realmente cautivador. Tiene un encanto especial. ¡Me alegra haberte conocido!"W\rCombatir te sale de forma natural, ¿verdad? Tu victoria es fruto de ello, ¿no?"y\bBurgh: ¡Ajá! ¡Luces encendidas! ¡Mis Pokémon de tipo Bicho revolotean de emoción por poder combatir contigo!"�\bSi el combate logra sacar a relucir la belleza de mis compañeros, será una escena que me hará latir el corazón, gane o pierda."�\bMhm... Siento que podría pintar un cuadro como ningún otro. ¡OK! Escucho a mi musa del combate alto y claro. ¡Vamos al grano!"o\bBurgh: Aww... Perdí. ¡Da igual! Perder contra ti no me molesta, porque eres IN-CRE-Í-blemente fuerte."Y\bSe gane o se pierda, los Pokémon de tipo Bicho siguen siendo geniales y hermosos."�\rElesa: Sí, cielo. Soy Elesa, la modelo mundialmente famosa. ¡Bienvenido a mi escenario! Mis adorados Pokémon y los tuyos se medirán en él."f\r¡C'est fini! Cuando estoy segura de ello, siento una descarga eléctrica recorrerme el cuerpo."t\r¡Quiero sentir esa sensación! ¡Así que ahora mis queridos Pokémon van a dejarte la cabeza dando vueltas!"l\rElesa: Madre mía... Tienes un estilo de combate encantador. Me has dejado completamente electrizada."�\rQuiero que mis Pokémon también se bañen en un foco glamuroso. Y en ese sentido, ¡los tuyos brillaron con una intensidad deslumbrante!"r\bClay: ¡Harrumph! Me has hecho esperar, ¿eh, chaval? Así que tú eres el Entrenador del que todos hablan."�\b¡Lo mucho que te haces más fuerte depende de lo mucho que quieras ganar! Si quieres ganar, ¡no pongas excusas! ¿Entendido?"x\b¡Si vas a estar quejándote, olvídate de combatir! Aunque, bueno, quizá contigo me esté preocupando por nada."�\bClay: Para ser tan joven, tienes un estilo de combate imponente. Me pregunto qué clase de viaje habrás vivido para hacerte tan fuerte."T\b¡Pero sigo sin llevar bien eso de perder! Vuelve por aquí otra vez, ¿vale?"~\rSkyla: ¡Ji, ji! Te estaba esperando. ¡Eres un Entrenador duro, capaz de plantarle cara al viento sin que te arrastre!"h\rAsí que esto va a decidir quién está en la cima, ¿verdad? ¡Me encanta estar en lo más alto!"|\r¡Desde las alturas se ve a kilómetros y kilómetros! Así que, ¿qué te parece si tú y yo nos divertimos un poco?"?\rSkyla: Eres un Entrenador bastante increíble, ¿verdad?"y\rMis Pokémon y yo estamos contentos, porque por primera vez en mucho tiempo hemos luchado con toda nuestra fuerza."[\bBrycen: Encantado de conocerte. Soy Brycen. En el pasado, estuve herido y deprimido."y\bEntonces alguien compartió esto conmigo... Existe una fuerza especial en estar junto a otras personas y Pokémon."~\bRecibir su apoyo te hace más fuerte. Te mostraré ese poder del que aprendí y que ahora está grabado en mi corazón."F\bBrycen: ¡Eres fuerte! No, tanto tú como tus Pokémon lo sois."j\bLas estrellas de este espectáculo, de esta historia, fuisteis tú y tus Pokémon. Lo hiciste bien."b\rRoxie: ¡No haces nada! ¡¿Qué sabes tú~?! ¡No haces nada! ¡¿Cómo piensas cambiar~?!"\\r¡Yo me encargo de eso~! ¡Voy a darte una descarga tóxica y a abrirte la mente~!!!!"f\r¡Soy Roxie~! ¡Escucha bien~! ¡Voy a hacer vibrar al público hasta sacarlo de sus asientos~!"�\rRoxie: ¡Tú no ganaste! ¡Yo simplemente perdí! ¡Fui débil y hice que mis Pokémon sintieran lo horrible que apesta perder!"j\r¡Ya verás~! ¡La próxima vez que nos encontremos te daré esa descarga tóxica que te prometí~!"t\bCheren: ¿Quieres demostrar lo fuerte que eres ganando, o quieres aprender qué significa realmente combatir?"�\bIncluso heridos, mis Pokémon lucharán por mí con una sola orden. Creo que valorarás y confiarás más en tus Pokémon si guardas ese hecho muy cerca de tu corazón."u\b¡Eso es! ¡Combato con todo lo que tengo para encontrar la relación ideal entre los Pokémon y las personas!"�\bCheren: Seguiré combatiendo contra muchos Entrenadores y Pokémon como este, y si logro descubrir qué clase de persona soy, eso abrirá mi camino."�\bEstoy seguro de que este camino me llevará a convertirme en la persona que estoy destinado a ser. Los Pokémon siempre estarán contigo y conmigo mientras avancemos por él."�\bDrayden: Como Entrenador, siempre me he limitado a perseguir una fuerza mayor. Pero ahora estoy envejeciendo, y pienso en el tiempo que me queda..."[\bLo que busco ahora es a un Entrenador joven que pueda mostrarme un futuro brillante."|\bCombatamos con todo lo que tenemos: tu habilidad, mi experiencia y el cariño con el que hemos criado a nuestros Pokémon."l\bDrayden: Maravilloso. Estoy agradecido de que hayamos tenido la oportunidad de conocernos y combatir."U\bConstruye un futuro brillante, no solo para ti, sino también para los demás."e\bMarlon: Uihaa~ ¡Qué pasa! ¡Así que me toca enfrentarme a ti! Vaya captura más inesperada."i\bSoy tan fuerte como el inmenso océano. Te va a arrastrar la marea, fijo. Bah, ya basta de charla."a\b¿Qué te parece si tú y yo armamos una buena marejada y dejamos al público sin aliento?"d\bMarlon: No es solo que parezcas fuerte, ¡es que de verdad eres una amenaza de las profundas!"x\b¡Igual que un mar embravecido que lo arrastra todo! ¡Uihaa~! ¡Tu fuerza y tu pasión me han pasado por encima!"|\bGrimsley: Vaya, vaya... Los desafiantes vienen uno tras otro. Bueno, da igual, la vida es un combate serio de todos modos."q\bEs más importante dominar las cartas que te han tocado que quejarte de las que le han dado a tus rivales."�\bLo que se decidirá aquí es cuál de los dos puede absorber la luz y el brillo de este combate. Dejemos que el destino eche a rodar."�\bGrimsley: Da igual si llegas a luchar a plena potencia o si la Dama Suerte te sonríe. Donde hay un ganador, también hay un perdedor."\\bUna derrota es una derrota. Ahora mismo, tú y tus Pokémon brilláis con intensidad."�\rShauntal: Los pensamientos del Entrenador unidos a la mente del Pokémon... Eso forma parte de una novela que escribí. ¡Me encanta escribir sobre Pokémon!"}\rLos comienzos son importantes, ya sea en una buena novela o en un buen combate. Oh, disculpa. Eres un desafiante, ¿verdad?"=\r¿Te gustaría ser el protagonista de mi nueva novela?"g\rShauntal: ¿Alguna vez sientes que te faltan las palabras cuando algo te conmueve profundamente?"s\rSoy escritora, pero ahora mismo me cuesta poner en palabras lo que siento. ¡Has sido así de impresionante!"M\bMarshal: Me llamo Marshal, el alumno número uno de mi maestro, Alder."|\bPara dominar el arte del combate, no he dejado de entrenar. Tú también recorres un camino parecido junto a tus Pokémon."T\bMi intención es ponerte a prueba y llevarte al límite de tu fuerza. ¡Kiai!"}\bMarshal: No existe un único Pokémon más fuerte ni la mejor combinación posible. Por eso es tan difícil seguir ganando."{\bSin embargo, creo que un corazón que ansía la fuerza es un ideal precioso. Te respeto, porque tú lo tienes. ¡Uf!"Y\rCaitlin: ¿Quién eres? Qué grosero eres al venir a interrumpir mi sueño. Hmf..."u\rParece que posees una combinación de fuerza y bondad. Lo que yo busco en mi oponente es una fuerza sublime..."`\rMuy bien. Haz todo lo posible por no aburrirme con un combate soporífero. ¿Está claro?"`\rCaitlin: Ganar es importante, pero más importante aún es si esta vez lo he hecho mejor."y\rQuiero mejorar y ganar con más elegancia, así que te invito a volver a ser mi rival en el futuro, si te apetece."`\bBenga: ¡Tú! ¡Sí! ¡Lo sabía, hueles a rival duro! ¿Pero sabes lo fuerte que soy yo?"o\b¡Eh, eh! ¡Mírame! ¡Quiero combatir contigo! ¡Mis Pokémon todavía no han pasado por lo suficiente!"X\b¡Veremos quién es más fuerte! ¡Esforcémonos al máximo para ser los mejores!"�\bBenga: ¡Qué emocionante! ¡La combinación entre tú y tus Pokémon! ¡Qué trabajo en equipo tan increíble! ¡Con eso podéis llegar a cualquier parte!"�\b¡Eh! ¡Eh! ¡Más te vale seguir aspirando a lo más alto y prometer que volverás a desafiarme! ¡Si no, llegaré a la cima en un abrir y cerrar de ojos!"f\rLana: Phew... ¡ha sido fantástico! ¡Tú y tus Pokémon estabais perfectamente sincronizados!"|\bKiawe: ¡Asombroso! Dejarme contagiar por la emoción de un rival... ¡No hay nada que me den más ganas de combatir!"�\r¡Uso mi intuición de chef para elegir siempre lo mejor de lo mejor! ¡Así que vamos a ponernos a cocinar en pleno calor del combate!"^\rY la próxima vez, si tienes hambre, ¡no seas tímido! ¡Acércate y prueba un bocado!"�\rOlivia: Vaya, hola. Encantada de conoceros. Soy Olivia. Mis compañeros son adorables y duros Pokémon de tipo Roca. Os reduciremos a polvo."G\rBianca: Ahhh, ¿he vuelto a llegar un poco tarde? ¡Looo siento!"�\r¿Sabes qué? Cuando viajé por distintas regiones me pasaron muchísimas cosas, ¡pero me alegro tantísimo de haber emprendido aquel viaje!"|\rEs difícil expresarlo con palabras, pero quiero transmitir este sentimiento a través de mis Pokémon. ¡Combatamos!"p\rBianca: ¡Gracias por ser mi rival! ¡Sí! ¡He aprendido muchísimo sobre cómo sacar lo mejor de todos!">\r¡Oh, casi se me olvida! ¡Enhorabuena por tu victoria!"^¡Qué mala suerte! Aun así, recibes algunos Créditos del Grandeur Club por intentarlo."%Has conseguido \v[61] créditos."¡Ding dong!"~\bLuc-ker: Cometí un error grave y continuado de juicio, y no espero ser perdonado. Estoy aquí simplemente para disculparme."�\bSé lo difícil que es el Desafío Titán, así que voy a echarte una pequeña mano. La próxima vez en el Desafío Titán, fíjate bien en lo que hay a mi izquierda."�\bFalkner: Dicen que unas alas pueden ser abatidas con una descarga eléctrica... ¡No permitiré semejantes insultos a mis aves!"x\bPero también debería empezar a estudiar a otros Pokémon. Te agradezco que me hayas hecho darme cuenta de ello."I\bMorty: Bien por haber venido. Yo puedo ver lo que otros no pueden."c\b¿Cómo? ¿Que eso no tiene nada que ver con los Pokémon? ¡Es cierto! ¡Vamos, combatamos!"V\rUm... no sé muy bien cómo decir esto, pero gracias por querer a tus Pokémon."�\bPryce: Llevo entrenando desde antes de que tú nacieras. Los Pokémon, igual que los humanos, hemos vivido muchas experiencias y sufrimientos a lo largo de nuestras vidas."h\bCuando la nieve se derrite, llega la primavera. Atesora el tiempo que pasas junto a tus Pokémon."d\rCaray. Eres un Entrenador misterioso, pero me has hecho darme cuenta de aquello que me falta."_\bWill: Bienvenido, el destino y tú me habéis elegido. Permíteme presentarme. Soy Will."|\bKoga: He usado contra ti todo lo que tenía. Pero mis esfuerzos han fracasado. Debo seguir perfeccionando mis habilidades."|\bNo veo miedo alguno en ti. Tienes determinación. Entonces, ¿eres uno de los Entrenadores más fuertes de por aquí?"M\bBruno: Sigues manteniéndote firme. Mi desafío ha quedado satisfecho."�\rKaren: Pokémon fuertes. Pokémon débiles. Esa es solo la percepción egoísta de las personas. Los Entrenadores realmente hábiles ganarían junto a aquellos a quienes aman."Y\bLance: Soy el líder del Alto Mando. Puedes llamarme Lance, el Entrenador Dragón."w\bLos dragones son criaturas míticas y sagradas. Son difíciles de capturar y criar, ¡pero su poder es superior!"b\bLance: No más palabras. Ha llegado la hora de ponerte a prueba en combate. ¿Estás listo?"T\bLance: No puedo creerlo. Estoy presenciando el ascenso de un gran Entrenador."n\bTus Pokémon han respondido a tu carácter fuerte y noble. Seguirás haciéndote más fuerte, ¿verdad?"R\bSilver: Qué pesado eres. No pareces fuerte. Deja de molestarme y lárgate."?\bHe dicho que dejes de curiosear. ¿Qué pretendes aquí?"I\bEso es. Voy a usar toda mi fuerza contra ti. ¡Y luego desaparece!"i\bSilver: Aun después de tanto entrenamiento, sigo sin poder ganar. Necesito creer en mis Pokémon."g\bEn cualquier caso, no voy a rendirme. La próxima vez que vuelvas te derrotaré. Sigue adelante."P\rLyra: Wooo, tienes buen ojo. Comparado con otros, se te ve muy despierto."I\rHas venido aquí en busca de un desafío, ¿verdad? ¡Yo también!"/\rY eso está bien. ¡Tengamos un combate!"J\rLyra: Awww. Supongo que esta vez me tocó perder. Qué mala suerte."Q\rY además eres realmente fuerte. Debes de haber viajado mucho y muy lejos."E\bEthan: Oh, ¿eh? Soy Ethan. ¿Qué haces aquí? ¿De aventura?"\bYo también estoy viviendo una aventura divertida. Puedo con cualquier obstáculo mientras tenga a mis Pokémon conmigo."P\bHoy me siento genial, ¿qué tal un combate? ¡Aquí mismo y ahora mismo!"G\bEthan: Vale. Me has pillado. ¡Ha sido un combate impresionante!"W\b¡Espero que volvamos a vernos cuando terminemos nuestras respectivas aventuras!"h\bPueden ser duros y desagradables, pero también son hermosos. ¿Te gustaría aceptar mi desafío?"�\rCynthia: Cuando te enfrentas a un Entrenador en combate, puedes aprenderlo todo sobre él. Una sola mirada tuya me dice muchas cosas."\\rQué Pokémon tiene, qué movimientos les ha enseñado, qué objetos les hace llevar."K\rEntonces no hacen falta palabras. ¡Yo, Cynthia, acepto tu desafío!"�\rCynthia: Ha sido excelente. En verdad, un combate extraordinario. Les diste a tus Pokémon el apoyo que necesitaban para maximizar su poder."w\rAplaudo sinceramente tu victoria en este desafío. Pero el camino que tienes por delante sigue siendo muy largo."~\bBarry: ¡Eh, tú! ¡Sí, más te vale fijarte en mí! ¡Porque voy a convertirme en el Entrenador más fuerte de todos!"D\b¡Y tú me vas a desafiar! ¡Y yo voy a dejarte impresionado!">\b¡Saca ya a tus Pokémon! ¡O te multo con 10 millones!"`\bBarry: ...! Pero no pasa nada. Sigue haciéndote más fuerte. Eso es lo que quiero decir."]\bCuanto más progreses tú, más duros nos haremos también mis Pokémon y yo, ¿sabes?"�\rDawn: Hola. Tú y tus Pokémon parecéis estar muy unidos. Siempre he pensado que las personas y los Pokémon no están hechos para ir solos."C\rPor eso procuro ayudar a los demás cuando tienen problemas."N\r¡Déjame echarte una mano viendo si puedes vencerme y seguir adelante!"{\rDawn: Parece que mis Pokémon se han llevado algún que otro golpe. Pero no te preocupes, ¡nos recuperaremos muy pronto!"\\rSi alguna vez necesitas una mano con el entrenamiento, ¡yo soy tu chica! ¡Búscame!"q\bLucas: ¡Heyo! ¿Qué tal te está yendo por aquí? Al principio a mí me resultó un poco desalentador..."d\bPero tener a tantos Entrenadores fuertes a los que enfrentarse también es emocionante, ¿no?"6\bDicho esto... ¡estés listo o no, vamos allá!"M\bLucas: ¡Resulta que el más fuerte eres tú! ¡Eso sí que sorprende!"g\bEste combate ha llevado mis sentidos al límite. Necesito echarme una siesta después de esto..."u\b¡Eso es! ¡Combato con todo lo que tengo para encontrar la relación ideal entre los Pokémon y las personas!"X\bAlder: Hola, me llamo Alder. Soy un Entrenador con un gran interés por el mundo."v\bUno de mis objetivos es enseñar a la gente lo maravilloso que es caminar hacia el futuro junto a los Pokémon."�\bCuando veo a otro Entrenador me lleno de emoción, y me pregunto cuál de los dos es más fuerte. ¡La emoción me hierve por dentro!"d\bAlder: ¡Bien hecho! Quienes cambian el mundo son siempre aquellos que persiguen sus sueños."�\b¡Cuando las cosas no salgan como esperabas, sigue entrenando en silencio! ¡Algún día podrás combatir tal y como lo imaginaste!"e\rIris: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Iris! ¡La gente me llama la chica que conoce el corazón de los dragones!"�\r¿Sabes qué? ¡Estoy deseando tener combates de verdad con Entrenadores fuertes! ¡Ansían la victoria con cada fibra de su ser!"0\r¡Vale! ¡Prepárate! ¡Voy a derrotarte!"a\rIris: ¡Me fastidia no haber podido ganar! ¡Pero sabes qué? ¡Más que eso, estoy feliz!"�\rQuiero decir, vamos. ¡Después de este combate tan serio, tú y yo nos conocemos mejor que antes! ¡Sí! ¡Desde luego que sí!"z\bHugh: Hugh está aquí para medir tus capacidades como Entrenador Pokémon. Que conste que no soy ningún simplón."V\bMás te vale dar lo mejor que tienes, o te tocará volver a empezar desde cero."4\b¡Ahora ven a por mí con todo lo que tengas!"]\bHugh: Gracias a ti, conseguí lo que me propuse. Ojalá hubiera podido mostrarte más."\bEres increíble. ¡Consigue la prueba de que eres un Entrenador del que tus Pokémon puedan sentirse orgullosos! ¡Nos vemos!"Y\rHilda: ¡Soy Hilda! ¡Cuando se trata de combates Pokémon, puedes contar conmigo!"T\rCréeme, se me da realmente bien esto. Si no me crees, ¡vamos a comprobarlo!";\r¡Este combate es mío! ¡No voy a caer fácilmente!"4\rHilda: Awwww, lo di todo y aun así perdí..."P\r¡Pero ha sido divertidísimo! ¿Ya es tan tarde? ¡Cómo pasa el tiempo!"~\bHilbert: Eh. Soy Hilbert. Supongo que ahora estoy un paso más cerca de convertirme en uno de los Entrenadores más fuertes."h\bEstoy seguro de que hemos recorrido un largo camino para llegar a ser quienes somos hoy. Mmm-hmm."T\bTengo ganas de combatir contigo, pero después de esto seamos amigos, ¿vale?"N\bHilbert: ¡Parece que tienes la victoria al alcance de la mano, colega!"b\b¡Pero la próxima vez te daré un combate que te dejará con la mandíbula por los suelos!"�\rRosa: ¡Soy Rosa! ¡Mi meta es entrenar duro, hacerme más fuerte y combatir con todo mi corazón contra toda clase de Entrenadores!"R\r¡Más te vale dar lo mejor de ti, para que no te barra de una sola pasada!"?\rAhora, ¿quieres combatir conmigo de una vez? ¡Yay hay!"b\rRosa: Jeje. Ha sido muy satisfactorio. Lo diste todo y me obligaste a esforzarme de verdad."~\rPero ya ves, lo importante es mantenerse positivo. ¡Dar ese primer pequeño paso puede impulsarte muchísimo hacia delante!"V\bNate: ¡Hola! Soy Nate. Es genial estar aquí, enfrentándome a ti ahora mismo."e\bMis rivales son cada vez más difíciles. Hay un montón de gente increíble a la que admirar.")\bSi te parece bien, ¡empecemos ya!"f\bNate: ¡Eso significa que no habrá descanso para mí! ¡Voy a entrenar cada día para mejorar!"T\bHa sido genial combatir contigo. ¡Más te vale estar atento la próxima vez!""\bAllister: A-aquí... voy..."M\rOpal: Muéstrame de lo que eres capaz cuando das todo de ti, criatura."C\rMelony: ¡No podrás escapar cuando te congele por completo!":\bPeony: ¡Prepárate, soy bastante feroz en combate!"q\bLeon: Puedo sentir a mis compañeros impacientes de emoción... ¡Lo vamos a pasar de auténtico campeón!"L\bHop: ¡Enseñémosle a todo el mundo el mejor combate de la historia!"S\bVictor: ¡Mis Pokémon están preparados y listos! ¿Quieres hacer una cata?"9\rGloria: Vale, ¡estoy a tope y lista para empezar!"f\rOleana: ¡Cuando te haga pedazos, el presidente Rose estará un paso más cerca de su objetivo!"k\bRose: ¡Enséñame esa energía necesaria para mantener vivo este mundo brillante y resplandeciente!"c\rMai: ¡Tengamos un combate divertido e intenso que ambos equipos puedan disfrutar de verdad!"8\rPalina: Sin más dilación, enséñame tu equipo."q\bIngo: Tal vez un combate Pokémon contigo logre despertar este recuerdo... ¿Me honrarías con un combate?"P\rSabi: Bueno, tendrás tus recompensas... ¡si antes consigues derrotarme!"d\bGaeric: ¡Si aspiras a lograr la victoria, debemos juzgar si estás a la altura del desafío!"�\bBeni: ¡Tú eres el rival digno de mis grandes técnicas ninja, que han permanecido latentes durante todos estos largos años!"m\rZisu: Enséñame de lo que eres capaz. ¡Observaré con atención todos y cada uno de tus movimientos!"8\bKamado: ¡El más fuerte de los dos prevalecerá!"_\bAdaman: Oh, ¡me saltaré los saludos! ¡No tenemos más tiempo que perder! ¡Empecemos!"R\rIrida: Comparemos lo que sabemos para ver de quién es el mundo más vasto."s\rCogita: Esta será la única vez que me permita esto, para reforzar aún más tu determinación. Combatamos."~\bVolo: ¡HA LLEGADO LA HORA DE CREAR UN MUNDO COMPLETAMENTE NUEVO! ¡Todos desaparecerán para forjar un MUNDO NUEVO Y MEJOR!"d\bPero tener a tantos Entrenadores fuertes a los que enfrentarme también es emocionante, ¿no?"X\rEnfermera Joy: Buenos días, \PN. Tus Pokémon parecen estar bastante maltrechos."0\r¿Te gustaría que curase a tus Pokémon?"\rDéjame ayudarte.",\r¡Ya está todo perfecto! ¡Cuídate!"\rNo pasa nada entonces."G\rEnfermera Joy: Lo siento, \PN, eso es todo lo que tenía a mano."w\bOak: ¡Hola! ¡Me llamo Oak! ¡La gente me llama el Profesor Pokémon! ¡Estudio a los Pokémon como profesión!"�\bPara algunas personas, los Pokémon son mascotas. Otras los usan para pelear. Necesitas tus propios Pokémon para protegerte, especialmente aquí."c\bPero, en vez de hablar de ello, aprenderás más con la experiencia. ¡Ven, combate conmigo!"�\bOak: ¡Así que has ganado! Entiendes que tu victoria no fue solo mérito tuyo. El vínculo que compartes con tus Pokémon es maravilloso."�\b¡Espero que tampoco descuides tu Pokédex! ¡Cuando la completes, es muy probable que tu visión sobre los Pokémon haya cambiado!"i\bGiovanni: Vaya... resulta impresionante que estés aquí... ante una figura tan peligrosa como yo."c\bDebo advertirte que este no es lugar para críos como tú. Pero ya que me has visto aquí..."9\b¡Por tu insolencia, conocerás un mundo de dolor!"B\bGiovanni: Tienes cierta mirada... Me recuerda a... alguien."V\bVoy a decirte esto ahora... Da igual lo fuerte que seas, algún día perderás."�\bElm: ¡Te estaba esperando! ¿Sabes algo sobre mi investigación? Como ya sabes, hoy en día los Pokémon se llevan en Poké Balls."�\bPero antes de que se inventaran las Poké Balls, la gente caminaba junto a sus Pokémon. Eso podría tener algo que ver con cómo crecen o evolucionan..."E\bDime, ¿cómo crías a tus Pokémon? ¡Espero un gran combate!"�\bElm: Sabía que eras alguien un poco diferente: ¡nunca dejas de sorprenderme! ¡Gracias a ti, mi investigación va de maravilla!"�\b¿Buscas rivales más duros? Entonces sigue todo recto. ¡Y no olvides dar las gracias a todos aquellos que combatieron contra ti!"�\bBirch: Mi nombre es Birch. Los humanos vivimos junto a los Pokémon. A veces como compañeros de juegos, otras como compañeros de trabajo."�\bY a veces nos unimos y combatimos contra otros como nosotros. Pero, pese a nuestra cercanía, no lo sabemos todo sobre los Pokémon."{\bDe hecho, todavía hay muchísimos misterios en torno a los Pokémon. Entonces, ¿cuál es tu secreto para criarlos?"z\b¡Sí! ¡Esa es la actitud! …¡Arghhh! ¡Me están entrando unas ganas tremendas de salir ahí fuera y ver mundo!"�\b¡Me encantaría que tu mundo se sintiera más amplio que nunca! Aunque me encantaría aún más que volvieras de vez en cuando para enseñarme cuánto has progresado."r\bMaxie: Estaba pensando... aunque no seas más que un niño, tus ojos me hablan de una feroz determinación."�\bMe llaman Maxie. Soy el líder del Team Magma, y tú eres uno de esos jóvenes que podrían moldear el futuro de nuestra sociedad."�\bLa tierra existe para que los humanos podamos seguir avanzando y ascendiendo, explorar, desarrollar, explotar, y dar pasos hacia el futuro..."�\b¡Por eso nosotros, el Team Magma, debemos aumentar la masa continental del mundo! ¡Cree que eso nos llevará a un futuro de eterna felicidad para la humanidad!"~\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... De verdad lo has conseguido, niño. ¡Has mostrado un poder que supera al del gran Maxie!"�\bEspléndido. Simplemente espléndido, joven Entrenador. Has rechazado mis ideales sin dudar ni un segundo... Y aun así, ¡no cederé! ¡No me doblegaré! ¡Mis ideales no vacilarán!"b\bArchie: ¿Qué tenemos aquí? Menuda expresión tan feroz para un mocoso tan pequeño. Jeh."n\bEsa cara me dice que no eres otro crío sin cerebro. Me llamo Archie, ¡y estoy al mando del Team Aqua!"�\b¿Sabías que toda la vida de este mundo depende del mar para existir? Pero día tras día, todos estamos destruyendo nuestro recurso más preciado."�\bLos Pokémon sufren como resultado de nuestras acciones. Por eso tomé una decisión. ¡Nosotros, el Team Aqua, lo devolveremos todo a su estado puro original!"�\bArchie: ¡Bwahahahahahaha! ¡Bwaha! ¡Pero si no es mi pequeño adversario! Ni siquiera encuentro palabras para alabarte como mereces."�\bA veces lo mejor es simplificar las cosas. ¡Solo diré que has estado a la altura de mis expectativas, mocoso! ¡Pero eso no cambia nada! ¡No puedo rendirme ahora! ¡No puedo!"�\bRowan: ¡Es un gran placer conocerte! Permíteme presentarme como es debido antes de nada. Mi nombre, como ya sabes, es Rowan. Estudio a los Pokémon."�\bA veces jugamos juntos, y otras veces trabajamos juntos. Algunas personas usan a sus Pokémon para combatir y estrechar aún más sus lazos con ellos."�\bIncluso ahora, sigo emocionándome cuando estoy con Pokémon, así que empecemos nuestra prueba sobre los lazos con nuestros Pokémon."q\bRowan: ¡Tu último combate fue espléndido! Es natural que haya venido a presenciar tu momento de gloria."�\bPero el mundo es inmenso. Hay muchísimos más Pokémon. ¡Eso significa que aún te quedan muchísimas más emociones por descubrir y disfrutar!"�\bCyrus: ...Ya veo. Debes de ser el Entrenador del que he oído hablar. Aunque difícilmente esperaba que ese temerario fuera un simple niño."�\bPero debo decir... que eres un espécimen extraordinario. Unas emociones tan lamentablemente inútiles... ¡Escúchame! Nuestro mundo es tosco, está incompleto."�\bEl mundo debe cambiar. Entonces, ¿quién lo cambiará? Yo, Cyrus. Y el Team Galaxia. ¡Haré que te arrepientas de haber escuchado a tu corazón!"i\bCyrus: Ya veo... realmente eres fuerte. Y la base de tu poder es tu compasión hacia los Pokémon."�\b...Qué desperdicio... Esas emociones no son más que simples ilusiones. ...Pero eso no importa. Dudo que alguna vez llegues a comprender mi postura."z\r¡Hola! Me llamo Profesora Juniper, y estoy investigando cuándo y cómo surgieron las criaturas llamadas Pokémon."~\rLos hay de muchísimas formas y viven en lugares muy distintos. Viviendo y trabajando juntos, nos complementamos mutuamente."~\rTener combates Pokémon entre nosotros profundiza los lazos entre las personas y los Pokémon. Entonces, ¿estás preparado?"�\rJuniper: Estoy asombrada. ¡Buen trabajo! ¡Apuesto a que oiré a la gente hablar del brillante rastro que estás dejando por el mundo!"�\rDe verdad espero que, como resultado, descubras qué es importante para ti, ¡porque los Pokémon crean oportunidades de conocer a más personas y Pokémon maravillosos!"~\bMi nombre es Ghetsis. Estoy aquí como representante del Team Plasma. Me gustaría hablarte de la liberación Pokémon."�\bLos Pokémon están sometidos a las órdenes egoístas de los Entrenadores. Son distintos de los humanos, pues albergan un potencial desconocido."}\b¡Así es! ¡Debemos liberar a los Pokémon! ¡Entonces, y solo entonces, humanos y Pokémon serán realmente iguales!"�\bGhetsis: ¡Mis cálculos...! ¡No! ¡Mis meticulosos planes! Esto no cambia mi objetivo. ¡Mis planes secretos no se han visto alterados!"r\b¡Soy absolutamente perfecto! ¡YO SOY LA PERFECCIÓN! ¡Soy el gobernante absoluto que cambiará el mundo!"r\bN: Tu Pokémon... hace un momento estaba diciendo... Oh, tú no puedes oírlo. Qué triste. Mi nombre es N."�\bAsí que has encerrado a la mayoría de tus Pokémon en Poké Balls. Yo también soy Entrenador, pero no puedo evitar preguntarme... ¿son realmente felices así?"a\bBien, ¡déjame volver a oír la voz de tus Pokémon! Quiero comprenderte. ¡Muéstramelo!"�\bN: Nunca esperé oír a los Pokémon decir cosas así... Mientras los Pokémon estén confinados en Poké Balls... jamás se convertirán en seres perfectos."�\bDebo cambiar el mundo por los Pokémon, porque son mis amigos. Así que necesito poder... un poder suficiente para hacer que cualquiera esté de acuerdo conmigo."x\bSoy Augustine Sycamore. ¡Hola! ¡Nuestro mundo está ampliamente habitado por criaturas conocidas como Pokémon!"q\bAlgunos corren por las llanuras, otros surcan los cielos y otros nadan en las profundidades del océano..."�\bAhora, ¡tengamos todos un combate Pokémon! Tu rival seremos mis Pokémon y yo, prestándonos fuerza mutuamente hacia la victoria."a\bVaya, ¡desde luego tienes cierto je ne sais quoi! ¡Tengo un buen presentimiento contigo!"�\b¡La fuerza que has encontrado es sencillamente maravillosa! ¡De verdad amas y confías en tus Pokémon! Atesora estos momentos junto a tus Pokémon compañeros."�\bTienes una Pokédex; eres uno de los elegidos. Soy Lysandre. He intentado aprender todo lo posible sobre los Pokémon para ayudar a construir un futuro más brillante."�\bY, para concluir, los necios improductivos están consumiendo nuestro futuro. El Team Flare necesita hacer borrón y cuenta nueva."�\bEl conocimiento es poder, después de todo. Úsalo bien. Es vital que este mundo se convierta en un lugar mejor. Mi deseo... ¡es un mundo más hermoso!"|\b¡Excelente! Pero, ¿qué es lo que realmente estás protegiendo? ¿Un mañana que solo acabará siendo peor que hoy?"T\bSe acabó... Los necios sin visión seguirán mancillando este hermoso mundo."Y\b¡Hola! ¡Encantado de conocerte! Me llamo Kukui. ¡Espero que podamos ser amigos!"�\bMe encanta comprender el potencial y las capacidades de los Pokémon, así que dejo que me golpeen con toda clase de movimientos para poner a prueba su poder."b\bEntonces, ¿quieres pasar por mi prueba para hacerte más fuerte? ¡Eso es, ponte a prueba!"_\bKukui: No pude ganar aunque lo di todo... ¡Pero qué sensación tan refrescante! ¡Woo!"�\bBueno, ya sabía que sería una derrota aplastante. Aun así, me alegro de haber podido combatir contigo. ¡Y no podría estar más agradecido de haberte conocido a ti y a tus Pokémon!"�\b¡Saludos, mocoso tembloroso! El odiado jefe que te aplasta, y te aplasta, y nunca afloja... Sí. ¡El gran y malvado Guzma está aquí!"�\bTenemos todas esas viejas tradiciones mohosas de gimnasios y pruebas... ya iba siendo hora de deshacernos de toda esa basura absurda y crear algo nuevo para nosotros."�\bAl fin y al cabo, aquí todo el mundo ya sabe quién es el Entrenador más fuerte. ¿Quieres ver qué aspecto tiene la destrucción? ¡Aquí la tienes en forma humana: tu chico, Guzma!"E\bYa veo. Buen trabajo... supongo. Has tenido agallas de verdad."u\bEra \PN, ¿verdad? Te recordaré... ¡como alguien a quien estaré encantado de machacar en cualquier momento!"�\rSoy la presidenta de la Fundación Æther. Pero, por favor, llámame simplemente Lusamine. Me alegra muchísimo que nos hayamos conocido."�\rHay personas como tú, que recorren las islas para aprender más sobre los Pokémon. También hay gente desgraciada que daña a los Pokémon por sus propios motivos."�\rSeré como una madre para todos esos pobres Pokémon y los colmaré de amor. Todos ellos serán preservados para la eternidad en mi colección."�\rOh, no te preocupes. Déjamelo todo a mí. Créeme, los niños serían mucho más felices si simplemente escucharan a los adultos que los rodean."R\rQué decepción... Pensar que todos vosotros sois tan estrechos de miras..."�\r¡Todo lo que quiero son mis preciosas bestias! ¡No me importa nada ninguno de los demás! Simplemente, iros. No os necesito aquí... ¡Ya no os necesito!"?\rHola, me llamo Cheryl. Me alegra sinceramente conocerte."W\r¿Así que eres mi rival de hoy? Mis Pokémon estaban deseando tener un combate."(\r¡No podrás agotarlos uno a uno!"N\r¡Gracias! Mis adorables Pokémon se han hecho un poquito más fuertes."�\rSer Entrenadora no es fácil. Cuanto más combates, más descubres. Pero, ¿sabes? ¡Por eso mismo también adoro a los Pokémon!"F\rSoy Mira... Quiero hacerme más fuerte para no ser tan miedica."E\rAsí que prepárate, ¡Mira va a enseñarte todo lo que tiene!"G\rMira se pregunta si podrá llegar muy lejos en la Torre Batalla."~\rPero parece que tú siempre estás junto a tus Pokémon. Así es como te volviste tan fuerte. ¡Mira empieza a comprenderlo!"c\bSoy Riley. Soy Entrenador y sí, supongo que es un poco extraño que esté entrenando aquí."�\bLa gente que entrena aquí suele ser la que tiene demasiado tiempo libre. ¡Así que esperemos poder ponérnoslo difícil el uno al otro!"U\bAhora, haremos todo lo que esté en nuestra mano para derrotar a tus Pokémon."d\bRiley: Conoce a tu enemigo. Si conoces los Pokémon de tu rival y los movimientos que usan..."V\bSi cuentas con esa información, tus posibilidades de ganar mejoran muchísimo."�\b¡Jejeje! ¡Lo siento! Si quieres ser el mejor Entrenador de todos los tiempos, lo vas a tener realmente difícil. ¡Porque estás hablando de mí!"r\bTienes cara de no enterarte de nada. La verdad es que no sabes gran cosa, ¿verdad? En fin, hola, soy Buck."o\b¡Puedo sentir a mis Pokémon temblando dentro de sus Poké Balls! ¡Es por anticipación, no por miedo!"j\b¡Fweh! ¡Demasiado! Supongo que me tocará bajar los humos y mejorar a mi equipo sobre el terreno."N\b¡Más me vale ponerme las pilas para una revancha contigo aquí mismo!"�\rYo... soy Marley. Yo... no me gusta hablar... elijo mis palabras con cuidado, pero aun así podrían herir a alguien sin querer..."=\rCuando pienso en eso, me bloqueo... Lo siento mucho..."L\r...Entonces? ...¿Vamos a combatir? ...Vale. Haré todo lo que pueda."f\r...Eres muy fuerte. Eso me hace sentir feliz. ...No sé por qué. Es una sensación extraña..."P\r...Puede que me guste combatir contigo. ...Solo un poco. Solo un poquito."m\bMi nombre es Eusine. Estoy siguiendo el rastro de un Pokémon llamado Suicune. Encantado de conocerte."�\bParece que en ti hay mucho más de lo que aparenta a simple vista... Mi instinto me dice que parece que ya te has encontrado con Suicune antes."{\bMi deseo de encontrar a Suicune es muchísimo mayor que el tuyo... ¡No dejaré de seguirte hasta averiguar lo que busco!"E\bPuff, puff... Yo... no soy rival para ti. ...Tal como predije."�\b¡Nunca había visto un combate tan intenso! No me arrepiento de nada... Hasta pronto, por ahora. ¡Pero volveré para conseguir de ti aquello que busco!"R\bSoy Emmet. Soy un Jefe de Metro. Y no hay nada que me guste más que ganar."`\bVoy totalmente en serio. Muy en serio. Porque si un combate no es serio, no es divertido."L\b¡Así que todo está listo! ¡Apunta a la victoria! ¡Todos a bordo!"�\bPerdí contra ti. Porque eres el Entrenador más fuerte al que me he enfrentado últimamente. ¡Eres un Entrenador muuuuuy fuerte! ¡Sí! ¡Fue divertido!"s\bTú quieres ganar, y yo no quiero perder. Eso es real. ¡Cuando chocamos en combate, me emociono muchísimo!"l\bSoy Ingo, Jefe de Metro. ¿Comprendes bien a los Pokémon? ¿Puedes mantenerte fiel a tus principios?"�\b¿Qué puedo ver después de ganar, ganar y volver a ganar? No puedes saber lo que viene tras la victoria sin ganar una y otra vez."R\bPor lo tanto, pondré todo mi empeño en combatir contigo. ¡Todos a bordo!"k\b¡Bravo! ¡Excelente! Me alegra haber luchado tan duro contra un Entrenador tan magnífico como tú."r\bTu talento te ha llevado a un destino llamado Victoria. Sin embargo, tu viaje no ha hecho más que empezar."\rPiénsalo, ¿vale? Jeje."Q\rAwww. Supongo que esta vez me tocó llevarme la derrota. Qué mala suerte.">\bOh, ¿eh? Soy Ethan. ¿Qué haces aquí? ¿De aventura?"T\bTengo ganas de combatir contigo, pero después de esto seamos amigos, ¿vale?"z\bMi deseo de buscar a Suicune va mucho más allá del tuyo... ¡No dejaré de seguirte hasta averiguar lo que busco!"�\bOye, le he echado un vistazo a tus datos de Battle Swap. Parece que tienes la idea correcta, ¡pero sigues siendo bastante cuadriculado!"�\bEscucha, ¿vale? El conocimiento no consiste solo en leer libros o hacer trabajo de mesa. ¡Eso, por sí solo, puede no servir de nada!"�\b¡Tienes que experimentar las cosas con el corazón y con el cuerpo, entiendes? ¡Exprime hasta la última gota de tu conocimiento y ven a por mí!"h\b¡Pfft, tío! ¡Esta ha sido la última vez que pierdo contra ti! ¡Tenemos que repetir esto, eh!"@\b¡Iré a por ti con todo! Sin restricciones, ¿entendido?"�\r¡Eh! ¡Hola! ...Espera, ¿eres tú el desafiante? No sé muy bien cómo decirlo, pero... hablando claro, pareces bastante débil."}\r¿Seguro que estás preparado para enfrentarme? Mmm... Bueno, ¡de acuerdo! ¡Nos lo tomaremos con calma al principio!"D\r¡Vale! ¡A ver si logras encender mi pasión por el combate!"\\r¡Oye, espera un segundo! ¡Así que sí que eres duro después de todo! ¡Me gustas!"S\r¡Si alguna vez volvemos a combatir, no perderé! ¡No lo olvides! ¡Adiós!"b\b¡Ahahah! ¡¿Oyes a este público?! ¡Todos están deseando ver nuestro combate! ¡Ahahah!"s\b¡Apuesto a que estás temblando por la tensión de poder combatir conmigo! ¡Pero no te preocupes por nada!"s\b¡Tucker, la estrella del espectáculo, te bañará en un brillo deslumbrante! ¡Aquí y ahora! ¡Veámoslo!"?\b¡Eres fuerte, pero sobre todo tienes un encanto único!"�\bEn ti veo un potencial clarísimo para convertirte en una superestrella como yo. ¡Esperaré con muchísimas ganas nuestro próximo encuentro!"c\b¡Joven Entrenador! ¿Crees en tus Pokémon? ¿Puedes creer en ellos de verdad, de corazón?"h\b¡Mi cuerpo está siempre junto a los Pokémon! ¡Mi corazón late siempre al unísono con ellos!"o\b¡Si vuestros lazos de confianza son frágiles, jamás vencerás a mis hermanos! ¡Demuéstramelo aquí!"^\bBueno, ¡menuda exhibición! Ni siquiera dándolo todo mis hermanos pudieron superarte."v\b¡El espíritu de tu equipo es realmente admirable! Los ojos de tus Pokémon son verdaderamente claros y puros."I\rSoy Lucy... Yo soy la ley aquí... Porque soy la Reina del Pike..."<\rYa lo sabes, pero para avanzar... debes derrotarme..."n\rNo soy de charla vacía. Date prisa. Vamos... Tu suerte... espero que no la hayas gastado toda aquí...")\r...Eso es todo... Desaparece ya..."3\r...Pero a ti no te olvidaré... ...Jamás..."J\rSaludos... Mi nombre es Anabel. He oído varios rumores sobre ti..."�\rCon toda sinceridad, lo que he oído no me parece atractivo en absoluto... La razón por la que he venido a verte... Bueno, solo hay una..."6\rDéjame ver tu talento en toda su extensión..."]\rFufufu, muy bien... Tienes confianza en tu talento para el combate Pokémon, ¿verdad?"}\rTe exhorto a que sigas combatiendo y sigas ganando. Estaré esperándote. Hasta la próxima vez que nos encontremos..."�\b¿No estarías de acuerdo en que las exploraciones son la más grandiosa de las aventuras? ¡Tu propio ingenio! ¡Tu propia fuerza! ¡Tus propios Pokémon!"\\bY, por encima de todo, solo tu valor para guiarte a través de mundos desconocidos..."�\b¡Ah, sí, joven aventurero! ¡Esta vida es grandiosa, desde luego! ¡Grandiosa, sí que lo es! ¡Y ahora, trae tu coraje a nuestro combate!"R\b¡Hahahah! ¡Grandioso lo fue! ¡Grandioso, sí, desde luego! ¡Bien hecho!"�\b¡Joven explorador! ¡Me has superado por completo! ¡Eso solo demuestra que aún me queda mucho por aprender! ¡Que nuestros caminos vuelvan a cruzarse!"i\b¡Así que has llegado hasta aquí! Como Entrenador veterano, tendré que dar mi máximo esfuerzo."�\bAsí es como los mejores Entrenadores se muestran respeto mutuo: ¡combatiendo con todo como dedicados alumnos de los Pokémon!"�\bMuéstrame el vínculo que has construido con tus Pokémon. ¡Muéstrame lo que has aprendido a través de tus combates con otros Entrenadores!"�\b¡Bravo! Imagino que muchos grandes Entrenadores vendrán a desafiarme como acabas de hacer tú. Es algo que espero con muchísimas ganas."~\bTe harás todavía más hábil. ¡Sigue combatiendo contra Entrenadores de todo el mundo y sigue creciendo en grandeza!"�\rNo hace falta preocuparse. Deja que el azar haga lo suyo. Igual que las sorpresas de un tablero de juego, la vida está llena de giros y vueltas."�\rLas cosas sucederán como tengan que suceder. Pero basta de eso. Hay una cosa que sé con certeza: no has llegado aquí solo por suerte."P\rNo perdamos más tiempo. ¡Deseo poner a prueba tus habilidades yo misma!"z\r¡Qué fabuloso por tu parte! Tu amor por los Pokémon brilló con fuerza y, a su vez, tus Pokémon creyeron en ti."|\rPor eso supiste afrontar espléndidamente todo lo que se puso en tu camino. ¡Fue una victoria verdaderamente maravillosa!"�\b¡Bzweep! Perdona, no me hagas caso. Lo que estoy usando es un invento mío. Es mi máquina de análisis de datos, y me dice lo que has traído."�\bYa veo... Tengo que decir que es una buena configuración. ¿Qué dirías, un 47%? ¡Oh, no dejes que ese número te preocupe!")\bMuy bien, ¡pongámonos en marcha!"a\bHmm... Aquí me he llevado la derrota. Y no, desde luego no me hace ninguna gracia perder."m\bPero está bien. Hay cosas que se aprenden ganando. Pero también hay cosas que se aprenden perdiendo."o\bBienvenido. Como ya sabes, Lady Caitlin, mi señora, no es de las que aceptan una derrota de buen grado."W\bSin embargo, por un motivo que no soy libre de revelar, no puede combatir aquí."}\bEn consecuencia, yo, Darach, combatiré en su lugar. Permíteme asegurarte que no saldrás perdiendo por enfrentarte a mí."z\bHe recurrido a toda reserva de experiencia y etiqueta transmitida a través de nuestro glorioso legado de servicio."q\bPero ni aun así logré rechazar tu asombroso e inspirador desafío. Me siento verdaderamente humillado..."Y\rAquí se permite a los Entrenadores afrontar desafíos con sus Pokémon favoritos."�\rImagino que hubo momentos tensos para llegar hasta aquí con tu elegido. Pero comprende esto: uno brilla más cuando logra superar un desafío."M\rSoy Argenta, y yo seré tu desafío más temible. Te reto a superarme."�\rNo debes olvidar jamás que existe un lugar donde todo el mundo puede brillar. Eso también vale para cualquier clase de Pokémon."�\rDifunde ese mensaje con tus propias palabras. Es algo que todos deberían oír. Y ahora, tras haber perdido, esta dama ya no tiene nada más que decir salvo... ¡adiós!"z\b¡Eh, has escapado del Penitenciario del Caos! ¡Debes de ser un Entrenador impresionante para conseguir algo así!"\bMás allá de esta sala se encuentra el final de tu Caos. Allí podrás conseguir la recompensa que te mereces. ¡PERO! Solo una cosa más. Ronda extra. ¡Por faaaavor! ¡Derrótame y conseguirás recompensas extra! Sé que tu equipo ya debe de estar fatigado..."]\bEso es, ahora ya no acepto un no por respuesta. No retrasemos esto más, ¿de acuerdo?"y\b¡Lo has conseguido! ¡Estoy abrumado! ¡Eres el símbolo de un verdadero Maestro Pokémon! Toma, te mereces esto.")Se te han concedido 25 Créditos GC."K\bAdelante. Ya no tengo mucho más que decir, aparte de: ¡bien hecho!"�\b¡Eh, fue un buen combate! No te vengas abajo por ello, al fin y al cabo yo ni siquiera estoy jugando según las reglas. JAJA."U\bVuelve aquí otra vez. Estarás preparado. Estaremos esperando. ¡Anda, sigue!"<\b¿Compraste un Pase Backstage para conocernos? *ríe*"\\bSabes lo que eso significa, ¿verdad? ¡RONDA EXTRA! Y no acepto un no por respuesta."F\bNo lo retrasemos más, ¿de acuerdo? ¡Por favor! ¡Derrótame!"�\b¡Lo has conseguido! ¡Estoy abrumado! ¡Eres el símbolo de un verdadero Maestro Pokémon! Aparte de eso, ya no tengo mucho más que decir salvo: ¡bien hecho! El encuentro ha terminado. Ciaoz~"�\b¡Eh, fue un buen combate! No te vengas abajo por ello, al fin y al cabo yo ni siquiera estoy jugando según las reglas. JAJA. Vuelve aquí otra vez. Estarás preparado. Estaremos esperando. Bye~"_\bAra ara, bien hecho por haber llegado tan lejos. ¿Quieres una bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Es broma."o\bHa sido un desafío duro, ¿verdad? Ya casi estás, colega, tus recompensas están justo detrás de mí."6\bCuraré a tu equipo para que puedas prepararte."5\bJeh. Así es, ¡tu último rival aquí soy yo!"Q\bJoder, colega, ¡muy buena! Ni siquiera puedo enfadarme por haber perdido.";\bYa no tengo nada más que decir salvo: ¡bien hecho!"�\bJaja, sin rencores, colega. No es como si Hitsu o Foul fueran más fáciles de vencer, al fin y al cabo todos estamos rompiendo aquí las reglas-que-debían-ser-rotas.";\bBueno, cuando vuelvas a estar listo, aquí seguiré."n\bAra ara, ¿compraste un pase solo para volver a vernos? ¿Quieres una bo'ohw'o'wo'er por eso? Es broma.".\bNo hace falta decir más. ¡Combatamos!"�\bJoder, colega, ¡muy buena! Ni siquiera puedo enfadarme por haber perdido. ¡Bien hecho, y gracias por venir a verme! ¡Hasta la vista!"s\bJaja, sin rencores, colega, al fin y al cabo todos estamos rompiendo aquí las reglas-que-debían-ser-rotas."m\b¡Oh! ¿Te acercas a mí? Incluso después de todo ese combate, aun así has decidido venir hacia mí."P\bPero no quiero luchar contra un rival tan débil. Deja que te cure antes."M\bAhora veamos qué clase de poder eres capaz de reunir para derrotarme."2\bTsk... No importa si logras vencerme aquí."s\bSiempre puedo volver para derrotarte. Y aunque no pudiera, hay quienes poseen un poder muy superior al mío."a\b¡Por supuesto que no eres capaz de derrotarme. ¡¡¡Soy el maestro de las malas artes!!!"F\b¿Te sientes enfadado? ¡Vuelve si quieres recibir otra paliza!"4\b¡Oh! ¿Te acercas a mí por voluntad propia?"\bRealmente fascinante."M\bAhora diviérteme participando en un combate conmigo. ¡Vaya sorpresa!"h\bTsk... No importa, hay quienes poseen un poder muy superior al mío. Puedes irte después de mí."?\r¿Oh? Has llegado tan lejos y aun así sigues avanzando."C\rMuy bien, ¡veamos si eres capaz de mantener ese entusiasmo!"E\rYa veo... He perdido. Tengo ganas de ver cómo progresas, \PN."/\rPero recuerda, siempre estoy observando."J\rTe falta fuerza y la determinación necesaria para seguir adelante."P\rNo cruzarás este horizonte donde se unen tu pasión y tu determinación."h\rVaya, vaya, qué sorprendente. ¿Has decidido combatir conmigo sin una auténtica determinación?"/\rVeamos si logras mantener el entusiasmo."J\rEso sí que es sorprendente... Mi Minuend se equivocó por una vez."T\r\PN, espero con interés tus progresos. Y recuerda: siempre estoy observando."b\rUn combate sin verdadera determinación solo demuestra que no estás en el camino correcto."K\rEncuentra tu propia determinación, y yo la juzgaré con mi Minuend.",\b\PN, ¿eh? Debería haberlo esperado."J\bBueno, ya que estás aquí, déjame contarte una pequeña historia."�\bÉrase una vez un adolescente que dio con este mundo por casualidad. Recorrió sus rincones de arriba abajo, buscando vivir por sí mismo el viaje de Ash."�\bHasta que un día terminó ese viaje. Pero como en aquel momento no había nada más que hacer en el mundo, decidió empezar de nuevo, y otra vez, y otra vez.">\bPero, por supuesto, todo lo bueno debe llegar a su fin."�\bUn día, mientras intentaba explotar el sistema al que creía haberse acostumbrado tanto, este lo expulsó por la fuerza y lo devolvió a su mundo original."8\bY al cabo de un tiempo, se olvidó de este mundo."<\bEso fue... hasta que aquel mundo vivió una pandemia."�\bAquel adolescente, ahora algunos años mayor y con algo más de conocimiento y sentido común, quiso ayudar a mejorar este mundo."^\bAsí que contactó con el creador de este mundo, y se le dio la oportunidad de hacerlo."W\bY fue entonces cuando nací yo. Luc-ker. (¡Por cierto, el guion es importante!)"e\bUn pequeño dato curioso: ¡ese en realidad no era mi nombre original! Pero eso ya no importa."�\bLo único que necesitas saber es que llevo muchos años ayudando a mejorar los sistemas de este mundo, tomándome descansos de vez en cuando."@\bPor supuesto, con el tiempo acabaría conociendo a Hitsu."�\bCuando se le ocurrió por primera vez la idea del Grandeur Club, nunca pensé que sería yo quien ayudaría a hacerlo posible, pero aquí estamos."m\bCon Entrenadores llegados de todo el universo Pokémon, esta es nuestra carta de amor a la franquicia."�\bPor si no se notaba, también nos encantaba Pokémon Masters. ¡Así que queríamos que algunos Entrenadores de allí también pudieras combatirlos aquí!"�\bEstoy muy contento con todo lo que hemos logrado. Por supuesto, hubo muchísimas dificultades, pero las superamos para llegar a donde estamos hoy."C\bY ahora, hemos llegado al final de nuestro viaje compartido."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"Z\b¿Qué, pensabas que eso era una pista de que íbamos a añadir la Gen 9? ¡Jajaja!"�\bNah, simplemente me gustaba cómo sonaba decirlo. La Gen 9 no va a añadirse al juego, por desgracia (o por suerte para mí, la verdad)."m\bDicho esto, también tengo que decirte ariagato a ti, \PN. Sin ti, nunca habríamos llegado tan lejos."x\bY como agradecimiento por dejarnos vivir juntos el final de nuestro viaje, deja que te recompense con un combate."U\bOh, ¿quieres enfrentarte a mí a plena potencia? Nunca dejas de sorprenderme."x\bMuy bien. Pero no digas que no te lo advertí: este combate usará las mecánicas de los Desafíos Sync y Titán."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!""\bEso no funcionó, ¿verdad?"�\b¡Uf! Incluso rompiendo múltiples límites del sistema, sigo sin poder derrotarte. De verdad eres un Entrenador increíble, \PN."r\bClaro, podría haber roto aún más límites, pero la verdad es que no quiero destruir este mundo, ¿sabes?"�\bAquí es donde te daría una recompensa, pero me han programado para no darte ninguna si has decidido limitarte a abusar de mí :<("O\bEn fin, tu recompensa por vencerme: tres bo'ohw'o'wo'ers muy especiales."]\b¡Gracias por dejarme emplearme a fondo! La verdad es que se ha sentido bastante bien."�\bNo te preocupes demasiado por no haber podido derrotarme. ¡Al fin y al cabo, estaba rompiendo múltiples límites del sistema!"u\bAunque, pensándolo bien... ya te lo advertí. Deberías saberlo por los Entrenadores del Desafío Sync, ¿no?"]\bAunque, pensándolo bien... ya te lo advertí. En el Grandeur Club todo vale, ¿sabes?"\bTambién diste un combate bastante bueno, y me llevaste a límites a los que ningún otro Entrenador me había llevado antes."'\bEn fin, ¡eso es todo por aquí!";\bVen, deja que te lleve de vuelta a donde perteneces."h\bCuando la nieve se derrite, llega la primavera. Atesora el tiempo que pasas junto a tus Pokémon."0La puerta se cierra con llave tras de ti..."/\bBrock: ¡Muéstrame lo mejor que tienes!"$\rMisty: ¿Estás lista, cielo?"|\bTeniente Surge: ¡Los combates Pokémon son guerra! ¡Te enseñaré lo que es bueno y te freiré hasta que te rindas!"@\rErika: Deja que mis damas demuestren el arte del ikebana."0\rSabrina: Veamos quién será el vencedor."<\rJanine: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Janine! ¡Recuerda este nombre!"G\bBill: ¿Has venido a ver mi colección de Pokémon? ¡Mira esto!"W\bRyuki: ¡Hagamos chocar nuestros ardientes espíritus en un estallido de gloria!"A\rAgatha: ¿Qué haces aquí fisgoneando, niño entrometido?"e\bTrace: Debería comprobar si tus Pokémon realmente están en buena forma... ¡con un combate!".\bBlue: ¡Muéstranos tu verdadero poder!"L\rLeaf: He visto que tú también tienes buenos Pokémon, ¿me das uno?"e\bOak: ¡Hola! ¡Me llamo Oak! ¡La gente me llama el Profesor Pokémon! ¡Ven, combate conmigo!"C\bGiovanni: ¡Por tu insolencia, conocerás un mundo de dolor!"{\bFalkner: ¡Te mostraré el verdadero poder de los gloriosos Pokémon de tipo Volador! ¡Vientos, permaneced conmigo!"F\bBugsy: Déjame demostrarte lo que he aprendido de mis estudios."v\rWhitney: ¿Quieres un combate contra mí, la talentosa y superadorable yo? ¡Pues considéralo una advertencia!"�\bMorty: Con un poco más, podría ver un futuro en el que conozca al Pokémon de los colores del arcoíris. ¡Tú vas a ayudarme a alcanzar ese nivel!"\bChuck: Déjame decirte una cosa: ¡soy lo bastante duro como para aplastar piedras y romper huesos! ¡Urggh! ¡Oooarrgh!"W\rJasmine: Oh... eh, hola. ¿Quieres a tus Pokémon? ¿Podrías demostrármelo...?"L\bPryce: ¡Yo, Pryce, el Entrenador del invierno, demostraré mi poder!"?\rClair: Voy a usar todo mi poder contra ti. ¡Hagámoslo!"6\bWill: ¡Perder no es una opción para nosotros!"U\bKoga: Prepárate para ser víctima de mis técnicas... Muy pronto lo verás..."C\bBruno: ¡Inclínate ante nuestro poder abrumador! ¡Hoo hah!",\rKaren: Pruébame. Entreténme. Vamos."P\bLance: Ha llegado la hora de ponerte a prueba en combate. ¿Estás listo?"3\bSilver: Qué pesado eres. No pareces fuerte."O\rLyra: Has venido aquí en busca de un desafío, ¿verdad? ¡Yo también!"W\bEthan: Hoy me siento genial, ¿qué tal un combate? ¡Aquí mismo y ahora mismo!"J\bElm: Dime, ¿cómo crías a tus Pokémon? ¡Espero un gran combate!"}\rRoxanne: ¿Serías tan amable de mostrarme cómo combates para que pueda aprender? Así también veré cuánto he mejorado."A\bBrawly: ¿Quieres desafiarme? Veamos de qué estás hecho."P\bWattson: ¡Haré que salten chispas contigo! ¡No digas que no te avisé!"3\rFlannery: ¡Prepárate! ¡Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"c\bNorman: Más te vale dar lo mejor de ti. ¡Yo haré todo lo que esté en mi mano para ganar!"[\rWinona: Contempla nuestra elegante coreografía. ¡No pestañees o te arrepentirás!"E\bTate: ¡Esta combinación nuestra! \rLiza: ¿Puedes superarla?"�\bJuan: Supongo que hoy un Coordinador podría enseñarte un truco o dos. ¡Contempla la gran ilusión de agua esculpida por nosotros!"j\bSidney: Me gusta esa mirada que me lanzas. Supongo que me darás un buen combate. ¡Vamos al grano!"l\rPhoebe: No tengas miedo. En fin, si buscas un desafío, ¡a ver si puedes hacerle daño a mis amigas!";\rGlacia: Me pregunto qué vas a mostrarnos. Adelante."~\bDrake: Para que podamos combatir con los Pokémon como compañeros, ¿sabes lo que hace falta? ¿Sabes qué es lo necesario?"\bSteven: ¡Dánoslo todo!"�\bWallace: ¿Quién puede danzar con más elegancia junto a sus Pokémon? ¿Quién debería exhibir el arte más grácil en combate, tú o yo y mi gran ilusión de agua?"v\bWally: Mis Pokémon me han dado valor y fuerza para luchar. ¡Tengo que ganar por ellos! ¡Así que prepárate!"n\rMay: ¿Traerías y me enseñarías a todos tus Pokémon en un combate conmigo? ¡Estoy emocionadísima!"�\bBrendan: El hecho de que estés aquí significa que puede que te hayas enfrentado a mi padre y lo hayas derrotado. ¡Pero enfrentarte a mí es otra historia! ¡Allá voy!"x\bBirch: Todavía hay muchísimos misterios en torno a los Pokémon. Entonces, ¿cuál es tu secreto para criarlos?"�\bMaxie: ¡Por eso nosotros, el Team Magma, debemos aumentar la masa continental del mundo! ¡Cree que eso nos llevará a un futuro de eterna felicidad para la humanidad!"�\bArchie: Los Pokémon sufren como resultado de nuestras acciones. Por eso tomé una decisión: ¡nosotros, el Team Aqua, lo devolveremos todo a su estado puro original!"%\bRoark: ¡Esto va a ser brutal!"D\rGardenia: ¡Vamos a combatir! ¡Uno rapidito de verdad, vale?"M\rMaylene: Además, me tomo los combates muy en serio. ¡Cuando quieras!"M\bCrasher Wake: ¡La victoria será nuestra! ¡Vamos, acabemos con esto!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: Acepto tu desafío. ¡Tengo la confianza necesaria para derribar tu defensa!"_\rCandice: Ya te aviso: soy dura, porque sé cómo concentrarme. ¡Prepárate para perder!"X\bVolkner: Espero que seas tú quien me haga recordar lo divertido que es combatir."o\bAaron: Quiero alcanzar la perfección, igual que mis Pokémon de tipo Bicho. ¡Déjame enfrentarme a ti!"P\rBertha: Bueno, ¿le mostrarías a esta anciana todo lo que has aprendido?"H\bFlint: ¡Muy bien, fenómeno! ¡Vamos a darle un poco de picante!"K\rCynthia: No hacen falta palabras. ¡Yo, Cynthia, acepto tu desafío!"E\bBarry: ¡Saca ya a tus Pokémon! ¡O te multo con 10 millones!"T\rDawn: ¡Déjame echarte una mano viendo si puedes vencerme y seguir adelante!":\bLucas: Listo o no, ¡vamos allá nosotros también!"�\bRowan: Incluso ahora, sigo emocionándome cuando estoy con Pokémon, así que empecemos nuestra prueba sobre los lazos con nuestros Pokémon."�\bCyrus: El mundo debe cambiar. Entonces, ¿quién lo cambiará? Yo, Cyrus. Y el Team Galaxia. ¡Haré que te arrepientas de haber escuchado a tu corazón!"i\bCilan: ¿Te gustaría participar en este combate contra mí? Todavía me queda mucho por aprender."U\bChili: ¡Voy a enseñarte de lo que somos capaces mis Pokémon ardientes y yo!"w\bCress: Seremos mis estimados Pokémon y yo quienes te enfrentaremos en combate. ¿Serías tan amable de aceptar?"�\rLenora: Voy a investigar cómo combates con los Pokémon que has criado con tanto cariño. ¡La curiosidad es la salsa de la vida!"x\bBurgh: ¡Ajá! ¡Luces encendidas! ¡Mis Pokémon de tipo Bicho corretean de emoción por poder combatir contigo!"�\rElesa: Sí, cielo. Soy Elesa, la modelo mundialmente famosa. ¡Bienvenido a mi escenario principal! Mis queridos Pokémon y los tuyos competirán aquí."t\bClay: ¡Harrumph! Me has hecho esperar, ¿eh, chaval? Así que tú eres el Entrenador del que hablaban, ¿no?"L\rSkyla: Entonces, ¿qué te parece si tú y yo nos divertimos un poco?"�\bBrycen: Recibir el apoyo de tus Pokémon te hace más fuerte. Te mostraré ese poder del que aprendí y que ahora está grabado en mi corazón."m\rRoxie: ¡Soy Roxie~! ¡Escucha bien~! ¡Voy a hacer vibrar al público hasta sacarlo de sus asientos~!"�\bDrayden: Combatamos con todo lo que tenemos: tu habilidad, mi experiencia y el cariño con el que hemos criado a nuestros Pokémon."i\bMarlon: ¿Qué te parece si tú y yo armamos una buena marejada y dejamos al público sin aliento?"�\bGrimsley: Lo que se decidirá aquí es cuál de los dos puede absorber la luz y el brillo de este combate. Dejemos que el destino eche a rodar."G\rShauntal: ¿Te gustaría ser el protagonista de mi nueva novela?"\\bMarshal: Mi intención es ponerte a prueba. Llevarte al límite de tu fuerza. ¡Kiai!"_\rCaitlin: Haz todo lo posible por no aburrirme con un combate soporífero. ¿Está claro?"�\bAlder: Cuando veo a otro Entrenador me lleno de emoción, y me pregunto cuál de los dos es más fuerte. ¡La emoción me hierve por dentro!"v\bBenga: ¡Eh, eh! ¡Mírame! ¡Quiero combatir contigo! ¡Mis Pokémon todavía no han pasado por lo suficiente!"�\rIris: ¡Hola! ¡Soy Iris! ¡La gente me llama la chica que conoce el corazón de los dragones! ¡Prepárate! ¡Voy a derrotarte!"4\bHugh: ¡Ven a por mí con todo lo que tengas!"B\rHilda: ¡Este combate es mío! ¡No voy a caer fácilmente!"]\bHilbert: Tengo ganas de combatir contigo, pero después de esto seamos amigos, ¿vale?">\rRosa: ¿Quieres combatir conmigo de una vez? ¡Yay hay!"�\rRoxanne: Hola, soy Roxanne. Me gusta elaborar estrategias antes de un combate, aplicando todo lo que he estudiado hasta ahora."z\rEstoy segura de que ambos hemos vivido muchos combates, adquiriendo un enorme conocimiento sobre el arte de luchar."m\bTu talento levantó una oleada de asombro que me desbordó. Deseo volver a sentirlo. ¡Sigue adelante!"A\b¡Ajá! Qué alma joven tan estupenda, rebosante de vigor."[\rNo es de extrañar que los Pokémon que combaten a mi lado acabaran confundiéndose."S\rContempla nuestra elegante coreografía. ¡No pestañees o te arrepentirás!"T\rWinona: Veo que tú también eres uno con tus Pokémon. Reconozco tu talento."E\bNo necesitamos hablar... \r...porque ambos podemos percibir..."I\b...lo que piensa el otro... \r...¡todo dentro de nuestras mentes!"q\bTate: El vínculo entre tú y tus Pokémon... \rLiza: ...era mucho más fuerte que el nuestro. Lo sabemos."u\bSidney: Dijeron que yo era un macarra, ¡pero les enseñé de qué están hechas las bellezas del lado oscuro!"\bSidney: Escucha lo que tiene que decir este perdedor. Tienes un largo camino por delante, pero tienes lo que hace falta."~\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... ¡Jajaja! Tienes razón. ¿Oh? Dame un momento... Hola. Mi amiga me dice que me estás buscando."d\rNo tengas miedo. En fin, si buscas un desafío, ¡a ver si puedes hacerle daño a mis amigas!"a\rMe gustaría ver hasta dónde puede llevarte tu vínculo. ¡No nos avergüences perdiendo!"2\rMe pregunto qué vas a mostrarme. Adelante."�\rQué alivio, ¡qué ardiente ha sido eso! Los ánimos ardían con tanta fuerza que mis movimientos helados palidecen en comparación."}\bTú... ¿Qué viste en tu viaje junto a tus Pokémon? ¿Qué sentiste al encontrarte con tantos Entrenadores como tú?"�\b¡Eh! ¡Eh! ¡Más te vale seguir apuntando alto y prometer que volverás a desafiarme! ¡Si no, llegaré yo a la cima en un abrir y cerrar de ojos!"}\bEres increíble. ¡Tienes la prueba de que eres un Entrenador del que tus Pokémon pueden sentirse orgullosos! ¡Nos vemos!"Q\r¡Más te vale dar lo mejor de ti para que no te barra de una sola pasada!"\rJuniper: Tener combates Pokémon entre nosotros profundiza los lazos entre personas y Pokémon. Entonces, ¿estás preparado?"[\bN: Bien, ¡déjame oír la voz de tus Pokémon! Quiero comprenderte. ¡Muéstramelo!"{\bGhetsis: ¡Debemos liberar a los Pokémon! ¡Entonces, y solo entonces, humanos y Pokémon serán realmente iguales!"F\rVioleta: ¡Ahora ven a por mí! ¡Yo, Violeta, te haré frente!"_\bGrant: Espero que me demuestres que tu habilidad como Entrenador supera incluso la mía."U\rKorrina: ¡Ja, ja! ¡Ha llegado el momento de la gran entrada de Lady Korrina!"\bRamos: La supervivencia de las plantas es una señal de su fuerza. ¿Estás seguro de que puedes enfrentarte a todo eso?"b\bClemont: ¡Hola! ¡Me gustan mis combates Pokémon igual que mis inventos: DE ALTO VOLTAJE!"~\rValerie: Las escurridizas Hadas pueden parecer frágiles como una brisa y delicadas como una flor, pero no te confíes."a\rOlympia: Este es un ritual para decidir tu destino y tu futuro. ¡Que comience el combate!"\bWulfric: Dependiendo de los Pokémon que elijas, podría ser tu rival más duro hasta ahora... o un completo blandengue."'\rMalva: ¡Estoy que ardo, mocoso!"~\bSiebold: Consagrarte por completo a una vida hecha de experiencias fugaces... eso sí que es verdaderamente artístico."b\bWikstrom: Juremos ambos que nuestro duelo será justo y honorable. ¿Preparado? ¡En garde!"W\rDrácena: ¡Enfrentarme a ti hará que mis Pokémon crezcan como la mala hierba!"�\rDianta: ¿Sabes? De verdad me encantaría aprender más sobre cómo un Entrenador fuerte como tú cría a sus Pokémon, llenos de esperanza por el futuro."�\rShauna: ¡Estoy segura de que vamos a ser grandes amigos! ¡Eh! ¿Podemos ver ya a los Pokémon? ¡Quiero conocerlos yo también!";\bTierno: En fin, ¿podemos tener un combate Pokémon?"�\bTrevor: Estoy viajando con mi Pokédex para recorrer altas montañas y vastos mares, pero eso no significa que no pueda combatir. ¡Vamos!"b\rSerena: ¡Woohoo! ¡No puedo esperar a ver de qué somos capaces! Ejeje, ¡vamos a empezar!"3\bCalem: Muy bien, hagámoslo. ¡Vamos, todos!"6\bSycamore: ¡Tengamos todos un combate Pokémon!"8\bLysandre: Mi deseo... ¡es un mundo más hermoso!"K\bIlima: ¡Contempla a los magníficos Pokémon del inigualable Ilima!"B\rLana: ¡Voy a enseñarte de lo que es capaz una Lana seria!"V\bKiawe: ¡Espero que traigas ese fuego contigo y reduzcas mi desafío a cenizas!"H\rMallow: ¡Vamos a ponernos a cocinar en pleno fragor del combate!"k\bSophocles: ¡Eh! ¿Podrías enseñarme algunos trucos para tener más confianza mientras combatimos?"a\rMina: ¡Quizá tus habilidades en combate sean una auténtica obra maestra! ¡Vamos allá!"e\rAcerola: ¡Quizá nuestro combate sea uno de esos que se cuenten en los libros durante siglos!"S\rHapu: Parece que vas a labrarte una gran historia. Es hora de ponerse serio."\\bNanu: No te lo tomes demasiado en serio. Te agotarás si siempre vas con tanta prisa."v\rOlivia: Puedes contar conmigo, chaval. ¡Prepárate para el combate Pokémon más duro que hayas tenido jamás!"z\rKahili: Veamos hasta dónde podemos volar. ¡Los vientos de la victoria soplarán a favor de mis Pokémon y de mí!"h\bMolayne: Ahora tengo que hacer lo que pueda para mantenerme al nivel de los demás. ¡Combatamos!"C\bHala: ¡El viejo Hala también va a darlo todo! ¡Choquemos!"D\bHau: ¡Quiero hacer todas las cosas divertidas! ¡Combatamos!"Y\rLillie: ¡Haré todo lo posible para que ningún Pokémon tenga que acabar herido!"B\bGladion: Combate conmigo. No aceptaré un no por respuesta.":\rSelene: ¡Estoy al máximo de energía! ¡Adelante!"@\bElio: Estaré encantado de mostrarte de lo que soy capaz."i\bKukui: Entonces, ¿quieres pasar por mi prueba para hacerte más fuerte? ¡Eso es, ponte a prueba!"=\rLusamine: A ver... Sí, tú. \PN. Combatirás conmigo."^\bGuzma: ¿Quieres ver qué aspecto tiene la destrucción? ¡Aquí está tu chico, Guzma!"�\bEusine: Mi deseo de buscar a Suicune es muchísimo mayor que el tuyo... ¡No dejaré de seguirte hasta averiguar lo que busco!"_\rCheryl: ¿Así que eres mi rival de hoy? Mis Pokémon estaban deseando tener un combate."B\rMira: ¡Prepárate, Mira va a enseñarte todo lo que tiene!"a\bRiley: Ahora vamos a hacer todo lo que esté en nuestra mano para derrotar a tus Pokémon."u\bBuck: ¡Puedo sentir a mis Pokémon temblando dentro de sus Poké Balls! ¡Es por anticipación, no por miedo!"K\rMarley: ...¿Vamos a combatir? ...Vale. Lo haré lo mejor que pueda."J\bEmmet: ¡Todo está listo! ¡Apunta a la victoria! ¡Todos a bordo!"W\bIngo: Haré todo lo que esté en mi mano para combatir contigo. ¡Todos a bordo!"R\bNoland: ¡Exprime hasta la última gota de tu conocimiento y ven a por mí!"C\rGreta: ¡A ver si logras encender mi pasión por el combate!"{\bTucker: ¡Tucker, la estrella del espectáculo, te bañará en un brillo deslumbrante! ¡Aquí y ahora! ¡Veámoslo!"t\rLucy: No soy de charla vacía. Date prisa. Vamos... Tu suerte... espero que no la hayas gastado toda aquí..."{\bSpenser: ¡Si vuestros lazos de confianza son frágiles, jamás vencerás a mis compañeros! ¡Demuéstramelo aquí!">\rAnabel: Déjame ver tu talento en toda su extensión..."3\bBrandon: ¡Trae tu coraje a nuestro combate!"�\bPalmer: Muéstrame el vínculo que has construido con tus Pokémon. ¡Muéstrame lo que has aprendido a través de tus combates con otros Entrenadores!"X\rDahlia: No perdamos más tiempo. ¡Deseo poner a prueba tus habilidades yo misma!"2\bThorton: Muy bien, ¡pongámonos en marcha!"U\bDarach: Permíteme asegurarte que no saldrás perdiendo por enfrentarte a mí."G\rArgenta: Yo seré tu desafío más temible. Te reto a superarme."-La fría puerta de hierro está cerrada."�\rYo... soy Marley. Yo... no me gusta hablar... elijo mis palabras con cuidado, pero aun así podrían herir a alguien sin querer..."\ts[5]¡Ding dong!"x\bCometí un grave y continuo error de juicio, y no espero ser perdonado. Estoy aquí simplemente para disculparme."�\bSé lo difícil que es el Desafío Sync, así que voy a echarte una pequeña mano. La próxima vez en el Desafío Sync, fíjate bien en lo que hay a mi izquierda."FElige el Pokémon al que quieres otorgar la Bendición de Arceus."*<<Imbuyendo la Bendición de Arceus>>"0¡Los Entrenadores se están transformando!"VParece que la alarma de seguridad se activó después del combate. ¿Qué harás?":\b???: Ehhh, así que de verdad había alguien aquí.".¡Rápido! ¡Escapa por donde has venido!""¡Corre! ¡Corre por tu vida!"l\bTrace: Quizá debería comprobar si tus Pokémon realmente están en buena forma... ¡con un combate!"�\bMaxie: ¡Nosotros, el Team Magma, debemos aumentar la masa continental del mundo! ¡Cree que eso nos llevará a un futuro de eterna felicidad para la humanidad!"Izquierda"
Abajo"Derecha"Sí"No"Quedarse y enfrentarse"Volver al vestíbulo"Escapar;[�"Choose your path."U\bMilo: Well then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"h\rNessa: No matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."i\bKabu: In the end, the match will be decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."G\rBea: I think I'll test that unshakable spirit of yours, shall I?"#\bAllister: H...here...I go..."Y\rOpal: I'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."4\bGordie: Size means strength! Savor this pain!"p\rMelony: All righty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."Q\bAvery: Prepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"-\rKlara: You'll never know what hit you!"O\bPiers: Get ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"M\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"P\bRaihan: Bring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"^\bMustard: Don't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"n\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolutely champion time!"<\bHop: So let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"a\bBede: I suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how pathetic you are and how strong I am."U\rMarnie: It'd be no fun if things ended quick... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"M\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna give it a taste test?"B\rGloria: Ok, wait no further! All pumped up and ready to go!"\\rMagnolia: So, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."(\rSonia: Let's give it our all now!"a\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, then Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"�\bRose: I saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: So let's have a fun and intense battle that both our teams can really enjoy!"k\bLian: I'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or face the wrath of my Pokemon!"1\rArezu: Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"3\rCalaba: Now let's not be distracted further."0\bIscan: N-now, you insist... We can begin."6\rPalina: Without any further, show me your team."1\bMelli: Accept your loss and out of my way!"p\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory loose... Would you honor me with a battle?"F\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win me first!"d\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"E\rCharm: I'm the eldest Fortune, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"I\rClover: I'm the middle Fortune, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"Y\rCoin: I'm the youngest Fortune, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."v\bBeni: You, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to molder all these long years!"P\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every moves!"c\bKamado: We will let fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh. I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"N\rIrida: Let's compare what we know, whose's world is vast in comparison."\\rCyllene: You know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."4\bRei: Now it's time for our partners to shine."=\rAkari: Here I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"x\bLaventon: Come now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"f\rCogita: I will have to pardon this only time, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."f\bVolo: TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"S\bMilo: Hmmm? Oh, you must be one of those challengers, right? My name's Milo."b\bWe're gonna be as tough as weeds! But... that's not gonna keep you down! What a proper job!"O\bWell then, shall we get this haystack rolling? This is gonna be a doozy!"�\bMilo: Battling with you seems to perk my Grass- type Pokémon right up! I hope that has been a fulfilling Pokémon battle for you too!"3\bWe'll be cheering you on from the bleachers!"o\rNessa: You're one of the ones endorsed by Hitsu, right? You've become something of a hot topic among us."{\rI think you've already realized, but I'm Nessa. I don't doubt that your mind as a Pokémon Trainer must be quite refined."e\rBut no matter what kind of plan you may be plotting, my partner and I will be sure to sink it."T\rNessa: Your teamwork was just flawless! It's enough to make me a bit jealous."O\rRide that current all the way to the end! Give the crowd what they want!"\bKabu: Every Trainer and Pokémon trains hard in pursuit of victory. But that means your opponent is also working hard to win."q\bI was training right up until the last moment so that I can guarantee you the best match when we face off!"b\bBut in the end, the match is decided by which side is able to unleash their true potential."r\bKabu: Clearly, your talent surpassed my many years of experience. I'm glad I could also feel my own growth."`\bAnd I plan to keep growing and battling, until I become an old coot that nobody can beat!"\\rBea: One has to be careful not to let a single victory lull oneself into complacency."Z\rDo you also have an unshakable spirit that won't be moved, no matter what you face?"0\rI think I'll just test that out, shall I?"<\rBea: Facing you gave me all the explanation I needed."k\rBea: It's good to be unshakable in the face of battle. But it's good to be moved by battle, as well."\bAllister: ......Oh. You.")\b...I'm Allister. ...You look well."\bH-here... I go..."<\bAllister: ...That was ace. I will rem... ember you..."%\bG-give it your best out there."�\rOpal: There you are, child. Though you are really lacking in the color pink, you seem like a fine candidate to be my successor."p\rMy morning tea is finally kicking in, and I suppose it's a bit late to introduce myself, but... I'm Opal."S\rI'll keep an eye on you, child. Show me what you can do when you go all out."}\rOpal: Still not what I'm looking for... Oh, don't worry yourself about it, child. It's just a matter of my preference."d\rIt's time for me to step out of the spotlight soon. For young, fresh talents to really shine."[\bGordie: The name's Gordie. I admit I feel a little bad for doing this to you, but..."U\bI'm going to use this match to show the crowd that my Pokémon are unbeatable!",\bSize means strength! Savor this pain!"K\bGordie: That was... impressive. Rules are rules. You get to move on."T\bI pride myself on my solid Pokémon. I just need to train harder, that's all."N\rMelony: I am Melony. Well, you'll find my battle style is quite severe."O\rIf You're not careful, I could sweep your feet right out from under you."f\rAlrighty, I suppose we should get started. You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid."w\rMelony: Of course seeing my Pokémon lose is sad, but to meet someone so young with such ability is quite grand."6\rGive the next one a right thrashing, would you?"B\bAvery: Quite the commendable punctuality. My name is Avery."z\bI don't think you're quite up to snuff... And it's up to me, as an elegant adult, to make sure you get the message."J\bPrepare to experience psychic powers that defy human comprehension!"+\bAvery: Improbable... No, impossible!"P\bPerhaps I am just an average man who gave everything he possibly could..."d\rKlara: Aha, there you are, right on time too! I'm the colorful, caring and charismatic Klara!"h\r......What's with the silence? Am I being mocked... by a kid?! Gosh, you're a pain in the neck..."&\rYou'll never know what hit you!"K\rKlara: Huh?! No no no! NO no no! There must be some kind of mistake!"M\rAaagh! Why can't I win?! All that effort, and nothing to show for it?!"]\bPiers: *sigh*... So you're finally here, huh? Reckoned nobody was comin' to challenge."~\bThe only thing a humble singer can do is sing a humble song. I still hope you enjoy the battle, though you know you'll lose!"H\bGet ready for a mosh pit with me and my party! It's time to rock!"J\bPiers: Piers doesn't do encores, but I admit I'm tempted right now."2\bLet's meet up again for a battle some time!"J\bPeony: Gahahaha! Aren't you the brave one, pickin' a fight with me!"@\bCan't say I hate you buttin' in here... The name's Peony!"F\bBrace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle! Don't you fret!"Q\bPeony: Gahahaaa! Look at me, takin' a thrashin' from a youngster like you!"[\bThat was one ultra-mega-heated final battle! Hats off to you. In more ways than one!"h\bRaihan: Oh! If it isn't the Trainer endorsed by the Hitsu! Let's see... What was your name again?"r\bAh, right! \PN! And if Hitsu himself recognized your potential... Then I guess you'll be quite the Trainer."H\bBring the storm! I, the Mighty Raihan, will send everyone flying!"|\bRaihan: In the aftermath of that furious battle... I feel as pure and refreshed as when the sky clears after a storm."V\bI might have lost, but I still look good. Maybe I should snap a quick selfie..."\\bMustard: Why, hello there! I'm pleased as cheese that you could join me for a battle."B\bYou seem to be the hardworking type too! My name's Mustard!"U\bDon't keep this old man waiting too long! Just say the word when you're ready!"|\bMustard: Strength ebbs and flows in an endless cycle. One moment you grasp it, and the next, it slips from your hand."o\bYou young folks grow so fast! It never ceases to amaze me. Congratulations, from the bottom of my heart!"W\bLeon: It probably goes without saying, but... hello! I'm Galar's Champion, Leon!"|\bI love giving it everything I've got as a Trainer and seeing my team give everything they've got to seize another victory!"f\bI can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"`\bLeon: You've beat even the unbeatable Champion! I offer you my heartfelt congratulations!"�\bI hope this isn't the last time I get to meet you in battle! Keep challenging me so that I can keep reaching ever greater heights!"U\bHop: It's me, Hop! It's time for my new legend to begin here with my Pokémon!"}\bMy goal's to take on my bro. But not just that, I want to beat him! I want to be the one who beats the unbeatable Champion!"V\bSo let's show everyone the greatest battle ever, to be one step closer to Leon!"E\bHop: That was a real nail-biter of a match! I'm happy for you!"X\bI'm a bit disappointed in myself, but you won't get me so easily next time, mate!"w\bBede: What a joke. It's positively criminal of you, wasting my time here. So why don't you walk out of here now?"t\bYou're aware that I was chosen by Hitsu and Galar's Chairman himself, so that makes me more amazing than you!"[\bI suppose I should prove beyond doubt just how strong I am and how pathetic you are."j\bBede: This isn't what I planned. If I was able to defeat you, then everything would've been fine..."W\bNext time... I'll prove I'm a notch above the competition to everyone before me."g\rMarnie: Fancy seein' you again. I'm Marnie. Seems like I'm gonna have to watch out for you, huh?"[\rWhat're you gawkin' at? It's exactly what you think. I'm goin' to be the one to win."P\rIt'd be no fun if things ended just yet... Got some fight in you? Wicked!"k\rMarnie: Ok, I got to see a lot of the good points of you and your Pokémon! Guess that's not so bad!"V\rJust so y'know... I still haven't decided if I'm gonna cheer for you... See ya!"w\bVictor: Victor here. I've just finished cooking something tasty back there... Would you like to have some later?"V\bNo? I'm pretty confident when it comes to cooking and Pokémon battles, y'know."B\bWanna have a taste test? My Pokémon are prepped and ready!"W\bVictor: Thorough preparation is important for both cooking and Pokémon battles."a\bYour teamwork is just like a bowl of great curry! I gotta learn the secret to your recipe!"h\rGloria: Pleased to meetcha! I'm Gloria! And everywhere is a great stage for adventure and battle!"|\rAnd all that got me more peckish than usual. I think I'll make some sandwiches after this! It'll really hit the spot!">\rOk, wait no further! I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"U\rGloria: Strength is hard to obtain, and even harder to keep! Or so they say..."P\rWith your performance, there's no doubt you'll be smashing all obstacles!"}\rMagnolia: Oh goodness, dear me. I'm sorry. I didn't even notice my guest! My name is Magnolia. Welcome, young trainer!"m\rAs you know, we Dynamax our Pokémon today using the energy from Wishing Stars that have fallen to us."b\rDynamaxing draws out the true strength from the trust between a Pokémon and their Trainer."R\rSo, \PN. Time to show me your true strength in the bonds of trust you have."~\rMagnolia: You have certainly grown strong in the face of adversity, dearie. It's up to you to figure out what to do with it."{\rThere are things that only young people like you can do, and there are other things that only you can do. Dream big."{\rSonia: Name's Sonia. I'm the professor's assistant. I've been on a journey to solve the Galar region's biggest mysteries!"o\rAh, here! It's a book I wrote! I even signed it - that makes it a collector's item. Don't want it? Okay."!\rLet's give it our all now!"e\rSonia: Whoa, what's all this about all of a sudden? I've never seen anything like this before!"7\rYour feat today is gonna be featured in my book!"�\rOleana: So, you got through all they have to stop you. I would expect nothing less of the Trainers handpicked by Hitsu himself."h\rBut I am afraid it is now time for you to go home. I'll treat you to something truly spectacular."T\rOnce I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"z\rOleana: Arghhh! This is inexcusable... What was I thinking... Anyone who's made it this far would be no pushover..."E\rEverything I did, I did to further the chairman's own goals..."\bRose: Ladies and gentlemen! To everyone watching from the lobby and from home, you have all been waiting for this big moment!"~\bBefore I get carried away, please allow me to introduce myself once again. My name is Rose, and it is a pleasure to be here."�\bI saw talent in you. You reminded me a little bit of myself, back when I was young. Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"�\bRose: Hmm, this isn't looking too good for me... Most impressive, \PN. I wouldn't expect any less from a challenger endorsed by Hitsu."�\bIt's too bad, but it can't be helped... I do tend to ramble on, I know. I love to make speeches. But I think I can stop talking now."^\rMai: Trying to bring out the best in our partners is one thing we might have in common."i\rDo you feel confident that you can lead your Pokémon in battle? Well, I guess such talk can wait."V\rSo let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"s\rMai: Through battling, I feel that I'm coming to a greater understanding both of you and of my own Pokémon."U\rI hope I can come to understand the feelings of wild Pokémon in this way too."h\bLian: I'm Lian. I've already deduced that you've come here well-prepared. Such an earnest desire."5\bBut I must turn you away, even if it pains me."h\bI'm keen to advance further, so withdraw while you still can. Or... face the wrath of my Pokemon!"n\bLian: I apologize for becoming briefly incomposed. I may've been defeated, but my passion still stands!"L\bAnd it seems we've settled things here. Don't get cold feet after me!"_\rArezu: You've got quite the reputation, you know. I mean, your journey is one to reckon."S\rSome people are actually kinda scared of you for doing something so amazing."A\rI'm Arezu, by the way! Real nice to meet you! Let's begin!"G\rArezu: My luck's run out, though... as you can most likely tell."P\rBut you're amazing, you know that? Your display of control was beautiful!"c\rCalaba: That's Warden Calaba to you. Ho? Now would you look at that... I've heard about you."N\rThe chosen one? More like a whelp in my view. Waste no more of my time."+\rNow let's not be distracted further."f\rCalaba: I owe you an apology. I treated you with disrespect, thinking you were just some whelp."|\rI didn't even have the courtesy to listen to you. You'd think someone who's lived as long as I have would be more patient."8\bIscan: Give me a moment... So, um... I'm Iscan..."j\bWell, sudden visits give me quite a shock... I do hope you'll give me advance notice in the future.",\bN-now, if you insist... We can begin."z\bIscan: Your nerves aren't just steel... They're... titanium. It's positively frightening how, um, fearless you are."5\bI'll, um... I'll just take my leave here then."z\rPalina: You're that child who they speak of. Your strength must be amazing, and yet... you have such a gentle face."^\rI believe you have the potential to do great things. But let's not force that onto you.".\rWithout further ado, show me your team."Q\rPalina: That was a splendid match! I'm so proud of both you and your team."I\rThank you, truly, for battling together with me. It means so much."a\bMelli: Heh, it looks like even a slight breeze could topple you. Can you really defeat me?"Q\bStop trying to humiliate yourself. I can't be stopped by the likes of you!".\bAccept your loss and get out of my way!"\\bMelli: Listen here! Neither I nor my Pokemon admit defeat just yet. That was a fluke!"u\bHowever! I will withdraw to allow them to recover. There's no shame in a tactical retreat. Keep your guard up!"j\bIngo: Good day, good trainer. Pleased to properly meet you. Your presence... reminded me of... uhh."�\bI recall faintly, that I had a partner once, who looked... like me. His name escapes me; all I could remember was my own name."d\bPerhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"�\bIngo: Sometimes I find myself saying things without knowing where the words come from... yet those words seem to fill me with power."z\bAh, but now I've sidetracked us with this talk. Please convey my well wishes to your next challenger. Hurry onward!"m\rSabi: My clairvoyance told me... You're super talented, right? I bet you're gonna be fun to play with!"T\rI'm Sabi! I know why you're here too! To get to the end and get your rewards!">\rWell, you'll get it... if you can win against me first!"G\rSabi: Wow, you caught us AND you beat us. You've won my respect!"�\rOooh, and one more thing: Am I even really clairvoyant? Am I really having fun, or am I bored? Hmm. No one but me could really know, right?"c\bGaeric: Let's begin with some proper introductions! I am Gaeric. And you must be \PN, right?"o\bOn what grounds do you come here seeking for the title of the best? What does your heart tell you to do?"a\bIf that is what you hope to accomplish, then we must judge whether are you up to the task!"O\bGaeric: I'm tough as an iceberg, but you smashed me through and through!"@\bI suppose you can get on with it now. This one's alright!"S\rCharm: Now who might you be? Not some stray traveler, from the looks of you."c\rI bring good luck to my sisters wherever I go, and ill luck to anyone who crosses our paths."6\rI'm the eldest, and I'll be your unlucky Charm!"S\rCharm: You're really going to insist on getting in the way, you little runt?"L\rNow I know more about how you fight, and I won't hold back next time."Q\rClover: Your luck's just run out. A vicious trap, laid out by yours truly."V\rThought you spotted a four-leaf clover? Well, I'll soon have you seeing double!"@\rI'm the middle sister, and I'm one Clover you can't pick!"N\rClover: This place... You gotta be kidding me! It wasn't a fair battle!"]\rWe were basically goin' easy on you! I'll make you regret that confidence next time!!!"�\rCoin: I should introduce myself properly... before I show you poor fool how wrong it was to assume that you could ever beat me."X\rHeads, I win, and tails, you lose. You've got no chance in this game of fortunes."K\rI'm the youngest, Coin, but I'm definitely not your good-luck piece."W\rCoin: What a blithering mooncalf I am. I guess I lose the coin toss sometimes..."V\rYou will pay for this embarrassment. I swear I will make you pay with interest!";\bBeni: Lively and kicking, are you? Good to see that."�\bI heard you managed to quell your foes one after another, oh, did it ever make my blood run hot and my heart pound... At last... at last..."u\bYou, the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder for all these long years!"|\bBeni: It doesn't matter to me who wins and who loses. I'm here to show you how a ninja fights, the style of a dying breed!"S\bAnyway, they say hunger is the best seasoning. I'm going off to eat my fill."m\rZisu: The name's Zisu. Captain of the Security Corps. So you're the one that everyone's talking about?"P\rI see you've got some fight in you. Figured I'd give what advice I could."G\rShow me what you can do. I'll carefully observe your every move!"\rZisu: Strong style, agile style... You know what is right for a given situation, and direct your Pokemon with a little nudge."N\rYou are a true veteran in Pokemon battles. That's a lot coming from me!"a\bKamado: I have been waiting for you! I am Kamado, commander of the Galaxy Expedition Team!"V\bHrrrm! You've got vigor, I'll give you that! You've come far enough to face me."S\bLet fate decide what happens next! Whichever of us is stronger will prevail!";\bKamado: You truly are a force to be reckoned with..."r\bI'm grateful to you for showing me what a heartening presence Pokémon can be. We must spar again sometime!"u\bAdaman: Look who's being punctual! Good to finally meet you, stranger! I'm Adaman, leader of the Diamond Clan."|\bTime is all about change, and we can't live in fear of that. We can only try to change the time we live in for the better."l\bOh, look at the time. I'll cut the greetings then! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"S\bAdaman: Well, you've done it! That was amazing! I'm still shaking, even now."V\bNext time we'll come at you even harder and give you a battle you won't forget!"Y\rIrida: This stage is just for the both of us. I'm Irida, leader of the Pearl Clan!"`\rThe world before our eyes grows broader when we achieve true understanding with Pokémon."?\rLet's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."`\rIrida: Your sheer power, it's as unfathomably vast as space itself. I'm in awe before it."i\rI know I may never come to understand everything out there, but I'll keep my heart open to trying."\\rCyllene: I am the captain of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps. You may call me Cyllene."O\rWe are here to prove our capability in taming and handling our Pokémon."S\rYou know what is expected of you. Now it is up to you to see things through."�\rCyllene: I set a high hurdle to judge whether a stranger like yourself could be worthy, but you cleared it. You've passed your trial."O\rBe proud. Present yourself orderly for whoever may come before you next."@\bRei: I'm Rei, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps!"�\bI want to conduct survey work so I can reach a point where if I meet a Pokémon, we can understand each other, even without battling."?\bHow about you then? It's time for our partners to shine!"b\bRei: The way you fight alongside your Pokémon - you don't seem scared of battling one bit."@\bFair enough. We'll just have to catch up the best we can."Z\rAkari: Hi! I'm Akari, a member of the Galaxy Team's Survey Corps! Nice to meet you!"h\rOur job as the Survey Corps is to research Pokémon and find out what kind of creatures they are!"6\rHere I go now! Get ready to face my full power!"q\rAkari: I guess doing research tasks and learning is one thing, and using that knowledge well is another..."^\rBattling certainly has its merits... I think I understand my Pokémon a bit better now."K\bLaventon: Ah! You gave me quite the shock, coming to me like that..."]\bOh yes, and...what might your name be? Oho! So you're called \PN! My name is Laventon."S\bI am something of a scholar seeking to deepen our understanding of Pokémon."n\bCome now! What do you say? Shall we help one another out, for me to seek understanding of your Pokemon?"[\bLaventon: Splendiferous results! I daresay you've earned yourself a pat on the back!"Q\bYou know, I expect great things of you. Carry on the good fight out there!"�\rCogita: First off, no "mistress," thank you. Just Cogita. It seems I'll be able to fulfil my duty at long last, thanks to you."c\rIndeed, I am to guide you, lost one. For the task of preventing great disaster falls to you."l\rThis is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."c\rCogita: There is nobility in knowing what must be done and seeing to it. You see, don't you?"y\rI have passed on to you all there is to pass. Where history goes from here... I leave it to you to see it through."�\bVolo: Ever since I was young, whenever I encounterd something painful or heartbreaking... I couldn't help but wonder why life was so unfair and why I was cursed to live through such things."�\bEventually, I chose to direct all my energy into my own natural curiosity and ambition. And what tickled my curiosity stronger than anything else were the mysteries to be found in legends, in history, in ruins..."�\bEver since I becoming convinced that Arceus really does exist, I also realised I need to be able to subjugate its power... TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"�\bVolo: I've devoted myself to Arceus beyond any other! I worshiped it as the creator of our entire world! I dedicated all of my passion and interest to studying it! All the time I've spent poring over the legends... Everything that I've done!"�\bDo you mean to tell me that this world doesn't need to be remade? Then, my journey is over. My story ended when I lost to you."The door is locked..."c\bBrock: Hi, I believe having rock hard defense and determination will overcome all obstacles!"_\bYou'd better have true-grit determination, or you will have a hard time hurting my pals!"\bShow me your best!"O\bBrock: The world is huge. There are still many strong trainers like you."0\bI have faith that you will overcome them!"F\rMisty: You are looking at the world-famous beauty, Misty, here!"J\rYou'd better not get blown away by my looks and my all-out offense!"\rAre you ready, sweetie?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! This makes me so angry!"U\rI need to clear my head of these defeats... I definitely won't lose next time!":\bLt. Surge: Hey, puny kid! I have to hand it to you."L\bIt takes guts to take me on. And you'd better keep your nerves tight."T\bBecause Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!"2\bLt. Surge: Okay! You're the real deal, kid!"6\bBack to brushin' up. Keep goin' like lightning!"\\rErika: ...Zzz... zzz... Hm? Oh, good day to you. It makes me sleepy to be here alone."V\rDid you perhaps wish to challenge me? Very well... I, Erika, graciously accept."4\rLet my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."*\rErika: Oh! I admire your technique."I\rI would be really happy to see your demonstration again next time."S\rSabrina: I had a vision of your arrival, and I know you are not a simpleton."R\rI saw a challenge from you, but intentionally didn't see further than that."H\rGetting ready, aren't you? Let's find out who the victor will be.";\rSabrina: Your power... far exceeds what I foresaw..."A\rYou'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."1\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember the name!"i\rKnow that even though I'm the daughter of a reowned Elite Four, it doesn't mean that I'm inferior!"Z\rOtherwise you're going to pay the consequences of the horror I'm about to give you!"O\rJanine: Fufufufu... I'm sorry to disappoint you... You're the real deal."l\rI'm going to reapply myself and improve my skills, to become much better than both my father and you!"J\bBlaine: Good day! Do you know all about Pokémon? Especially yours?"`\bHow about the best type of Pokémon to train and cultivate? Bet that got you puzzled huh."G\bWanna know the burning answer? Let me give you a lesson on that!"P\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown the wits and knowledge to overcome me."T\bIt makes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"y\bBill: Hiya! Call me Bill! I'm a true-blue Poké Maniac! I'm the one who developed the system to transfer Pokémon!"g\bHey! What's with that skeptical look? I'm not joshing you, pal. Speaking of that, why am I here?"B\bDid you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!"G\bBill: That's a bummer. I've got to thank you for the great time."Q\bNow, I've gotta find out why am I here with the other Kanto gym leaders..."Z\rLorelei: Are you well versed in handling icy creatures? No one can best me on that."T\rWith my well-planned strategy, all Pokémon will be frozen solid at my mercy!"4\rHope you brought your winter coat along, heh."G\rLorelei: You're better than I thought. I'm feeling the heat now!"G\rI will be sure to think of a counter-strategy after this battle!"?\bRyuki: The name's Ryuki. I'm what you might call a star."]\bI'm gonna be a Kantonian Gym Leader one day! The whole world will know me soon enough!"V\bYou're gonna be my fan, right? Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"5\bRyuki: What a gig. You're a hidden talent too!"J\bIf we played it loud and well enough, our fame will be unstoppable!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child?"`\rYou have a Pokédex on you! You're the child that Oak's taken under his wing, aren't you?"f\rPokémon are meant for battling! Not to be collected! I'll show you how a real Trainer battles!"1\rAgatha: You win. I've nothing else to say."B\rWell, what are you waiting for? Run along now, child! Shoo!"`\bTrace: Hi. You must have taken a long path to get here. Was it to get a worthy challenge?"_\bAs for me, I wanna catch tons of different Pokémon and train them up to be strong! Heh!"T\bMaybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"P\bTrace: Man, you truly are something! But that doesn't mean I'm giving up!"<\bI'll keep taking on your challenges if we meet again!"e\bBlue: Who are you? My name's Blue. I was once the Kanto Champion, although it was short-lived."c\bBut I ain't any ordinary chump then! If I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."V\bWanna give it a try? I'll know if you're good or not by battling you right now."p\bBlue: You're tough, I'll give you that. But there's always someone better. You have to be more dedicated!"4\bI gotta get back to training. Smell ya later!"`\rLeaf: Oh, whoops! You're not a Pokémon! Sorry, I thought you were some kind of Pokémon."r\rWell, uh… nice to meet you. I'm Green! Are you here because you're also looking for… something special?"G\rI noticed you got some good Pokémon there too, can I have them?"V\rGreen: Wow, you're strong! Oh, I know! Why don't you become one of my Pokémon!" \rThink about it, ok? Hehe."\bRed: ... ...""\b... ... ... ... ... ... ..."\b... ... ... ... ... ..."\bRed: ... ... ..."\bWords are unnecessary!"l\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied till now."[\rI'm sure we've both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."r\rWould you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become.">\rRoxanne: You were flawless. I still have much to learn."P\rI want to learn even more from you. Will you be my opponent then as well?"9\bBrawly: Huge wave incoming! Look out! Right on it!"b\bChurned by the rough waves of the seas, toughened by the cave of the outskirts. I'm Brawly!";\bYou want a challenge? Let's see what you're made of."C\bBrawly: Whoa. Wow! You made a bigger splash than I expected."m\bYour talent brings forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"<\bWattson: Ah-ha! Fine young soul. Brimming with vigor."H\bI know what you want. You want to battle my Pokémon! Wahahahaha!"B\bI'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"f\bWattson: Wahaha. You ended up giving me a thrill! I'm so impressed that I can't help but laugh!"H\bI swell with optimism, seeing a promising young Trainer like you!"a\rFlannery: Welcome... No, puny trainer! I see you've made it here to look for capable foes!"r\rUh... dare not underestimate me, I shall, uh... demonstrate the hot moves I have honed with my grandfather!")\rBrace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"v\rFlannery: Your strength sure reminds me of my grandfather. I guess I was trying too hard to be someone I'm not."\\rWhen I don't act like myself, no wonder Pokémon that battle at my side get confused."u\bNorman: Well, the world of Pokémon is deep. I honestly think that no amount of training would ever be enough."E\bBut there's no challenge for me to battle a greenhorn Trainer!"W\bSo you'd better give it your best shot. I will do everything in my power to win!"O\bNorman: You did a great job. You went all out and earned that victory..."D\bI want my kid to learn from you. Hope you will meet him soon."B\rWinona: I'm one with the birds and have soared the skies..."C\rHowever grueling, we have triumphed with elegance and grace."Q\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"U\rWinona: I see you are one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."T\rI know you'll keep aiming higher and higher! That's what brought you victory."Z\bTate: Heh heh heh... Were you surprised? \rLiza: Tee hee hee... Were you surprised?"D\bWe don't need to talk..... \r....because we can each tell...."?\b....what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"4\bThis combinations of ours! \rCan you beat it?"f\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...far stronger than ours. We can tell."D\bWe will meet again someday.... \r...we are very sure of that."j\bJuan: It seems you have a compelling reason to battle me. Did you know that I am a retired trainer?"_\bI had given up my position as Gym Leader once. I had entrusted everything to my student."�\bBut enough chatter. I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"k\bJuan: Like the finest music, the battles we made together strikes chords of inspiration in my heart."U\bI close my eyes, and I see visions of you soaring. A certain sign of nobility!"c\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties are made of!"e\bYou can also talk all you want, but offense over defense! All that matters is how strong I am!"h\bNow I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"c\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. It's a long way, but you've got what it takes."Y\bAnd when you gain new strength, come back here! No holds barred. No hard feelings!"}\rPhoebe: Uh-huh.. Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute.... Hi! My friend's saying you are looking for me."s\rYou can't see her? Ahahaha. Of course. She is a ghost, and I am one of the few able to communicate with her."c\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"k\rPhoebe: There's definitely a stronger bond between you and your team. It's only natural that I lost."Z\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring shame to us by losing!"k\rGlacia: I've traveled afar, so that I can hone my icy skills. But all I have seen are weak trainers."R\rWhat about you? It would please me to no end if you could go all out on me."8\rI wonder what are you going to show me. Bring it."l\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning high that my icy moves pale in comparison."Y\rDon't be complacent. If you feel the need to cool your emotions, come to me again."v\bDrake: In their natural state, Pokémon are wild living things. They can help us, hinder us, and they are free."i\bFor us to battle with Pokémon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"4\bIf you don't, you will never prevail over me!"f\bDrake: You deserve every bit of credit for coming this far. You do seem to know what is needed."|\bYes, a true virtuous heart. It is through that that Pokémon learn right from wrong. The influence helps them grow strong!"{\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like you?"H\bWhat has awakened in you? I want you to hit me with it all of it!"\bBring me your best shot!"p\bSteven: Congratulations! The feelings you have... and the Pokémon that responded with all their might..."n\bThey came together as one, and created an even greater power. And thus, you were able to grasp victory!"�\bWallace: At times your Pokémon should dance like a spring breeze, at others they should strike like lightning. I want to feel bedazzled by your performance!"�\bWho can most elegantly dance with their Pokémon? Who can exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?""\bShow me right here and now!"\\bWallace: Bravo! I realize now your authencity and magnificence as a Pokémon Trainer."C\bI find much joy in having met you and your Pokémon. Encore!"x\bWally: N-nice to meet you! I'm Wally. My Pokémon and I are always moving together, little by little, day by day!"O\bI'm sure that you and your Pokémon must have had to overcome a lot too."k\bMy Pokémon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"�\bWally: Arghhhh!!! Hah... you. Thank you for not holding back. I feel like I've been able to take another step forward thanks to you."b\bLook out! One day... I swear I'll catch up to you! That's a promise I intend to live up to!"A\rMay: Heeeeeeey! How's it going? I'm May! Glad to meet you!"~\rMy dream is to become friends with Pokémon all over the world! I want to understand everything about you and your Pokémon!"O\rWould you show me all your Pokémon in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"X\rMay: Ohoho, wow, you did it! You defeated me, but I have learnt so much from you!"T\rYou make me feel passionate about getting stronger, maybe next time I'll win!":\bBrendan: Huh, hi. Name's Brendan. Nice to meet you!"t\bMy dream is to become a better Pokémon Trainer! I want to learn even more and become stronger than I am now!"r\bWith you being here, you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"M\bBrendan: Hmmm... I didn't seem to have it together this time. Oh well!"@\bI'll have to try harder next time! You can count on that!"c\rViola: That determined expression... That glint in your eye says you're up to the challenge."|\rIt's fantastic! Whether it's the tears of frustration that follow a loss or the blossoming of joy that comes with victory."Y\rBoth are great subjects for my camera! Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"{\rViola: The world you see through a lens, and the world you see with a Pokémon by your side, can look entirely different."V\rYou and your Pokémon have shown me a whole new depth of field! Just fantastic!"}\bGrant: I've been waiting in eager anticipation for a worthy challenger! It's quite an achievement to participate here."f\bVery impressive, actually. I have a feeling that our battle will turn out to be worth the wait!"N\bI hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."V\bGrant: There are some things that seem out of reach no matter how hard you try."Z\bHowever, it's important that you never give up, no matter the opponent or the odds!"_\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance! Just kidding! Nice to meet you!"{\rI was doing some special training with my Lucario when all of a sudden, it was drawn in by your aura and dashed off here."P\rI think Lucario wants to battle with you. Would you accept our challenge?"\\rKorrina: Oh! I have been defeated! Alack, alay! Lady Korrina gave a terrible display."A\rWhat an explosive display of strength, far exceeding mine."�\bRamos: Ho ho! I may not look it, but I'm the best green fingers yer could meet. If yeh want to know about plants, I'm yer man."k\bSo what'd yer think, whippersnapper? Did yeh enjoy the greenery along your path to being a Champion?"V\bTheir survival is a sign of their strength. Yer sure yer up to facing all that?"g\bRamos: Yer believe in yer Pokémon... And they believe in yer, too... Strength like mighty oaks."R\bIt was a fine battle, young sprout. Yeh sure can't force a true friendship."V\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokémon battles how I like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"{\bAnd Pokémon sure are mysterious... Even as far as science has come, there's still so much we don't know about them."[\bNonetheless, let's both do our best in battle. The future is now, thanks to science!"o\bClemont: There's no shame in losing. I'm glad I get to learn something new thanks to strong challengers."�\bBut what I'm trying to do is just to enjoy everyday to the fullest with my Pokémon, while exploring the science that I love with my inventing."g\rValerie: Oh, if it isn't a young trainer. You've come fluttering down to me on a fortunate wind."l\rThen I suppose you have earned yourself the right to battle me. I hope it proves entertaining to you."_\rThe elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."F\rValerie: Yes. A fine battle. Victory is captivating, is it not?"a\r... ... ... Ah... Forgive me. I was so captivated, I forgot for a moment that it is yours."N\rOlympia: The time has arrived for us to be standing here. I am Olympia."H\rNow our paths have intertwined and crossed. Our Pokémon as well."J\rThis is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"j\rOlympia: A testament of your skill. Proof of your power. A symbol of trust. Your Pokémon obey you."<\rCountless stars light your way forth. Have no limits."x\bWulfric: Y'know what? Ice is both extremely hard and terribly fragile at the same time. You know what that means?"|\bDepending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."u\bBut that's all right. That's how it should be! Anyway, enough of my rambling! Let's get this show on the road!"w\bWulfric: Impressive! Your Pokémon fought with great courage. I can tell that you've trained your Pokémon well."s\bYour Pokémon really threw everything they had into that battle just now. You truly are something, you know?"c\rMalva: You're the illustrious one, are you? People know me as the Fire Pokémon user, Malva."h\rDo your best, because if you can't impress me with your real strength, you'll never get far here."g\rBut it should be a walk in the park for you, right? I'm burning up with my hatred for you, runt!"�\rMalva: Oooh, you wicked little Trainer! You're just too much, you know? You're so amusing that I just want to burn you up where you stand!"G\rBut I'll let you live... I will definitely remember this battle!"�\bSiebold: You there! Young lad! I have a question I must pose to you. Do you think Pokémon battling can ever be worthy of being called an art?"u\bYou see, cooking is the type of art that disappears as soon as it is completed. Pokémon battles are the same."i\bTo devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."~\bSiebold: Devote yourself entirely, so even that which will fade and disappear is ingrained forever upon your heart and mind!"�\bIt is the duty of both Trainers and Chefs to find the good in any raw materials they have to work with. There lies the answer to reaching ever higher."e\bWikstrom: Well met, young challenger! Verily am I the famed blade of hardened steel, Wikstrom!"_\bWith my magnificent Pokémon at my side, I will reveal the scope of Trainer achievement!"_\bLet us both give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"�\bWikstrom: What sweet, glorious pain and joy now rock my mighty heart? My will, which even shakes spears, trembles at so fine a battle as this!"j\bWhat now? I am undone! Good knight, you are indeed my equal, and worthy to proceed this lofty hall!"u\rDrasna: Oh goodness, hello to you! Welcome, welcome. You must be a strong Trainer. That's just wonderful news!"c\rWhen I was growing up, my grandparents raised me on tales of the Pokémon of time and space."�\rIt's really thanks to those stories that I decided to become a Dragon type Trainer. Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"S\rDrasna: Oh, you! You're too much! You and your Pokémon are simply charming!"F\rWith your Pokémon, I'm sure you can beat every last one of us."y\rDiantha: Welcome trainer. Since I’m an actress, sometimes people will talk to me because they’re fans of mine!"�\rOften, they’ll say that watching me act gave them courage or cheered them up! But I also get a lot of energy from my fans when I meet them!"�\rYou know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."{\rDiantha: I-I'm so choked up that it's hard to know what I should say, but I... I... I'm just so glad at this moment."`\rAfter all, it gave me the chance to meet and battle with you and your wonderful Pokémon!"@\rShauna: Hey hey! Nice to meet you! Did you have fun here?"y\rHey, do you know what's about to happen? That's right! We're going to battle! We ARE Pokémon Trainers, after all!"h\rI'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"J\rShauna: I'm so glad I went on a journey. I made some great friends."{\rI was able to visit many places, meet a lot of nice people, and make many wonderful memories! I bet you are the same too!"v\bTierno: All right! Nice to meetcha! Y'know, it'd feel like we were closer if we called each other by nicknames."9\bCan I call you Jammy? Hahaha! Alright, lighten up!"z\bAnyway, can we have a Pokémon battle? Oh, uh... sorry to just throw that at you. But that's why we're here, right?"A\bTierno: That's awesome, it makes me wanna dance right now!"M\bThat display of strength makes me wanna groove and spin in excitement!"b\bTrevor: Um, hi. I'm Trevor. My dream is to see all kinds of Pokemon the world has to offer!"[\bTherefore I'm on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas."9\bThat doesn't mean I can't battle though. Let's go!"U\bTrevor: There is still so much I don't know. Do I just not have what it takes?"I\bOh, so you can't learn everything just from the Pokédex... I see!"d\rSerena: Hi there! My name's Serena. I turn my friendship with my Pokémon into pure strength!"Y\rYou are special. I feel like the friendship we have with our Pokémon connects us."V\rWoohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!"^\rSerena: Everyone has their own good points. That’s true of people and Pokémon alike!"t\rI’ve definitely noticed what your good points are! I’ll bet you anything your Pokémon have noticed, too."\\bCalem: Hi, I'm Calem. I'm gonna keep pushing forward till I'm the strongest I can be!"\bI think it would be fun to compete to see who's stronger. But we can't call it a competition unless I beat you at least once!"3\bAll right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"|\bCalem: You're one of my best opponents! You might come up with new strategies that'll help battles go a lot smoother."U\bBefore you ask, no, I'm not going to tell you what strategies I use next time!"�\bIlima: Greetings! I couldn't help but observe your battles. You looked so very delightful in battle that I had no choice but to summon you here."v\bI must admit, I've been wondering about you. I look forward to seeing the brilliance of your moves in my trial."Q\bVery well then! Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!"Z\bIlima: You, or should I say you and your Pokémon, make quite the interesting team!"P\bI'll be feeling the aftershocks from that battle for a long time to come."|\rLana: Hello. I'm Lana. I used to go fishing a lot with my twin sisters, so you could also say it's one of my talents!"a\rYou look like an able-bodied Trainer. We could go fishing for wild Pokémon together then!"R\rBut more important than that… I will show you what a serious Lana can do!"V\rLana: Phew... that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"Z\rIt seems I was too early to think that my full power would be enough to defeat you."�\bKiawe: The name's Kiawe. My Marowak and I are students of the ancient dances that have been passed down in Alola for generations."h\bI'll fully display the vaunted dancing of my Pokémon! Win or lose, there's never enough dancing!"r\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing else makes me want to battle more!"V\bYes... That's exactly the sort of intense training that made me who I am today."}\rMallow: Hey! Thanks for coming! Have you had breakfast yet? I've got a Super Mallow Special for you, if you're hungry!"q\rYou aren't? OK. But remember to take a break here and there. A Pokémon master doesn't always go hustling."s\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! Let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"s\rMallow: Awwww, I lost. Guess now I'll have to get my Grass-type Pokémon to make me feel all better again..."P\rAnd if you're hungry next time, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"d\bSophocles: Hi, I'm not really the greatest around other people. When people stare at me, I..."�\bYou may not have noticed, but I just fainted, like, three times... I'm trying really hard to get used to other people looking at me."_\bUm! If you have some time, could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling me?"`\bSophocles: I'm shy... and I've certainly felt lonely before, but I'm great with robotics."]\bWhat? You're interested in how machines are constructed? Why didn't you say so sooner?"x\rMina: Oh! Please pose over there. Yes! Fantastic! Now that's a great composition! I could paint a picture of you!"~\rGuess I didn't introduce myself though. I'm Mina, a painter. I mean, I sort of am, actually just wander around doing my art."I\rMaybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"Y\rMina: Hrmmm! Bueno, esto es frustrante. No logré sacar de verdad todo mi poder..."�\rI'd like to draw a picture of the way you look when you're battling! Let's have another full-power Pokémon battle again sometime, yeah?"�\rLillie: Nice to meet you! My name's Lillie. Starting the day off with a warm smile and a greeting always puts me in a great mood!"h\rThere are trainers here who come to challenge you to battles, so you can’t let your guard down!"G\rI'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"Z\rLillie: Ugh, you got us. I wish we'd had a little more time to prepare. That's all."W\rWell, moping around won't fix anything, will it? Come on, let's try to cheer up!"o\bNanu: You there, if do you wanna take this spot? I'd like to go home. I just wanna take it easy, y'know."y\bYou're here to challenge me? What a hassle, crud. This is bad news. Well, I can't just ignore something like this."^\bDon't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."�\bNanu: I'm an old man. I try not to have dreams anymore. As long as young kids like you enjoy yourselves, that's all I can ask for."Q\bTrying to get even stronger is fine, too... But that's a really long path."M\rHapu: Alola! This is how we greet people in my hometown every morning."�\rIt is good to wake up early! You should make the most of the time you have! Having to tend to the fields every morning has made me an early riser."V\rLooks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."b\rHapu: Yes. It's unfortunate that we lost, but I guess we'll just have to cheer for you now."J\rYou are undoubtedly a prodigious Trainer. You did an admirable job."�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock-types. We'll grind you to dust."c\rOur skills are so polished, they're sparkling. I'm starting to feel like a polished diamond."P\rYou can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"T\rOlivia: Diamonds only sparkle after the coal is pushed to its absolute limit."T\rI think your journey will hold many surprises. I hope it holds many joys too."`\rKahili: Hi, I am a professional golfer and a trainer. I aim to perfect my skills as both."�\rI aim to make my matches entertaining for the spectators. Besides, I enjoy playing the games that the audience enjoys watching."[\rLet's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"O\rKahili: Whew! Battling with you was like a refreshing breeze! Thank you."\\rOh, are you interested in golf too? You could be talented. I'd be happy to teach you."b\bMolayne: Hi, I was observing the stars until you came up... yawn... I'm still super sleepy."w\bIt’s been a while since I’ve walked around in a new place and met so many new people. It’s a nice feeling."P\bNow I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"r\bMolayne: In every situation, you pick the best moves and items. So I too have to rack my brain in battle..."?\bBut you outsmarted me in the end. You're second to none!"h\rAcerola: Hiya, I'm Acerola! I know I don't look it, but my family used to pretty much be royalty."{\rI love reading! Books can take us on journeys to fantastical worlds and tell the stories of people far away from us."J\rMaybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"M\rAcerola: Phew! Well, there goes my hope of beating you to smithereens."u\rI hope we can keep doing fun things together! There's a whole world of exciting things for us to do out there!"X\bHala: Dooot doo doo, just a kahuna on a stroll. Oh, a rare visitor! Hi, I'm Hala."i\bYou’ll meet people and Pokémon... and may sometimes encounter some things that can’t be seen."g\bThe more you think about these things, the stronger your mind and body will become! Let's clash!"r\bHala: ...Hmmph! This result comes as no surprise to me. What a fine Trainer... and what fine Pokémon, too!"x\bA heart-pounding battle like that always sends a shiver through my whole body! I'm sure my Pokémon felt it, too!"w\bHau: Hey, I'm Hau. Nice to meet you! I don't know anything about this place, so everything is so cool and fresh!"d\bBattles aren't about whether you win or lose. They're about whether you have the will to win!"2\bI wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"{\bHau: We managed to pull off something pretty amazing, when my partners and I were all in sync and wanting the same thing."Z\bBut looks like we're still one step away from being the strongest Trainer and team!"J\bGladion: What does a Pokémon Trainer really need to be successful?"i\bI trained for a long time trying to figure that out. I guess everyone might have their own answer."D\bBut at least for me... I want the strongest rival for myself."?\bGladion: I didn't beat you, but it was still worth it..."�\bAt the very least, I can appreciate your strength a lot more now than I could've before. Thanks. You've helped make us stronger."^\rSelene: Alola! I’m Selene, there's been nonstop excitement ever since I arrived here!"[\rLet’s be so energized today that we shine even brighter than the sun and the moon!",\rI'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"[\rSelene: Aww, that's a shame. But I'm lucky to be able to experience this excitement!"C\rJust thinking about it makes me want to challenge you again!"i\bElio: Alola! My name’s Elio. Isn't it amazing that someone was able to make something this huge?"\\bThis club is pretty tough, but we make lots of lifelong memories by going through it."6\bI’d be happy to show you what I'm capable of."7\bElio: Whoa! You're strong. Looking great, buddy!"u\bThe strength of friendship, being kind, having fun... Maybe I should say... we all got stronger together, huh?"-\rMisty: Aiyeee! That makes me so angry!":\bBack to brushin' up. You keep goin' like lightning!"Q\bBlaine: Impressive! You have shown your wits and knowledge to overcome me."Q\bMakes me all fired up for more! Be passionate! Feel the burning curiosity!"f\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"W\bThey have not faced my magnificent wings that have taken me to greatest heights!"Y\bI'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"<\bFalkner: A defeat is a defeat. You are strong indeed."T\bAs long as I have lofty ambitions, I can fly as far as I want. Just like you!"H\bBugsy: You seems like a trainer with great knowledge in Pokémon."x\bBut I never lose when it comes to Bug-type Pokémon. My research is going to make me an autoridad expert of them!"<\bLet me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."N\bBugsy: Bug-type Pokémon are deep. There are many mysteries to explore."g\bBut I should start my studies of other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."M\rWhitney: Hi! I'm Whitney. Pokémon are super-cute! Don't you think so?"C\rAnd since I am super-cute too, I am definitely good at this!"T\rYou want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!",\rWhitney: Waaaaaaahhhhhhh! You meanie!"M\rSniff... Don't think that this is over. I will get stronger next time!"E\bMorty: Good of you to have come; I can see what others cannot."[\bAnd just a bit more... I would be a truly powerful trainer, worthy of meeting Ho-oh."O\bShow me the power you possess. You're going to help me reach that level!"f\bMorty: I don't think our potentials are so different. But you seem to have something I don't..."i\bIf I battle with you next time, I will be able to see something new again... I look forward to it."d\bChuck: WAHAHAH! So you've come to train under my wing? No? Then you just spoiled my training!"\\bLet me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"Z\bWhat? It has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"B\bChuck: Losing to a kid. The next generation is doing great."P\bBut a loss is a loss! From now on, I'm going to train 24 hours every day!"[\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokémon? Regardless of their appearance?"v\rS-steel type Pokémon are hard, cold, sharp and really strong... but they yearn for gentle love and care too..."5\rUm... I'm not lying. May I prove it to you...?"F\rJasmine: Y-you are well-polished, in both skill and kindness..."Q\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokemon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokemon, alike humans, have seen many experiences and suffering in our lives."C\bSince I am your elder, let me teach you what I mean by that."M\bPryce: Impressive prowess. It's rare to find a Trainer as good as you."U\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokemon."n\rClair: The audacity to look me in the eye. You are looking at the world's best Dragon-type Master here."e\rI can hold my own even against Elite Four members. To think you have the guts to challenge me.";\rI will use my full power against you. Let's do this!"V\rClair: What?! Here to brag about your victory? Fine. Congratuations! Happy now?"]\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is it that I lack of."[\bWill: Welcome, you and Fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."]\bI have trained all around the world, to reach where people have acknowledged my might."?\bLet me put on this show to convince you as well. Behold!"b\bWill: I have observed your techniques - you're the best without a doubt. I have no regrets.";\bThis battle will go down in history. I'm sure of it."d\bKoga: Fwahahaha! So you found me, the one who lives in shadow. It makes me shiver with mirth."k\bMy intricate style will confound and destroy you. The true terrors are not merely about brute force."I\bPrepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon..."m\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills."L\bI am looking forward to see you put your abilities to the test again."H\bBruno: Extreme training results in unleashing untapped potential."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So are you one of the strongest trainers around here?"T\bNevermind, I am challenging you! Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"D\bBruno: You are still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."Q\bI have no other words. Do not trouble yourself on my behalf. Move forward!"<\rKaren: What now? You wanna challenge me? How amusing."e\rIf you have not heard of them, I'm known for my overpowering tactics. Think you can handle me?"&\rTry me. Entertain me. Let's go."n\rKaren: There are no such thing as weak Pokemon. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."[\rI like your style. You know what's important. Hit me up whenever you are free again."�\bRoark: I'm but one Trainer who decided to walk proudly with Rock-type Pokémon. Everyday, we toughen ourselves by digging up Fossils."o\bCould I show you how tough we are? I need to see the toughness of the Pokémon that battle with you too!"\bThis'll be rocking!"X\bRoark: We lost control there. With skill like yours, it's natural for you to win."f\bNext time, I'd like to challenge you to a Fossil-digging race underground in the Sinnoh region!"z\rGardenia: I can't deny that Grass-types have many weak points, but that's not the only factor in deciding who wins!"q\rMy Pokémon are growing good and strong. You can't go wrong with me! Come on, let's cut to the good stuff!"6\rLet's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"Q\rGardenia: How are you feeling? I wanted to win and brag about my Pokémon."L\rI try to be as tough as I can, but you are the victor today. Amazing!"{\rMaylene: Nice to see you. I don't really know what it means to be strong, but I will do the best I can as a Trainer."A\rThanks to my training, I'm slowly gaining more confidence."B\rI also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"V\rMaylene: Learn from your foe by wininng, and learn from your foe by losing too."J\rYes, everything is an experience. I've still got some room to grow!"k\bCrasher Wake: The ring is my rolling sea~ The towering waves shaped me~ Crash! Crash! Crasher Wake~!"\bMy Pokémon were toughened up by stormy white waters! They'll take everything you throw at them and then pull you under!"8\bVictory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"P\bCrasher Wake: Hwah! It's come and gone! How do I say this... I want more!"v\bI have fun battling, regardless if I win or lose! I hope your victories will put more smiles on people's faces!"t\rFantina: Ah, oui, are you here for a challenge? I hope very much you enjoy them, you seem to be très strong."H\rBut win I shall, non? Because moi is of course très fantastique!"P\rEnfin, so it shall be. I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."V\rFantina: Excusè moi! Dumbfounded! Très très strong! Your power so admirable!"j\rMerci beacoup, for having this dance with moi! If ever you have time, see moi again, ok? Au revoir!"a\bBryon: Trainer! You're young, just like my son Roark, on the quest to challenge the world."�\bWith more Trainers like you taking charge, the future of the Pokémon world is bright! But as a wall to you youngsters, I'm not stepping aside just yet!"U\bI'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to withstand all your attacks!"d\bByron: Gwahahaha! You were strong enough to take down my prized team. I recognize your power."N\bI saw something great in you. Do show your power to other Trainers too!"\\rCandice: You're going to be my opponent? Sure thing! I was waiting for someone tough!"D\rBut I should tell you, I'm tough because I know how to focus."9\rI'll show you just what I mean. Get ready to lose!"p\rCandice: Wow! You're great! You've earned my respect! I think your focus and will bowled us over totally!"9\rBut next time I'll focus even more and won't lose!"d\bVolkner: Sigh... Alright. It's not often that I get challengers. But they've all been boring."^\bI didn't break a sweat beating them all. But anyway, I guess we'd better get this done."M\bI hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."a\bVolkner: ...Hehehe. Hahahah! ...That was the most fun I've had since... I don't know when!"[\bIt makes me excited to know you and your team will keep battling at greater heights!"Y\bAaron: Hello! It's good to meet you! I should explain that I'm a huge fan of bugs."g\bThey might be nasty and mean, but they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"O\bI want to become perfect, just like my Bug Pokémon. Let me take you on!"�\bAaron: Being perfect sure is a deep and complex affair. I will concede defeat, but I think you came to see how great Bug-type Pokémon can be!"d\rBertha: Well, well. You're quite the adorable one, but you've got a spine. Ahaha! I'm Bertha."S\rI have a preference for Ground-type Pokémon. Vast, wide and ever-embracing."B\rWell, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"t\rBertha: You're quite something, youngster. I like how you and your Pokémon earned the win by working as one."W\rThat's what makes you so strong. Ahahaha! I think you can go as far as you want."�\bFlint: Yo! The name's Flint! Battles are clashes of the burning spirits of Pokémon, they ain't about appearances or what's weak or strong."�\bIt's about whether combatants can burn hot or not! I could feel your fiery spirits! Let me tell ya, my heart's always on fire!"1\bAll right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"z\bFlint: Why I oughta...! I don't believe it! I lost! I didn't take you for granted... But I didnt expect you to win!"C\bI'm blown away by this! You and your Pokémon are hot stuff!"[\bLucian: Ah, you timed your arrival well. I've just finished reading a book, you see."\bAllow me to introduce myself. I am Lucian, a user of the Psychic-type. You've proven yourself to be outstanding getting here."W\bSo I'm afraid I will have to go all out against you to live up to my reputation."Q\bLucian: The highs and lows. You are as remarkable as the book I just read."_\bPlease go through the exit to your right, while I'll be reading books to calm my nerves."e\bCilan: Um. My name is Cilan. I like Grass-type Pokémon, they are always so deep and profound."]\bWould you like to take part in a match against me? There's still much to learn for me."Q\bNothing personal... No hard feelings... We're gonna battle, come what may."{\bCilan: What a surprise... You're very strong, aren't you? I guess my brothers wouldn't be able to defeat you either."]\bI'm glad I was at least able to bring out the delectable charm of Grass-type Pokémon."j\bChili: Listen up! My name is Chili! I light things up with Fire-type Pokémon, like habanero tacos!"W\bThat's that, then! I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokémon can do!">\bYou're fired up too, right? Get ready for the scorcher!"B\bChili: Whoa ho! You're on fire! You scorched everyone, huh?"H\bBut you have to hand it to me for putting up a good fight, right?"|\bCress: Pleased to make your acquaintance, I'm Cress, a specialist in Water-type Pokémon. They're refreshing as I like it."k\bIt shall be my esteemed Pokémon and I that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"Y\bJust as water flowing from high places to low places is natural, so is my victory."s\bCress: How amazing! Even if there were a lot of reasons, you managed to take on someone as impressive as me!"c\bI plan on retraining myself with the aim of defeating you after you've become even stronger!"h\rLenora: Welcome! You came all the way out here now! Don't be shy! You're too young to be bashful!"y\rWhen I was little, my dad would always bring home bones he dug up. I was very captivated by what they were before!"|\rNow I'm also going to research how you battle with the Pokémon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"W\rLenora: Your fighting style is so enchanting. It's charming. I'm glad I met you!"]\rBattling is second nature to you, isn't it? Your victory is the result of that, right?"o\bBurgh: Ah ha! Lights on! My Bug-type Pokémon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"t\bIf the battle brings out the beauty in my mates, it will be a scene that makes my heart flutter, win or lose."�\bMhm... I feel like I can paint a picture unlike any before. OK! I can hear my battle muse loud and clear. Let's get straight to it!"h\bBurgh: Aww... I lost. Whatever! Losing to you doesn't bug me, because you are a-MAZ-ingly strong."C\bWin or lose, Bug-type Pokémon are still cool and beautiful."�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my stage! My beloved Pokémon and your Pokémon shall compete."Y\rC'est fini! When I'm certain of that, I feel an electric jolt run through my body!"a\rI want to feel the sensation, so now my beloved Pokémon are going to make your head spin!"_\rElesa: My, oh my... You have a sweet fighting style. You shocked me through and through."}\rI want my Pokémon to bathe in the glamourous spotlight too. In that sense, your Pokémon were gleaming very brightly!"k\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they've been talkin' about, huh."r\bHow much stronger ya get comes from how much ya want to win! If ya want ta win, don't make excuses! Got it?"v\bIf yer gotta bellyache, just forget 'bout fightin'! Well, I might be fussin' 'bout nothing when it comes to ya."{\bClay: Fer such a young 'un, ya have an imposin' battle style. I wonder what kind a journey ya had that made ya so strong."@\bBut, I still don't like losin'! Come here again, alrite'?"\rSkyla: Hee-hee! I've been waiting for you. You're a tough trainer who can face the wind and not get blown off your feet!"j\rSo this is going to be a showdown that decides who's at the top, right? I love being at the summit!"^\rYou can see for miles and miles from high places! So how about you and I have some fun?":\rSkyla: You're a pretty amazing trainer, aren't you?"l\rMy Pokémon and I are happy, because for the first time in a while, we fought with our full strength."V\bBrycen: Pleased to meet you. I'm Brycen. In the past, I was hurt and depressed."e\bThen someone shared this with me... There is strength in being with other people and Pokémon."}\bReceiving their support makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."B\bBrycen: You are strong! No, both you and your Pokémon are."T\bThe stars of this show, this story, were you and your Pokémon. You did well."j\rRoxie: You don't do anything! What do you know~?! You don't do anything! How're you gonna change~?!"Y\rI've got you covered~! I'm gonna give you a toxic shock and open up your mind~!!!!"T\rI'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"g\rRoxie: You didn't win! I just lost! I was weak and make my Pokémon feel how much losing stinks!"W\rWatch out~! Next time we meet, I'm going to give you a toxic shock as promised~!"u\bCheren: Do you want to show how strong you are by winning, or do you want to learn what battling really means?"�\bEven if hurt, my Pokémon will fight for me with just one command. I think you'll value and trust your Pokémon more if you keep that fact close to your heart."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal realtionship between Pokémon and people!"�\bCheren: I'll keep battling many trainers and Pokémon like this, and if I can learn what kind of person I am, it'll open up my path."�\bI'm sure this path will lead me to become the person I'm meant to be. Pokémon will always be with you and me as our path goes."~\bDrayden: As a trainer, I've simply been pursing greater strength. But now I am aging, thinking about the time I have left..."U\bWhat I'm searching for now is a young trainer who can show me a bright future."t\bLet's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokémon with."K\bDrayden: Wonderful. I'm grateful we had a chance to meet and battle."K\bMake a bright future, not just for yourself, but for others as well."U\bMarlon: Uihaa~ Sup! So I'm facing you! That's a good catch right off the wall."g\bI'm strong like the ocean's wide. You're gonna get swept away, fo' sho'. Eh, that's enough talk."G\bHow 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"J\bMarlon: You don't just look strong, you're a deep threat fo' reals!"m\bJust like a ragin' sea that washes everythin' away! Uihaa~ I was swept away by your might and passion!"o\bGrimsley: Man oh man... Challengers coming one by one. Well, no matter, life is a serious battle anyway."x\bIt's more important to master the cards you're holding than to complain about the ones your opponents were dealt."u\bWhat will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."�\bGrimsley: Whether you get to fight at full strength, or whether Lady Luck is smiling on you. Where there's a winner, there's also a loser."R\bA loss is a loss. Right now, you and your Pokémon are shining brilliantly."�\rShauntal: The trainer's thoughts with the Pokémon's mind... That's part of a novel I wrote. I absolutely love writing about Pokémon!"u\rBeginnings are important, whether in a good novel or a good battle. Oh, excuse me. You're a challenger, right?"8\rWould you like to be the subject of my new novel?"^\rShauntal: Do you ever feel like you're lost for words when something greatly moves you?"t\rI'm a writer, but right now I'm having trouble putting my feelings into words. You were just that impressive!"H\bMarshal: My name is Marshal, the No. 1 pupil of my mentor, Alder."y\bIn order to master the art of fighting, I've kept training. You're also walking a similar path with your Pokémon."X\bIt is my intention to test you to take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"v\bMarshal: There is no single strongest Pokémon or best combination. That's why it is difficult to keep winning."t\bHowever, I think a heart that desires strength is a precious ideal. I respect you, because you have it. Whew!"L\rCaitlin: Who are you? How uncouth you are to disturb my sleep. Hmf..."y\rYou appear to possess a combination of strength and kindness. What I look for in my opponent is superb strength..."]\rVery well. Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. We clear?"f\rCaitlin: Winning is important, but what's more important is whether I've done better this time."t\rI want to improve and win more elegantly, so I invite you to be my opponent again in the future, if you wish."U\bBenga: You! Yeah! I knew it, you smell tough! But do you know how strong I am?"`\bHey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokémon haven't been through enough!"?\bWe'll see who's stronger! Let's try hard to be the best!"u\bBenga: So exciting! You and your Pokémon's combination! What amazing teamwork! You can go anywhere with that!"|\bHey! Hey!! You better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"U\rLana: Phew...that was fantastic! You and your Pokémon were perfectly in sync!"m\bKiawe: Astounding! Being thrilled by an opponent's excitement... Nothing makes me want to battle more!"w\rI use my chef's intuition to pick out the cream of the crop! And let's get cooking into the heat of battle then!"Q\rAnd next time if you are hungry, don't be shy! Step on up and have a bite!"�\rOlivia: Why hello there. Nice to meet you all, I'm Olivia. My partners are adorable, rugged little Rock- type. We'll grind you to dust."H\rBianca: Ahhh, did I reach here a little late again? So-oooo-orry!"|\rKnow what? When I traveled to various regions, so many things happened to me, but I'm so glad I went on that journey!"i\rIt's hard to put into words, but I want to express this feeling through my Pokémon. Let's battle!"p\rBianca: Thank you for being my opponent! Yep! I learned a lot on how to bring out the best from everyone!"<\rOh, I almost forgot! Congratulations on your victory!"BUnlucky! You still get some Grandeur Club Credits for trying."You got \v[61] credits."Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don’t expect to be forgiven. I’m simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Titan Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Titan Challenge."u\bFalkner: People say wings can be clipped with a jolt of electricity... I won't allow such insults to my birds!"b\bBut I should start studying other Pokémon too. I'm grateful that you made me realize that."E\bMorty: Good of you to have come, I can see what others cannot."\\bWhat? That has nothing to do with Pokémon? That's true! Come on, we shall do battle!"R\rUm... I don't know how to say this, but thank you for loving your Pokémon."�\bPryce: I have been training since before you were even born. Pokémon, alike humans, have had many experiences and suffering in our lives."Z\bWhen the snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."Z\rGeez. You are a mysterious trainer, but you made me realise what is is that I lack."[\bWill: Welcome, you and fate have chosen me. Allow me to introduce myself. I am Will."u\bKoga: I have subjected you to everything I could muster. But my efforts failed. I must hone my skills further."e\bI see no fear in you. You're determined. So, you're one of the strongest trainers around here?"C\bBruno: You're still standing firm. My challenge's satisfied."�\rKaren: Strong Pokémon. Weak Pokémon. That is only the selfish perception of people. Truly skilled trainers would win with their loved ones."W\bLance: I am the leader of Elite Four. You can call me Lance, the Dragon Trainer."n\bDragons are mythical, sacred creatures. They're hard to catch and raise, but their powers are superior!"M\bLance: No more words. It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"N\bLance: I can't believe it. I am witnessing the rise of a great Trainer."x\bYour Pokémon have responded to your strong and upstanding nature. You will continue to grow stronger, won't you?"T\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong. Stop bothering me and scram."=\bI said stop noseying around. What's your purpose here?"C\bThat's it. I will use my full power against you. Then scram!"[\bSilver: I still can't win after all that training. I need to believe in my Pokémon."W\bAnyway, I am not giving up. I'll beat you next time when you come back. Move on."I\rLyra: Wooo, you have keen eyes. You look sharp compared to others."@\rYou are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!",\rAnd that's good. Let's have a battle!"?\rLyra: Awww. Guess I took the loss this time. Tough luck."G\rAnd you are really strong. You must have travelled long and far."G\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What'cha doing here? On an adventure?"c\bI'm also on a fun adventure. I can handle any obstacles, as long I have my Pokémon with me."H\bI'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!">\bEthan: Aite. You got me. That was an impressive battle!"N\bHope we get to meet up again after we finish our individual adventures!"k\bThey might be nasty and mean, but yet they're beautiful too. Would you like to take on my challenge?"~\rCynthia: When you are facing a Trainer in battle, you can learn everything about them. One look at you tells me many things."c\rWhat Pokemon they have, what moves they've taught. What items they make their Pokémon hold."I\rThere's no need for words then. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"\rCynthia: That was excellent. Truly, an outstanding battle. You gave the support your Pokémon needed to maximize their power."f\rI sincerely applaud your victory in this challenge. But the road before you is still very long."n\bBarry: Hey, you there! Yeah, you'd better watch me! Because I'm going to be the strongest Trainer ever!"C\bAnd you will be challenging me! You will be impressed by me!"@\bSend out your Pokémon now! Or I'm fining you 10 million!"W\bBarry: ...! It's alright, though. Keep getting stronger. That's what I'm saying."F\bThe more you do, the tougher my Pokémon and I get too, y'know."�\rDawn: Hey there. You and your Pokemon look close-bonded. I've always thought that people and Pokemon aren't meant to go alone."K\rThat's why I make it a point to help others when they're in trouble!"D\rLet me give you a hand to see if you can beat me and move on!"f\rDawn: Looks my Pokémon got injured a little. But no need to worry, we'll get better very soon!"O\rIf you ever need a helping hand for training, I'm your gal! Look for me!"V\bLucas: Heyo! How's your time here? At first it was a bit discouraging for me..."O\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting isn't it?"?\bNow with that said... Ready or not, let's have a go too!"H\bLucas: Turns out that you're the stronger one! That's surprising!"]\bHaving this battle pushed my senses to their limits. I need to take a nap from this..."i\bThat's right! I battle with everything to find the ideal relationship between Pokémon and people!"V\bAlder: Hello, my name's Alder. I'm a trainer with a keen interest in the world."t\bOne of my goals is to tell people about how wonderful it is to walk toward the future together with Pokémon."\bI feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"d\bAlder: Well done! The ones who change the world are always the ones who pursued their dreams."�\bWhen things don't go as you thought, silently continue to train! Someday, you will be able to battle in the way you envisioned!"S\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons!"�\rYou know what? I really look forward to having serious battles with strong trainers! They desire victory with every fiber of their being!"3\rOK! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"T\rIris: I'm upset I couldn't win! But you know what? More than that, I'm happy!"z\rI mean, come on. After this serious battle, you and I got to know one another better than before! Yep! We sure did!"n\bHugh: Hugh's here to gauge your capabilities as a Pokémon trainer. I ain't no simpleton for your info."S\bBring up your A-game now, otherwise it is back to the drawing board for you.".\bNow come at me with everything you got!"a\bHugh: Thanks to you, I accomplished what i set out to do. I wish I could've show you more."b\bYou're amazing. Get the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"Q\rHilda: Hilda's me! When it comes to Pokémon battles, you can count on me!"[\rTrust me, I'm really good at this. If you don't believe me, let's get it going then!":\rThis battle is mine to win! I won't go down easily!":\rHilda: Awwww, I gave it my all, and I still lost..."O\rBut that was really fun! Is it that late already? Time sure does fly by!"g\bHilbert: Hey. I'm Hilbert. Guess I'm one step closer to being one of the strongest trainers now."Q\bI'm sure we've come a such a long way to get to who we are today. Mmm-hmm."X\bI'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"C\bHilbert: Looks like you've got victory in your grasp, buddy!"I\bBut next time, I will give you a match worth making your jaw drop!"u\rRosa: I'm Rosa! My goal is to train hard, get stronger, and battle my heart out against all kinds of trainers!"Q\rYou've gotta do your best, so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"=\rNow, would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"^\rRosa: Hehe. That was very satisfying. You went all out and gave me a run for my effort."r\rBut it's important to stay positive, you see? Taking that first little step will really propel you forward!"P\bNate: Hey there! I'm Nate. It's great to be here, facing against you now."h\bMy opponents are getting more and more challenging. There's tons of amazing people to look up to.".\bIf it's okay with you, let's begin now!"X\bNate: This means no breaks for me! I will be training every day to better myself!"V\bIt's been a blast battling against you. You'd better be on your toes next time!""\bAllister: H-here... I go..."@\rOpal: Show me what you can do when you go all out, child."C\rMelony: You won't be able to escape when I freeze you solid!"=\bPeony: Brace yourself, I'm pretty ferocious in battle!"l\bLeon: I can feel my partners itching with anticipation... We're gonna have an absolute Champion Time!"9\bHop: Let's show everyone the greatest battle ever!"J\bVictor: My Pokémon are prepped and ready! Wanna have a taste test?"5\rGloria: Ok, I'm all pumped up and ready to go!"\\rOleana: Once I beat you to pieces, Chairman Rose will be one step closer to his goal!"Z\bRose: Show me your energy, required to keep this brilliant, glittering world alive!"X\rMai: Let's have a fun and intense battle that both of our teams can really enjoy!"6\rPalina: Without further ado, show me your team."j\bIngo: Perhaps a Pokémon battle with you would jog this memory... Would you honor me with a battle?"N\rSabi: Well, you'll get your rewards... if you can win against me first!"_\bGaeric: If you hope to accomplish victory, we must judge whether are you up to the task!"z\bBeni: You are the opponent worthy of my great ninja techniques that have been left to smolder all these long years!"O\rZisu: Show me what you can do. I will carefully observe your every move!"4\bKamado: Which of us is stronger will prevail!"]\bAdaman: Oh, I'll cut the greetings! We don't have any more time to waste! Let's begin!"F\rIrida: Let's compare what we know to see whose world is vaster."t\rCogita: This is the only time I will have to pardon myself, to further strengthen your resolve. Let's battle."p\bVolo: IT'S TIME TO CREATE A BRAND NEW WORLD! Everyone will vanish, for the forging of a NEW BETTER WORLD!"P\bBut having so many strong Trainers to face, it's also exciting, isn't it?"F\rNurse Joy: Good day, \PN. Your Pokemon looks really roughed up."/\rWould you like me to heal your Pokémon?"\rLet me help you.""\rAll's great now! Take care!"\rNo worries then."@\rNurse Joy: Sorry \PN, that's all the items I had on hand."q\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! I study Pokémon as a profession."�\bFor some people, Pokémon are pets. Other use them for fights. You need your own Pokémon for your protection, especially here."f\bBut rather than talking about it, you'll learn more from experience. Here, come battle with me!"�\bOak: So, you've won! You understand that your victory was not just your own doing. The bond you share with your Pokémon is marvelous."|\bI hope you do not neglect your Pokédex too! When it's completed, your views about Pokémon will likely have changed!"[\bGiovanni: Why... impressive of you to be here... with a dangerous figure such as me."h\bI have to warn you that this is not a place for kids like you. But since you have seen me here..."9\bFor your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"H\bGiovanni: You have a certain look... It reminds me of... someone."U\bI will tell you this now... No matter how strong you are, you'll lose someday."�\bElm: I've been waiting for you! Do you know anything about my research? As you know, Pokémon are carried in Poké Balls these days."�\bBut before the Poké Ball was invented, people used to walk with Pokémon. It could have something to do with how Pokémon grow or evolve..."R\bTell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"x\bElm: I knew you were a little different - you never cease to amaze me! Thanks to you, my research is going great!"~\bYou're looking for tougher opponents? Then keep going straight. And don't forget to thank all those who battled against you!"{\bBirch: My name is Birch. We humans live alongside Pokémon. Friendly playmates at times, cooperative workmates at others."�\bAnd sometimes, we band together and battle others like us. But despite our closeness, we don't know everything about Pokémon."w\bIn fact, there are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon, then?"c\bBirch: Yup! That's the spirit! …Arghhh! I'm getting the itch to get out and see the world!"�\bI'd love it if your world seemed wider than ever! Though I'd love it even more if you came back from time to time to show me what progress you've made."s\bMaxie: Now here I was wondering, though you are but a child, your eyes tell me of your fierce determination."}\bI am called Maxie. I stand as the head of Team Magma, and you are one of the younglings who may shape our society's future."|\bThe land exists so we humans might continue onward and upward, explore, develop, exploit, stepping into the future..."�\bThat is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"}\bMaxie: Hah... Hah... Hahhh... You've really done it, child. You've shown a power that exceeds that of the great Maxie!"�\bSplendid. Just splendid, my young Trainer. Rejecting my ideals without a second thought... And yet. I will not yield! I will not bend! My ideals will not be shaken!"g\bArchie: What do we have here? That's quite a fierce expression for such a wee little scamp. Heh!"u\bThat face tells me you're not just another mindless brat. The name's Archie, leading the Team Aqua at its top!"�\bDo you know that all life in this world depend on the sea for life? But day by day, we're all destroying our most precious resource!"�\bPokémon suffer as a result of our action. That's why I came to a decision. We, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"�\bArchie: Bwahahahahahaha! Bwaha! Well, if it isn't my little adversary! I can't even find the words to praise you as you deserve."�\bSometimes it's best to keep things simple. All I'll say is you met my expectations, scamp! But it changes nothing! I can't give up now! I can't!"�\bRowan: It's so very nice to meet you! Allow me to properly introduce myself first. My name, as you know, is Rowan. I study Pokémon."�\bAt times we play together, and at other times we work together. Some people use their Pokémon to battle and develop closer bonds with them."n\bEven now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."o\bRowan: Your last battle was splendid! It's only natural that I come and witness the your crowning glory."{\bBut the world is immense. There are many more Pokémon. That means there are many more thrills for you to seek and enjoy!"�\bCyrus: ...I see. You must be the Trainer I've been hearing about. Although I'd hardly expected to see that the foolhardy is a mere child."�\bBut, I must say... You are a remarkable specimen. Such pitifully useless emotions... Hear me! This world of ours is a crude one, it is incomplete!"�\bThe world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"n\bCyrus: I see... You are indeed strong. And the basis of your power is your compassion towards Pokémon."�\b...How wasteful... Such emotions are but mere illusions. ...But that doesn't matter. I doubt you will ever understand my position."�\rJuniper: Hi there! My name is Professor Juniper, and I am researching when and how the creatures called Pokémon came into existence."y\rThey come in many shapes and live in many different places. Living and working together, we complement each other."t\rHaving Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"~\rJuniper: I am astonished. Nice work! I bet I will hear the words from people about your blazing paths around the world!"�\rI really hope you learn what is important to you as a result, because Pokémon create chances to meet more wonderful people and Pokémon!"~\bGhetsis: My name is Ghetsis. I am here representing Team Plasma. I would like to talk to you about Pokémon liberation."�\bPokémon are subject to the selfish commands of Trainers. They are different from humans, since they contain unknown potential."t\bThat's right! We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"{\bGhetsis: My calculations... No! My careful schemes! This doesn't change my goal. My secret plans have not been disturbed!"a\bI'm absolutely perfect! I AM PERFECTION! I'm the absolute ruler who will change the world!"b\bN: Your Pokemon... Just now, it was saying... Oh, you can't hear it. How sad. My name is N."�\bSo, you've confined most of your Pokémon in Poké Balls. I'm a Trainer, too, but I can't help wondering, are Pokémon really happy that way?"V\bWell, let me hear your Pokémon's voice again! I wanna understand you. Show me!"�\bN: I never expected to hear Pokémon say such things... As long as Pokémon are confined in Poké Balls... Pokémon will never become perfect beings."�\bI have to change the world for Pokémon, because they're my friends. So, I need power... Power enough to make anyone agree with me."w\bSycamore: I am Augustine Sycamore. Hello! This world of ours is widely inhabited by creatures known as Pokémon!"f\bSome run across the plains, others fly through the skies, and others yet swim in deep oceans..."\bNow, let's all have a Pokémon battle! Your opponent shall be me and my Pokémon, lending strength to one another to victory!"b\bSycamore: Well now, you DO have a certain je ne sais quoi! I have a good feeling about you!"�\bThe strength you've found is simply marvelous! You truly love and trust your Pokémon! Treasure these moments with your partner Pokémon."�\bLysandre: You have a Pokédex; you are one of the chosen ones. I am Lysandre. I've tried to learn as much about Pokémon as I can to help build a brighter future."n\bAnd to conclude, unproductive fools are consuming our future. Team Flare needs to wipe the slate clean."�\bKnowledge is power, after all. Put it to good use. It is vital that this world becomes a better place. My desire... It is for a more beautiful world!"x\bLysandre: Excellent! But what are you really protecting? A tomorrow that will only end up being worse than today?"V\bIt's over... Fools with no vision will continue to befoul this beautiful world."V\bKukui: Hey there, nice to meet you! The name's Kukui. I hope we can be friends!"�\bI love to understand Pokemon's potential and capabilities, so I let myself get hit with all kinds of moves so I can test their power!"l\bNow, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"^\bKukui: I couldn't win even though I went all out... But what a refreshing feeling! Woo!"�\bWell, I always knew it would be a crushing defeat. I'm still glad I got to battle you. And I'm as thankful as I could be that I met you and your Pokémon!"�\bGuzma: Greetings, cowering brat! The hated boss who beats you down, and beats you down, and never lets up... Yeah. Big bad Guzma is here!"�\bWe've got all these moldy old traditions of gyms and trials, It's about time we cut out all that silly garbage and make something new for ourselves."�\bAfter all, everyone already knows who the strongest Trainer is here. Wanna see what destruction looks like? Here it is in human form - it's your boy Guzma!"C\bGuzma: I see. Great work... I guess. You had some real guts."]\bIt was \PN, right? I'll remember you... as someone I'll be happy to beat down anytime!"|\rLusamine: I am the president of the Aether Foundation. But please, just call me Lusamine. I'm so glad that we got to meet."�\rThere are people like you, who travel the islands to learn more about Pokémon. There are also unfortunate people who harm Pokémon for reasons."�\rI will be like a mother to all of those poor Pokémon and shower them with love. They will all be preserved for eternity in my collection."�\rOh, don't you worry. You just leave everything up to me. Trust me, children would all be much happier if they'd only listen to the adults around them."V\rLusamine: What a disappointment... To think that you are all so small-minded..."�\rAll that I want is my precious beasts! I don't care about any of the rest of you! Just leave. I don't need you here... I don't need you any longer!"G\rCheryl: Hello, my name's Cheryl. I'm sincerely glad to meet you."Q\rYou're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."5\rYou won't be able to tire them out one by one!"G\rCheryl: Thank you! My adorable Pokémon became a little tougher."|\rBeing a Trainer isn't easy. The more you battle, the more you discover. But, you know? I love Pokémon for that, too!"P\rMira: I'm Mira... I want to get tougher so I won't be such a scaredy-cat."<\rSo get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"F\rMira: Mira wonders if she can get very far in the Battle Tower."{\rBut It seems you are always with your Pokémon. That's how you got to be so strong. Mira is beginning to understand!"_\bRiley: I'm Riley. I'm a Trainer, and yes, it is a bit odd that I would be training here."{\bPeople training here would be those with too much time on their hands. So let's hope we can give each other a tough time!"K\bNow, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."^\bRiley: Know your enemy. If you know your opponent's Pokémon and what moves they use..."U\bIf you have intelligence like that, your chances of winning are much improved."�\bBuck: Hehehe! Sorry! If you wanna be the greatest Trainer ever, that's going to be really tough. Because you're talking about me!"Z\bYou look puzzled. You really don't know anything, do you? Anyways, howdy, I'm Buck."e\bI can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"V\bBuck: Fweh! Too much! I guess I'll humble down and better my team on the field."G\bI'd better shape up on the field for a rematch against you here!"�\rMarley: I...am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."@\rWhen I think of that, I clam up... So sorry about that..."@\r...So? ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best."m\rMarley: ...You're so strong. It makes me feel happy. ...I don't know why. This is a strange feeling..."L\r...I might like battling with you. ...Just a little. Only a tiny bit."a\bEusine: My name is Eusine. I'm on the trail of a Pokémon named Suicune. Glad to meet you."q\bThere seems to be more than meets the eye with you... My gut tells me you seem to have met Suicune before."~\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"I\bEusine: Puff, puff... I am... no match for you. ...As I predicted."�\bI have never seen a battle this intense! I have no regrets... Farewell for now. But I will come back to get what I'm looking from you!"Y\bEmmet: I am Emmet. I am a Subway Boss. And I like winning more than anything else."^\bI am really serious. Really serious. Because if a battle is not serious, it is not fun.":\bSo everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"�\bEmmet: I lost against you. Because you are the strongest Trainer I've fought lately. You're a verrrrry strong Trainer! Yup! It was fun!"m\bYou want to win, and I don't want to lose. That's real. When we clash in battles, I feel very excited!"k\bIngo: I am the Subway Boss Ingo. Do you understand Pokémon well? Can you hold on to your principle?"v\bWhat can I see after winning, winning, and winning? You cannot know what happens after winning without winning."T\bTherefore, I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"e\bIngo: Bravo! Excellent!! I am glad that I fought so hard against a wonderful Trainer like you."m\bYour talent has brought you to the destination called Victory! However, your journey has just started." \rThink about it, OK? Hehe.";\rLyra: Awww. Guess I got the L this time. Tough luck."H\bEthan: Oh, hey? I'm Ethan. What 'cha doing here? On an adventure?"V\bI'm looking forward to battle against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?"}\bMy desire to search for Suicune is far beyond yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"|\bNoland: Hey, I had a look at your Battle Swap data. You seem to have the right idea, but you're still square in your head!"o\bListen up, okay? Knowledge isn't only about reading books or doing desk work. It may as well be useless!"�\bYou have to experience things with your heart and your body, understand? Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"g\bNoland: Pfft, man! That's absolutely the last time I lose to you! We have to do this again, hey!"=\bI'll come after you hard. No holds barred, understand?"�\rGreta: Hey! Howdy! ...Wait, are you the challenger? I don't know how to say it, but... To put it bluntly, you look pretty weak."c\rAre you sure you're up for me? Hmm... Well, all right! We'll take things easy to start with!"8\rOkay! Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"E\rGreta: Ow, wait a second! You are tough after all! I like you!"K\rIf we ever battle again, I won't lose! Don't you forget it! Bye-bye!"\\bTucker: Ahahah! Do you hear this crowd! They're all itching to see our match! Ahahah!"o\bI bet you're twitching all over from the tension of getting to battle me! But don't worry about a thing!"j\bTucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"E\bTucker: You're strong, but above all, you have a unique charm!"w\bIn you, I see a definite potential for a superstar like me. I will very much look forward to our next encounter!"r\bSpenser: Young one of a Trainer! Do you believe in your Pokémon? Can you believe them through and through?"]\bMy physical being is with Pokémon always! My heart beats as one with Pokémon always!"^\bIf your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"g\bSpenser: Well, that was some display! Even fully unleashed, my brethren could not overpower you."^\bYou team spirit is truly admirable! Your Pokémon's eyes are truly clear and unclouded."I\rLucy: I am Lucy... I am the law here... For I am the Pike Queen..."A\rYou already know it, but to advance, you must defeat me..."k\rI'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here...";\rLucy: ...That's all there is... Disappear already..."/\r...But you, I won't forget... ...Ever..."W\rAnabel: Greetings... My name is Anabel. I have heard several rumors about you..."�\rIn all honesty, what I have heard does not seem attractive in any way... The reason I've come to see you... Well, there is but one reason..."0\rLet me see your talent in its entirety..."f\rAnabel: Fufufu, nicely done... You have confidence in your Pokémon battling talent, don't you?"q\rI urge you to keep battling and keep on winning. I will be waiting for you. Until the next time we meet..."�\bBrandon: Wouldn't you agree that explorations are the grandest of adventures? Your own wits! Your own strength! Your own Pokémon!"N\bAnd, above all, only your courage to lead you through unknown worlds..."w\bAah yes, young adventurer, indeed this life is grand! Grand, it is! Now, then! Bring your courage to our battle!"E\bBrandon: Hahahah! Grand it was! Grand, yes, indeed! Well done!"�\bYoung explorer! You've bested me through and through! It just goes to show that I have much to learn still! May our paths cross again!"c\bPalmer: So, you've come this far! As a trainer of age, I'll have to give you my best effort."v\bThat's how the best Trainers show respect to each other. By battling all out as dedicated students of Pokémon!"y\bShow me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"�\bPalmer: Bravo! I imagine many great Trainers will come to challenge me as you have just done. That's something I look forward to a great deal."{\bYou will become even more skilled. Keep battling Trainers from around the world and keep growing greater in stature!"\rDahlia: No need to worry. Let chance do what it does. Like surprises from the game board, life goes through twists and turns."�\rThings will go as they will. But, enough of that. I know one thing for certain. You have arrived here not merely because you were lucky."D\rLet us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!"t\rDahlia: How fabulous of you! Your love of Pokémon shone through, and in turn, your Pokémon believed in you."f\rThat is why you handled everything thrown your way splendidly. A most wonderful victory it was!"�\bThorton: Bzweep! Sorry, don't mind me. What I'm using is an invention of mine. It's my data-analyzing machine telling me what you brought."i\bI see... I have to say, that's a good setup. Like say, 47%? Oh, don't let that number concern you!"#\bAll righty, let's get going!"[\bThorton: Hmm... I got handed the loss here. It's not making me happy at all, losing."e\bBut that's all right. Some things you learn from winning. But some things you learn by losing."f\bDarach: Welcome. As you know, Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one to accept defeat willingly."T\bHowever, for a reason I'm not at liberty to disclose, she cannot battle here."�\bConsequently, I, Darach, will do battle in her ladyship's place. Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."z\bDarach: I drew on every reserve of experience and etiquette handed down through our heritage of glorious servitude."a\bBut even then, I failed to fend off your stunning and inspiring challenge. I am humbled..."V\rArgenta: Here allows Trainers to mount challenges with their favorite Pokémon."�\rI imagine there were tense moments getting here with your chosen one. But understand that one shines the brightest when a challenge is overcome."[\rI am Argenta, and I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me."y\rArgenta: You must never forget there is a place where everyone can shine. That goes for any kind of Pokémon, too."�\rSpread that message in your own words. It's one everyone should hear. And now, having lost, this lady has nothing left to say at all, but... Bye-bye!"e\bHitsu: Hey, you escaped the Mayhem Penitentiary! You must be an impressive trainer to do that!"�\bBeyond this room, is the end of your Mayhem. You may get the reward you deserve there. BUT! Just one more. Bonus round. Pleaseeeee! Defeat me, and you will get extra rewards! I know your team should be fatigued now..."W\bThere, now I can't take no for an answer. Let's not delay any further, shall we?"p\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master. Here, you deserve this.",25 GC Credits have been awarded to you."@\bGo on. I have nothing much to say now, besides well done!"t\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA."M\bCome back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Go on!">\bHitsu: You bought a Backstage Pass to meet us? *laughs*"W\bYou know what that means, right? BONUS ROUND! And I can't take no for an answer."@\bLet's not delay any further, shall we? Please! Defeat me!"�\bHitsu: You did it! I am overwhelmed! You are the symbol of a true Pokemon master! Other than that, I have nothing much to say now, besides well done! The meet and greet is over. Ciaoz~"�\bHitsu: Hey, it was a good fight there! Don't be down about it, as I am not playing by the rules anyway. HAHA. Come back here again. You will be prepared. We will be waiting. Bye~"Z\bLuc: Ara ara, well done on making it this far. Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er? Just kidding."]\bTough challenge, wasn't it? You're almost there mate, your rewards lie just behind me."/\bI'll heal your team so you can ready up."9\bHeh. That's right, your final opponent here is me!"A\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost."8\bI have nothing more to say now, except well done!"�\bHaha, no hard feelings mate. It's not like Hitsu or Foul would be easier to beat anyway, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."=\bWell, whenever you're ready again, I'll still be here."k\bLuc: Ara ara, you bought a pass just to meet us again? Want a bo'ohw'o'wo'er for that? Just kidding."\bSay less. Let's battle!"w\bLuc: Damn, nice one mate! I can't even be mad that I lost. Well done, and cheers for meeting me! Hasta la vista!"i\bHaha, no hard feelings mate, since we're all breaking the rules-that-were-meant-to-be-broken here."g\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me? Even after all of that fighting you still chose to approach me."U\bBut I don't want to fight with such a weak opponent. Let me heal you up first."D\bNow let's see what kind of power you can muster to defeat me.";\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter if you can beat me here."{\bI can always come back to defeat you. And even if I can't, there are those who possess much greater power than I do."U\bFoul: Of course you aren't able to defeat me. I am the master of foul plays!!!"2\bFeeling angry? Come back for more beatings!";\bFoul: Oh! You're approaching me, on your own accord?"\bFascinating indeed."G\bNow amuse me by engaging in a battle with me! Surprise surprise!"u\bFoul: Tsk... Doesn't matter, there are those who possess much greater power than I do. You may leave after me."L\rVermint: Oh? You've made it this far and you're still moving forward."<\rVery well, let's see if you can keep that enthusiasm!"P\rVermint: I see... I've lost. I look forward to seeing your progress, \PN."*\rBut remember, I am always watching."B\rVermint: You lack strength and the resolve to move forward."S\rYou shall not pass this horizon where both of your passion and resolve meet."Y\rVermint: My, my quite surprising You've decided to battle me without true resolve?".\rLet's see if you can stay enthusiastic."C\rVermint: That's surprising... My Minuend was wrong for once."Z\r\PN, I'm looking forward towards your progress. And remember, I am always watching."[\rVermint: A battle without true resolve just shows that you're not on the right path."B\rFind your own resolve and I shall judge it with my Minuend."2\bLuc-ker: \PN, huh? Should've expected that."<\bWell, since you're here, lemme tell you a lil' story."�\bOnce upon a time, a teenager stumbled upon this world. He roamed the world far and wide, seeking to experience Ash's journey for himself."�\bUntil one day, he'd finished the journey. But with nothing else to do in the world at that time, he decided to start over again, and again, and again.":\bBut of course, all good things must come to an end."�\bOne day, when trying to exploit the system that he thought he'd grown so used to, it forcefully ejected him out, back into his original world.":\bAnd then after a while, he forgot about this world."9\bThat was, until that world experienced a pandemic."|\bThe teenager, now a few years older with some more knowledge and common sense, wanted to help out in improving this world."Y\bSo he reached out to this world's creator, and was given the opportunity to do so."Q\bAnd that's when I was born. Luc-ker. (the hyphen is important by the way!)"b\bA bit of trivia: That actually wasn't my original name! But that really doesn't matter now."�\bAll you need to know is that I've been helping improve this world's systems for many years now, taking breaks every now and again."A\bOf course, I would eventually meet Hitsu during this time."}\bWhen he first came up with the idea of the Grandeur Club, I never thought I'd be the one to facilitate it, but here we are."j\bWith trainers coming from all over the Pokémon universe, this is our love letter to the franchise."}\bIf you couldn't tell, we also loved Pokémon Masters. So we wanted some trainers from there that you could battle here too!"�\bI'm very happy with what we've accomplished. Of course, there were many, many struggles, but we've overcome them to get where we are today."@\bAnd now, we're at the end of our shared journey together."*\bKore ga watashitachi no Rakua desu!"G\bWhat, you thought that was a hint to us adding in Gen 9? Hahaha!"�\bNah, I just liked the sound of saying that. Gen 9 isn't going to be added into the game unfortunately (or fortunately for myself, actually)."v\bThat being said, I do have to say ariagato to you as well, \PN. Without you, we would've never gotten this far."q\bAs a thank you for letting us experience the end of our journey together, let me reward you with a battle."\\bOh, you want to face off against me at my full power? You never cease to surprise me."y\bVery well. But don't say you weren't warned - this battle will use the mechanics of the Sync and Titan Challenges."%<i>inhales and clears throat</i>"2\bMite kudasai... watashi no furu power desu."\bLuc-ker..."\bARUTIMETTO..."\bSUPEKUTAKURU,"\bYAAAAAAAAH!!!" \bThat didn't work, did it?"~\bLuc: Phew! Even while breaking multiple system limits, I still can't beat you. You're truly an incredible trainer, \PN."g\bOf course, I could've broken more limits, but I really don't want to destroy this world, y'know?"~\bHere's where I'd give you a reward, but I've been programmed to not give you any if you've decided to only bully me :<("N\bAnyway, your reward for beating me. Three very special bo'ohw'o'wo'ers."D\bLuc: Thanks for letting me go all-out! That felt pretty good."v\bDon't worry too much about the fact that you couldn't beat me! I was breaking multiple system limits after all."j\bBut then again... I did warn you. You should know from the trainers from the Sync challenge, right?"_\bBut then again... I did warn you. All's fair when it comes to the Grandeur Club, y'know?"i\bYou also did put up a pretty good fight, and pushed me to limits that no other trainer has before.")\bAnyway, that's all for this place!"6\bCome, let me take you back to where you belong."V\bWhen snow melts, spring arrives. Cherish your time together with your Pokémon."!The door locks behind you..." \bBrock: Show me your best!"%\rMisty: Are you ready, sweetie?"W\bLt. Surge: Pokémon battles are war! I'll show you and shock you into surrender!";\rErika: Let my ladies demonstrate the art of Ikebana."6\rSabrina: Let's find out who the victor will be."2\rJanine: Hi! I'm Janine! Remember this name!"H\bBill: Did you come to see my Pokémon collection? Check this out!">\bRyuki: Let our fiery spirits clash in a blaze of glory!"<\rAgatha: Why are you here noseying about, pesky child."U\bTrace: I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"-\bBlue: Show it to us - your true power!"J\rLeaf: I noticed you got some good Pokemon there too, can I have it?"j\bOak: Hello there! My name is Oak! People call me the Pokémon Professor! Here, come battle with me!"C\bGiovanni: For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"b\bFalkner: I'll show you the real power of the glorious flying Pokémon! Winds, stay with me!"C\bBugsy: Let me demonstrate what I've learned from my studies."]\rWhitney: You want a battle with me, the talented super-cute me? That's a warning hint!"�\bMorty: With a little more, I could see a future in which I meet the Pokémon of rainbow colors. You're going to help me reach that level!"c\bChuck: Let me tell you, I'm tough enough to crush stones and shatter bones! Urggh! Oooarrgh!"U\rJasmine: Oh... uh, hello. Do you love your Pokemon? May you prove it to me...?"I\bPryce: I, Pryce - the winter trainer - shall demonstrate my power!"C\rClaire: I will use my full power against you. Let's do this!",\bWill: Losing is not an option for us!"O\bKoga: Prepare to be the victim of my techniques... You shall see soon...":\bBruno: Bow down to our overwhelming power. Hoo hah!"-\rKaren: Try me. Entertain me. Let's go.">\bLance: It's time I tested you in battle. Are you ready?"7\bSilver: Pesky one. You do not seem to be strong."F\rLyra: You are here looking for a challenge, am I right? Me too!"O\bEthan: I'm feeling good today, how 'bout a match? Right here, right now!"W\bElm: Tell me, how do you raise your Pokemon? I will be expecting a great battle!"{\rRoxanne: Would you kindly demonstrate how you battle so I could learn? I would also see how much better I've become."E\bBrawly: You wanna challenge me? Let's see what you're made of."K\bWattson: I'll make sparks fly from you! Don't say I didn't warn you!"3\rFlannery: Brace yourself! Haiyaaaaaaaaaaaaa!"Z\bNorman: You'd better give it your best shot. I'll do everything in my power to win!"Y\rWinona: Witness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you will regret it!"@\bTate: This combinations of ours! \rLiza: Can you beat it?"{\bJuan: I guess a Coordinator could show you a trick or two today. Witness the grand illusion of water sculpted by us!"l\bSidney: I like that look you're giving me. I guess you'll give me a good match. Let's get down to it!"k\rPhoebe: Don't be afraid. Anyway, if you are looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"@\rGlacia: I wonder what are you going to show us. Bring it."o\bDrake: For us to battle with Pokemon as partners, do you know what it takes? Do you know what is needed?"&\bSteven: Give us your best shot!"�\bWallace: Who can most elegantly dance with their Pokemon? Who should exhibit the most graceful art in battle, you or me and my grand illusion of water?"q\bWally: My Pokemon have given me courage and strength to fight. I have to win for their sake! So get ready!"^\rMay: Would you bring and show me all your Pokemon, in a battle with me? I'm so excited!"{\bBrendan: You being here means that you may have faced and defeated my dad. But facing me is a different story! Here goes!"t\bBirch: There are still many, many mysteries surrounding Pokémon. What's your secret in raising Pokemon then?"�\bMaxie: That is why we, Team Magma, must increase the landmass of the world! Believe that this will lead to a future of eternal happiness for humanity!"�\bArchie: Pokémon suffer as a result of our actions. That's why I came to a decision, we, Team Aqua, will return everything to its unspoiled beginnings!"!\bRoark: This'll be rocking!"@\rGardenia: Let's get down to battle! A real quick one, OK?"K\rMaylene: I also take battling very seriously. Whenever you're ready!"F\bCrasher Wake: Victory will be ours! Come on, let's get it done!"T\rFantina: Win I shall, non? I wish to show you battling à la danse classique."Z\bByron: I'll take your challenge. I have the confidence to batter down your defense!"]\rCandice: I should tell you, I'm tough, because I know how to focus. Get ready to lose!"V\bVolkner: I hope you're the one who'll make me remember how fun it is to battle."U\bAaron: I want to become perfect, just like my bug Pokemon. Let me take you on!"J\rBertha: Well, would you show this old lady how much you've learned?"8\bFlint: All right, hotshot! Let's spice things up!"M\rCynthia: There's no need for words. I, Cynthia, accept your challenge!"O\bBarry: Send out your Pokemon now! Or I am gonna fine you for 10 million!"M\rDawn: Let me give you a hand, to see if you could beat me and move on!"0\bLucas: Ready or not, let's have a go too!"u\bRowan: Even now, I get a thrill when I'm with Pokémon, so let's begin our test on the bonds with our Pokemon."�\bCyrus: The world must change. Then, who will change it? Me, Cyrus. And Team Galactic. I will make you regret paying heed to your heart!"g\bCilan: Would you like to take part in this match against me? There's still much to learn for me."J\bChili: I'm going to show you what me and my blazing Pokemon can do!"q\bCress: It shall be I and my esteemed Pokemon that you must face in battle. Would you be so kind to oblige?"\rLenora: I'm going to research how you battle with the Pokemon you've so lovingly raised. Curiosity is the spice of life!"p\bBurgh: Ah hah! Lights' on! My Bug-type Pokemon are scurrying with excitement about getting to battle you!"�\rElesa: Yes sweetie. I'm Elesa, the world famous model. Welcome to my main stage! My beloved Pokemon and your Pokemon shall compete."h\bClay: Harrumph! Kept me waitin', didn't ya, kid? So yer the Trainer they been talkin' about, huh."4\rSkyla: So, how about you and I have some fun?"�\bBrycen: Receiving the support of your Pokémon makes you stronger. I'll show you this power I learned about, which is now etched in my heart."[\rRoxie: I'm Roxie~! Listen up~! I'm gonna rock the audience right outta their seats~!"|\bDrayden: Let's battle with everything we have: your skill, my experience, and the love we've raised our Pokemon with."O\bMarlon: How 'bout you and I make some waves and sweep the audience away?"\bGrimsley: What will be determined here is which of us can absorb the light and shine of this match. Let our fates begin."B\rShauntal: Would you like to be the subject of my new novel?"b\bMarshal: It is my intention to test you. To take you to your limits of your strength. Kiai!"X\rCaitlin: Make your best effort not to bore me with a yawn-inducing battle. Clear?"�\bAlder: I feel fired up when I see another trainer, and I wonder which one of us is stronger. The excitement builds to a fever pitch!"f\bBenga: Hey, hey! Look at me! I want to battle with you! My Pokemon haven't been through enough!"|\rIris: Hi! I'm Iris! People call me the girl who knows the hearts of dragons! Brace yourself! I'm going to defeat you!"0\bHugh: Come at me with everything you got!"D\rHilda: This battle will be mine to win! I won't go down easy!"a\bHilbert: I'm looking forward to battling against you, but let's be friends after this, ok?">\rRosa: Would you please battle with me already? Yay hay!"m\rRoxanne: Hi, Roxanne here. I like to strategize before a battle, applying what I've studied until now."]\rI'm sure we have both experienced many battles, gaining immense knowledge on battling."n\bYour talent brought forth a wave of astonishment, overwhelming me. I look forward to it again. Ride on!"@\bWattson: Aha! What a fine young soul brimming with vigor."B\rNo wonder the Pokémon that battle at my side got confused."O\rWitness the elegant choreography by us. Don't blink or you'll regret it!"T\rWinona: I see you're one with your Pokémon as well. I recognize your talent."@\bWe don't need to talk... \r...because we can each tell...">\b...what the other is thinking... \r...all in our minds!"j\bTate: The bond between you and your Pokémon... \rLiza: ...was far stronger than ours. We can tell."d\bSidney: They said I was a punk, but I showed them what the dark side's beauties were made of!"w\bSidney: Listen to what this loser has to say. You've got a long road ahead of you, but you've got what it takes."�\rPhoebe: Uh-huh... Uh-huh... Hahaha! You're right. Oh? Gimme a minute... Hi! My friend's telling me that you're looking for me."b\rDon't be afraid. Anyway, if you're looking for a challenge, see if you can hurt my friends!"W\rI'd like to see how far your bond can carry you. Don't bring us shame by losing!"7\rI wonder what you're going to show me. Bring it."o\rGlacia: What a relief, how fiery that was! Spirits burning so high that my icy moves pale in comparison."�\bSteven: You... What did you see on your journey with your Pokémon? What did you feel, meeting so many Trainers like yourself?"~\bHey! Hey!! You'd better keep aiming higher and promise to come back and challenge me! Else I will get to the top in no time!"i\bYou're amazing. You've got the proof that you're a trainer your Pokémon can be proud of! See you!"P\rYou've gotta do your best so that I won't be wiping you out in one sweep!"}\rJuniper: Having Pokémon battles between one another deepens the bonds between people and Pokémon. So, are you ready?"S\bN: Well, let me hear your Pokémon's voice! I wanna understand you. Show me!"o\bGhetsis: We must liberate the Pokémon! Then, and only then, will humans and Pokémon truly be equals!!!"9\rViola: Now come at me! I, Viola, will take you on!"U\bGrant: I hope you'll show me that your skill as a trainer surpasses even mine."?\rKorrina: Haha! Time for Lady Korrina's grand appearance!"e\bRamos: The survival of plants is a sign of their strength. Yeh sure yer up to facing all that?"U\bClemont: Hi! I like my Pokemon battles how i like my inventions. HIGH-VOLTAGE!"h\rValerie: The elusive Fairies may appear frail as a breeze and delicate as a bloom, but watch out."S\rOlympia: This is a ritual to decide your fate and future. The battle begins!"�\bWulfric: Depending on which Pokémon you choose, I could be your most challenging opponent yet or I could be a total pushover."#\rMalva: I'm burning up, runt!"r\bSiebold: To devote yourself entirely to such a life, made up of fleeting experiences, that is truly artful."i\bWikstrom: Let us alll give our word that our contest shall be fair and honorable. Ready? En garde!"@\rDrasna: Facing you will make my Pokémon grow like weeds!"�\rDiantha: You know, I'd really love to learn more about how a strong Trainer like you raises your Pokémon, brimming with hope for the future."p\rShauna: I'm sure we're gonna be great friends. Hey! Can we see the Pokémon now? I want to meet them too!"5\bTierno: Anyway, can we have a Pokémon battle?"�\bTrevor: I am on the journey with my Pokedex to travel high mountains and wide seas, but that doesn't mean I can't battle. Let's go!"^\rSerena: Woohoo! Can't wait to see what we can do! Eeheehee, we're going to get started!":\bCalem: All right, let's do this. Come on, everyone!"2\bSycamore: Let's all have a Pokémon battle!"?\bLysandre: My desire... it is for a more beautiful world!"H\bIlima: Behold the magnificent Pokémon of the one and only Ilima!">\rLana: I'm going to show you what a serious Lana can do!"L\bKiawe: I hope you bring that fire with you and burn up my challenge!!"<\rMallow: Let's get us cooking into the heat of battle!"P\bSophecles: Um! Could you teach me some tips on confidence while battling?"O\rMina: Maybe your battling skills will be a masterpiece! Let's get going!"S\rAcerola: Maybe our battle will be one to be told in books for centuries too!"\\rHapu: Looks like you are going to make a fine tale for yourself. Time to get serious."d\bNanu: Don't take it too serious now. You’ll tire yourself out if you’re always in a rush."X\rOlivia: You can count on me, kid. Get ready for your hardest Pokémon battle yet!"c\rKahili: Let's see how far we can fly. The winds of victory will blow for me and my Pokémon!"Y\bMolayne: Now I’ve got to do what I can to keep up with the others. Let's battle!"D\bHala: Old Hala here will also be going all out! Let us clash!"7\bHau: I wanna do all the fun stuff! Let's battle!"O\rLillie: I'll do my best so that no Pokémon have to end up getting hurt!"9\bGladion: Battle me. I won't take no for an answer."4\rSelene: I'm fired up to the max! Bring it on!"=\bElio: I’d be happy to show you what I am capable of."s\bKukui: Now, you wanna go through my trial to make yourself stronger? That's right, put yourself to the test!"@\rLusamine: Let's see... Yes, you. \PN. You will battle me."I\bGuzma: Wanna see what destruction looks like? It's your boy Guzma!"�\bEusine: My desire to search for Suicune is far greater than yours... I won't stop following you until I've found out what I'm after!"Y\rCheryl: You're my opponent of the day? My Pokémon have been itching for a battle."?\rMira: Get ready, Mira will show you all of what she got!"R\bRiley: Now, we will be pulling out all the stops to put your Pokémon down."k\bBuck: I can feel my Pokémon shivering inside their Poké balls! It's out of anticipation, not fear!"A\rMarley: ...Are we going to battle? ...OK. I'll do my best.">\bEmmet: Everything's ready! Aim for victory! All aboard!"O\bIngo: I will exert every possible effort to battle with you. All aboard!"J\bNoland: Shake out every last bit of your knowledge and bring it on!"9\rGreta: Let's see you ignite my passion for battle!"r\bTucker: Tucker, the star of the show, will bathe you in a brilliant glow! Right here and now! Let's see it!"q\rLucy: I'm not one for idle chatter. Hurry. Come on... Your luck... I hope you didn't use it all up here..."g\bSpencer: If your bonds of trust are frail, you will never beat my brethren! Prove it to me here!"8\rAnabel: Let me see your talent in its entirety..."1\bBrandon: Bring your courage to our battle!"|\bPalmer: Show me the bond you've built with your Pokémon. Show me what you've learned through battles with other Trainers!"L\rDahlia: Let us not waste any time. I wish to test your skills myself!",\bThorton: All righty, let's get going!"M\bDarach: Let me assure you that you won't be shortchanged by facing me."R\rArgenta: I will be your most daunting challenge. I dare you to overcome me.""The cold iron door is locked."�\rMarley: I... am Marley. I... I don't like to talk... I choose my words carefully, but they may still hurt someone accidentally..."\ts[5]Ding dong!"�\bLuc-ker: I made a severe and continuous lapse in my judgement, and I don't expect to be forgiven. I'm simply here to apologize."�\bI recognise how difficult the Sync Challenge is, so I'm going to help you out a little. Pay attention to what's to my left next time in the Sync Challenge."5Choose the Pokémon to give Arceus' Blessing to."!<<Imbuing Arceus' Blessing>>"#The trainers are transforming!"RThe security alarm must have been tripped after the battle. What will you do?"0\b???: Ehhh, there really was someone here.",Quick! Scurry back where you came from!"Run! Run for your life!"[\bTrace: Maybe I should check if your Pokémon really are doing well... with a battle!"�\bMaxie: We, Team Magma, must increase the landma