OtherIu;␀�	[["_\bTate and Liza spend a lot of time here. If they aren't in the gym they are usually here.",\bOh, you're here to challenge the Gym?"=\bThose two are my children. They won't be easy to beat."V\bYou ended up beating my kids? They do have a hard time getting along after all."l\bSo you want to go to Sootopolis City. That place is hard to get into without the proper preperations."b\bWe have a psychic in town who may be able to teleport you there. Why don't you go ask them?"g\bHere at the institute we study how to get into space. We just launched a shuttle a few days ago."�\bSophocles: Good, there you are. Ampharos here and I need to guide a space probe back to earth. But, um, Ampharos lost its confidence."[\bI was thinking a battle might cheer it up. Seeing you battle always gave me a boost."C\bSophocles: I think that did the trick. Thanks for your help."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at Wyndon Stadium against Marnie."&\bSophocles: Thanks for the help."X\bI'm sorry that you can't go up any higher. Take this as a gift for coming though."\bYou still can't go up."\rAmpharos..."=\bWelcome to the Space Center. Feel free to look around.["c\bVito y Leti pasan mucho tiempo aquí. Si no están en el gimnasio, normalmente están aquí."/\bOh, ¿has venido a desafiar al Gimnasio?"<\bEsos dos son mis hijos. No serán fáciles de vencer."d\b¿Así que al final venciste a mis hijos? La verdad es que les cuesta bastante compenetrarse."o\bAsí que quieres ir a Ciudad Arrecípolis. Es difícil entrar en ese lugar sin la preparación adecuada."u\bTenemos en la ciudad a un psíquico que quizá pueda teletransportarte allí. ¿Por qué no vas a preguntarle?"r\bAquí, en el instituto, estudiamos cómo llegar al espacio. Hace solo unos días lanzamos un transbordador."�\bChris: Bien, ahí estás. Ampharos está aquí y necesito guiar una sonda espacial de vuelta a la Tierra. Pero, eh... Ampharos ha perdido la confianza."W\bPensaba que un combate podría animarlo. Verte combatir siempre me daba ánimos."?\bChris: Creo que eso ha funcionado. Gracias por tu ayuda."�Rotom Phone: Aviso. Nuevo combate programado para las Series Mundiales de Coronación. El combate tendrá lugar en el Estadio de Ciudad Puntera contra Mary."#\bChris: Gracias por la ayuda."Y\bSiento que no puedas subir más. Aun así, toma esto como regalo por haber venido." \bTodavía no puedes subir."\rAmpharos..."J\bBienvenido al Centro Espacial. Siéntete libre de echar un vistazo.;["_\bTate and Liza spend a lot of time here. If they aren't in the gym they are usually here.",\bOh, you're here to challenge the Gym?"=\bThose two are my children. They won't be easy to beat."V\bYou ended up beating my kids? They do have a hard time getting along after all."l\bSo you want to go to Sootopolis City. That place is hard to get into without the proper preperations."b\bWe have a psychic in town who may be able to teleport you there. Why don't you go ask them?"g\bHere at the institute we study how to get into space. We just launched a shuttle a few days ago."�\bSophocles: Good, there you are. Ampharos here and I need to guide a space probe back to earth. But, um, Ampharos lost its confidence."[\bI was thinking a battle might cheer it up. Seeing you battle always gave me a boost."C\bSophocles: I think that did the trick. Thanks for your help."�Rotom Phone: Announcement. New scheduled match for the World Coronation Series. The match will take place at Wyndon Stadium against Marnie."&\bSophocles: Thanks for the help."X\bI'm sorry that you can't go up any higher. Take this as a gift for coming though."\bYou still can't go up."\rAmpharos..."=\bWelcome to the Space Center. Feel free to look around.Iu;␀		[[""\rDon't even try it."\rJust get going."H\bTate: You'll need at least two Pokémon if you want to battle us.")\bTate: Welcome to the Mossdeep Gym."&\rLiza: We battle in cooperation.",\bDon't expect us\n\rto go easy on you."'\