ntage of Patrats."&\bYou looked at me, so we battle."X\bThe Striaton Gym uses three different types. It's hard figuring out what to take."*\rDo you think I'm ready for the gym?"6\rI think Chili is the best. Fire types are cool.Iu;␀�
