ancel]"\bElgyem"1\rHello, and welcome to the Pokémon Center."5\rWe restore your tired Pokémon to full health.",\rWould you like to rest your Pokémon?"5\rOK, I'll take your Pokémon for a few seconds."0\rYour Pokémon may be infected by PokeRus."m\rLittle is known about the PokeRus except that they are microscopic life-forms that attach to Pokémon."D\rWhile infected, Pokémon are said to grow exceptionally well."\rThank you for waiting."3\rWe've restored your Pokémon to full health." \rWe hope to see you again!">\rFirst, you should restore your Pokémon to full health."8\rYour Pokémon have been healed to perfect health."\rWe hope you excel!"\rAudino"Yes"NoIu;␀�[[%"E\bThe food is great! Sometimes we get to watch a gym battle too."G\bCress: Try Chili first. His passion will burn right through you."L\bCress: My turn now. Don't be sorry that you jumped into the deep end."L\bCress: The final challenge is Cilan. He may snare you in his tactics."W\bCress: You are a ripple in the pond. May you continue to touch those around you."*\rWelcome to the Striaton Restaurant!"j\bCilan uses Grass type Pokémon. They are weak against the Bug, Fire, Poison, Flying, and Ice types."{\bThey are strong against Water, Ground, and Rock. Electirc, Grass, Ground, and Water moves also don't do much damage."C\bCilan: Welcome to the Striaton Gym. Your aroma is marvelous."W\bCilan: It seems my turn has finally come. It's time for the battle to be served."<\bCilan: Well brothers, it seems \PN has beaten us all."$\bYou've earned the Trio Badge."%\bCress: Here, have this TM too."9\bTM109 contains Dive. A two-turn water type attack."%\bChili: Here's one from me too!"V\bTM38 contains Fire Blast. A powerful force of fire that may burn your opponent."5\bCilan: Last but not least, here's one from me."@\bTM108 contains Solar Blade. A two-turn grass type attack."|\bCilan: Your way of battle has inspired me. I'm going to travel the land and savor as many of the savory delights as I can."0\bChili: You seem like a strong challenger.">\bCress: Why not battle us all? I'm sure you'll enjoy it."{\bCilan: An excellent idea! How about you start with Chili for the appetizer, Cress for the main course, and me for desert."V\bCress uses Water type Pokémon. They are weak against Grass and Electric types."s\bThey are strong against Fire, Ground, and Rock. Fire, Ice, Steel, and Water moves also don't do much damage."^\bChili uses Fire type Pokémon. They are weak against the Water, Ground, and Rock types."~\bThey are strong against Bug, Grass, Ice, and Steel. Bug, Grass, Fire, Ice, Steel, and Fairy moves also don't do much damage."5\bOh, you're here for the gym. It's at the back.""\bDon't tell me to slow down."@\bChili: I'm your first opponent. Let's get this heated up.":\bChili: Next up is Cress. You'll drown in his skill."M\bChili: Your final challenge is Cilan. It will be a bittersweet battle."E\bChili: I can't believe you beat us all. It really burns me up.[%"T\b¡La comida es estupenda! A veces incluso podemos ver un combate de gimnasio."@\bBenny: Prueba primero con Maíz. Su pasión te abrasará."Q\bBenny: Ahora me toca a mí. No lamentes haberte metido en aguas profundas."L\bBenny: El desafío final es Millo. Puede atraparte con sus tácticas."V\bBenny: Eres una onda en el estanque. Ojalá sigas llegando a quienes te rodean."/\r¡Bienvenido al Restaurante de Armonía!"i\bMillo usa Pokémon de tipo Planta. Son débiles a los tipos Bicho, Fuego, Veneno, Volador y Hielo."�\bSon fuertes contra Agua, Tierra y Roca. Los movimientos de tipo Eléctrico, Planta, Tierra y Agua tampoco les hacen mucho daño."J\bMillo: Bienvenido al Gimnasio de Armonía. Tu aroma es maravilloso."S\bMillo: Parece que por fin ha llegado mi turno. Es hora de servir el combate."F\bMillo: Bien, hermanos, parece que \PN nos ha derrotado a todos."'\bHas conseguido la Medalla Trío.".\bBenny: Toma, quédate también esta MT."E\bLa MT109 contiene Buceo. Un ataque de tipo Agua de dos turnos."3\bMaíz: ¡Aquí va una por mi parte también!"T\bLa MT38 contiene Llamarada. Una poderosa llamarada que puede quemar al rival."M\bMillo: Y por último, pero no menos importante, aquí tienes una mía."P\bLa MT108 contiene Cuchilla Solar. Un ataque de tipo Planta de dos turnos."x\bMillo: Tu forma de combatir me ha inspirado. Voy a viajar por el mundo y a saborear todas las delicias que pueda."*\bMaíz: Pareces un aspirante fuerte."O\bBenny: ¿Por qué no luchas contra los tres? Seguro que lo disfrutarás."�\bMillo: ¡Una idea excelente! ¿Qué te parece empezar con Maíz como aperitivo, seguir con Benny como plato principal y terminar conmigo de postre?"U\bBenny usa Pokémon de tipo Agua. Son débiles a los tipos Planta y Eléctrico."|\bSon fuertes contra Fuego, Tierra y Roca. Los movimientos de tipo Fuego, Hielo, Acero y Agua tampoco les hacen mucho daño."V\bMaíz usa Pokémon de tipo Fuego. Son débiles a los tipos Agua, Tierra y Roca."�\bSon fuertes contra Bicho, Planta, Hielo y Acero. Los movimientos de tipo Bicho, Planta, Fuego, Hielo, Acero y Hada tampoco les hacen mucho daño."6\bOh, has venido por el gimnasio. Está al fondo."*\bNo me digas que vaya más despacio."9\bMaíz: Soy tu primer rival. Vamos a calentar esto."B\bMaíz: El siguiente es Benny. Te ahogarás en su habilidad."E\bMaíz: Tu desafío final es Millo. Será un combate agridulce."M\bMaíz: No puedo creer que nos hayas vencido a todos. Me pone que ardo.;[%"E\bThe food is great! Sometimes we get to watch a gym battle too."G\bCress: Try Chili first. His passion will burn right through you."L\bCress: My turn now. Don't be sorry that you jumped into the deep end."L\bCress: The final challenge is Cilan. He may snare you in his tactics."W\bCress: You are a ripple in the pond. May you continue to touch those around you."*\rWelcome to the Striaton Restaurant!"j\bCilan uses Grass type Pokémon. They are weak against the Bug, Fire, Poison, Flying, and Ice types."{\bThey are strong against Water, Ground, and Rock. Electirc, Grass, Ground, and Water moves also don'