ado."<\bSe suponía que mi Klink iba a ganar y evolucionar..."\rNo me decepciones." \rDeja de apuntar tan alto."\bPrepárate para rodar.".\bPerdí, pero aprendí mucho observando."'\r¿Pensabas que ibas a escaparte?",\rDebería haber venido más preparado.;["\bAhhh!"*\bDon't sneak up on people like that."\bAnother adventure.")\bMy team could always use some fun."\bAn unexpecting subject."1\bMy Klink was supposed to win and evolve..." \rDon't be a failure to me."\rStop shooting so high."\bGet ready to roll."+\bI lost, but I gained a lot watching.""\rThought you could get away?"(\rI should have been more prepared.Iu;␀�[[	"\rDon't interupt me."\rStay out of my way."\rYou've traveled deep.".\rThe electricity in this place is scary.[	"\rNo me interrumpas."!\rNo te pongas en mi camino."\rHas llegado muy adentro.".\rLa electricidad de este lugar da miedo.;[	"\rDon't interupt me."\rStay out of my way."\rYou've traveled deep.".\rThe electricity in this place is scary.Iu;␀�[[""\rPalp"2\rGet off the runway if a plane ever goes by."b\rSkyla: Are you here for an air battle? Alright let's do it. ... You lost. Sorry about that."<\bI can't get Palpitoad out of the water. What do I do?"2Mistralton City\nStrewn with Windblown Leaves"\bI've been through Chargestone Cave before. It's no more dangerous than any other cave, even with the extra electricity in it."�\bCilan: Good timing \PN. I've just found out about Skyla's 'Air Battles'. As a Gym Leader, I cannot stand the tactics she takes with challengers."�\bI challenged her myself over this but lost. Perhaps if you battle me you can show her the same spirit you showed me? It may get her to take you on for real."\bAre you ready to battle?"=\bNow that we're ready, prepare for a delectable battle.""\bWhenever you're ready I am."u\bCilan: Now that you have seen \PN's battle style, don't you think he deserves a chance to battle you for real."�\rSkyla: I admit, \PN has talent. I suppose I'll do a real battle wit