 I'm holding back."/\bRudy: Come back when you're even better."/\rIris: Hi \PN! Back to battle a Champion?"T\rIris: I think we're both improving. Try to bring more Dragon types next time."(\rElesa: Let's make this beautiful.">\rElesa: Come back any time to show me a stunning battle."+\rLenora: I guess I can give it a try."Q\rLenora: Impressive. Keep training like that and become a champion one day."K\rCynthia: At long last I get to try you on myself. Are you ready \PN?"`\rCynthia: Keep traveling and discovering new things. It will help you out in the long run."P\rFlannery: I'm ready... I mean I'm going to... Whatever. Let's just fight."0\rFlannery: I just need some more practice."C\rBea: Trainer of Pikachu. I've trained hard for this rematch."%\rBea: I will continue to train."D\rClair: Welcome. Think you are still strong enough to beat me?"F\rClair: It's amazing how you keep getting stronger and stronger."A\bBugsy: I've done some research. I think I've got this one."0\bBugsy: It's okay. I'll just study harder."(\bFlint: I'm ready for a good time."U\bFlint: I wish we could battle with more options. You give me a real challenge." \rLuana: Have you improved?"7\rLuana: There are still some surprises after all."\bClemont: I'm ready, \PN."B\bClemont: You did great, \PN. I'll do even better next time."@\bCheren: Now that I'm ready let me show you my true power."/\bCheren: There's nothing I can teach you."\bAllister: R-Ready."#\bAllister: U-Until next time.".\rViola: I'll take a picture after I win.">\rViola: Let me take a picture to celebrate your victory."'\rValerie: Victory to the elegant."A\rValerie: That battle was very elegant. I congratulate you."&\rSabrina: I knew you would come.".\rSabrina: I wonder what I should do now?"8\bNoland: You'll never know what to expect with me."1\bNoland: It's okay. I'll just study harder."4\bAaron: The power of my team will destroy you."\bAaron: Rematch anytime."&\rErika: Time for another battle."#\rErika: That was pretty good."R\rL