is.";\rLana: All the adults in town have lost their energy."6\rLana: I invited Misty and Brock to visit Alola."5\rLana: I plan on meeting up with an old friend.""\rLana: This trip sounds fun."!\rLana: A Pokémon League..."\rLana: Good morning, \PN."%\rLana: Where will you go first?"+\rLana: Alola. I like your new friend."\rLana: You picked me."yAnnouncment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Carmo, located in Pewter City, is ready for battle."n\bKukui: Looks like you have another battle lined up. Good luck, \PN. We'll be rooting for you from home.""\rLana: Come back again soon.",\rLana: It's great to see Lillie again."\bVulpix!"H\bKiawe: I'm Kiawe. It's nice to meet a fellow battler like myself."<\bKiawe: I knew you would pick the strongest out of us."#\bKiawe: What a day. I'm beat."*\bKiawe: I wish I could have the egg."H\bKiawe: There should be all kinds of new Pokémon for you to find."5\bKiawe: I can't imagine what we will see there."?\bKiawe: Visiting a science place isn't the most exciting."D\bKiawe: I won't get cold. I'm made of firey passion after all."8\bKiawe: My team and I will be able to handle this."N\bKiawe: My farm is in shambles. My parents are too tired to do anything!"*\bKiawe: It's good to see them again.",\bKiawe: I'm going to battle Tapu Fini.".\bKiawe: I can't wait to try out the gym."C\bKiawe: Just you wait, \PN. I'm going to become the Champion."8\bKiawe: I'm fired up. This class will be exciting."&\bKiawe: That was a great battle."X\bKiawe: I'm concerned about Goh. He doesn't like to battle. Who do you battle now?"0\bKiawe: I'll get you into shape. Let's go!",\bKiawe: Good luck in your next battle."\bEevee"2\bGladion: I'm ready to get back to training."MRotom Dex:... It's hiding in the plants on the right side of the school."r\bKukui: Alola! For our first lesson with our new student we are going to explore the forest near the school."\bAlola has a bunch of new Pokémon for \PN to see. Come find me in the forest and we will head back whenever you're done."S\bKukui: Let's have a battle now that everyone is here. Pick whoever you want."g\bKukui: That was a great battle. Before we go, I see \PN has a Z-Ring on. Where did you get that?"Y\bWhat!? Tapu Koko! It's rare for the guardian deity to take an interest in someone."}\bAnyways, that Z-Ring will allow you to use Z- Moves. With a Z-Crystal, you can unleash powerful attacks during battle."_\bClearing a trial is a good way to earn one. That's it for today. Everyone can head home."o\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have two eggs in front of us. Who wants to raise one?"g\rLillie: I do! I would love to get over my fear of Pokémon and maybe starting small will fix it."}\bSamson: Well if there are no objections then the egg is yours. I'll take the other one. I'm excited to see what it becomes."i\bKukui: Glad we got that figured out. I also wanted to quickly explain to \PN what Alola forms are."|\bIn Alola, some Pokémon look and behave different than they do elsewhere in the world. You may have seen some by now."o\bIn fact, even Pikachu evolves into something different: an Electric and Psychic type. Isn't it amazing!?"h\bWell that's it for now. \PN, head over to Lillie's place and make sure the egg gets there safely."~\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have a special trip planned today. But first, let me introduce our guest."*\bThis is Olivia. Say Alola everyone."D\rOlivia: Nice to meet you all. I'm the Kahuna of Akala Island."v\bKukui: Speaking of Akala, we are all going to be going there as a field trip. I want you to explore the island."k\b\PN, I've already told everyone else what they could do. There's a trial there for you to look into."8\bWell that's it for now. Let's go to Akala Island!"BRotom Dex: There is a boat in Hau'oli City that will take us."�\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. Today we are going to learn about Mega Evolution and see some Kantonian forms."s\bAnd what better place to do that than Kanto? I hope everyone is ready because we are heading to Pallet Town!"s\bProbably not the most exciting for you \PN, but everyone else has never been there. Let's meet at the blimp."�\bKukui: For today we are going to visit the Aether Paradise. It's full of many wild Pokémon and Miss Lusamine is in charge of the place."g\rLusamine: I'm always willing to do something nice for my little girl. This trip will be a blast."3\bLet's head over to the ship in Hau'oli City."[\bKukui: Today we are heading to Mount Lanakila. The snowy mountain on Ula'ula Island!"S\bKukui: Lusamine and I had a chat and she has a special offer for all of you."w\rLusamine: Due to your brave actions in rescuing me, I want to give you all the chance to become Ultra Guardians."�\rBy doing this you will hunt down Ultra Beasts that pop up around Alola and help them find their way back home. I know you can all do it."l\bKukui: With that said, the first one has already been spotted. It should be found in Melemele Meadow."e\bBeast Balls might help getting them easier. Lusamine sent someone over who will sell you some."L\rMallow: Everyone else noticed that the adults are super tired, right?"E\rLana: I was hoping it was just my parents that were like that."0\bKiawe: We need to do something to fix it."!\bSophocles: Sure, but what?"�\rLillie: My mother called earlier today and told me what needs done. We need to go on an Ultra Guardians mission to the Altar of the Sunne."+Rotom Dex: Let's all head to the boat!"�\bKukui: It's finally time that we head to Poni Island. All of you have your individual research projects, and I'll be leaving it up to you to complete them."x\bLana, you're to meet up with your friend. Kiawe, you're to train. Mallow, you're to learn how to make a new dish."�\bSophocles, you're to evolve your Charjabug. Lillie, you're to study the Pokémon living on the island. And finally \PN, you're to have your final Grand Trial."H\bNow that everyone is ready, head over to the boat. And good luck."{\bKukui: Alola everyone. Today we're heading to Malie City, a city that takes heavy inspiration from the Johto region."o\bFeel free to explore the unique culture. \PN, there is even a gym for you to participate in if you wish."N\bEveryone, let's take the boat to Tapu Village and head east from there."o\bKukui: Alola everyone. I'm very excited to announce that the first ever Alola League has been completed."�\bI know all of you have been looking forward to it, so let's not waste any time. Head for the boat in Hau'oli City and let's head over."i\bKukui: Alola everyone. As you're all aware, your vacation is starting and school will be on break."%\bWhat does everyone plan to do?"9\bSophocles: I'm going to the Mossdeep Space Center.":\rLana: My dad and I are going to look for a Manaphy."M\rMallow: I'm going to make my father's kitchen the best it can ever be."G\rLillie: My family and I are going to look for my missing father."S\bKiawe: I'm continuing my island challenge. One day I'll be an Island Kahuna."g\bKukui: What about you, \PN? Going to travel the world some more? Sounds like a great plan to me."a\bKiawe: Not so fast. We never got to battle in the Manalo Conference. \PN, do me the honor."(\bKukui: That's it everyone. Enjoy-"�Rotom Dex: Wait. I also want to talk about what I'm doing. If \PN is returning home, then I'm going to work with the Aether Foundation."C\PN, it's been wonderful being your Pokédex. Until next time."Q\bKukui: On that note, it's time you all went your own ways. Alola everyone."l\bKukui: Everyone, let's give \PN and Goh a strong Alolan welcome! It's great to see our champion back."�\bOf course, becoming a champion wasn't enough for him and he's now in the World Coronation Series. No doubt he'll be the one to win it."b\bKiawe: Professor! I want to battle \PN. I want to help him get even stronger so he can win."V\bKukui: How about it, \PN? Or would you rather battle someone else? Your choice."_\bKukui: Everyone, let's give a strong Alola welcome to Lillie and Gladion's father, Mohn!"\bMohn: Thank you, everyone, for the hospitality. I know I've missed so much, but I promise I'm not going anywhere from now on."(\rLillie: Professor. Where's Kiawe?"�\bKukui: He left to do some last minute training upon learning \PN was coming back. There's a Battle Royal taking place soon. \PN, I assume you're interested."M\bMohn: I haven't seen one of those in years. Let's head over and watch."\rPopplio"\rBrionne"\rPrimarina"Meltan"It's a Meltan."(Would you like to take it with you?"\bCharja"\bVika"%\rLillie: Nice to meet you, \PN."L\rLillie: I'm not actually a Trainer. You'll have to pick someone else.".\rLillie: I'll take good care of the egg."2\rLillie: This trip will be very educational."$\rLillie: This sounds exciting."*\rLillie: This is going to be hard..."5\rLillie: Snowy's egg was found on the mountain!"8\rLillie: Being an Ultra Guardian will be exciting!"a\rLillie: My mom just called the school. She said we need to head to the Altar of the Sunne."$Rotom Dex: Let's take the boat."S\rLillie: I wonder what they think of Alola? I hope they don't find it boring.",\rLillie: I don't know about this trip."1\rLillie: I'm curious what a gym looks like."L\rLillie: Snowy and I are looking forward to this. Don't go easy on us."7\rLillie: I still can't believe you're a Champion."6\rLillie: Perhaps I'll see you during my travels."-\bGoh: H-Hey \PN. Your friends are nice."c\rLillie: I'm so happy we found my father. Nihilego is a great addition to the family as well."B\rLillie: Hello there. Please keep that Pikachu away from me."4\rLusamine: I've dreamed of this day for years."7It looks lost. Would you like to take it with you?";Rotom Dex: Another Ultra Beast found! Let's head home."Q\bSophocles: You're the new classmate? I can't wait to learn more about you."\bSophocles: Me? Okay..."!\bSophocles: I need a break."'\bSophocles: Today was pretty fun.";\bSophocles: I hope it doesn't take long to get there."3\bSophocles: This trip sounds like a good one."4\bSophocles: This sounds like my kind of place."(\bSophocles: I'm going to freeze...")\bSophocles: I guess I can help out."B\bSophocles: My parents are so tired. I wonder what happened.";\bSophocles: How come no one told me they were coming?"I\bSophocles: I'm so excited. I already know what my project will be."3\bSophocles: Do you think they have good food?"W\bSophocles: I've been training hard for this. Don't think I'm going to hold back."2\bSophocles: I'm looking forward to learning."*\bSophocles: Mossdeep sounds amazing."E\bSophocles: Mossdeep was fun. I'm planning on going back again.""\bSophocles: I'll do my best."0\bSophocles: I'm going to keep growing too."a\bSophocles: I'm happy they found him. Who would have guessed it would be somewhere so cold.")Rotom Dex: Let's head to the forest."+Rotom Dex: Pick a classmate to battle." Rotom Dex: Let's head home."5Rotom Dex: Let's meet with Lana in Hau'oli City."JRotom Dex: Let's meet with Sophocles in Hau'oli City's shopping mall."Rotom Dex: Take your seat."+Rotom Dex: Let's go to Lillie's place."ERotom Dex: Let's go to Hala's place. It should be north of here."1Rotom Dex: Let's go to the trial on Route 2."&Rotom Dex: Let's go talk to Hala."/Rotom Dex: Let's go talk to the professor."NRotom Dex: Let's go talk to Lillie. After that let's go to Kiawe outside."Rotom Dex: Let's go home.".Rotom Dex: Let's go to Mallow on Route 3."&Rotom Dex: Let's go visit Lillie."#Rotom Dex: We should sit down."7Rotom Dex: There should be a boat in Hau'oli City."&Rotom Dex: Let's visit Sophocles."&Rotom Dex: Let's go to the blimp."9Rotom Dex: Let's explore the forest near the school."3Rotom Dex: Let's take this Pokémon to Lillie.":Rotom Dex: Let's take this Pokémon to the professor."0Rotom Dex: Let's go to the Aether Paradise.",Rotom Dex: Let's talk to the professor."5Rotom Dex: Let's go to the ship in Hau'oli City.",Rotom Dex: Let's go to Melemele Meadow."-Rotom Dex: Let's go to the Royal Avenue."+Rotom Dex: Let's deal with Team Skull."+Rotom Dex: Let's find the Ultra Beast."2Rotom Dex: There's an Ultra Beast on Route 3."0Rotom Dex: Let's go see Kiawe at his ranch."?Rotom Dex: Lana should be on the beach near Kukui's house."?Rotom Dex: Mallow is at her father's shop in Hau'oli City."HRotom Dex: Let's go to Hau'oli and take the ship to Ula'Ula Island.")Rotom Dex: Let's go to Hania Desert.">Rotom Dex: Let's go to the trial at the Thrifty Megamart."(Rotom Dex: Let's battle Nanu again.";Rotom Dex: Let's deal with Team Skull in Hau'oli City."3Rotom Dex: Let's go to the Altar of the Sunne.":Rotom Dex: Let's go to the forest next to the school."'Rotom Dex: Let's battle Tapu Koko."#Rotom Dex: Let's battle Misty."0Rotom Dex: Let's go to the Pokémon Center."Rotom Dex: Let's sit down."'Rotom Dex: Let's head to the boat.",Rotom Dex: Let's go to Seafolk Village.".Rotom Dex: Let's go to Ancient Poni Path."'Rotom Dex: Let's go to Poni Wilds."/Rotom Dex: Let's go to Poni Breaker Coast."5Rotom Dex: A Pokémon is running around in here."$Rotom Dex: Let's go to Route 3."+Rotom Dex: Let's find Professor Kukui."7Rotom Dex: Let's go to Tapu Village and head east.")Rotom Dex: Let's go to Hau'olu City."MRotom Dex: Let's take the boat in Hau'oli City to the Manalo Conference."The board is empty."O\bJames: They ate my bottlecap collection! We have to punish them somehow."=\bMeowth: Are you sure you saw one of them come in here?"X\rJessie: Yes. It's hard to forget that strange Pokémon with a hex nut for a head."(\rJessie: Can't you see we're busy?"\bWobbuffet!" \rOlivia: Nice to meet you."W\bSamson: Alola! You must be the person my cousin sent. Could you hand me the egg?"0\bI can't wait to see what it hatches into."P\bNot quite ready to say goodbye. That's fine. Come back when you're ready."f\bYou're impressed by my school, aren't you? I can see it in your face. I welcome you to join us."/\b...Though you should ask your mom first."%\bYou should ask your mom first.">\bSamson: She said yes? Excellent! Welcome to the school."c\bProfessor Kukui has offered to take you in while you stay here. He should be home right now."&\bKukui should be home right now."C\bSamson: She said yes then? Excellent! Welcome to the school."5\bSamson: Hello \PN. How's school going for you?"F\bSamson: My egg hatched into a Kantoian Vulpix. What a surprise."\bSamson: zzz..."T\bSamson: I feel so much more alert. Ready to run this school with a new vigor."I\bSamson: The Pokémon League has begun. Perhaps I'll see you there."5\bSamson: The league sure was full of surprises."V\bSamson: Enjoy your holiday, \PN. I hope you'll come back one day to see us all."\rTogedemaru"%Your Pokémon were fully healed."\rVulpix"C\bMohn: Being here really brings me back. So much has changed."P\rMallow: I hear you're from Kanto! I bet you have a bunch of cool stories."=\rMallow: So it's me then. Don't be sorry when you lose."K\rMallow: Maybe you can come over some time and experience my cooking."T\rMallow: Looking at the eggs just makes me want to go home and cook some food.":\rMallow: I wonder if there is good food to be found?".\rMallow: I hope to see some Grass types!"/\rMallow: I wonder what we will see there."5\rMallow: Poor Steenee isn't going to like this."6\rMallow: I'm prepared to hunt some Ultra Beasts."3\rMallow: We have to do something to fix this."S\rMallow: Lana's sneaky. She organized the whole thing without anyone knowing."-\rMallow: Maybe I should cook something."k\rMallow: I think I'll leave Tsareena here. It should be fine if I travel without any Pokémon, right?"2\rMallow: A league, huh? I guess I'll try it."\rMallow: Morning.":\rMallow: Come see the restaurant when you have time."H\rMallow: Alola, \PN. I worked hours on making a good meal for you."5\rMallow: Don't think I'll lose without a fight.")\rMallow: We'll see you soon, right?"E\rMallow: I'm so happy Lillie and her family are together again."\bMarowak"Yes"No[,"&\bYo también voy a esta escuela."@\bTodo el mundo actúa como si no existiera. ¡No es justo!"-\rSamina: Me alegra volver a verte, \PN."\bTurtonator"m\rMisty: ¡Sorpresa! Apuesto a que no esperabas verme aquí. Puedes darle las gracias a Nereida por eso."a\rEsto puede ser unas vacaciones para mí, pero no creas que no puedo derrotarte en combate."�\rMisty: Ugh, sigo sin poder ganar. Quizá Brock tenga más suerte. Lo último que oí es que iba a visitar a la Enfermera Joy en el Centro Pokémon.")\bChris: Toma asiento y empezaremos."\r¡Genial!"\rSteenee"\rTsareena"b\bChris: El Centro Espacial de Algaria fue increíble. Me alegra que Zarala pudiera llevarme."@\bPero supongo que tú querrás un combate. Me parece bien."9\bChris: Voy a quedarme aquí. Ya nos veremos luego."=\bKukui: Toma asiento, primo, y empezaremos la lección.">\bKukui: Ven a mirar la pizarra si alguna vez te pierdes."/\bKukui: Siéntate y continuaremos, primo."\bKukui: Te veré en casa."-\bKukui: Siéntate y empezaremos, primo."=\bKukui: Debería encontrarse en la Pradera de Melemele."E\bKukui: ¿A que fue amable por parte de Nereida organizar esto?" \bKukui: Ve hacia el barco.";\bKukui: Te deseo suerte. Ven a visitarnos alguna vez."?\bKukui: ¡Alola, primo! ¿Cómo le va a nuestro campeón?"7\b¿Por qué no te sientas por los viejos tiempos?"M\bKukui: No estoy aquí para luchar contigo. Ya sé que puedes vencerme."H\bKukui: Ha sido genial volver a verte, \PN. Estaremos animándote.""\bKukui: Toma asiento, primo."H\bKukui: Ha sido genial volver a verte, \PN. Estaremos animándote.">\rNereida: Me llamo Nereida. Encantada de conocerte, \PN."3\rNereida: Supongo que quieres luchar conmigo."=\rNereida: No puedo esperar a volver a casa y relajarme."9\rNereida: Me pregunto qué habrá dentro del Huevo."0\rNereida: La Isla Akala suena emocionante.")\rNereida: Nunca he estado en Kanto."\rNereida: ¿Otro viaje?"+\rNereida: Va a hacer demasiado frío.".\rNereida: Popplio y yo podemos con esto."E\rNereida: Todos los adultos del pueblo han perdido la energía.">\rNereida: He invitado a Misty y a Brock a visitar Alola."4\rNereida: Pienso reunirme con una vieja amiga."+\rNereida: Este viaje suena divertido."$\rNereida: Una Liga Pokémon...""\rNereida: Buenos días, \PN."(\rNereida: ¿Adónde irás primero?"2\rNereida: Alola. Me cae bien tu nuevo amigo."%\rNereida: Me has elegido a mí."�Anuncio. Se ha encontrado un nuevo rival para las Series Mundial de Coronación. Carmo, ubicado en Ciudad Plateada, está listo para combatir."n\bKukui: Parece que tienes otro combate por delante. Buena suerte, \PN. Estaremos animándote desde casa."\rNereida: Vuelve pronto."5\rNereida: Me alegra mucho volver a ver a Lylia."\b¡Vulpix!"T\bChris: Soy Chris. Es un placer conocer a otro amante de los combates como yo."?\bChris: Sabía que elegirías al más fuerte de nosotros."-\bChris: Menudo día. Estoy hecho polvo."3\bChris: Ojalá pudiera quedarme con el Huevo."R\bChris: Debería de haber un montón de Pokémon nuevos para que encuentres."7\bChris: No puedo imaginarme lo que veremos allí."R\bChris: Visitar un lugar científico no es precisamente lo más emocionante."V\bChris: No voy a pasar frío. Al fin y al cabo, estoy hecho de ardiente pasión."/\bChris: Mi equipo y yo podremos con esto."h\bChris: Mi granja está hecha un desastre. ¡Mis padres están demasiado cansados para hacer nada!"(\bChris: Me alegra volver a verlos.",\bChris: Voy a enfrentarme a Tapu Fini."0\bChris: Estoy deseando probar el gimnasio."B\bChris: Ya lo verás, \PN. Voy a convertirme en el Campeón.">\bChris: Estoy que ardo. Esta clase va a ser emocionante."&\bChris: Ha sido un gran combate."Q\bChris: Me preocupa Goh. No le gusta combatir. ¿Con quién combates ahora?".\bChris: Voy a ponerte en forma. ¡Vamos!",\bChris: Suerte en tu próximo combate."\bEevee"2\bGladio: Estoy listo para volver a entrenar."TRotom Dex:... Está escondido entre las plantas del lado derecho de la escuela."v\bKukui: ¡Alola! En nuestra primera lección con el nuevo alumno vamos a explorar el bosque cerca de la escuela."{\bAlola tiene un montón de Pokémon nuevos para que \PN vea. Ven a buscarme al bosque y volveremos cuando hayas terminado."[\bKukui: Ahora que ya estamos todos aquí, tengamos un combate. Elige a quien quieras."s\bKukui: Ha sido un gran combate. Antes de irnos, veo que \PN lleva puesto un Z-Ring. ¿Dónde lo conseguiste?"W\b¿¡Qué!? ¡Tapu Koko! Es raro que la deidad guardiana se interese por alguien."\bEn fin, ese Z-Ring te permitirá usar Movimientos Z. Con un Cristal Z, podrás desatar ataques muy poderosos en combate."v\bSuperar una prueba es una buena forma de conseguir uno. Eso es todo por hoy. Todo el mundo puede volver a casa."p\bKukui: Ahora que \PN está aquí, podemos empezar. Tenemos dos Huevos delante. ¿Quién quiere criar uno?"p\rLylia: ¡Yo! Me encantaría superar mi miedo a los Pokémon, y quizá empezar por algo pequeño me ayude."�\bChris: Bien, si nadie se opone, entonces el Huevo es tuyo. Yo me quedaré con el otro. Estoy deseando ver en qué se convierte."}\bKukui: Me alegra que ya esté decidido. También quería explicarle rápidamente a \PN lo que son las formas de Alola."�\bEn Alola, algunos Pokémon tienen un aspecto y un comportamiento distintos a los que muestran en otras partes del mundo. Puede que ya hayas visto algunos."p\bDe hecho, incluso Pikachu evoluciona a algo distinto: un tipo Eléctrico y Psíquico. ¿No es increíble?"t\bBueno, eso es todo por ahora. \PN, ve a casa de Lylia y asegúrate de que el Huevo llegue allí sano y salvo."�\bKukui: Ahora que \PN está aquí, podemos empezar. Hoy tenemos planeada una excursión especial. Pero antes, dejad que os presente a nuestra invitada."*\bEsta es Mayla. Decid todos "Alola"."M\rMayla: Encantada de conoceros a todos. Soy la Kahuna de la Isla Akala."e\bKukui: Hablando de Akala, todos vamos a ir allí de excursión. Quiero que exploréis la isla."[\b\PN, ya les he dicho a los demás lo que pueden hacer. Allí hay una prueba para ti."=\bBueno, eso es todo por ahora. ¡Vamos a la Isla Akala!"@Rotom Dex: Hay un barco en Ciudad Hau'oli que nos llevará."�\bKukui: Ahora que \PN está aquí, podemos empezar. Hoy vamos a aprender sobre la Megaevolución y a ver algunas formas de Kanto."v\b¿Y qué mejor lugar para hacerlo que Kanto? Espero que todos estéis listos, porque nos vamos a Pueblo Paleta."|\bProbablemente no sea lo más emocionante para ti, \PN, pero los demás nunca han estado allí. Reunámonos en el zepelín."~\bKukui: Hoy vamos a visitar el Paraíso Æther. Está lleno de Pokémon salvajes y la señora Samina es quien lo dirige."l\rSamina: Siempre estoy dispuesta a hacer algo bonito por mi pequeña. Este viaje va a ser maravilloso."*\bVayamos al barco de Ciudad Hau'oli."[\bKukui: Hoy nos dirigimos al Monte Lanakila. ¡La montaña nevada de la Isla Ula'Ula!"Y\bKukui: Samina y yo hemos hablado, y tiene una oferta especial para todos vosotros."�\rSamina: Debido a vuestras valientes acciones al rescatarme, quiero daros a todos la oportunidad de convertiros en Ultraguardianes."�\rAl hacerlo, perseguiréis a los Ultrentes que aparezcan por Alola y les ayudaréis a encontrar el camino de vuelta a casa. Sé que todos podéis hacerlo."h\bKukui: Dicho eso, el primero ya ha sido avistado. Debería encontrarse en la Pradera de Melemele."x\bLas Ente Balls pueden ayudar a capturarlos más fácilmente. Samina ha enviado a alguien que os venderá algunas."]\rLulú: Todos os habéis dado cuenta de que los adultos están agotadísimos, ¿verdad?"@\rNereida: Yo esperaba que solo mis padres estuvieran así."5\bChris: Tenemos que hacer algo para arreglarlo.""\bChris: Sí, pero ¿el qué?"�\rLylia: Mi madre llamó antes hoy y me dijo qué hay que hacer. Tenemos que emprender una misión de Ultraguardianes al Altar de la Luna.")Rotom Dex: ¡Vayamos todos al barco!"�\bKukui: Por fin ha llegado el momento de dirigirnos a la Isla Poni. Todos tenéis vuestros proyectos de investigación individuales, y voy a dejar en vuestras manos la tarea de completarlos."{\bNereida, tú vas a reunirte con tu amiga. Chris, tú vas a entrenar. Lulú, tú vas a aprender a preparar un plato nuevo."�\bChris, tú vas a hacer evolucionar a tu Charjabug. Lylia, tú vas a estudiar los Pokémon que habitan la isla. Y por último, \PN, te enfrentarás a tu última gran prueba."I\bAhora que todos estáis listos, id hacia el barco. Y mucha suerte."|\bKukui: Alola a todos. Hoy nos dirigimos a Ciudad Malíe, una ciudad que toma una gran inspiración de la región de Johto."z\bSentíos libres de explorar su cultura única. \PN, incluso hay un gimnasio en el que puedes participar si quieres."O\bTodos, tomemos el barco hasta Pueblo Tapu y vayamos al este desde allí."o\bKukui: Alola a todos. Me hace muchísima ilusión anunciar que la primera Liga Alola ya está terminada."�\bSé que todos la estabais esperando con ganas, así que no perdamos tiempo. Id al barco de Ciudad Hau'oli y pongámonos en marcha."o\bKukui: Alola a todos. Como ya sabéis, empiezan vuestras vacaciones y la escuela cerrará temporalmente."$\b¿Qué piensa hacer cada uno?"0\bChris: Voy al Centro Espacial de Algaria."7\rNereida: Mi padre y yo vamos a buscar a Manaphy."Y\rLulú: Voy a convertir la cocina de mi padre en la mejor que haya existido jamás."E\rLylia: Mi familia y yo vamos a buscar a mi padre desaparecido."Y\bChris: Voy a continuar mi recorrido insular. Algún día seré Kahuna de una isla."^\bKukui: ¿Y tú, \PN? ¿Vas a seguir viajando por el mundo? Me parece un plan estupendo."i\bChris: No tan deprisa. Nunca llegamos a combatir en la Conferencia de Manalo. \PN, hazme el honor."-\bKukui: Eso es todo, chicos. Disfrutad-"�Rotom Dex: Espera. Yo también quiero decir qué voy a hacer. Si \PN vuelve a casa, entonces yo voy a trabajar con la Fundación Æther."A\PN, ha sido maravilloso ser tu Pokédex. Hasta la próxima."[\bKukui: Dicho esto, ha llegado la hora de que cada uno siga su camino. Alola a todos."�\bKukui: ¡Todos, demos a \PN y a Goh una gran bienvenida al estilo de Alola! Me alegra muchísimo ver de nuevo a nuestro campeón."�\bPor supuesto, convertirse en campeón no le bastó y ahora está compitiendo en las Series Mundial de Coronación. Sin duda será él quien las gane."v\bChris: ¡Profesor! Quiero combatir contra \PN. Quiero ayudarle a hacerse aún más fuerte para que pueda ganar."^\bKukui: ¿Qué me dices, \PN? ¿O preferirías combatir contra otra persona? Tú eliges."d\bKukui: ¡Todos, demos una gran bienvenida al estilo Alola a Mohn, el padre de Lylia y Gladio!"�\bMohn: Gracias a todos por vuestra hospitalidad. Sé que me he perdido mucho, pero prometo que a partir de ahora no volveré a irme a ninguna parte."-\rLylia: Profesor. ¿Dónde está Chris?"�\bKukui: Se fue a hacer un entrenamiento de última hora en cuanto supo que \PN regresaba. Va a celebrarse una Batalla Real muy pronto. \PN, supongo que te interesa."8\bMohn: Hace años que no veo una. Vayamos a verla."\rPopplio"\rBrionne"\rPrimarina"Meltan"Es un Meltan."(¿Te gustaría llevártelo contigo?"\b¡Charja!"\b¡Vika!"*\rLylia: Encantada de conocerte, \PN."Q\rLylia: En realidad no soy Entrenadora. Tendrás que elegir a otra persona."*\rLylia: Cuidaré muy bien del Huevo."/\rLylia: Este viaje será muy instructivo."%\rLylia: Esto suena emocionante."'\rLylia: Esto va a ser difícil..."<\rLylia: ¡El Huevo de Nevada apareció en la montaña!"8\rLylia: ¡Ser Ultraguardián va a ser emocionante!"a\rLylia: Mi madre acaba de llamar a la escuela. Dijo que tenemos que ir al Altar de la Luna."!Rotom Dex: Tomemos el barco."V\rLylia: Me pregunto qué pensarán de Alola. Espero que no les parezca aburrida."/\rLylia: No sé qué pensar de este viaje."A\rLylia: Tengo curiosidad por saber cómo será un gimnasio."P\rLylia: Nevada y yo tenemos muchas ganas de esto. No nos lo pongas fácil."7\rLylia: Aún no puedo creer que seas un Campeón."/\rLylia: Quizá te vea durante mis viajes."4\bGoh: H-Hola, \PN. Tus amigos son simpáticos."z\rLylia: Me alegra muchísimo que encontráramos a mi padre. Nihilego también es un gran miembro más de la familia."B\rLylia: Hola. Por favor, mantén a ese Pikachu lejos de mí."2\rSamina: Llevo años soñando con este día."8Parece perdido. ¿Te gustaría llevártelo contigo?"BRotom Dex: ¡Se ha encontrado otro Ultrente! Volvamos a casa."V\bChris: ¿Eres el nuevo compañero de clase? Estoy deseando saber más sobre ti."\bChris: ¿Yo? Vale..."#\bChris: Necesito un descanso."*\bChris: Hoy ha estado bastante bien."5\bChris: Espero que no tardemos mucho en llegar."$\bChris: Este viaje suena bien."<\bChris: Este sitio suena justo como los que me gustan.""\bChris: Me voy a congelar..."/\bChris: Supongo que puedo echar una mano."N\bChris: Mis padres están agotadísimos. Me pregunto qué habrá pasado."<\bChris: ¿Cómo es que nadie me dijo que iban a venir?"D\bChris: Estoy emocionadísimo. Ya sé cuál será mi proyecto."0\bChris: ¿Crees que tendrán buena comida?"I\bChris: He entrenado duro para esto. No creas que voy a contenerme."-\bChris: Tengo muchas ganas de aprender."'\bChris: Algaria suena increíble."@\bChris: Algaria fue genial. Tengo pensado volver otra vez."$\bChris: Haré todo lo posible."1\bChris: Yo también voy a seguir creciendo."c\bChris: Me alegra que lo encontraran. Quién iba a pensar que estaría en un lugar tan frío." Rotom Dex: Vamos al bosque."=Rotom Dex: Elige a un compañero de clase para combatir." Rotom Dex: Volvamos a casa.":Rotom Dex: Reunámonos con Nereida en Ciudad Hau'oli."ORotom Dex: Reunámonos con Chris en el centro comercial de Ciudad Hau'oli."Rotom Dex: Toma asiento."&Rotom Dex: Vamos a casa de Lylia."GRotom Dex: Vamos a casa de Hela. Debería estar al norte de aquí."/Rotom Dex: Vamos a la prueba de la Ruta 2."(Rotom Dex: Vamos a hablar con Hela."/Rotom Dex: Vamos a hablar con el profesor."JRotom Dex: Vamos a hablar con Lylia. Después iremos con Chris fuera." Rotom Dex: Volvamos a casa.",Rotom Dex: Vamos con Lulú a la Ruta 3."(Rotom Dex: Vamos a visitar a Lylia."&Rotom Dex: Deberíamos sentarnos.":Rotom Dex: Debería haber un barco en Ciudad Hau'oli."(Rotom Dex: Vamos a visitar a Chris.""Rotom Dex: Vamos al zepelín."9Rotom Dex: Exploremos el bosque cerca de la escuela."/Rotom Dex: Llevemos este Pokémon a Lylia."3Rotom Dex: Llevemos este Pokémon al profesor.")Rotom Dex: Vamos al Paraíso Æther."/Rotom Dex: Vamos a hablar con el profesor."1Rotom Dex: Vamos al barco de Ciudad Hau'oli."/Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Pradera de Melemele.")Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Avenida Royal."3Rotom Dex: Vamos a encargarnos del Team Skull.".Rotom Dex: Vamos a encontrar al Ultrente."-Rotom Dex: Hay un Ultrente en la Ruta 3."1Rotom Dex: Vamos a ver a Chris en su rancho."MRotom Dex: Nereida debería estar en la playa cerca de la casa de Kukui."HRotom Dex: Lulú está en la tienda de su padre, en Ciudad Hau'oli."IRotom Dex: Vamos a Hau'oli y tomemos el barco hacia la Isla Ula'Ula."+Rotom Dex: Vamos al Desierto de Haina.":Rotom Dex: Vamos a la prueba del Supermercado Ahorro."6Rotom Dex: Vamos a volver a luchar contra Kaudan."ERotom Dex: Vamos a encargarnos del Team Skull en Ciudad Hau'oli."*Rotom Dex: Vamos al Altar de la Luna.";Rotom Dex: Vamos al bosque que hay junto a la escuela."0Rotom Dex: Vamos a luchar contra Tapu Koko.",Rotom Dex: Vamos a luchar contra Misty.")Rotom Dex: Vamos al Centro Pokémon."Rotom Dex: Sentémonos."%Rotom Dex: Vamos hacia el barco."(Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Aldea Marina."1Rotom Dex: Vamos al Sendero de Poni Antiguo."+Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Pradera de Poni."3Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Costa Escarpada de Poni."6Rotom Dex: Hay un Pokémon correteando por aquí.""Rotom Dex: Vamos a la Ruta 3."4Rotom Dex: Vamos a encontrar al Profesor Kukui.">Rotom Dex: Vamos a Pueblo Tapu y avancemos hacia el este."'Rotom Dex: Vamos a Ciudad Hau'olu."RRotom Dex: Tomemos el barco de Ciudad Hau'oli hacia la Conferencia de Manalo."La pizarra está vacía."^\bJames: ¡Se comieron mi colección de chapas! Tenemos que castigarlos de alguna manera.">\bMeowth: ¿Seguro que viste a uno de ellos entrar aquí?"d\rJessie: Sí. Es difícil olvidar a ese extraño Pokémon con una tuerca hexagonal por cabeza."-\rJessie: ¿No ves que estamos ocupados?"\b¡Wobbuffet!"%\rMayla: Encantada de conocerte."e\bChris: ¡Alola! Tú debes de ser la persona que me envió mi primo. ¿Podrías darme el Huevo?"+\bEstoy deseando ver qué sale de él."S\b¿Aún no estás listo para despedirte? Está bien. Vuelve cuando lo estés."t\bTe ha impresionado mi escuela, ¿verdad? Se te nota en la cara. Eres bienvenido si quieres unirte a nosotros."7\b...Aunque antes deberías pedírselo a tu madre."2\bPrimero deberías pedir permiso a tu madre."J\bChris: ¿Te ha dicho que sí? ¡Excelente! Bienvenido a la escuela."p\bEl Profesor Kukui se ha ofrecido a acogerte mientras te quedes aquí. Ahora mismo debería estar en casa."0\bKukui debería estar ahora mismo en casa."S\bChris: ¿Así que te ha dicho que sí? ¡Excelente! Bienvenido a la escuela."8\bChris: Hola, \PN. ¿Qué tal te va en la escuela?"P\bChris: Mi Huevo acabó eclosionando en un Vulpix de Kanto. Qué sorpresa."\bChris: zzz..."j\bChris: Me siento muchísimo más despierto. Listo para llevar esta escuela con energías renovadas."F\bChris: La Liga Pokémon ha comenzado. Tal vez nos veamos allí."=\bChris: Desde luego, la liga estuvo llena de sorpresas."b\bChris: Disfruta de tus vacaciones, \PN. Espero que algún día vuelvas para vernos a todos."\rTogedemaru"-Tus Pokémon se han curado por completo."\rVulpix"R\bMohn: Estar aquí de verdad me trae recuerdos. Han cambiado tantas cosas..."b\rLulú: ¡He oído que eres de Kanto! Apuesto a que tienes un montón de historias geniales."G\rLulú: Así que me toca a mí. No te arrepientas cuando pierdas."A\rLulú: Quizá algún día puedas venir a probar mi cocina."N\rLulú: Ver los Huevos me da ganas de volver a casa y ponerme a cocinar.";\rLulú: Me pregunto si habrá buena comida por allí."0\rLulú: ¡Espero ver algunos tipos Planta!"-\rLulú: Me pregunto qué veremos allí."8\rLulú: A la pobre Steenee no le va a gustar esto."?\rLulú: Estoy lista para salir a cazar algunos Ultrentes."8\rLulú: Tenemos que hacer algo para arreglar esto."R\rLulú: Nereida es muy lista. Organizó todo esto sin que nadie se enterara."+\rLulú: Quizá debería cocinar algo."q\rLulú: Creo que dejaré aquí a Tsareena. Seguro que no pasa nada si viajo sin ningún Pokémon, ¿verdad?"6\rLulú: ¿Una liga, eh? Supongo que la probaré."\rLulú: Buenos días.">\rLulú: Pásate por el restaurante cuando tengas tiempo."N\rLulú: Alola, \PN. He pasado horas preparando una buena comida para ti."9\rLulú: No creas que voy a perder sin plantar cara."+\rLulú: Nos veremos pronto, ¿verdad?"Q\rLulú: Me alegra muchísimo que Lylia y su familia vuelvan a estar juntos."\bMarowak"Sí"No;[,"\bI go to this school too."7\bEveryone acts like I don't exist. It's not fair!"+\rLusamine: Good to see you again \PN."\bTurtonator"^\rMisty: Surprise! Bet you weren't expecting to see me here. You can thank Lana for that."S\rThis may be a vacation for me, but don't think I can't beat you in a battle."�\rMisty: Ugh, I still can't win. Maybe Brock will have a better chance. Last I heard he said he was going to visit Nurse Joy at the Pokémon Center."0\bSamson: Take your seat and we will begin."\rSweet!"\rSteenee"\rTsareena"a\bSophocles: The Mossdeep Space Center was incredible. I'm glad Molayne was able to take me."8\bBut you probably want a battle. I suppose we can."=\bSophocles: I'm going to stay here. I'll see you later."C\bKukui: Take your seat, cousin, and we will start the lesson."9\bKukui: Come look at the board if you're ever lost."4\bKukui: Sit down and we will continue, cousin."$\bKukui: I'll meet you at home."1\bKukui: Sit down and we will start, cousin."4\bKukui: It should be found in Melemele Meadow."6\bKukui: Wasn't it nice of Lana to organize this?" \bKukui: Head for the boat."3\bKukui: I wish you luck. Come visit sometime."6\bKukui: Alola, cousin! How'd our champion doing?"4\bWhy don't you take a seat for old times sake?"I\bKukui: I'm not here to battle you. I already know you can beat me."K\bKukui: It was great to see you again, \PN. We'll be rooting for you.""\bKukui: Take a seat, cousin."K\bKukui: If was great to see you again, \PN. We'll be rooting for you."3\rLana: My name is Lana. Nice to meet you \PN."+\rLana: I guess you want to battle me."/\rLana: I can't wait to go home and relax."(\rLana: I wonder what's in the egg."*\rLana: Akala Island sounds exciting."-\rLana: I've never been to Kanto before."\rLana: Another trip?"'\rLana: It's going to be too cold."%\rLana: Popplio and I have this.";\rLana: All the adults in town have lost their energy."6\rLana: I invited Misty and Brock to visit Alola."5\rLana: I plan on meeting up with an old friend.""\rLana: This trip sounds fun."!\rLana: A Pokémon League..."\rLana: Good morning, \PN."%\rLana: Where will you go first?"+\rLana: Alola. I like your new friend."\rLana: You picked me."yAnnouncment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Carmo, located in Pewter City, is ready for battle."n\bKukui: Looks like you have another battle lined up. Good luck, \PN. We'll be rooting for you from home.""\rLana: Come back again soon.",\rLana: It's great to see Lillie again."\bVulpix!"H\bKiawe: I'm Kiawe. It's nice to meet a fellow battler like myself."<\bKiawe: I knew you would pick the strongest out of us."#\bKiawe: What a day. I'm beat."*\bKiawe: I wish I could have the egg."H\bKiawe: There should be all kinds of new Pokémon for you to find."5\bKiawe: I can't imagine what we will see there."?\bKiawe: Visiting a science place isn't the most exciting."D\bKiawe: I won't get cold. I'm made of firey passion after all."8\bKiawe: My team and I will be able to handle this."N\bKiawe: My farm is in shambles. My parents are too tired to do anything!"*\bKiawe: It's good to see them again.",\bKiawe: I'm going to battle Tapu Fini.".\bKiawe: I can't wait to try out the gym."C\bKiawe: Just you wait, \PN. I'm going to become the Champion."8\bKiawe: I'm fired up. This class will be exciting."&\bKiawe: That was a great battle."X\bKiawe: I'm concerned about Goh. He doesn't like to battle. Who do you battle now?"0\bKiawe: I'll get you into shape. Let's go!",\bKiawe: Good luck in your next battle."\bEevee"2\bGladion: I'm ready to get back to training."MRotom Dex:... It's hiding in the plants on the right side of the school."r\bKukui: Alola! For our first lesson with our new student we are going to explore the forest near the school."\bAlola has a bunch of new Pokémon for \PN to see. Come find me in the forest and we will head back whenever you're done."S\bKukui: Let's have a battle now that everyone is here. Pick whoever you want."g\bKukui: That was a great battle. Before we go, I see \PN has a Z-Ring on. Where did you get that?"Y\bWhat!? Tapu Koko! It's rare for the guardian deity to take an interest in someone."}\bAnyways, that Z-Ring will allow you to use Z- Moves. With a Z-Crystal, you can unleash powerful attacks during battle."_\bClearing a trial is a good way to earn one. That's it for today. Everyone can head home."o\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have two eggs in front of us. Who wants to raise one?"g\rLillie: I do! I would love to get over my fear of Pokémon and maybe starting small will fix it."}\bSamson: Well if there are no objections then the egg is yours. I'll take the other one. I'm excited to see what it becomes."i\bKukui: Glad we got that figured out. I also wanted to quickly explain to \PN what Alola forms are."|\bIn Alola, some Pokémon look and behave different than they do elsewhere in the world. You may have seen some by now."o\bIn fact, even Pikachu evolves into something different: an Electric and Psychic type. Isn't it amazing!?"h\bWell that's it for now. \PN, head over to Lillie's place and make sure the egg gets there safely."~\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. We have a special trip planned today. But first, let me introduce our guest."*\bThis is Olivia. Say Alola everyone."D\rOlivia: Nice to meet you all. I'm the Kahuna of Akala Island."v\bKukui: Speaking of Akala, we are all going to be going there as a field trip. I want you to explore the island."k\b\PN, I've already told everyone else what they could do. There's a trial there for you to look into."8\bWell that's it for now. Let's go to Akala Island!"BRotom Dex: There is a boat in Hau'oli City that will take us."�\bKukui: Now that \PN is here we can get started. Today we are going to learn about Mega Evolution and see some Kantonian forms."s\bAnd what better place to do that than Kanto? I hope everyone is ready because we are heading to Pallet Town!"s\bProbably not the most exciting for you \PN, but everyone else has never been there. Let's meet at the blimp."�\bKukui: For today we are going to visit the Aether Paradise. It's full of many wild Pokémon and Miss Lusamine is in charge of the place."g\rLusamine: I'm always willing to do something nice for my little girl. This trip will be a blast."3\bLet's head over to the ship in Hau'oli City."[\bKukui: Today we are heading to Mount Lanakila. The snowy mountain on Ula'ula Island!"S\bKukui: Lusamine and I had a chat and she has a special offer for all of you."w\rLusamine: Due to your brave actions in rescuing me, I want to give you all the chance to become Ultra Guardians."�\rBy doing this you will hunt down Ultra Beasts that pop up around Alola and help them find their way back home. I know you can all do it."l\bKukui: With that said, the first one has already been spotted. It should be found in Melemele Meadow."e\bBeast Balls might help getting them easier. Lusamine sent someone over who will sell you some."L\rMallow: Everyone else noticed that the adults are super tired, right?"E\rLana: I was hoping it was just my parents that were like that."0\bKiawe: We need to do something to fix it."!\bSophocles: Sure, but what?"�\rLillie: My mother called earlier today and told me what needs done. We need to go on an Ultra Guardians mission to the Altar of the Sunne."+Rotom Dex: Let's all head to the boat!"�\bKukui: It's finally time that we head to Poni Island. All of you have your individual research projects, and I'll be leaving it up to you to complete them."x\bLana, you're to meet up with your friend. Kiawe, you're to train. Mallow, you're to learn how to make a new dish."�\bSophocles, you're to evolve your Charjabug. Lillie, you're to study the Pokémon living on the island. And finally \PN, you're to have your final Grand Trial."H\bNow that everyone is ready, head over to the boat. And good luck."{\bKukui: Alola everyone. Today we're heading to Malie City, a city that takes heavy inspiration from the Johto region."o\bFeel free to explore the unique culture. \PN, there is even a gym for you to participate in if you wish."N\bEveryone, let's take the boat to Tapu Village and head east from there."o\bKukui: Alola everyone. I'm very excited to announce that the first ever Alola League has been completed."�\bI know all of you have been looking forward to it, so let's not waste any time. Head for the boat in Hau'oli City and let's head over."i\bKukui: Alola everyone. As you're all aware, your vacation is starting and school will be on break."%\bWhat does everyone plan to do?"9\bSophocles: I'm going to the Mossdeep Space Center.":\rLana: My dad and I are going to look for a Manaphy."M\rMallow: I'm going to make my father's kitchen the best it can ever be."G\rLillie: My family and I are going to look for my missing father."S\bKiawe: I'm continuing my island challenge. One day I'll be an Island Kahuna."g\bKukui: What about you, \PN? Going to travel the world some more? Sounds like a great plan to me."a\bKiawe: Not so fast. We never got to battle in the Manalo Conference. \PN, do me the honor."(\bKukui: That's it everyone. Enjoy-"�Rotom Dex: Wait. I also want to talk about what I'm doing. If \PN is returning home, then I'm going to work with the Aether Foundation."C\PN, it's been wonderful being your Pokédex. Until next time."Q\bKukui: On that note, it's time you all went your own ways. Alola everyone."l\bKukui: Everyone, let's give \PN and Goh a strong Alolan welcome! It's great to see our champion back."�\bOf course, becoming a champion wasn't enough for him and he's now in the World Coronation Series. No doubt he'll be the one to win it."b\bKiawe: Professor! I want to battle \PN. I want to help him get even stronger so he can win."V\bKukui: How about it, \PN? Or would you rather battle someone else? Your choice."_\bKukui: Everyone, let's give a strong Alola welcome to Lillie and Gladion's father, Mohn!"\bMohn: Thank you, everyone, for the hospitality. I know I've missed so much, but I promise I'm not going anywhere from now on."(\rLillie: Professor. Where's Kiawe?"�\bKukui: He left to do some last minute training upon learning \PN was coming back. There's a Battle Royal taking place soon. \PN, I assume you're interested."M\bMohn: I haven't seen one of those in years. Let's head over and watch."\rPopplio"\rBrionne"\rPrimarina"Meltan"It's a Meltan."(Would you like to take it with you?"\bCharja"\bVika"%\rLillie: Nice to meet you, \PN."L\rLillie: I'm not actually a Trainer. You'll have to pick someone else.".\rLillie: I'll take good care of the egg."2\rLillie: This trip will be very educational."$\rLillie: This sounds exciting."*\rLillie: This is going to be hard..."5\rLillie: Snowy's egg was found on the mountain!"8\rLillie: Being an Ultra Guardian will be exciting!"a\rLillie: My mom just called the school. She said we need to head to the Altar of the Sunne."$Rotom Dex: Let's take the boat."S\rLillie: I wonder what they think of Alola? I hope they don't find it boring.",\rLillie: I don't know about this trip."1\rLillie: I'm curious what a gym looks like."L\rLillie: Snowy and I are looking forward to this. Don't go easy on us."7\rLillie: I still can't believe you're a Champion."6\rLillie: Perhaps I'll see you during my travels."-\bGoh: H-Hey \PN. Your friends are nice."c\rLillie: I'm so happy we found my father. Nihilego is a great addition to the family as well."B\rLillie: Hello there. Please keep that Pikachu away from me."4\rLusamine: I'