ust be the person my cousin sent. Could you hand me the egg?"0\bI can't wait to see what it hatches into."P\bNot quite ready to say goodbye. That's fine. Come back when you're ready."f\bYou're impressed by my school, aren't you? I can see it in your face. I welcome you to join us."/\b...Though you should ask your mom first."%\bYou should ask your mom first.">\bSamson: She said yes? Excellent! Welcome to the school."c\bProfessor Kukui has offered to take you in while you stay here. He should be home right now."&\bKukui should be home right now."C\bSamson: She said yes then? Excellent! Welcome to the school."5\bSamson: Hello \PN. How's school going for you?"F\bSamson: My egg hatched into a Kantoian Vulpix. What a surprise."\bSamson: zzz..."T\bSamson: I feel so much more alert. Ready to run this school with a new vigor."I\bSamson: The Pokémon League has begun. Perhaps I'll see you there."5\bSamson: The league sure was full of surprises."V\bSamson: Enjoy your holiday, \PN. I hope you'll come back one day to see us all."\rTogedemaru"%Your Pokémon were fully healed."\rVulpix"C\bMohn: Being here really brings me back. So much has changed."P\rMallow: I hear you're from Kanto! I bet you have a bunch of cool stories."=\rMallow: So it's me then. Don't be sorry when you lose."K\rMallow: Maybe you can come over some time and experience my cooking."T\rMallow: Looking at the eggs just makes me want to go home and cook some food.":\rMallow: I wonder if there is good food to be found?".\rMallow: I hope to see some Grass types!"/\rMallow: I wonder what we will see there."5\rMallow: Poor Steenee isn't going to like this."6\rMallow: I'm prepared to hunt some Ultra Beasts."3\rMallow: We have to do something to fix this."S\rMallow: Lana's sneaky. She organized the whole thing without anyone knowing."-\rMallow: Maybe I should cook something."k\rMallow: I think I'll leave Tsareena here. It should be fine if I travel without any Pokémon, right?"2\rMallow: A league, huh? I guess I'll try 