at's did you think of that Masked Royal? What a strong Trainer."n\bKukui: I heard there was an Ultra Beast wandering the island. See if you can't find it, Ultra Guardian."ORotom Dex: Using my scanner I found an unknown Pokémon inside the school!")\bKukui: So you found it? Great job."}\bKukui: You're awake. I have some exciting news for you. Ula'ula Island's Island Kahuna has some free time for a challenger."U\bHead over to the ship in Hau'oli. I'll inform the class on where you're going."\bLitten"\bTorracat"\bIncineroar")Rotom Dex: Let's head to the school."Poipole!">\bKukui: Alola! So you're \PN. Glad to have you on board."8\bThis is my home. Let me show you around a little."T\bThat there is Rockruff. It's a friendly guy who I'm sure you'll grow to love."\bRockruff!"9\bOh right, your bed is the one closest to the door."o\bThis is a Rotom Dex. I figured it would be a nice companion for you to have while you're here. Enjoy it."_\bKukui: Two Ultra Beasts have been seen in the area. I suggest you hurry up and get them."4Rotom Dex: My scanners say they are on Route 2."\bRow... let"It's a Pokédex."YRotom: Hello there \PN. Nice to meet you. I look forward to our adventures together."6You got the Rotom Pokédex.\me[Item get]\wtnp[40]"D\bKukui: Let's go meet your classmates now that you have Rotom."8\bKukui: It's been a fun day. Better get some rest."�\bKukui: For today I have a different assignment for you. I want you to go meet up with Lana in Hau'oli City. She's going to take you fishing."f\bKukui: Seems like you had a fun day. I've got something fun for you tomorrow so get some sleep."\\bKukui: For today I want you to meet up with Sophocles. He'll be in the shopping mall."!\bKukui: Get some sleep \PN."M\bKukui: I'm guessing you won. Great job cousin! I knew you could do it."�\bRockruff has been excited ever since you left. I think it wants to join your team. I'd be fine letting the litte guy go with you."?\bTomorrow's another day though. Be sure to get some res