[["lRotom Dex: That didn't take too long. Let's visit some other friends today. Kiawe might be at the farm."Y\bMy friend is looking for nectar right now. Don't think I'm gonna let you steal it."W\bSophocles: You want to help me rescue the Ultra Beast? Too bad this one is mine."0\bSophocles: I guess you can take this one."-\bI'm getting ready for my island trial."3\bYou're challenging it too! No wonder I lost."{\rMallow: Good to see you \PN. I need to find some nectar for a recipe of mine. It should be in the meadow next to us."�\rMallow: Good job getting the nectar. You can keep that one. I found my own. My Bounsweet actually evolved in the process. Let me show you."4\rMallow: That's all I had for you. Thanks \PN.""\bNo one is going to stop me."4\bI can't slow down. It goes against my nature.":Rotom Dex: Great work. Let's head back to the school.""\rWhere are all the Raticate?"7\rNever stop looking. They all show up eventually."\bEver seen my show?"G\bIt's a great show. Really, stop what you're doing and go see it." \bThey call me Dragon Rage.")\bYou're good. It's time I moved on."7\bIt's always a bonus to feel bonded to your team."8\bGive it to a friend to increase their friendship."0\bSo someone finally made the trip up here."=\bWhat a great hike that was. Can't wait to do it again.["|Rotom Dex: Eso no llevó mucho tiempo. Hoy podríamos visitar a algunos otros amigos. Chris podría estar en la granja."X\bMi amiga está buscando néctar ahora mismo. Ni se te ocurra intentar robárselo."X\bChris: ¿Quieres ayudarme a rescatar al Ultrente? Qué pena, porque este es mío."/\bChris: Supongo que puedes llevarte este."2\bMe estoy preparando para mi prueba insular.":\b¡Tú también vas a desafiarla! Con razón perdí."�\rLulú: Me alegra verte, \PN. Necesito encontrar néctar para una de mis recetas. Debería estar en la pradera que hay aquí al lado."�\rLulú: Buen trabajo consiguiendo el néctar. Puedes quedarte con ese. Yo encontré el mío. De hecho, mi Bounsweet evolucionó por 