as. Can't wait to do it again.Iu;␀�[[&"\bA new battle. Let's go."=Rotom Phone: Based on performance, your rank is now 602."{Announcment. New opponent found for the World Coronation Series. Ariel, located in Floaroma Town, is ready for battle."\bHow sad."]\rI like to stand out here and wait for the stars. You can look at this until they come."Q\rThis is the perfect spot to watch for stars. Don't try and get me to move."�\bHala: Congratulations on beating the totem. Having beat a trial, you now get the right to fight me in a grand trial. I hope you're ready."6\bWonderful job. Take this as a reward. A Fighti-"M\bAh, it seems Tapu Koko has a different opinion. Take this one instead."M\bAn Electrium Z. With that you can power up your Electric-type attacks."CRotom Dex: Let's go back and inform the professor of your win."Q\bHala: I would suggest Olivia next. Akala would be a fun place to try next."\bSableye"k\bHala is the Kahuna of this island. You can only challenge him after beating one trial on the island.":Iki Town\nThe place where we give thanks to Pokémon."\rFlabébé">\bI'm in the mood to share the move Drain Punch with you."1\bWhich Pokémon would you like me to teach?"\bCome back anytime!"�\bSo you want to know about Pokémon that used to evolve by trade? Let me break it down for you. Which do you want to know about?"z\bKadabra, Machoke, Graveler, Haunter, Boldore, Gurdurr, Phantump, Pumpkaboo, and Alolan Graveler evolve at level 35."�\bPoliwhirl and Slowpoke evolve in the day when holding a King's Rock. Onix at day with a Metal Coat. Porygon at day with an Upgrade."O\bClamperl at day with a Deep Sea Scale. Feebas at day with a Prism Scale."f\bRhydon at day with a Protector. Magmar at day with a Magmarizer. Spritzee at day with a Sachet."�\bScyther evolves when holding a Metal Coat at night. Seadra at night with a Dragon Scale. Porygon2 at night with a Dubious Disk."/\bClamperl at night with a Deep Sea Tooth."}\bElectabuzz at night with an Electirizer. D