ore important than things like growth or a sense of achomplishment."\bLeave me alone.">\rPokémon can be good or bad. It depends on the Trainer."B\bA lot of people don't come to Marts nowadays. I wonder why."G\bThere are wicked people who will use Pokémon for criminal acts."'\bTeam Rocket is just one example."6\bMax Repel keeps weaker Pokémon from appearing."9\bMax Repel stays effective longer than Super Repel."\rDo you sell food here?";\rA revive is costly, but it revives fainted Pokémon!"W\rA lot of people just go to Lilycove for their shopping. I like the quiet though."@\bI'm searching for items that raise the stats of Pokémon."<\bThey're effective over the course of a single battle."E\bX Attack, X Defend, X Speed, and X Special are what I'm after."6\bIt's always a good idea to stock up on Potions."c\bI need to stock up on potions so that I can beat the Gym. It's not cheating if they let you."V\bSometimes, a Trainer duo will challenge you with two Pokémon at the same time."3\bI need you to cover for me tomorrow. Please?"F\bRepel not only keeps bugs away, it also works on weak Pokémon."D\bPut your strongest Pokémon at the left of the Pokémon List."C\bIf your first Pokémon is strong, Repel's effect is boosted."R\rI've been trying to find stones for some time now. Is this the wrong store?"A\rDo you know about Rare Candy? They don't sell it in shops."C\rI think it makes Pokémon grow very quickly all of a sudden."+\bPotions are essential for traveling."2\rI wonder what I should buy for my Pokémon?"J\rHave you tried using an X Speed? It speeds up a Pokémon in battle."T\bThe market does have some interesting items, but you can't beat the classics."\bWhat do I want?"=\bDon't they have anything to advertise the Safari Zone?" \bYou seem nice. Take this."A\bGive that to Kurt. He will make something special for you."b\bHow did you get here? It's been a long time since we've had a visitor. You have to tell me."B\rI need to stock up on potions so that I can get to the Gym."8